#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "524500"
msgid "Too much has happened, so my mind and body are exhausted."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "525264"
msgid "…maybe…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "525284"
msgid "Everything, including my memories,\nare dummies planted inside of me by someone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "525364"
msgid "Such a thought crosses my mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "525580"
msgid "I recall advancing through the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF,\nbut some parts are missing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "526092"
msgid "No, that's not the issue here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "526460"
msgid "You do the same.\nDetermine if I'm a worthy Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "526616"
msgid "Master, I want to confirm something.\nYou're missing memories, aren't you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "526832"
msgid "Figures. Or, it could be that\nyou're a phony capable of fooling me…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "526924"
msgid "#C236196003Archer#CDEF stares at me intensely, as if looking through me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "527152"
msgid "…maybe…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "527172"
msgid "Everything, including these hazy memories,\nare dummies planted inside of me by someone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "527268"
msgid "Ah, there's no chance of that. The only\nMaster capable of making such a\nmiserable face is you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "527364"
msgid "You're the Master who summoned me, no doubt.\nI may also have memory loss,\nbut how could I forget that?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "527572"
msgid "…wait, hold on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "527600"
msgid "Did he just say something rude about me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "527896"
msgid "OUCH!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "528580"
msgid "Even my Servant has memory loss, not just me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "529020"
msgid "Good answer. That's my Mas―――\nnah, flattery will just spoil you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "529188"
msgid "Umm, Darling? I'm prepared to take a\nleap of faith in asking this…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "529264"
msgid "Have you possibly forgotten about me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "529436"
msgid "I'm furious with myself for making #C236196003Caster#CDEF ask me\nsuch a question."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "529528"
msgid "Ah! Ahhhh! It's okay, it's okay!\nI'm not angry or anything,\nI just wanted to confirm it!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "529624"
msgid "…rather, Darling, you look like you're in\npain. It may have been forward of me, but I\nwanted to be the one to bring it up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "529752"
msgid "#C236196003Caster#CDEF bows her head and apologizes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "530152"
msgid "…maybe…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "530172"
msgid "Everything, including my memories,\nare dummies planted inside of me by someone…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "530364"
msgid "I meaaan, #C236196003Tamamo#CDEF could never mistake the scent\nof Darling's soul. My marking doesn't\ncome off so easily."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "530496"
msgid "……huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "530508"
msgid "Did this Servant just blurt out something kind of disturbing?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "530660"
msgid "After all, you forgot about that passionate\nrooftop confession, that dazzling night,\nwhen I took the lead from you―right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "530996"
msgid "…how sad.\nWhat cruel tricks fate plays on people."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "531076"
msgid "I mean, reasons aside―――\nI think these are 100% fake tears."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "531848"
msgid "…I see.\nJust like #C236196003Leo#CDEF's #C236196003Gawain#CDEF, #C236196003Caster#CDEF has missing memories."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "531976"
msgid "I can't remember everything, but\n#C236196003Caster#CDEF clearly knows \"what's missing.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "532260"
msgid "Okay, there are heaps of things to do tomorrow.\nPlease rest tonight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "532836"
msgid "………now then."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "533208"
msgid "…I'll need a good explanation."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "533272"
msgid "You're all bark and no bite, SIR."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "533556"
msgid "Anecdotes about #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF aside,\nI can't accept this unless he explains why he became so weak."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "533792"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF says, then snaps his fingers."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "533932"
msgid "Anyway I look at it, they're wine and wine glasses."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "534384"
msgid "―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "534396"
msgid "So, just like us, he was trapped here too…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "536276"
msgid "You seem calm, despite that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "536312"
msgid "Calm…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "536728"
msgid "…perish? Me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "537304"
msgid "Look, no matter what, you're doomed.\nWhich means that you'll now be fighting to\nhasten your own demise!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "537408"
msgid "With a cruel smile, #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF speaks of a hopeless reality."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "538500"
msgid "…what a foul Servant this guy is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "538648"
msgid "And anyway, why would I would sever our contract?\n#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF would probably kill #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "539172"
msgid "And don't forget.\nThis isn't my battle. This is your battle.\nKeep that in mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "539260"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF's words etch into my mind.\nThe golden Servant emphasized this to me:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "539360"
msgid "\"This is #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF's battle.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "539412"
msgid "…this is odd."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "539432"
msgid "It's a plain statement, but it takes a load off of me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "539580"
msgid "…though, I'm sure he said that to make me feel better."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "539636"
msgid "I get the feeling that this arrogant Servant isn't so bad."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "539700"
msgid "I can't trust his character, but I can rely on him in battle.\n…keeping that hunch in mind, I fall asleep."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "541392"
msgid "Good morning, Darling.\nHuh? I am up very early, you say?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "541780"
msgid "Now then, let us begin our excursion♪\nIt would be sooo great if the Commissary would\nsell us some sweets."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "542252"
msgid "Thus, stopping here would be a mistake."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "542756"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF heads off on his own again. I chase after\nhim in a fluster, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "544188"
msgid "I scold myself; before I get my memories back,\nI need to retrain my body."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "544480"
msgid "To… experience\nOnce more… thoroughly…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "544748"
msgid "―――Is that so?\nYou were always that kind of Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "545124"
msgid "………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "545212"
msgid "Eh? Wrong? That is not what you mean? Ah, about\nskills. Kaaay, I totally got it nowww. *tsk*."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "545888"
msgid "But anyway―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "545912"
msgid "This is good.\n#C236196003#SVT#CDEF is acting lively again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "545972"
msgid "Even if my memories are hazy,\nseeing #SVT[her][#C236196003Archer#CDEF][her][him]# be down hurts me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "546840"
msgid "Then, is it the same for #C236196003#SVT#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "547456"
msgid "Eh? You say, \"#C236196003Caster#CDEF doesn't have any\nsecrets either, right?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "547764"
msgid "Hmmph. I do. I do have some.\nI AM a deity."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "548124"
msgid "Even #C236196003#SVT#CDEF has an #C000246204SG#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "548960"
msgid "It's not #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF's fault."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "549228"
msgid "I've failed as a Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "549716"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF asserted: \"We are not partners.\nDo not get any wrong ideas.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "550148"
msgid "R-ridiculously condescending and spewing nonsense."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "550580"
msgid "…could it be?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "550600"
msgid "Did that \"Gorgeous\" class name start to grow on him…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "550660"
msgid "Then being way too self-conscious―――\nOr \"[#C000246204templation#CDEF]\" is how to describe this\npompous king…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "550876"
msgid "…but my assumption wasn't pulled out of thin air."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "551420"
msgid "…so he says."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line2
msgctxt "552036"
msgid "You may view it from the #C000246204SG#CDEF menu."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "553296"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF blew herself up this time as well.\n#C000246204SGs#CDEF are a bit frightening, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "553504"
msgid "Are hidden things not usually embarrassing\nthings?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "553684"
msgid "I do not know whether a third one exists,\nbut perhaps we should pray that #C236196003Rin#CDEF's next SG\nis a normal one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "554956"
msgid "…it couldn't be that #C236196003Rin#CDEF and this Servant are extremely\ncompatible, right…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "555416"
msgid "To tell the truth, it weighed on me a bit.\n…rather than desire, it sounded like\na complaint to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "556928"
msgid "Not only are her colors gaudy, her head is full\nof radio waves… You could say it's cleanly\ncultivated. An evil flower, kind of meaning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "557284"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF is right. We can't let that red\n#C236196003Lancer#CDEF have her way."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "557472"
msgid "We need to even the odds somehow…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "558048"
msgid "This… string? cord? has become a bit of a kink\nfor me, but sometimes we have to compromise.\nDarling, can you take this off somehow?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "558248"
msgid "…that's right. The reset curse might be gone,\nbut this isn't #C236196003#SVT#CDEF's original outfit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "558672"
msgid "A tasteless stage suits tasteless actors."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "558996"
msgid "Once that woman became a Servant, she was freed\nfrom old age. In spite of that, she yet\nobsesses with beauty―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "559388"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF spoke with elation and stifled laughter."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "559604"
msgid "I can't help but feel that his attitude is\nsomewhat cold, but like #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF says, we\ncan't let #C236196003Lancer#CDEF have her way."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "559988"
msgid "We need to even the odds somehow…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "560588"
msgid "…that's right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "561100"
msgid "…man. What's wrong with me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "561836"
msgid "…phew. Now I can finally be freed from these\nrestraints… This outfit is too flashy for me…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "562940"
msgid "……?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "563092"
msgid "But it feels like I'm missing some of that\n\"impact,\" or like I'm losing to #C236196003BB#CDEF's character."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "563312"
msgid "Hehehe… that #C236196003BB#CDEF surely must have all kinds\nof clothing like this or that prepared."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "563420"
msgid "This time―――This will be my chance to make\nmy constantly-in-sage-mode Darling fall madly\nin love with me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "564276"
msgid "…so he says."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "564512"
msgid "Ah, ah, ah!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "564948"
msgid "Ah, ah. Ah!\nMm, ahem."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "565416"
msgid "Kon, Kon, Kokonnn!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "565620"
msgid "Okay, please open up and say \"Ahh.\" Ahh♪\nThis humble #C236196003Caster#CDEF shall offer to check\nDarling's mouth.鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "566948"
msgid "This Servant's standard is just live or die."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "567188"
msgid "Wha―His wrath is aimed at me…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "567236"
msgid "He's always saying it's \"your battle\"!\nThis is just plain tyranny!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "567932"
msgid "…?\nSomething feels out of place with\nwhat #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF just said."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "568276"
msgid "I only kill a person myself when their soul is\nhideous or when they're hostile to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "569960"
msgid "…yes. That's the Master that #RUBS brightens me#RUBEI rely on#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "570632"
msgid "Good news?\nI wonder if there is any."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "571056"
msgid "As a Servant, whether a Master is worth\nserving… is the big question for us, see?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "571220"
msgid "So, I qualify as being a Master…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "571340"
msgid "Now then.\nMy advice is that a growing Master needs\nplenty of rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "571416"
msgid "You fought well.\nNow's the time for a good sleep."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "571696"
msgid "Hmm… Since it feels so gloomy, I think it's\ntime for some comforting words, but… whatevz,\neven if I can't get them across, so be it!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "571840"
msgid "So hey, Darling.\nI have something pleasant to say."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "572084"
msgid "Sure.\nThis world and the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF\nhave turned hideous."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "572176"
msgid "However, the one silver lining is that Darling\nhasn't been defiled. You're just the way\nyou were before."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "572432"
msgid "…she stops talking.\nBut, #C236196003Caster#CDEF had spoken with a heartfelt voice."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "572700"
msgid "Yes, that's right!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "572960"
msgid "With a \"Grr,\" #C236196003Caster#CDEF shakes her clenched fist,\nrenewing her determination."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573464"
msgid "While spewing all that out, #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF smiles with delight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "574632"
msgid "Am I glad that this Servant is evaluating me,\nor that he praised me for being stubborn as a mule?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "574848"
msgid "…now I can keep fighting."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "574996"
msgid "I can recover from all that now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575044"
msgid "How unfortunate though.\nThose #C000246204Egos#CDEF don't seem to include\nany Mesopotamian."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575292"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF keeps talking."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575400"
msgid "My fatigue-amassed consciousness falls into sleep."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575920"
msgid "…I awake from a deep sleep."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576360"
msgid "Heeyy, good morning♪\nHow are you feeling?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576744"
msgid "\n4,000 years ago."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577544"
msgid "As king, he #RUBS designed#RUBEcreated#REND that era."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578500"
msgid "…since he accepted thievery."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578648"
msgid "\"Ahh. This truly―――is one repulsive future.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578988"
msgid "Good ol' #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579084"
msgid "…my head still feels fuzzy, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579592"
msgid "My next rival is some suspicious #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579728"
msgid "But there's nothing to fear.\nYou have me with you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580612"
msgid "Good work today, Darling. Go ahead, please get\nsome rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580848"
msgid "Ahaa, Darling! You're such a sweety鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580920"
msgid "I'm not all that eager about your candidness,\nbut I will gratefully accept your concerns.\nOkay. Honestly, I'm worn out as well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581616"
msgid "#C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF… A \"self\" elevated to the form\nof an individual human."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583968"
msgid "I mean, she has extreme power, flexibility, volume."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584124"
msgid "Of course, I'll just ignore the cold sweat\non your brow. I'm looking forward to the\nnext battle VERY much鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585376"
msgid "I freeze up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586196"
msgid "――――Ha."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586408"
msgid "Surely no one would be so vain―my insight\nHAS dulled, too! Truly, #C000246204commoners ARE the most\ncontemptible creatures in the world#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587588"
msgid "#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF, the #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587772"
msgid "#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF. Stop empathizing with her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589000"
msgid "I awake to a familiar ringing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589056"
msgid "This is… My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589220"
msgid "We ran into a new #C000246204Sentinel#CDEF.\n#C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF was caught by #C236196003BB#CDEF\nand now she's our new enemy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589372"
msgid "A surprise appearance from a #C000246204Sentinel#CDEF\nforced us to retreat.\nShe was under #C236196003BB#CDEF's control."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589960"
msgid "I wonder how long I've been asleep."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590368"
msgid "Yeah, it wasn't like I was sleeping next to you\nor anything and was interrupted by that damned\nStudent Council call. Agh, blockheads!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590620"
msgid "Urged on by #C236196003#SVT#CDEF, I rush to get ready."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590876"
msgid "………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591752"
msgid "This situation isn't enough to get us down.\nAnd it won't, although―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591832"
msgid "What's wrong?\nYou're looking very bleak…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592336"
msgid "Who knows, maybe I simply forgot that I\nwas actually some crazy, bad person."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592424"
msgid "……!\nHeh―hahaha, hahahahahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592460"
msgid "Y-you're making me laugh, Praetor!\nI-if YOU'RE a bad person, that would make\nkittens archdemons!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592560"
msgid "………\nSomehow, that really does hurt me in a way, #C236196003Saber#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592748"
msgid "Those may be mistakes, but not wrongdoing.\nFear not, my Master. You are you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "594056"
msgid "To be honest, he's out of my league.\nWe may be better off if you do some #RUBSsimulations#RUBEtraining#REND\non buttering up #C236196003Jinako#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "594592"
msgid "This situation isn't enough to get us down.\nAnd it won't, although―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "594808"
msgid "…nothing gets past #C236196003Archer#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595248"
msgid "Who knows, maybe I simply forgot that I\nwas actually some crazy, bad person."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595336"
msgid "――――――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597292"
msgid "This situation isn't enough to get us down.\nAnd it won't, although―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597372"
msgid "…Master? You look a little down…\nPerhaps your memories have you troubled?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597476"
msgid "…this is why one can't make light of #C236196003Caster#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598012"
msgid "Who knows, maybe I simply forgot that I\nwas actually some crazy, bad person."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598100"
msgid "No, that's positively not the case."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598136"
msgid "I swear on all the gods of Heaven and Earth:\nyou're a person who assuredly possesses a\nchaste, pure, blank soul."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598284"
msgid "And that's because, despite ALL the temptation\nI throw your way, you NEVER falter;\nyou're a super sage!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598524"
msgid "………wait a second, #C236196003Caster#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598712"
msgid "That's a given. What I mean is,\nbeing \"alive\" is a state that changes.\nYou're total proof of that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598900"
msgid "That anxiety and hesitation shall one day turn\ninto your strength. By this\nWatery Heaven's Sunlight, I assure you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600772"
msgid "Who knows, maybe I simply forgot that I\nwas actually some crazy, bad person."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601252"
msgid "Then, I won't hesitate to behead you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601296"
msgid "………of course."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602048"
msgid "Obviously, I'm wicked scared.\nBut I don't think I'm running for that reason."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602132"
msgid "Just LIVING is a scary thing for me, naturally."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602504"
msgid "Having spoken his fill, #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF falls fast asleep."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603360"
msgid "#C080080080I see a day-to-day life.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603480"
msgid "Through those fond days."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603680"
msgid "That's―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603732"
msgid "I recover lost memories."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603888"
msgid "So then, why did I forget about it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604536"
msgid "But…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "605904"
msgid "Still. Loneliness by itself is merely poison.\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF has nothing but loneliness.\nShe lives as if she were dead."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606032"
msgid "About #C236196003Launcher#CDEF… oh, I mean,\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF's Servant, #C236196003Karna#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606200"
msgid "Oh, I don't mean that in a sarcastic way.\nI'm well aware of my own faults,\nbut we're talking about #C236196003Karna#CDEF here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606572"
msgid "…you look sleepy, Darling.\nPlease get yourself some rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606636"
msgid "Oh, me…?\nI'm… just thinking about something."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "607888"
msgid "Unlike the previous #C000246204Sentinels#CDEF, #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF,\nwhat happened with #C236196003Jinako#CDEF doesn't really\nexplain much."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "608296"
msgid "I don't regret it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "608540"
msgid "…I see.\nThen let's embrace that frustration\nand press forward."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "609944"
msgid "\"Why me?\"\n\"Why doesn't anyone else understand\nmy suffering?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "610104"
msgid "Hm…?\nI'm not teasing you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "610360"
msgid "Fine. Then I'll assume that you always\nhave delusions about being some\n#[masked gentleman][stunning beauty]#."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "610472"
msgid "Why though…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "611164"
msgid "It likely all depends on how each one of\nus will receive #C236196003Jinako#CDEF, or… punish her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "611288"
msgid "……………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "611308"
msgid "……aah…………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "611388"
msgid "Umm… sure, there's also that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "611420"
msgid "Well, if Darling feels hurt about it or\nsomething, maybe I should offer some comfort?\nJust kidding…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "611860"
msgid "To tell you the truth… I got to thinking about\n#C236196003Karna#CDEF… I wonder if #C236196003Karna#CDEF is envious\nof #C236196003Monji Gatou#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "612488"
msgid "Still, I started feeling a bit lonely\nthinking about how #C236196003Karna#CDEF was abandoned\nby his Master like that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "612988"
msgid "He was yet far from being enlightened,\nbut I say he was sufficiently capable of\nbeing a high monk."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614252"
msgid "Waah! That's dangerous.\nYou're still awake?\nPlease lie down properly tonight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614528"
msgid "With #C236196003#SVT#CDEF supporting my body, I reach the bed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "615948"
msgid "My risen body is forced back into bed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "616416"
msgid "I know because she always saves me,\ndespite my inexperience."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "616480"
msgid "――――――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "616836"
msgid "…I'm glad."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "616960"
msgid "…yes. You should sleep.\nSo long as you're here, our hope has\nyet to collapse."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618064"
msgid "…although, I still haven't thought of a\nsurefire plan yet. I'll have my Master chip in\non that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618376"
msgid "I was able to laugh and say,\n\"I'll pass on a lifestyle like that, but you're right.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618464"
msgid "…my situation hasn't changed at all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619032"
msgid "Darling, having trouble sleeping?\nIn that case, you may pet my tail if you\nwould like to."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619508"
msgid "Please watch as I, #C236196003Caster#CDEF, expend every wile I\npossess, and amass a mountain of many corpses\nif need be to bring victory to my Darling."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619760"
msgid "So please, have yourself a nice rest, #RUBS  Master#RUBEDarling#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "621948"
msgid "Right as I enter the room,\n#C236196003Saber#CDEF plonks straight onto the bed.\nShe's mad… actually, sulking."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622060"
msgid "You were pretty popular today, Praetor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622104"
msgid "While holding a big cushion,\nshe purses her cherry blossom lips."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622228"
msgid "It's not something you need apologize for.\n…I'm merely pouting because I want to.\nI know it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622508"
msgid "Firstly, beauty has value because there's\nsomeone to accept and praise it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622872"
msgid "…#C236196003Saber#CDEF stares somewhere far off."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "623772"
msgid "I hope it turns out for the better."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "624228"
msgid "…yep. I pray to the heavens that one day he,\nnot I, will have to face #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's heinous affection."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "624440"
msgid "Yep, it's one hell of a mess."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "624652"
msgid "Damn. What happened to my luck with women?\nDid having you as a Master lower me one rank!?\nIt IS possible!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "626696"
msgid "Listen, Darling.\nAs with that Oppai Monster a while back,\nbe wary of Miss Show-It-All."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "626896"
msgid "You must never show her compassion,\nlike you did for that cheeky horn-girl!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "627692"
msgid "…don't say that so calmly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "627724"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF. #C236196003Rani#CDEF. #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF. #C236196003Jinako#CDEF.\nAlso #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF, and now #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "628444"
msgid "Setting that aside…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "629612"
msgid "You must be tired after all that junk food.\nGo ahead and make yourself comfortable!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "630200"
msgid "Don't be swayed by her innocence.\nRegardless of how she acts now, her marks\non history still remain."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "631136"
msgid "I see――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "631324"
msgid "Mhm. I understand her\nfrom an artist's perspective,\nbut I will show her no leniency."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "631600"
msgid "Sure, I agree…\nBut my crammed stomach hurts too much to sleep."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "633080"
msgid "While #C236196003Caster#CDEF rubbed my back,\nwe made idle talk until my stomach stopped hurting――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "634000"
msgid "Well done.\nAs for you, Darling, please hurry off to the\nbath and wash that fatigue away."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "634404"
msgid "Like jumping into a jar and into another world.\nThat woman… is more a sage than a saint…\nLike an immortal delivered from her coil…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "635256"
msgid "I know she's our enemy, but she faced us\nso many times―and even served me her home\ncooking―that I kind of care about her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "635500"
msgid "……Praetor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "635516"
msgid "In my absentminded state, #C236196003Saber#CDEF clasps my hand in hers."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "635680"
msgid "It's so like you. At the same time,\nI know quite well that you have the strength\nto rise again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "636000"
msgid "I'd… prefer she not do that, I think…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "636096"
msgid "……Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "636340"
msgid "I'm going to enjoy seeing what the\nbattles to come will bring out in you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "636512"
msgid "Thanks, #C236196003Archer#CDEF.\n…sorry I treated you like a pervert today."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "636592"
msgid "I thought about having that footage\ndubbed over, but I'll let it go."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "636832"
msgid "……dear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637160"
msgid "After all, it hurts you to fight.\nDespite that, I believe you've become\nmuch stronger."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637252"
msgid "#C236196003Caster#CDEF… You're going good-wife mode on me today…\nAll that kindness seems to have settled me down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637368"
msgid "Huh? I'm always a good-wife."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637500"
msgid "Oh, she definitely kept it vague.\n…that said, I think it's best to keep\nthat landmine of a topic vague."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638044"
msgid "\"Of course,\" I reply."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638192"
msgid "―――We'll be fine.\nExhausted, I rapidly fall asleep."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638684"
msgid "…………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638704"
msgid "…………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638724"
msgid "…………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638744"
msgid "…………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638764"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF is asleep."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638924"
msgid "I'll hit the hay early today too.\nWe'll be tackling #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF again tomorrow…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639024"
msgid "Mm… my scarlet… Praetor………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639124"
msgid "Ahhn… oh, Darling…鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639164"
msgid "………in… got……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639204"
msgid "…what kind of dream is this Servant having?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639500"
msgid "Our first vow?\nWhen #C236196003Saber#CDEF and I reunited…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639652"
msgid "I am yours. And you are my Praetor.\nWe entrust each other with our hearts."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639960"
msgid "Mhm, that's a separate matter!\nYou are mine, and I won't be handing\nyou over to her!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641028"
msgid "\"On my own.\" Hearing that kind of bothers me…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641680"
msgid "Doesn't she know that my Darling\nhas human rights!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641784"
msgid "I stare straight at #C236196003Caster#CDEF as I agree on that point."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641860"
msgid "W-why are you glaring at me?\nCome now, you're only supposed to be mad at\n#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF! I'm innocent!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642324"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF has a vaguely cheerful smile on his face\nas he speaks."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642416"
msgid "Could it be that… this guy, #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF,\ndoesn't despise #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642912"
msgid "W-when he puts it like that…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643928"
msgid "#C080080080They were calm words.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "644416"
msgid "#C080080080The words come sharply, but there's warmth in their meaning.\nThe speaker of these words seems to relate to me.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "644564"
msgid "#C080080080But I don't remember. Who is this?#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "644732"
msgid "#C080080080―――No clue.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645104"
msgid "#C080080080So long as we're here, we won't vanish.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645428"
msgid "#C080080080Words assemble.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645532"
msgid "#C080080080The final, beginning hope.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645724"
msgid "#C080080080He says that, therefore, I may have given up,\nbut I mustn't draw the conclusion.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "646600"
msgid "\n………now, I'll close my eyes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "646716"
msgid "\n―――I won't end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "646876"
msgid "\n\"Yes―――\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "646992"
msgid "―――Suddenly, I wake up.\nIt seems I had a fragmented dream."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "647060"
msgid "Awake, huh?\nYou were awfully tired.\nA remarkably deep sleep―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "647280"
msgid "You awake now?\nDon't push yourself.\nRest for the time bei―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "647752"
msgid "A brief ending, it was.\nLet's be off then.\nI'll accompany you, #RUBS  Master#RUBEDarling#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "648904"
msgid "You would applaud for me every time.\nI would lean on you and let you pat my head…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649004"
msgid "…is that so?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649024"
msgid "I get the feeling that my time in the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF with\n#C236196003Saber#CDEF was nothing but close calls.\nAlways in a pinch."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649772"
msgid "I reply, \"thanks for the usual sarcastic concern.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649840"
msgid "Now THAT'S the only thing I had left to say."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650876"
msgid "Ah! I was joking, it was a joke!\nWake up, Darling!\nC'mon, this is our last night!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650960"
msgid "#C236196003Tamamo#CDEF wants to share more sweet nothings\nwith you! Time extension PLEASE!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651508"
msgid "I know."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651636"
msgid "However, for #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF,\nthere's one last hurdle that will have to be surmounted."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652488"
msgid "…yeah."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652744"
msgid "I temporarily escaped death."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653224"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF stares at me silently."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653364"
msgid "…aw, man.\nWhen he looks at me like that, I can't bluff or lie."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653496"
msgid "So I say―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "653512"
msgid "No need to worry, my man."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "653544"
msgid "I AM scared, but I'll deal with it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653612"
msgid "All I can answer with is my typical bluff."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654884"
msgid "…I wake up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "940244"
msgid "Hmhmhm. After #C236196003Rin#CDEF, even #C236196003Rani#CDEF yielded to us…\nThis is fine. Just the way I like it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "941080"
msgid "#C236196003Saber#CDEF's style…?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "941364"
msgid "…likes it both ways…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "941828"
msgid "However, that remark stirred my memories back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "942596"
msgid "Still, I don't feel very off-put, maybe because\n#C236196003Saber#CDEF herself enjoys the competition."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "943100"
msgid "A Master unconnected to her harem?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "943136"
msgid "Just another person in the group…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "943488"
msgid "To #C236196003Saber#CDEF, I'm just another sheep in the flock."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "943556"
msgid "I'm not the prettiest young #[boy][girl]#, so I'd\nbe low on #C236196003Saber#CDEF's pecking order in the harem,\njust sitting in my corner until Hell froze over."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "943732"
msgid "――――――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "944860"
msgid "Although, I know, I can't change who I am.\nI may be in the body of a Servant,\nbut at the same time, I am an emperor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "945636"
msgid "And yet, #C236196003Saber#CDEF shared her destiny with me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "945856"
msgid "I only know one thing. #C236196003Saber#CDEF really is anxious\nover #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF. That's all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "946232"
msgid "This is… #C236196003Saber#CDEF's #C000246204SG#CDEF!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "946400"
msgid "Its name is――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "946420"
msgid "\n――――THAT was her#RUBS     SG #RUBE secret#REND!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "946768"
msgid "I have an item in my hand right now.\nIt's probably… no, this is definitely something #C236196003Saber#CDEF wanted."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "947084"
msgid "But, before I do so…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "947356"
msgid "…something strange is going on.\nYou're unusually nervous, Praetor.\nThis is our room. Do rest easy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "947460"
msgid "…oh. Apparently I'm nervous."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "947592"
msgid "\"Here, it's a present.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "947620"
msgid "That's all I have to say, but it won't come out.\nDo I even understand that that's the very reason\nwhy I'm giving her this…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "948132"
msgid "――――――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "948148"
msgid "Ug-gah…! Hey, wait, WAIT, please wait!\nDamn you―――Ahh, are you some kind of demon!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "948404"
msgid "…ah. So I did take too long to do this.\nI'm sorry for being so late."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "948776"
msgid "…was that an #C000246204SG#CDEF…?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "950808"
msgid "Somehow, I pin Saber down."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "950840"
msgid "Resolved, I pin Saber down."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "950872"
msgid "Impatient, I pin Saber down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "950960"
msgid "――――――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "951160"
msgid "――――――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "951236"
msgid "…could #C236196003Saber#CDEF be feeling nervous…?\nEven though she loves harems…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "951404"
msgid "M-mhm. This is fine.\nI'm not nervous in the slightest!\nI-I'm not afraid!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "951480"
msgid "…it doesn't really look that way…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "951656"
msgid "I-I'm having one of my usual headaches!\n…stupid. I'm being meek because\nyou're special…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "951752"
msgid "She whispers faintly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "952136"
msgid "―――#C236196003Saber#CDEF's whispers raise my body temperature."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "952512"
msgid "――――――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "952896"
msgid "#C236196003Saber#CDEF gets out of bed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "953560"
msgid "I say―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "953616"
msgid "――――――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "953632"
msgid "―――Mhm!\nMay the virgin goddess bless us on our path!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "954152"
msgid "…it's all a bit daunting."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "954404"
msgid "Why the long face again, Praetor? Is it about\n#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF? I know, she impressed me as well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "955348"
msgid "…mhm. Though I'm happy to hear that,\nmy virtue is self-serving.\nIt's also exceptional."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "958292"
msgid "It does. For sure.\nAnd I don't care what it's like."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "958528"
msgid "#C236196003Saber#CDEF's eyes sparkle with pure affection\nas she speaks."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "958692"
msgid "M-mhm. Speaking of this to you is embarrassing!\nAll I'm saying is, I can relate to #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "959092"
msgid "It took a while, but now I've finally grasped\n#C236196003Saber#CDEF's truth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "959188"
msgid "There's no way #C236196003Saber#CDEF could be a tyrant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "959244"
msgid "I mean, look how much she loves people."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "959732"
msgid "Such a way of life deserves modest respect.\nAs selfish as she is, she respects others, still.\nShe lives like a single rose blooming in the air."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "959968"
msgid "Give up on #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF.\nRest easy and pay mind only to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "960052"
msgid "The scale of my love won't be beat out by hers!"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "960236"
msgid "No need to even say it. I know."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "960380"
msgid "Hm? Well now, what were you worrying over?\nWere you overthinking things again?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "961012"
msgid "…Incidentally, Praetor.\nAbout this lover strategy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "961392"
msgid "First off, I can't fight if #C236196003Saber#CDEF's not with me.\nAnd besides, #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF won't think anything\nof a Master being with their Servant, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "962108"
msgid "―――Err, that's extremely irrelevant."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "962284"
msgid "You hate \"short-term\" lovers, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "962372"
msgid "――――――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "962388"
msgid "Ohh, ohh… my Praetor…!\nI… how short-sighted I was!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "962688"
msgid "Yeah, that would reassure me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "963884"
msgid "Praetor, umm…\nDid you recall anything about me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "965112"
msgid "And when they're females no less."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "965828"
msgid "#C236196003Saber#CDEF is right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "965960"
msgid "Since I'm the only one that sees the #C000246204SG#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "966628"
msgid "Affected by #C236196003Saber#CDEF, who sighed,\nI also take a deep, deep sigh."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "966708"
msgid "Really, isn't this foul play?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "966868"
msgid "It makes me want to sigh again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "967196"
msgid "Th-that was a delusion!\nI don't think that way in the slightest!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "967492"
msgid "――――――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "968244"
msgid "My secret…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "968636"
msgid "Wha――!?\nS-sexually, meaning, like THAT?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "968940"
msgid "Saber"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "968952"
msgid "Rin"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "968956"
msgid "Rani"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "968984"
msgid "Y-yes!\nOf course, of course!\nI knew you had a good eye for such things!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "969264"
msgid "#C236196003Saber#CDEF fidgets, intertwining her fingers.\nAm I supposed to expect this reward\nto match how shy she's acting?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "969468"
msgid "So she says, then #C236196003Saber#CDEF points to―――\nher own thighs."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "969548"
msgid "…u-uhh, could this be the legendary act\nmen and women mess up in real life―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "969776"
msgid "Now forgiven, I timidly scoot up next to #C236196003Saber#CDEF\nand lay my head on her thighs."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "969884"
msgid "…they're soft, and warm."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "970356"
msgid "Oh? #C236196003Rin#CDEF?\nSo you prefer slender physiques."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "970720"
msgid "Oh? #C236196003Sakura#CDEF?\nSo you truly do like feminine, soft physiques?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "970992"
msgid "No, how could I ever?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "971384"
msgid "Wha――!?\nS-sexually, meaning, like THAT?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "971756"
msgid "Leo"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "971764"
msgid "Julius"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "971776"
msgid "Gatou"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "971784"
msgid "Shinji"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "972252"
msgid "He doesn't suit you.\nGive up on him. I won't allow it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "972308"
msgid "…#C236196003Gatou#CDEF, huh? \nI do think he has a trained,\nsuperb physique, but―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "973620"
msgid "For that reason―――\nDon't look so worried.\nYou burden yourself too much."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "974068"
msgid "Have no reservations. For when I'm in trouble,\nI'll be depending on you!\nIt wouldn't be fair otherwise, no?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "974232"
msgid "So long as that delicate body of\nhers puts itself in harm's way for me in return."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "974552"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF…\nHer obsession with you is no halfhearted thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "974704"
msgid "…sorry, I wasn't."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "975108"
msgid "I understand that. I do.\nExcept――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "975268"
msgid "The way she straight up said \"like\" makes me blush a little."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "975344"
msgid "#C236196003Saber#CDEF is genuine.\nI wonder if she truly does pine for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "975500"
msgid "If you have time to worry about that #C236196003BB#CDEF,\nthen spend that time on me!\nCare more, much more for me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "975616"
msgid "She looks angry on the outside.\nShe IS angry… right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "975676"
msgid "She said it so boldly that I couldn't help but laugh."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "976276"
msgid "Few #[men][women]# can stand and face the end of the\nworld. I'm proud of you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "977600"
msgid "…yeah.\nThat red outfit looked really good on her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "977664"
msgid "But―――I feel that―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "978112"
msgid "…hey, are you listening, Praetor!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "978272"
msgid "…sorry, I wasn't listening."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "978432"
msgid "I'm happy that you're thinking about me,\nbut I can't bear to see you troubled."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "978632"
msgid "…her sympathetic words warm my chest."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "978868"
msgid "Red is totally you."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "978888"
msgid "Isn't it too revealing?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "979212"
msgid "Maybe these clothes are a little too revealing?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "979472"
msgid "――――――!?!?\nY-you're… being awfully straightforward…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "979780"
msgid "For a smile like that, I guess it was\nall worth it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "980292"
msgid "…it's a… string…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "980472"
msgid "Agh! I've made up my mind.\nPraetor, open your eyes and behold.\nTHIS is art!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "980652"
msgid "……………………\n……………………\n……………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "980712"
msgid "…………………\n…………………\n…………………paradise, laid out before me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "981828"
msgid "―――#C236196003BB#CDEF, good job."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "982412"
msgid "……………………\n……………………\n……………………I am."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "982500"
msgid "Good to know my Servant isn't a full-on exhibitionist."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "982572"
msgid "We clearly have different tastes!\nI may as well be naked if I'm going\nto wear this!!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "983148"
msgid "Gleefully, #C236196003Saber#CDEF leans up against me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "983352"
msgid "…maybe, if she really was…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "983688"
msgid "At what point did I accidentally verbalize my thoughts?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "983992"
msgid "She's absolutely right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "984756"
msgid "#C236196003Saber#CDEF keeps glancing at me, as if wanting praise."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "984832"
msgid "All I can say is―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "984856"
msgid "You look great."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "984900"
msgid "It must be true if you say so.\nMhm, I thought so, too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "985220"
msgid "I sense it lacks said eroticism!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "985276"
msgid "…you're more hedonistic than I took you for."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "985328"
msgid "But fear not.\nI love you all the same!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "986264"
msgid "Well, what's done is done!\nI enjoyed myself! Wonderful work, #RUBS  Master#RUBEPraetor#REND!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "986368"
msgid "―――Ahem. So anyway.\nI thought to reward you for accomplishing\nthis great feat."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "986460"
msgid "A reward…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "986576"
msgid "I shall praise your great feat through song!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "986640"
msgid "Wh-WHAT?!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "987352"
msgid "…what's going on?\n#C236196003Saber#CDEF has fidgeting for a while now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "987616"
msgid "How rude! What do you take me for?\nNo emperor… I mean, king could be\nso gluttonous!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "987708"
msgid "………………\nIs that so?\nI think she's twisting the narrative here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "987780"
msgid "But let's not get into that―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "988340"
msgid "#C236196003Saber#CDEF jovially checks out the #RUBS    data  #RUBEmunitions#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "988524"
msgid "Which is why I LOVE rarities!\nThey always treat me well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "988824"
msgid "No rare treasure I come across will\never hold a candle to you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "989020"
msgid "…gaudiness?\nWhat on Earth is #C236196003Saber#CDEF talking about?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "991592"
msgid "……Saber."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1108344"
msgid "#C236196003Archer#CDEF is working on something.\nHe's humming and in such a good mood\nthat I have to wonder who this guy is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1108760"
msgid "Ahh. Comfy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1110272"
msgid "I continue, \"You get a little obsessive, don't you?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1110492"
msgid "The #C000246204Five Meditations#CDEF is reacting.\nThis is definitely #C236196003Archer#CDEF's keyword."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1111760"
msgid "Do you really get it? Its design, which\nenthralled many people, didn't actually\ncome from a design."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1112316"
msgid "You've got a sour look on your face.\nYou feeling alright?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1112376"
msgid "…no, just regretting my life choices a bit…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1112500"
msgid "…I wonder if #C236196003Archer#CDEF is one of those \"gun fanatics.\"\nBut that means he favors guns instead of bows, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1113744"
msgid "But the odd thing is that I have\nyet to see #C236196003Archer#CDEF maintaining his weapons."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1114708"
msgid "…hm? You were looking a little dizzy there…\nIs something wrong, Master?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1114784"
msgid "Something IS definitely wrong."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1115652"
msgid "………………\nThis Servant, #[does he think he's my][is he my]# mom?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1116076"
msgid "Oh, yeah. There was this weird item I got.\nThis \"Free-Ticket.\" Real sketchy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1116580"
msgid "………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1116596"
msgid "………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1116732"
msgid "………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1116748"
msgid "――――――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1116992"
msgid "Hungry? #C236196003Leo#CDEF and the others mentioned this\nbefore. It's not necessary to eat here in the\n#C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1117340"
msgid "―――Hmph."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1117352"
msgid "\"Huh?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1117448"
msgid "Wait here.\n…by the way, have you ever heard the Japanese\nfolktale, \"The Grateful Crane\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1117544"
msgid "You do? That's good.\nThen recall the moral of the story:\nno matter what you do, don't peek."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1117728"
msgid "…………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1117740"
msgid "………………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1117764"
msgid "………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1117796"
msgid "…………alright. Let's take a peek."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1117852"
msgid "I only have one hour, do I…?\nThat doesn't offer me a lot of prep time.\nAll right. Stir fry it is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1118168"
msgid "Wait. What?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1118188"
msgid "Why is there a (somewhat) fancy kitchen here?\nWhy is he having such a great time cooking?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1118284"
msgid "And lastly, why is he dressed like a BUTLER!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1118884"
msgid "That, there, is a plain ol' super butler."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1119384"
msgid "I'm fine.\nI don't eat the same foods\nas I prepare for others."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1119532"
msgid "#C236196003Archer#CDEF's #C000246204SG#CDEF means to surface.\n…of course, is it any wonder what kind of\n#C000246204SG#CDEF it'll turn out to be?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1119784"
msgid "I nod, \"yep.\"\nLet's leave it at that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1120412"
msgid "\"I was a Hero of Justice.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1121172"
msgid "I can do this again sometime, if you like.\nHow would Italian sound to you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1121292"
msgid "I act as if I didn't catch the slightest glimpse\ninto his past."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1121356"
msgid "Anyways…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1122520"
msgid "\"I'm sorry. I can't.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1123112"
msgid "……………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1123132"
msgid "…?\n#C236196003Archer#CDEF is acting weird.\nHe's giving me a grave stare…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1123220"
msgid "……Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1123236"
msgid "We lock eyes.\nHe's fixed on me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1123476"
msgid "………………sorry.\nI know this is making you nervous, but…\nDo you mind if we hit the showers?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1124172"
msgid "#RUBSstupid stupid stupid   #RUBE#C236196003Archer#CDEF just wants#REND to take a long shower because\n#RUBSstupid stupid stupid    #RUBEhis Mystic Code#REND got#REND covered in #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's poison-nectar."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1124416"
msgid "#RUBSstupid stupid    #RUBEHe has his#REND casual clothes on now.\n#RUBSstupid stupid stupid stupid    #RUBEHe wants us#REND to take a break until his Mystic Code dries."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1124668"
msgid "\"Just your imagination,\" bonehead?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1124836"
msgid "Are you stupid?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1126208"
msgid "Pretty dangerous, isn't it?\nWell, thankfully that wasn't\nalways the―――the―――wait."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1126296"
msgid "…no way… Did it never work out for me…\neven once…? Wait, hold on, that just\ncan't be…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1127016"
msgid "SYMPATHY/REVOKED――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1127176"
msgid "…hm, let's see.\nI think there was just one or two,\nbut it never lasted long."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1127548"
msgid "\"Who do you think you are, being all happy\nthere?\" It seems that I would indict myself\nwith baseless sins."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1128316"
msgid "But, one day―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1128544"
msgid "\"But your life wasn't a mistake\"――or something."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1129780"
msgid "Wait, maybe he really does think that?\nIf so, this Servant must be one hell of a lady-killer.\nOr have a heart of gold."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1130568"
msgid "Anyway, aren't you missing the point?\n#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF is who you want to catch, not #C236196003Jinako#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1130692"
msgid "I nod, \"Yeah, I know.\"\nIt feels like #C236196003Archer#CDEF poked fun at me first,\nbut I'll let it go this time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1130896"
msgid "…hm? What's up?\nYou're looking awfully pouty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1131280"
msgid "Anyone…?\nMy lover can just be \"anyone\"…."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1131332"
msgid "I mean, I don't dislike #C236196003Jinako#CDEF.\nI'm sulking for a much higher, human reason.\nTo be precise, it's like―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1131476"
msgid "I'm a girl, you know!"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1131504"
msgid "Who plays the man in this?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1131568"
msgid "…………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1131880"
msgid "…his words sounded oddly malicious…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1131984"
msgid "…that aside, #C236196003Archer#CDEF is right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1132036"
msgid "This operation is no game.\n#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF is a dangerous #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF.\nSince #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's life will be in my hands,\nI have to stay focused."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1132228"
msgid "――――――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1132400"
msgid "But it's a no from me.\nYou and I are a wholesome Master and Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1132596"
msgid "I get it, but I don't."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1132864"
msgid "Before being #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF's prince,\nbefore being #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's lover―you're my Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1133052"
msgid "…………Master?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1133072"
msgid "―――Woah!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1133576"
msgid "Haphazardly or not, where you shine is\nalways choosing to press on.\n…and that makes me proud."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1133996"
msgid "…wait, sorry.\nI'm asking something silly of you.\nForget it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1134548"
msgid "My \"many blunders\"…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1134572"
msgid "Was I really that lousy of a Master?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1135528"
msgid "No Servant is as open and easygoing as I am.\nAnd don't you remember how I ranked No. 1 in\n#C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF searches?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1135688"
msgid "\"Open\"…?\n\"Easygoing\"…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1136024"
msgid "It seems you and I can't exert our full power.\nMove cautiously and avoid impulsive reflexes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1136476"
msgid "And when they're females no less."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1137112"
msgid "#C236196003Archer#CDEF is right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1137248"
msgid "Since I'm the only one that sees the #C000246204SG#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1137320"
msgid "I'm glad we we're on the same page.\nNow, let's take #C236196003Rani#CDEF back ASAP."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1137844"
msgid "Affected by #C236196003Archer#CDEF, who sighed,\nI take a deep, deep sigh too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1138064"
msgid "It makes me want to sigh again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1138108"
msgid "Anyways, #C236196003BB#CDEF's #RUBS   program#RUBEtechnique#REND was terrifying,\nwasn't it? It felt like I was melting from\nthe inside."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1138968"
msgid "For sure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1138980"
msgid "What else can I say?\nI must have picked it up from my Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1139336"
msgid "From the way #C236196003Archer#CDEF worded it,\nI fear he said something scandalous."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1139832"
msgid "Now I'M the pervert?!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1139992"
msgid "Don't worry so much.\nGive or take 5 around the sides,\nyou're actually at a capable weight, Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1140508"
msgid "The next Sentinel is #C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF, huh?\nShe's also gonna be another challenge."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1140948"
msgid "…out of curiosity, Master,\nwho here is your type?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1141220"
msgid "…ahh, I wonder if he's trying to have a\nchange of pace, since I've been so down…"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1141632"
msgid "Rin"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1141636"
msgid "Rani"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1142684"
msgid "Well then, if you ever find someone who's\nyour type, be sure to tell me about it, Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1142776"
msgid "Let's cut to the chase, shall we?\nBetween #C236196003Leo#CDEF, #C236196003Julius#CDEF, #C236196003Gatou#CDEF, and #C236196003Shinji Matou#CDEF\nfor good(?) measure――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1142960"
msgid "Who would you say is your type, Master?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1143064"
msgid "Leo"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1143072"
msgid "Julius"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1143084"
msgid "Gatou"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1143092"
msgid "Shinji"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1143100"
msgid "Archer"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1143180"
msgid "Phrasing, sir. Phrasing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1143508"
msgid "#C236196003Julius#CDEF?\nI guess women are easily attracted to\nguys who are cold and mysterious."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1143700"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji Matou#CDEF? Sure, he did\nset himself up to be the class favorite.\nThe boy's got a future ahead of him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1143920"
msgid "………a switch flipped off from within me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1143972"
msgid "I glare at #C236196003Archer#CDEF with a look that says, \"Seriously?\"\nThis is no mere flattery.\nWho's my type? The #C236196003Archer#CDEF Type!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1144124"
msgid "………\nDo you… mean that? Seriously?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1144276"
msgid "Ah, erm… I guess I should say \"thanks.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1144584"
msgid "And so, the brief chat continued."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1144900"
msgid "Sad, isn't it, Master?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1144932"
msgid "So basically, I guess he's not pleased\nthat he got stuck with me for a Master?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1145692"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF is running out of pawns if she's\nrecycling Servants. This is where we make our\npush, Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1145804"
msgid "…#C236196003Archer#CDEF is right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1146236"
msgid "His words loosen my tensed shoulders."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1146280"
msgid "…yeah, this is just enough for me to handle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1146564"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF… the last wall guarding #C236196003BB#CDEF.\nAnd also our greatest threat yet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1147400"
msgid "I understand that. I do.\nExcept――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1147964"
msgid "I guess there's no \"quit\" command in your\nthought-routine. When it comes to struggling for\nsurvival, you've got the best stats."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1148712"
msgid "Looks like those clothes were bothering him\nmore than I imagined."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1148780"
msgid "It must be because he just never really\nlooked natural in those rocker restraints."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1148908"
msgid "Wow. So you're into clothes that\n\"rather than reveal, show off\"?\nI had no idea."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1149436"
msgid "…though, \"when in Rome,\" as the saying goes.\nThat outfit does fit in with\nthe #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1149656"
msgid "…ah, I see…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1149840"
msgid "Whoa, nice body!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1150112"
msgid "…sorry, I went overboard."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1150308"
msgid "…I fervently pray for this moment in\na lukewarm hell to quickly pass."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1150648"
msgid "Thank you very much."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1151024"
msgid "…so he says, while seemingly liking them…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1151068"
msgid "I guess if he's enjoying it, I'll let him be…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1151316"
msgid "#C236196003Archer#CDEF is wearing unremarkable, normal clothes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1152360"
msgid "No, no, as if!\nI shake my head and dispel the awful mental image."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1152932"
msgid "…Master?\nYour #RUBS   vitals #RUBEreadings#REND seem to be going off the charts…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1153400"
msgid "―――Woah!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1153668"
msgid "Still, #C236196003Archer#CDEF wearing glasses hit me with that much of a shock."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1154984"
msgid "After returning to our room, #C236196003Archer#CDEF lets out a sigh.\nDid I do something wrong…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1155432"
msgid "Saying this, #C236196003Archer#CDEF chuckles."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1155712"
msgid "Hm… What's so funny?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1155884"
msgid "I-it's nothing!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1156056"
msgid "#C236196003Archer#CDEF looks somewhat hurt."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1157560"
msgid "How rude.\nThat was pure, unadulterated skill."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1157900"
msgid "This makes me even more worried.\nHm? You say having a dependable Master\nshould put me at ease?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1158308"
msgid "Actually, that was a tactless of me to ask.\nNever mind. You're not THAT twisted of a person."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1158780"
msgid "…that smile is making me very uncomfortable,\nMaster."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1159060"
msgid "………………\n………………\n………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1159180"
msgid "I'll talk if you want to talk, Master.\nAnything you want to say to me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1159340"
msgid "Ahh, yeah. That."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1159952"
msgid "Fine.\nThen I have an idea."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1160404"
msgid "100 grams of a given food has just under\n5 kilocalories. Remember that well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1160908"
msgid "…man, he picks the worst time to dump all this on me.\nThis is why he has such an awful personality."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1162000"
msgid "Is he good at balancing? Or just cheap……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1162048"
msgid "You say something, Master?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1162076"
msgid "Oh, just that I'm blessed to have\nsuch a tall, wonderful Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1163204"
msgid "#C236196003Archer#CDEF stares off into the distance."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1163272"
msgid "…I guess he's reminiscing about the past he left behind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1293576"
msgid "…………………(staaaaare)."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1293612"
msgid "Clearly, the way #C236196003Caster#CDEF is acting is NOT good."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1293772"
msgid "Staaaaaaaaare!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1294144"
msgid "If I had to say, maybe something about\noverburdening #C236196003Caster#CDEF in battle?\nSorry, as usual. But thanks, #C236196003Caster#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1294288"
msgid "Kya☆\nI'm unworthy of your nice words鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1294464"
msgid "Is that so?\nReally, thanks again, #C236196003Caster#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1294528"
msgid "Alright then, that takes care of that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1294572"
msgid "Stoooooppp! Dang, I almost got carried away!\nThat wasn't what my problem was about!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1295396"
msgid "A-anyway, that Oppai Monster is bad news!\nHere am I being patient in so many ways―\nThis is driving me crazy!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1295752"
msgid "Yet, she hates #C236196003Lip#CDEF THIS much…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1295812"
msgid "Could it be that―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1296212"
msgid "―――Gah!? W-who's spreading\nsuch unfounded… somewhat-founded\ngossip about me!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1296412"
msgid "D-damn that little brat!\nHow dare he uncover the secret I sometimes\nhide cutely, sometimes desperately…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1297656"
msgid "…I don't get her reasoning, but anyhow,\ngreeting #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF seemed to be stressful for #C236196003Caster#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1297912"
msgid "That's not it! Mine is, err…\nLet's call it, \"cowardice.\"\nIt's an uneasiness every woman has."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1298552"
msgid "#C236196003Caster#CDEF's so-called \"tender\" #C000246204SG#CDEF is:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1298984"
msgid "I'm the one who's embarrassed!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1299160"
msgid "I say―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1299236"
msgid "A quick reply."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1299368"
msgid "I reflexively nod, \"Yes, I'll be careful.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1299552"
msgid "Also, only be as kind to #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF as necessary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1299688"
msgid "Both, of course鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1300316"
msgid "But―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1300452"
msgid "So…"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1300464"
msgid "Caster, make me something."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1300492"
msgid "H-huh?\n\"MAKE\"?\nYou mean make something to eat…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1300856"
msgid "I want to eat #C236196003Caster#CDEF's cooking."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1301092"
msgid "I  want  #C236196003Caster#CDEF's  home  cooking."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1301444"
msgid "Then I shall fulfill your request and prepare\na light meal, posthaste.\nPlease allow me about an hour."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1301548"
msgid "*clap* goes #C236196003Caster#CDEF's hands.\nAlong with her clap in prayer appears a small\nkitchen in a corner of My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1302096"
msgid "…………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1302396"
msgid "………how… is it?\nI'm well aware that I'm still inadequate,\nbut I did… try my best, you know…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1302496"
msgid "―――Well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1302512"
msgid "―――Umm."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1302552"
msgid "\nThis is, perfectly delicious――?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1303724"
msgid "T-that's a given!\nIt's no matter if I'm a poor cook, but\nfor my Darling, I―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1303812"
msgid "I can't help but feel personally frustrated\nif I can't serve my husband delicious food!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1303904"
msgid "#C236196003Caster#CDEF insists, cheeks flushing with shame."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1304272"
msgid "No! Don't go making this worse, NO!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1304388"
msgid "Thank you for the food.\nVery yummy, indeed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1304444"
msgid "Y-yes!\nI'm glad you enjoyed it, Master!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1304756"
msgid "…?\n#C236196003Caster#CDEF sighs as if she's worn-out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1306000"
msgid "#C080080080I'm in the center of a sprawling, sacred space.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1306876"
msgid "Aww, do you lack the tact to impress a woman?\nThe disrespect! Were it not your vivid stupor,\nI would have to bite your limbs off."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1307008"
msgid "Verily, how long shall you shrink from me?\nShall you curry my favor, or flee in haste?\nEither suffices, for either results the same."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1307304"
msgid "What is that?\nWhat am I even looking at?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1307348"
msgid "The word \"gigantic\" would not suffice to\ndescribe her dizzying, overwhelming presence.\nDespite appearing so large to me,\nI can tell that she's positioned far away."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1308024"
msgid "What feeble human would risk\na breath in her presence?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1308280"
msgid "Go on, act freely. You need only fear me.\nIt would sit poorly with me to see you\noffer reverence."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1308380"
msgid "…*gasp*!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1308512"
msgid "…still, my predicament hasn't changed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1308552"
msgid "I'll have to figure out WHY I'm in a place like\nthis later. Returning alive is my top goal.\nI must overcome that icy gaze though―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1308824"
msgid "…all this gawking is going to get me killed!"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1308944"
msgid "Who are you…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1309768"
msgid "She said \"Darling,\" albeit in the most apathetic\nway! I need some kind of explanation…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1310352"
msgid "But…"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1311208"
msgid "You intend to eat me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1311512"
msgid "\"What OLD HAG could be so massive!?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1312460"
msgid "What recourse have I?\nThis is how I have always been."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1314652"
msgid "Some nonsensical being in some nonsensical\nplace won't force us apart…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1315128"
msgid "#C080080080The light strengthens――No, it dims.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1315652"
msgid "And HEY! Why are you dreaming about OTHER\nWOMEN!? Stop messing about and WAKE UP!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1315744"
msgid "\nAfter exiting the tunnel of light,\nI find myself back in My Fox-Rampant Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1315972"
msgid "Thank goodness…!\nYou're awake, right, Darling!?\nI was worried to death…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1316472"
msgid "…so, about that.\nI'm jumping topics here, buuuut…\n………did you happen to see her?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1316724"
msgid "#C236196003Caster#CDEF batters the bed with slams."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1316952"
msgid "I-I'm happy to hear you say that, but…\nAgh! PLEASE forget what you saw!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1317140"
msgid "Apparently, #C236196003Caster#CDEF despises her \"Origin.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1317208"
msgid "…of course. Which is why… if I were to ever\ngrow more tails, would you please tear\nthem to shreds…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1317360"
msgid "I don't know how painful that would be,\nbut #C236196003Caster#CDEF is entrusting me with that important task.\nThat much I understand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1317508"
msgid "………now, let's put that aside."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1317812"
msgid "……………!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1317920"
msgid "How ever should I express this elation!? Oh,\nshall I ask the #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF's ethics system? Maybe\nthey can raise the game's rating for us!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1318464"
msgid "…no doubt. That's the level of spirit that I saw."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1318516"
msgid "W-was that the ONE thing you had to go and\nremember!? You're such a DUMMY, Darling!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1318600"
msgid "Fine, okaaaay. I geeeeetttt it.\nGood wives only grow one tail max―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1319992"
msgid "Maybe she's not feeling well, I wonder."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1320140"
msgid "Only brutes go chit-chat鷙-ing with other women\nin front of their wives."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1320684"
msgid "Erm, this is where I should say―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1320724"
msgid "How about a date, then?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1320780"
msgid "MIKON!?\nA d-d-date!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1321320"
msgid "Darling…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1322176"
msgid "Let's stop by later and shower her\nin compliments, Darling☆"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1322256"
msgid "Um, Darling…\nHave you remembered anything about me yet?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1322324"
msgid "…okay.\nNo, please don't worry about it.\nMemory or not, you're still my #RUBS  Master#RUBEDarling#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1322704"
msgid "So in times like these, smile.\nThat's the best offering you can dedicate\nto the fallen."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1324388"
msgid "And when they're females no less."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1324652"
msgid "Please don't look so troubled. You look like\nyou're itching to embrace me, no?\nMainly… around here鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1324836"
msgid "You're making this room's \"Seriousness Gauge\"\ncrash downwards, fast."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1325020"
msgid "Moreover, Darling has been especially worried\nover #C236196003Rani#CDEF… ah. Maybe I'll handle things\nthis time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1325204"
msgid "…but, I see now. I've been thinking about\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF carefully, like I did with #C236196003Rin#CDEF.\nThat's why I'm so down―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1325636"
msgid "#C236196003Caster#CDEF is right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1325772"
msgid "Since I'm the only one that sees the #C000246204SG#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1326116"
msgid "A young girl's sorrows are pure and sweet.\nExposing a Secret Garden… is painful, but it\ncan also be pretty fun!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1326360"
msgid "Affected by #C236196003Caster#CDEF, who sighed, I also take a\ndeep, deep sigh."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1326568"
msgid "It makes me want to sigh again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1327880"
msgid "We don't know any details about the #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF.\nPlease be careful, Darling."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1328096"
msgid "Right as we entered the room,\n#C236196003Caster#CDEF started grumbling."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1328348"
msgid "My secret…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1328748"
msgid "Wh―――!?\n\"Body\"? She means, in THAT way?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1329100"
msgid "Rin"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1329104"
msgid "Rani"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1329132"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF, you say?\nHrmm… I see Darling has a leg fetish!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1329500"
msgid "No, how could I ever?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1329712"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF, #C236196003Julius#CDEF, #C236196003Gatou#CDEF, and seawe―err, #C236196003Shinji#CDEF:\namong these, who do you prefer the most?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1329912"
msgid "Wh―――!?\n\"Body\"? She means, in THAT way?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1330184"
msgid "Leo"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1330192"
msgid "Julius"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1330204"
msgid "Gatou"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1330212"
msgid "Shinji"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1330464"
msgid "Darling    is   confused!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1330496"
msgid "Oooout! Three outs, change sides!\nThe #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF may allow Darling\nto like that seaweed, but I WILL NOT!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1331000"
msgid "Hehe. In all honesty,\nI longed to have a secret just between us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1331792"
msgid "About #C236196003Leo#CDEF and #C236196003Julius#CDEF, right? It's tragic to\nhave lost them both… but you mustn't wallow\nin regret."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1332652"
msgid "So please don't hesitate to depend on us\nwhen you're suffering.\nYou're not alone, Darling."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1332784"
msgid "And always by my side is my Servant―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1333300"
msgid "Pressured by #C236196003Caster#CDEF as her tail puffs up,\nI involuntarily nod,\n\"Yep.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1333496"
msgid "…you're wondering about #C236196003BB#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1333832"
msgid "Showing your enemy sympathy means\nendangering your life. Do you realize that?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1333920"
msgid "…that goes without saying.\nI realize that, but―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1333988"
msgid "…well, hearing you say that at least tells me\nthat you're not one to shrink away, Darling."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1334080"
msgid "Please, act in accordance with your heart.\nTo aid in that is a Servant's duty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1334160"
msgid "However, um, Darling? If you have the time\nto worry about your enemy, maybe you can spare\nme a little appreciation?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1334276"
msgid "…ahh. Looks like I went and made #C236196003Caster#CDEF feel very lonely."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1334368"
msgid "Then let's spend this time for her benefit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1334648"
msgid "…ouch!\nIf you're going to pull my tail,\ndo it more gently―――aaahh!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1334800"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF is the most troublesome enemy we've\nfaced yet. So please don't let your guard down,\n#RUBS  Master#RUBEDarling#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1336024"
msgid "Eh―wai―stop! Please!\nI humbly object to just sticking to one outfit!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1336440"
msgid "Yes! Outfit changes are justice鷙 DLC! DLC!\nOne outfit for a dollar would rake in so much\ncash―the #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF really is Hell鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1336632"
msgid "What do you think, Darling?\nIs it to your liking?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1336812"
msgid "I don't like you looking there.\nI-it's embarrassing…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1336876"
msgid "W-what did she… say?\n#C236196003Caster#CDEF? Embarrassed? No―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1336956"
msgid "Is everything starting to glitch out…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1337308"
msgid "Let's keep this energy up until an\n\"oopsie\" happens between us!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1337468"
msgid "…that was close."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1337700"
msgid "By the way, Darling.\nUm… I want to hear what you really think."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1338292"
msgid "It's―――utterly adorable."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1338428"
msgid "It appears my fears were groundless.\nHmmmm, I see, I see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1338760"
msgid "…hey, wait a second."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1338828"
msgid "Hehehe.\nThat bit is my desire to be blinded by love鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1339252"
msgid "#C236196003Caster#CDEF is happier than usual.\nHer tail is waving back and forth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1339732"
msgid "Yeahhh… ahaha…\nI'm happy to hear you call me a \"deity,\"\nbut it also makes me sad."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1340016"
msgid "#C236196003Caster#CDEF tries to fool me with a phony \"ohohoho.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1340492"
msgid "What's this fox so excited about…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1341128"
msgid "So, let's continue to take them on鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1341324"
msgid "Kya!\nThe power of our love is COSMIC!\nIt's bonkers. Totally bonkers!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1341516"
msgid "You've been training day in and day out,\nDarling. Please, accept this gift from #C236196003Tamamo#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1342912"
msgid "―――Ahhh! My ears!\nThey're not for tugging…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1343044"
msgid "For all your hard work,\nI'd like to support you with a gift.\nPlease take it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1343628"
msgid "\"Major achievement\"?\nWhat the heck did I do?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1343932"
msgid "You've proven mastery of my strengths and\nbrought out my best."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1344468"
msgid "…hm… I wonder if I can be both the partner\nAND the heroine in distress…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1344576"
msgid "………………\n………………\n………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1344624"
msgid "#C236196003Caster#CDEF's tail hangs dejectedly.\nWhat's the deal…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1345080"
msgid "R-really?\nI'm helpful?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1345476"
msgid "Ah, and if you'll allow it…\nI can show you that side of me, but in bed?\nThat might be easier, actually.☆"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1462012"
msgid "\"What kind of hero was #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1462408"
msgid "It's true, of course.\nThe #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF's records are objective facts.\nHow they're interpreted is up to the reader."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1462732"
msgid "……!"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1462852"
msgid "Were you really a tyrant…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1463312"
msgid "…created to be so?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1464192"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF said \"ancient gods and modern gods.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1464592"
msgid "…however."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1464608"
msgid "\"Created\" sounds a bit unsettling.\nIt's sort of, like, unbefitting of #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1464720"
msgid "You heard that? It's not befitting of me…\nI think so too, but it's true.\nI was created by the gods' design."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1465096"
msgid "The gods didn't create me to support humans.\nThey needed me because they feared humans."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1466600"
msgid "Those were the circumstances of my birth.\nUnlike all of you, I didn't come to be from\nliving an honest life."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1466816"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF speaks indifferently and cynically."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1466880"
msgid "His look carries scornful animosity towards the gods,\nbut no disdain at all towards himself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1467400"
msgid "And isn't that the \"self\" that you and I have?\nNo matter if one's body is crafted, or if\none was someone else's copy to begin with."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1467724"
msgid "If that's true,\nthen I can accept #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF's legend more."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1468064"
msgid "Yes. I didn't heed their intent.\nThough I WAS created, I was a born as a new\nform of life. And if that was the case―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1468208"
msgid "Then there was no sense in supporting\nthe ideas of some old gods.\nI lived as I saw fit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1468484"
msgid "I decreed myself king and ascertained what\nI saw as the right way to rule. That's all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1468576"
msgid "I governed over Uruk because it pleased me.\nThe gods' intent took no part in it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1469412"
msgid "I wound up getting his #C000246204SG#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1469804"
msgid "Were I to reincarnate, I'd pump blood as a man,\nbut my heart would rouse only for those of my\nera. I don't see that changing here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1469940"
msgid "Hence, I'm only taking a nice tour of the\n#C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF. I'll pay you with a secret for\nhaving escorted me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1470252"
msgid "…not one bit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1470268"
msgid "In all seriousness, why does such an absurd\nServant even exist…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1470852"
msgid "Hm? Your complexion doesn't look so bad,\nbut your vitals are dropping."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1471540"
msgid "I awoke in the wilderness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1471656"
msgid "\nSuddenly, I heard a far-off call."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1471756"
msgid "Curious about that call, I lifted my heavy eyelids."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1471824"
msgid "I had just awoken, but I was not rational."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1472144"
msgid "\n\n\n\n\"O chain. Bring the lynchpin back to us.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1472308"
msgid "I lacked human will."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1472456"
msgid "…however."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1472796"
msgid "I learned wisdom and reason.\nShe taught me of how Heaven and Earth work."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1472940"
msgid "\"#C236196003Enkidu#CDEF.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1473068"
msgid "My role.\nMy mission."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1473228"
msgid "My reason for being.\nMy reason for being created.\nMy reason to risk my life."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1473396"
msgid "Unlike me, he seems to grow.\nUnlike me, human blood is mixed within him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1473508"
msgid "Until he becomes an adult,\nI can't compete with him.\nUnless we fight on equal terms,\nit won't count as admonishment."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1473644"
msgid "\n―――And so, I gazed upon the fortress city."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1473956"
msgid "Arrogance? I could only think that the gods had been mistaken.\nThe child #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF had no shortcomings worthy of admonishment."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1474360"
msgid "The people of Uruk grieved.\n\"Why has it come to this?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1474872"
msgid "\n…what a powerful ego."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1475028"
msgid "\n\"You? Admonish me?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1475256"
msgid "Our battle lasted several days."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1475292"
msgid "I was a spear; an axe; a shield; a beast."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1475780"
msgid "\nFinally―――Who had won the battle?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1476332"
msgid "Regardless, I heard his words, then followed\nhis lead and collapsed as he did.\nI even thought, \"just like a mirror.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1476464"
msgid "\"Do you regret having to use your treasures?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1476512"
msgid "For some reason, I asked this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1476608"
msgid "So said #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF, in a cheerful voice."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1476744"
msgid "\"Ever since you came, my stores have been busy.\nYou made me develop this stupid habit of\nthrowing my treasures around.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1478532"
msgid "\"Fool.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1478628"
msgid "\"Listen――. That means――. Got it?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1478680"
msgid "He went on.\n\nAs he did, I heard words as precious as the stars.\nThis was the moment where I truly had a \"self.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1479276"
msgid "\"I won't forgive them! Why must you die?\nIf punishment must be rendered, lay it unto me!\nWas this crime born not from my own selfishness?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1479428"
msgid "The sky still cries.\nUnable to see, I make to him a suggestion."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1479976"
msgid "I admired him for that. Despised him all the same."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1480028"
msgid "We were created by the same father.\nWhy were we such different creatures?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1480104"
msgid "\"You have worth. A unique worth.\nThus, I say: in this world, I have but one friend.\nThat's why――\nyour worth won't change, not for all of eternity.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1480260"
msgid "I was a weapon.\nWeapons are made to be replaced every generation.\nMy worth, my mystique, existed only in this era."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1480380"
msgid "At the cost of being alone forever,\nhe made me something else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1480528"
msgid "\"Fool.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1480724"
msgid "He knew his weaknesses, but wouldn't change them.\nHe knew his strengths, but wouldn't flatter them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1480900"
msgid "Across this man's pride,\nI left an all-unhealing wound."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1481120"
msgid "\nMy records end here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1481152"
msgid "I'm a regret which has already vanished."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1481440"
msgid "\n\n…I squint from the light.\nIt seems I was having an old dream."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1481520"
msgid "……………………………………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1481560"
msgid "I happen to look up and see #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF\npressing his eyelids with his fingers."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1481760"
msgid "………it appears so.\nApparently, I was a tad tired as well.\nI saw something trivial yet nostalgic."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1482160"
msgid "Maybe he had been experiencing the same dream I had."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1482260"
msgid "I have to ask.\n#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF, his contractor, asks him―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1482388"
msgid "Do I resemble your friend?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1482416"
msgid "Is it true? Does Gil love humans?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1482612"
msgid "I never even had any, first of all.\nEven if I did have one, I've forgotten their\nname, for I can no longer speak it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1482840"
msgid "\"I can no longer speak it.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1483080"
msgid "Moron. In my past, I've never had\neven one acquaintance who resembles\na half-wit like yourself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1483184"
msgid "You're the one and only you.\nDon't feed me every bit of nonsense that\ncomes to your mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1483432"
msgid "…those words just made me really happy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1483476"
msgid "――――――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1483768"
msgid "How do I see humans!? Look at how I treated you\nand figure it out! Don't ask me something\nso obvious!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1484028"
msgid "If I were to do as he said, it would be obvious\nas to what his stance on humans is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1484548"
msgid "It's far from the truth about me.\nBear that in mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1484612"
msgid "Saying this, #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF leaves ahead of me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1484684"
msgid "I also hurry out of bed and run after his golden back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1485908"
msgid "I finally looked into the last part of #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF's legend."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1486820"
msgid "Okay, so―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1486884"
msgid "――――What?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1487048"
msgid "I see. So this means you read until the\nend of my epic. I won't ask why\nyou pose that question then."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1487552"
msgid "I should――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1488140"
msgid "…wait, hold on a second."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1488484"
msgid "It must be the same for my childhood self.\nIf he knew what he would become, then perhaps\nhe would seek to stop his own development."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1489452"
msgid "Is this the root of who #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF is…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1489844"
msgid "Until then, I had never mourned a death\nor feared death. I wasn't even aware of such\nthings."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1489948"
msgid "Still, someone as powerful as me was now\ngone. I knew death came for all, but that's\nwhen I first felt it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1490064"
msgid "\"Someone as powerful as me\" must be referring to #C236196003Enkidu#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1490440"
msgid "Of course, it's not as if I WASN'T thinking\nabout the plant of eternal youth and life.\nI needed one for my treasury for completion."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1490572"
msgid "It was a task I would've had to undertake\nwhether they returned to dust or not.\nAlso, I had found a reason."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1491128"
msgid "Still, even my folly surpasses what you humans\npossess. …disgracefully, I swallowed my\nshame and pressed on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1491404"
msgid "He speaks nostalgically."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1491608"
msgid "He probably really was afraid of death.\nBut that only serves as one reason."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1492140"
msgid "When I reached the underworld, I asked the sage\nabout the secret of eternal youth and life."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1492664"
msgid "The sage must have become timid after\ndenying his own being.\nHe had passed onto me his secret."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1492916"
msgid "\n\"I know that you do not obey the gods.\"\n\"I won't ask of you to beg Anu for mercy.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1493000"
msgid "\"Instead――I will share with you a secret.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1493316"
msgid "An elixir of eternal youth and life would\nexhibit well in my treasury. I descended the\nabyss, bottled up the plant, and resurfaced."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1494072"
msgid "I let a serpent have the miracle plant.\nThat conceited vermin snatched my\neternal life while I was bathing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1494200"
msgid "I've always endorsed desire. And it came back\nto bite me, in the form of a slithering\nserpent's mere appetite."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1494460"
msgid "That's it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1494560"
msgid "The legend states that the snake stole\nthe miracle plant from #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1495308"
msgid "Yet in the end, I was but a son of man….\nThat's all. I was young and reckless."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1495900"
msgid "If I had to confess, that was my first taste of\njoy. Collecting treasure is instinct to me.\nAkin to breathing. It brings me no joy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1496148"
msgid "I celebrated such facts as my possession of\na human perspective. Until that moment,\nI hadn't been human."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1496940"
msgid "In the end, I had nothing left―――\nI came to understand that THIS was my one and\nonly reward for completing my work."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1497364"
msgid "I had no need for eternal life. My eyes have\nalways been able to see the future.\nI never had any reason to fear death."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1497776"
msgid "Sorry. I said before that was I born complete,\nbut that was incorrect. There was a period\nwhere I was naive."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1498068"
msgid "I looked up at the wide expanse of the sky.\nEven with my eyes, it took many moons to\nsee through it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1498304"
msgid "…and I saw that future.\nIt was a galvanizing sight.\nI think I then lost my will to go on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1498988"
msgid "That how #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF's journey ended."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1499300"
msgid "Compared to the truth he came to realize at that moment,\nthe miracle plant was but a trifle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1499500"
msgid "He got more!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1499588"
msgid "Hmph. Come now.\nCollecting treasure is instinct to me.\nJust let it be."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1499840"
msgid "…anyway, now I finally get the picture."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1500076"
msgid "Oh? Could that look be one of reverence?\nVery well. Feast your eyes. I can change into\nanother outfit if you'd like."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1500712"
msgid "No way!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1500724"
msgid "I never make embarrassing emotional outbursts like her!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1502904"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF's words stab me like a spear.\nHow could I even GAIN weight…\nwhen I'm paired up with this guy…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1503312"
msgid "AH―――!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1505792"
msgid "Of course, there's no use in appraising the\nspoils of war just yet. She's after YOU."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1506092"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF. How far will that woman get on my nerves?\nTo send me such a vulgar #RUBS   program#RUBEtechnique#REND…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1506680"
msgid "I didn't expect #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF to catch me\nlooking at him unimpressed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1507120"
msgid "I was wrong, AUO!\nI will NEVER look at you unimpressed ever again!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1507332"
msgid "I shake my head with all I have, \"Not at all.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1507804"
msgid "You're the one who told me to curl up!\nWhat a brilliant change of mind!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1508400"
msgid "So, dungeon exploring all the time is tedious,\nno? #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, talk. Though whimsical, it IS\nthe chat time you covet so much."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1508544"
msgid "…\"The chat time I covet\"…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1508896"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF.\nAs a man, which woman would you\nwish to pin down?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1508980"
msgid "……huh?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1509276"
msgid "Rin"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1509280"
msgid "Rani"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1510504"
msgid "…that's oddly specific."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1511096"
msgid "Leo"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1511104"
msgid "Julius"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1511116"
msgid "Gatou"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1511124"
msgid "Gilgamesh"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1511708"
msgid "4,000 years!? I just got FLAT-OUT rejected…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1511756"
msgid "But this is odd, why do I feel dejected…?\nWe've just been talking casually.\nWhy am I taking damage from this?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1512888"
msgid "…oh yeah.\nI need to think about defeating #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1513608"
msgid "That's WAY too big a scale.\nUnlike the golden King of Heroes, I can't handle that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1514180"
msgid "―――Let's refocus.\nFirst thing is to defeat #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1514544"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF had her usual enthusiasm in that previous broadcast."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1514864"
msgid "…I know that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1514892"
msgid "I know that, but―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1515212"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF's eyes pierce me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1516348"
msgid "Your enemy is my enemy.\nIf you decide to stand and fight,\nthen I'll obviously stand with you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1516808"
msgid "Waku Waku Splash?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1517248"
msgid "Hmm. Whomever ordered this outfit has rather\nfine taste. Don't you think so, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1517356"
msgid "Oh boy………\nI feel bad for cheery #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1517756"
msgid "Slang like that has some soul to it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1518804"
msgid "…he's pitying me.\nHe's actually pitying me.\nHe's straight up, ACTUALLY PITYING ME!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1519120"
msgid "That battle was unexpectedly entertaining.\nMongrel as you may be, if this is your caliber,\nthen I'll permit you audiences with me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1519796"
msgid "\"Rares\"…?\nAh, those rare enemies."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1519836"
msgid "Right, I took them all down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1520168"
msgid "I can't believe it.\n#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF? Praising ME?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1520664"
msgid "I notice #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF seemingly flaunting\nhis golden armor at me as he peeks into my wallet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1521108"
msgid "Correct.\nThis barren treasury is how this pauper gets by."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1521172"
msgid "……………\n……………\n……………curses. Now I'm shedding tears…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1521472"
msgid "H-he's crying over THIS!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1521840"
msgid "Also, what's a \"#C236196003Hasan#CDEF\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1522124"
msgid "Who would laugh at such a lame joke!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1522436"
msgid "Heh… hehehe…. hehehehehe…\nI've saved up… and quite a bit…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1522776"
msgid "Behold!\nNOW you may kneel before your Master!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1522828"
msgid "Hm? Did something happen to your stores?\n………\n………well, well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1522908"
msgid "…I won.\nA total blowout."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1523292"
msgid "Or what?\nAre you making a display of your poverty\nto seek money from the affluent?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1523384"
msgid "I get it, that makes sense.\nYou're showing me how poor you are\nbecause you want charity from me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1523492"
msgid "AS IF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1523740"
msgid "…okay. Saving up this small amount won't cut it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1524004"
msgid "…money cap, here I come."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1524460"
msgid "Yes, and my cheer shall only grow,\nfor today is when my revenge comes to fruition, golden king."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1524612"
msgid "Hm? Very well…\nI see some sizable weight now compared\nto last time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1524792"
msgid "………………\n………………\n……………… I… did it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1524848"
msgid "I did it. I did it. IdiditIdiditIdiditIdidit.\nAt last, I made my comeback against #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1525100"
msgid "I was right to assign you to fixing the\ntreasury. Now, I'll be using my share of it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1525188"
msgid "…hm?\nThat sounded a bit strange."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1526300"
msgid "Still, I can definitely tell that #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF looks satisfied…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1526380"
msgid "I didn't quite get what I was expecting,\nbut just being able to drag those words out\nof him is kind of a win in my book…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1526740"
msgid "???\nHe's being unusually brief and direct with me.\nMaybe I did something to make #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF mad?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1527544"
msgid "…oh, I didn't know…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1527872"
msgid "Accordingly, I've used just as many Code Casts―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1528044"
msgid "If I say,\n\"Prideful kings don't typically accept\nhelp from their subjects!\"\nWill he get angry?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1528348"
msgid "…so, basically:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1528368"
msgid "This Servant thinks it's only natural\nothers should serve him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1529492"
msgid "After such success, you have nothing to fear.\nSeek as many flawless victories as possible―\nYou'll be renowned throughout the #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF."
msgstr ""

