#. unk_op1659
msgctxt "1676992"
msgid "　You cannot carry any more\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."
msgstr "　Você não pode carregar mais\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "1677048"
msgid "You may now save your current game data\n            as #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."
msgstr "Agora você pode salvar seus dados\n         como #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "1677132"
msgid "     You may use this data to carry\nover elements to the start of a new game."
msgstr "     Você pode usar esses dados para levar\nelementos ao início de um novo jogo."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "1677212"
msgid "Please be careful to not overwrite\n  the data while you are saving."
msgstr "Tome cuidado para não sobrescrever\n  os dados ao salvar."

#. unk_op1653
msgctxt "1677280"
msgid "Would you like to save your Clear Data?"
msgstr "Deseja salvar seus Clear Data?"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line1
msgctxt "1677320"
msgid "Are you sure you wish to exit"
msgstr "Tem certeza de que deseja sair"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line2
msgctxt "1677352"
msgid "without saving the Clear Data?"
msgstr "sem salvar os Clear Data?"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1677384"
msgid "I enter the private room #C236196003Sakura#CDEF prepared for us.\nThis is a space totally just for my Servant and me."
msgstr "Entro no quarto particular que #C236196003Sakura#CDEF preparou.\nÉ um espaço só meu e do meu Servo."

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1677504"
msgid "Outside the window, it's nighttime.\nApparently this indicates all communication with\nthe Student Council Room has been severed."
msgstr "Do lado de fora da janela, é noite.\nPelo visto isso indica que toda comunicação com\na Sala do Grêmio foi cortada."

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1677632"
msgid "Here, we can talk about things we don't\nwant others listening to."
msgstr "Aqui podemos falar de coisas que não\nqueremos que ninguém escute."

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1677700"
msgid "Phew. Finally we can rest.\nWe hardly get any chances to even breathe,\nthough that's how it always goes."
msgstr "Ufa. Enfim podemos descansar.\nMal temos chance de respirar,\nmas é sempre assim mesmo."

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1677804"
msgid "Another room with some nice ambiance. A school\nin sunset glow, a private room at night. Well,\nas long as I can rest, I have no complaints."
msgstr "Outro quarto de clima agradável. Uma escola\nno brilho do pôr do sol, um quarto à noite.\nSe dá para descansar, não reclamo."

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1677944"
msgid "Wow! A fine private room! Good job,\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF! I was hoping for a room with this\ntype of mood!"
msgstr "Uau! Que belo quarto! Muito bem,\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF! Eu queria um quarto com\nesse clima mesmo!"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1678052"
msgid "Since this will be our base from now on,\n#C236196003#SVT#CDEF cautiously checks the room."
msgstr "Como esta será nossa base daqui em diante,\n#C236196003#SVT#CDEF inspeciona o quarto com cautela."

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1678144"
msgid "As for me… pathetically, the moment I entered the room,\nI was drained of my strength."
msgstr "Quanto a mim… que vergonha: assim que\nentrei no quarto, minhas forças se esvaíram."

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1678232"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF clears #SVT[her][his][her][his]# throat with an \"ahem\"\nand calmly begins to speak to #SVT[her][his][her][his]# amateur of a Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1678388"
msgid "#RUBS  Master#RUBEPraetor#REND.\nI never had any proof to back this up, but…\nYou've lost your memories, haven't you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1678508"
msgid "#C236196003Saber#CDEF looks at me with suspicion, which pains me terribly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1678584"
msgid "…I see.\nEven without my memories,\nmy body seems to remember all the time we spent together.\nBeing the cause of that expression on her face\nis enough to make me feel awful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1678760"
msgid "So it's true…\nIt's sad, but don't let it get you so down.\nYou're being honest with me. I'm glad."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1678860"
msgid "My memories are fragmented,\nand a sense of discomfort wells up within me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1678936"
msgid "Truthfully, as I am now, I can't remember even who I am.\nThere's definite proof that I fought together with #C236196003Saber#CDEF\nin the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, but my detailed memories\nare like the sights beyond a thick mist."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1679172"
msgid "…is that right? You have the same expression\nas the Praetor I remember―――\nIn that case, I must also confess something."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1679296"
msgid "I think we heard this from #C236196003Gawain#CDEF:\nmy memory isn't complete either."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1679380"
msgid "I get the feeling that what you lack is\nfor a deliberate purpose, but what I lack is\nfor a functional purpose."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1679492"
msgid "…just a hunch, though. It may be the case that\nwhen a Servant enters the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF,\nmemories gained in the Near Side are erased."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1679652"
msgid "…I had no idea.\nThough I understand, #C236196003Saber#CDEF's confession came as a shock."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1679744"
msgid "Even #C236196003#SVT#CDEF has lost memories, not just me.\nThis means we've both reverted back to the moment we met."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1679860"
msgid "Could it be that #C236196003Saber#CDEF's memories\nand my memories of us fighting alongside each other\nare lost forever―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1679988"
msgid "Hey! Don't make that face! I so badly want to\nhug you for some reason! My memory is\nhazy too, so don't stress me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1680104"
msgid "…mhm. At any rate, this means we must start\nall over again, Praetor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1680176"
msgid "From this point on, I shall determine if you're\nfit to be my Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1680248"
msgid "The answer will come in the end. Rest for now.\nRecover from your fatigue. Starting tomorrow,\nour daily routine begins."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1680368"
msgid "I answer #C236196003Archer#CDEF's question honestly, albeit with hesitation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1680448"
msgid "I can't lie to him.\nEven without my full memory, my body pleads to me not to do so."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1680532"
msgid "Truthfully, as I am now, I don't have definite\nproof of even who I am."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1680604"
msgid "I have memories of fighting alongside him\nin the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, but no matter\nhow hard I try, I see only clouded scenes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1680744"
msgid "So #C236196003Archer#CDEF says while crossing his arms in his usual smug pose.\nHe finds enjoyment in this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1680852"
msgid "W-what's with that look!? Why are you lifting\nthat chair? You going to swing it?\nYou want to swing it at me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1680964"
msgid "I mean, he says that he forgot…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1681000"
msgid "All memories of his Master up until now, so…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1681048"
msgid "Seriously!? You're not trying to make me\nremember by smacking me…!? Did you even\nforget how to act like a lady!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1681164"
msgid "Ah, well, from the beginning you\nnever really were a―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1681224"
msgid "Personal punishments are now over."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1681260"
msgid "My memory may be hazy, but I just couldn't\nfeel satisfied without a little protest.\nTruly, the human body is filled with secrets and mysteries."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1681404"
msgid "…anyway, let's sort things out.\nHonestly, just like you, I have some spots\nwhere my memory is vague."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1681508"
msgid "I recall our battles in the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF,\nbut my memories are obscure, as if bits\nand pieces were erased."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1681632"
msgid "Someone intended for you to have memory loss,\nwhile my case is a natural result. It's not\nreasonable to consider us the same."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1681760"
msgid "For Servants, going from the Near Side to the\nFar Side may be impossible in and of itself.\nI'm lucky to just have some burnt memory."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1681896"
msgid "…I was prepared for this after hearing it from #C236196003Gawain#CDEF,\nbut #C236196003Archer#CDEF's confession still came as a shock."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1682032"
msgid "Yet, despite all that, #C236196003Archer#CDEF's gaze hasn't a glint of worry.\nIt glows with a strong sense of trust."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1682152"
msgid "At any rate, we'll both just have to redo this\nall over again. An amateur Master and a\nnameless Heroic Spirit…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1682264"
msgid "Even so, as long as you trust yourself\nand the Servant you chose, the things you need\nto do won't change."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1682372"
msgid "#C236196003Archer#CDEF's voice beams with confidence."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1682428"
msgid "In the face of his reliability, I nod in reply,\nbrimming with determination too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1682512"
msgid "Now then, rest up and prepare for tomorrow.\nNo time to mess around.\nLife is about training daily."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1682612"
msgid "Those few words send a sharp pain through me.\nNow that I think about it, why haven't I told her\nabout this yet?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1682724"
msgid "Even without my memories,\nmy body seems to remember all the time we spent together."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1682808"
msgid "…I should be the one apologizing.\n#C236196003Caster#CDEF, concerned for her Master,\nknew she wouldn't like what she'd hear,\nbut still dove into the issue."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1682964"
msgid "…it's not too late, even now.\nI confess honestly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1683016"
msgid "About how I currently can't even remember who I am."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1683068"
msgid "About how I remember fighting in the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF with #C236196003Caster#CDEF,\nbut not any vivid details, no matter how much I try."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1683220"
msgid "Ah, that's not the case. Darling is Darling,\nmemories or not鷙 Please have confidence\nin that. Be like, \"YEAH!\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1683332"
msgid "Mikon!? N-no, no. Just talking to myself!\nMore importantly, erm, this is unfortunate!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1683420"
msgid "As a wife, it makes me so sad… *sob, sob, sob*.\nAnd we were so intimate, so close that\nother Servants were envious… *peek*."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1683548"
msgid "#C236196003Caster#CDEF hides her face in the hem of her Western clothes\nand breaks down crying.\n*sob, sob, sob*"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1683660"
msgid "…*tsk*.\nThat way of reacting is the one most\nimportant thing you DO recall, I see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1683744"
msgid "I have to give it to you Darling, you've got\niron self-control.\nYou're tough, even with hazy memory."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1683848"
msgid "Now, it's time for me to confess.\nSooo, to be honest… erm, it seems that I've\nforgotten various things too. Tee-hee."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1683968"
msgid "I still have memories of our battles in the\n#C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF. However, bits and pieces\nare vague for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1684088"
msgid "Ah, I already figured out the cause.\nServants, by design, are not made for\ntraveling from the Near Side to the Far Side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1684212"
msgid "Typically, they get burnt to cinders. I\nthink I was fortunate―only a portion of my\nmemory got toasted."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1684316"
msgid "But, it appears that my Darling's memory loss\nis a separate matter. No doubt that a scoundrel\nhad some hand in this!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1684436"
msgid "My case is grave, but #C236196003Caster#CDEF took that into\nconsideration with a smile and an \"it's alright.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1684548"
msgid "Let's look on the bright side, Darling.\nWe can refoster our love from the beginning!\nOne could see this as lucky!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1684664"
msgid "Ehehe… soooo, let's get cozy in bed toget―\nHuh? Why is my pillow in the corner? \"At least\nhold back on the first day, pink fox\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1684796"
msgid "Come onnnnnn!\nThis is no fun, Darlliinnnggg!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1684844"
msgid "Outside the window, it's nighttime.\nThis must be proof that we're not connected\nto the school building right now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1684960"
msgid "Here, we can talk about things we don't\nwant others listening to."
msgstr "Aqui podemos falar de coisas que não\nqueremos que ninguém escute."

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1685028"
msgid "What a shabby room. A far cry from\na bedchamber a king would rest in,\nbut it's suitable for you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1685128"
msgid "Then again, the best part of any journey is\nthrowing around insults in a cheap lodge.\nVery well―I have no discontent with this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1685260"
msgid "I'll use this seat. You may curl up and sleep\nin that corner of the room where I nicely\ncan't see you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1685364"
msgid "The old me would've probably obeyed\nhim and his haughty attitude, unwillingly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1685444"
msgid "But things are different now.\nAs far as his fighting goes,\nthe #C236196003King of Heroes#CDEF stock has crashed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1685560"
msgid "Like, what's up with those stats?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1685596"
msgid "I won't rest easy unless I at least mention this.\nIt's a matter of life or death for me, after all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1685696"
msgid "I take a deep breath, once again gather up all my courage,\nlook straight at #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF, and…"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1685808"
msgid "That wasn't the deal, you King of Zeros fraud!!!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1685860"
msgid "Hmph. ―――Take a guess."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1685888"
msgid "Don't \"take a guess\" me.\nJust spill it already."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1685936"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF said that #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF is an extraordinary Servant,\nbut if THAT'S extraordinary, then the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF market\nis going to crash and make the oil crisis look like a joke."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1686152"
msgid "…hmph. Ah, certainly, the details of how\nI became weakened are known only to me.\nI suppose I must then. Wait a moment."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1686272"
msgid "At that moment, a ripple undulated in the air.\nPorcelain-like objects appear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1686352"
msgid "Come now, it's simple.\nLike those other Heroic Spirits,\nI've manifested as a Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1686440"
msgid "\"You will join the #C000246204Moon Cell's Holy Grail War#CDEF.\"\nThat's the situation I was placed under."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1686548"
msgid "However, I was too powerful.\nThe #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF doesn't desire the strongest\nMaster, it desires the one who remains last."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1686684"
msgid "The outcome would be assured with me. I was\nnever suited for this #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF. Thus, I\nwas sealed away in the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1686852"
msgid "Fool. Do not lump me in with the likes of you\nall. I myself entered this place."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1686932"
msgid "I find it hilarious that instead of a brawl\nbetween seven #C000246204Magi#CDEF, it's a 128-man winner-\ntakes-all. Briefly put, it lacks desire."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1687076"
msgid "For me, the Near Side's #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF is\nas tiresome as it gets. Dramas without betrayal,\nschemes, or futility don't suit my taste."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1687228"
msgid "Thus, I gave up on the Near Side.\nThe #C000246204Far Side#CDEF is a place where humanity's\nmalicious information is trapped――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1687356"
msgid "That stagnance and murk is similar to primordial\nchaos. The silence is just right. So, I made\nlodge there and fell into a decadent dream."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1687496"
msgid "He plunged into that sky of darkness out of his own volition…\nOr, one could say that he yielded himself to a peaceful sleep."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1687624"
msgid "This Servant is the recreation of a Heroic\nSpirit who performed great feats.\nThough his human nature is far from the norm,\nthis man is on a totally different level."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1687792"
msgid "Sleeping within that darkness means losing one's self."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1687848"
msgid "A normal Heroic Spirit would probably have to\n\"stay awake, never sleeping so they can maintain their self.\"\nYet, this man \"did not harm his self while staying asleep.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1688016"
msgid "Truly, he wouldn't die even if you killed him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1688064"
msgid "However, it seems that I dozed a tad too long.\nAfter all, I DID leave my body to nil for a\nmillenium―no, close to an eternity."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1688192"
msgid "My soul didn't fade, but it's natural that my\nabilities have waned.\nSuch is my debilitation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1688288"
msgid "Isn't it fine, though? Thanks to that,\nyou were rescued. Don't they call that\na \"godsend\" in your country?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1688396"
msgid "Endeavor to my rehabilitation with humility.\nThis is a good opportunity. I'll amuse myself\nwith feeling what it's like to be weak too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1688532"
msgid "He says, as if dumping his problem on someone else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1688584"
msgid "…I still can't get a grasp of who he really is,\nbut this is undoubtedly #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF's true nature."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1688700"
msgid "A Heroic Spirit who flat-out rejects the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF,\ncalling it foolish.\nNo one's ally; unreliant on anyone; a self-centered Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1688856"
msgid "Maybe that's why he made a contract with\na novice #ROFS0001#RUBS  Magus#RUBE#C000246204Wizard#CDEF#REND like myself…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1688976"
msgid "What about yourself?\nHave your memories returned?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1689028"
msgid "You said you lost your memories\nof not only the Near Side's #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF,\nbut even from before joining, correct?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1689160"
msgid "Of course not.\nNot remembering who I am terrifies me.\nIt's just that this situation is too bizarre to\nworry about that right now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1689292"
msgid "I see.\nYou want to return to the Near Side that badly?\nThen, I must remind you once again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1689384"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nI have no interest in the Near Side.\nEscape is the objective all of YOU have."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1689488"
msgid "However――Once you complete that objective,\nyou will perish. The very moment you return,\nthe curtain will fall on you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1689608"
msgid "I don't understand what that means. My one\nand only hope is to return to the Near Side.\nWhat does that have to do with death?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1689736"
msgid "It's obvious. You have no #C000246204Command Seals#CDEF.\nOn your return, the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF will no longer\nconsider you a Master and will dispose of you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1689904"
msgid "Well, even without #C000246204Command Seals#CDEF, you can\ncontinue as long as you have a Servant, but――\nas I said, I won't go to the Near Side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1690052"
msgid "As a result, you'll return as a #ROFS0001#RUBS  Magus#RUBE#C000246204Wizard#CDEF#REND\nwith neither #C000246204Command Seals#CDEF nor a Servant.\nA mere life to be ended by the next opponent."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1690244"
msgid "…upon realizing it, I grip my left hand tightly,\nnow deprived of #C000246204Command Seals#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1690344"
msgid "I can't believe it.\nNOW I've come to realize the gravity of it all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1690412"
msgid "The moment I had used up all my #C000246204Command Seals#CDEF,\nI had ended up sacrificing my very life to this Servant――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1690536"
msgid "Don't look so gloomy.\nThis doesn't mean you are completely without\nhope, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1690620"
msgid "For example: after returning,\nyou could snatch the #C000246204Command Seals#CDEF off of\nother Masters and secure a new Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1690748"
msgid "Or, you could acquire power in this place which\nsurpasses mine and set me to work as a\nServant both in name and actuality."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1690872"
msgid "Struggle as best you can. That sight of you\nwill be an appetizer I relish. I'll accompany\nyou until I get bored."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1690988"
msgid "Naturally, I may sever the contract at any time.\nNever displease me… I would normally say,\nbut that won't accomplish anything."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1691116"
msgid "I won't demand perfection from you, a commoner.\nI haven't had so much to drink that I would\norder one to do what they can't do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1691244"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF. I'll give you the sole\nliberty to sever our contract. When you have\ngiven up on everything, simply say the word."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1691392"
msgid "When you say,\n\"there's nothing left for me anymore.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1691448"
msgid "\"There's nothing left.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1691472"
msgid "While I was in that darkness,\nthat's the one thing I chose not to say,\neven up until the very end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1691572"
msgid "He laughs, saying that the time will come\nwhen #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF will speak those words #[he][she]# \nrefused to speak."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1691704"
msgid "He's not fighting for #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF's sake.\nHe's a demon who accepted the contract to savor\n#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF's story."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1691856"
msgid "That being the case, the instant #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF\ngives up, I'll become useless to him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1691960"
msgid "You loathe me well. It seems that at last\nyou've come into your own. You wouldn't\nbe worth associating with otherwise."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1692080"
msgid "Now then, prepare for tomorrow and rest.\nThis entire affair runs deep.\nIt'll be difficult to survive without rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1692196"
msgid "This is my fight only.\nFlipping that logic, it also means that I\nshould act however I please."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1692292"
msgid "…I woke up to a ringing sound, like an alarm clock.\nIt's a call from the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1692388"
msgid "Waking up after getting plenty of sleep,\nI see the school is in sunset.\nSo this school really DOESN'T have any\nconcept of a day and time, it seems."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1692536"
msgid "Good. I slept pleasantly. Though the small size\nof this room is wanting, everything else is\ngenerally agreeable."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1692652"
msgid "Best of all is turning sides in the night and\nseeing your profile. I would still be fascinated\neven after staring for an entire night."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1692788"
msgid "…no, this is not the time. We should be\nstaying focused. Let us head to the Student\nCouncil Room, Praetor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1692896"
msgid "You awake yet?\nThen let's head to the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1692956"
msgid "What, something bothering you?\n…ah, it's this room, right? It does look\npretty lonely with the light coming in."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1693072"
msgid "…there really aren't ANY pots in here…\nIf #C236196003Ms. Fujimura#CDEF is around, I could press her\nfor one or two utensils, easy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1693208"
msgid "Ah, sorry for keeping you.\nLet's get a move on, Master. Knowing #C236196003Leo#CDEF,\nI'm sure he already has a plan cooked up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1693336"
msgid "Hehehe. Getting up early and prepping\nmy darling's meal 2 hours before they wake…\nsuch is the mark of a good wife."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1693452"
msgid "So, how would you like to begin your morning?\nWith a meal? With a bath? Or perhaps…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1693540"
msgid "Ahh! Hold on, hold on!\nWhy are you rushing for the door at mach speed!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1693612"
msgid "I get it! It was just a joke! Even I know when\nit's time to be serious. Off now to the Student\nCouncil Room to plan our next move, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1693752"
msgid "Awoken, have you? It is quite an amazing\naudacity you have―waking later than the king."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1693840"
msgid "So, what now? Has your goal to escape from the \n#C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF changed at all?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1693944"
msgid "…going back to the Near Side is like returning\nso I can die."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1694008"
msgid "I'm aware of that. I would be lying if I said I\nwasn't absolutely terrified."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1694088"
msgid "―――Yet, my goal stays the same, nonetheless.\nAfter all, I yelled out that I \"won't quit,\"\nand I summoned this Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1694212"
msgid "People die sooner or later. It's only a matter of time.\nSo what's important isn't how long we live,\nbut what we leave behind―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1694344"
msgid "―――I felt my head throb."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1694372"
msgid "There was something, just now.\nAs if I saw part of a hazy memory."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1694440"
msgid "Heh. An immature ideal. However, there is value\nin seeing it, from a philosophical point of\nview. Do not let it become but a brave face."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1694580"
msgid "Good. Then do as you say. I will not ask to\nconfirm again. You may go ahead and drown in\nthose ideals of yours."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1694692"
msgid "Look, a summons from the Student Council Room.\nThey must have completed the labyrinth analysis.\nWhy not make an inquiry into that red woman?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1694836"
msgid "It seems like he's in somewhat of a good mood this morning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1694896"
msgid "We withdrew from the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF\nand returned to My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1694976"
msgid "I extracted #C236196003Rin#CDEF's hidden #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nWe drove #C236196003Rin#CDEF back, but she vanished like a phantom."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1695108"
msgid "…it looks like it took more energy than I\nexpected to search this unfamiliar Labyrinth.\nThe moment I laid down, a rapid sleep fell over me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1695252"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF let out a long sigh too,\nas if breathing out the fatigue."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1695332"
msgid "…wait.\nCould it be that #C236196003#SVT#CDEF feels sad rather than tired…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1695412"
msgid "…pardon me, Master. Since my power does not\nrecover, I brought us into such a perilous\npredicament."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1695516"
msgid "I am twofold frustrated. If we were our\nprevious selves, we would have handily swatted\naway such a Servant!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1695624"
msgid "Sorry. It's about my ineptitude, Master.\nHow could my strength have fell so much…?\nIt's just plain sad, if I say so myself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1695752"
msgid "I apologize, Darling… I was negligent. It\nappears that I was overly optimistic despite\nknowing I was in a weakened state."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1695876"
msgid "How could that lizard girl have made my Master\nfeel such disgrace!? My frustration is enough\nto make another tail pop out!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1696000"
msgid "I said this, frankly: \"No, I also feel frustrated.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1696052"
msgid "Being helpless against #C236196003Lancer#CDEF wasn't #C236196003#SVT#CDEF's fault.\nIt was because #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF, as the Master,\ncouldn't provide enough backup and direction."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1696244"
msgid "And there's also what #C236196003Rin#CDEF said."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1696292"
msgid "\"If I leave #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF, #[he][she]#'ll turn the tables\nbefore I know it.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1696388"
msgid "I wonder about being overestimated, but to\nturn her words into truth, #C236196003#SVT#CDEF and I need to\ngather more experience."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1696520"
msgid "Y-yes, that does not sound bad.\nRather, it sounds good."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1696576"
msgid "Memory aside, I previously was peeved about\nreacquiring our skills from scratch. Now, I have\nchanged my mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1696688"
msgid "From now on, be diligent in training with me.\nIf we are together, we can strive to flourish\nmore grandly than before!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1696808"
msgid "…man. You were grieving over those captured\nMasters, having their magic circuits stolen.\nBut, my Master doesn't seem that delicate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1696944"
msgid "When push comes to shove, I'll just have to\nshove back with you. Now we gotta get our minds\nand bodies back in shape, right, Master?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1697080"
msgid "Experience!? Experience with my Darling!? Awawa!\nPlease wait a moment! I will Miko-make our futon\nnow, Tamamo-style!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1697200"
msgid "I quietly rise from my seat and place my hand\non the door. I'll sleep in the Student Council\nRoom tonight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1697308"
msgid "But to tell the truth, I am extremely elated\nabout that as well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1697376"
msgid "Because, the \"acquisition of skills\" means that\nin sickness or in a pinch, we shall fight\ntogether, does it not?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1697492"
msgid "Yes. That is precisely the teamwork of a married\ncouple! No matter how many times we repeat this,\nI personally feel happy!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1697616"
msgid "…wait, huh? Basically, is this not like being\nnewly-wed again? Could it be that I am a super\nwinner?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1697720"
msgid "…\nI never really understand what #C236196003Caster#CDEF says or does,\nbut since we've never been married, won't she just\nbe getting tricked?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1697864"
msgid "As a Master, although it's imperative that I get\nmy abilities back, bringing back my forgotten\nmemories is still also important."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1697996"
msgid "If my memories are also my \"concealed heart,\"\nwe could work things out quickly if they take\nthe same shape as an #C000246204SG#CDEF, like with #C236196003Rin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1698160"
msgid "#C000246204SG#CDEF, huh… You likely will not produce such a\nthing; for you see, you are poor at secrecy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1698268"
msgid "Forget about that, will you? As far as I\nremember, you had a lot of worries, but were\nthe type that couldn't keep a secret, see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1698400"
msgid "Ah, errr… My Darling has no #C000246204SG#CDEF, or, how should\nI put it… Honestly, it is like, even if you\nkept a secret, it would be obvious what it is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1698556"
msgid "\"I have no secrets\"…\nSince I can't even remember those secrets,\nit sounds pretty obvious."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1698648"
msgid "Of course not. I am naught but secrets. Half of\nmy life was a struggle for power―mixing\nsecret plots with lust. To you, I… no."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1698780"
msgid "Because it is you, there is much I cannot say.\nA secret is the maiden's weakness, frightened\nby love. If you're a proper #[man][woman]#, know this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1698928"
msgid "Well, honestly, I have but three of them.\nWhether I divulge them or not depends on this\nadventure. I look forward to it, Praetor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1699060"
msgid "Actually, I do have some. I am a Heroic Spirit\nafter all, albeit a minor one. I have plenty of\nguilt for my past."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1699176"
msgid "But it's fine if I don't tell you about them,\nright? I don't really want to, either."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1699264"
msgid "Well―――if you're lucky, there may be a\nchance to teach you a life lesson thing or two.\nI'm praying it doesn't happen, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1699396"
msgid "A-a-absolutely! That is most correct! If I may:\nI, #C236196003Caster#CDEF, carry no falsehoods, and am wholly\ndevoted to serving my Darling… Hoho!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1699544"
msgid "Hohoho… hoho… Gwaah! I cannot do this after\nall! Please do not look upon me with such\ninnocence!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1699644"
msgid "I could foist one or two, well actually, a\nthousand or a hundred-million or so. However, I\ncannot readily divulge them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1699764"
msgid "I, too, have pride, as a woman. As long as you\ndo not unleash your mighty hunk powers on me,\nI am sorry, but I will never tell."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1699892"
msgid "…if you do come to see my secrets,\nplease be well and thoroughly prepared."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1699968"
msgid "Really, it might be more correct to say \"had.\"\nI wonder how much about #C236196003#SVT#CDEF my past self knew."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1700080"
msgid "I need to reconfirm them again,\nthrough this battle―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1700140"
msgid "We withdrew from the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF\nand returned to My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1700220"
msgid "I extracted #C236196003Rin#CDEF's hidden #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nWe drove #C236196003Rin#CDEF back, but she vanished like a phantom."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1700352"
msgid "…it looks like it took more energy than I\nexpected to search this unfamiliar Labyrinth.\nThe moment I laid down, a rapid sleep fell over me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1700496"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF also sits in his chair listlessly,\nwith eyes looking half open."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1700584"
msgid "…wait.\nCould it be that #C236196003#SVT#CDEF feels sad rather than tired…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1700664"
msgid "…however, things are not well. I felt in\nrapture from becoming one of the weak, but this\nis simply too much."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1700776"
msgid "Being pushed about the entire time by such a\nthird-rate Servant is… unbearingly\ndisappointing of me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1700880"
msgid "His long sleep definitely enfeebled his body,\nbut the core of this issue lies with my inadequacy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1700980"
msgid "We were helpless against #C236196003Lancer#CDEF\nbecause #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF couldn't\nprovide enough backup and direction."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1701116"
msgid "I scold myself; before I get my memories back,\nI need to retrain my body."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1701192"
msgid "And there's also what #C236196003Rin#CDEF said."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1701240"
msgid "\"If I leave #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF, #[he][she]#'ll turn the tables\nbefore I know it.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1701336"
msgid "I wonder about being overestimated,\nbut to turn those words into truth,\n#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF and I need to gather more experience."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1701472"
msgid "Fool. How many times must I tell you not to\nconsider us as on the same level? You have\ntremendous hubris."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1701580"
msgid "My recovery and your growth are separate things.\nDo not dream of such things as \"fighting\ntogether.\" Enough absurdities."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1701704"
msgid "I become terrified again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1701732"
msgid "Compared to the gaze of these red eyes,\n#C236196003Lancer#CDEF's bloodlust is much lovelier."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1701828"
msgid "Mongrel. Hold that light tongue of yours.\nIf you were a retainer of mine, I would be\nbeheading you. However―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1701944"
msgid "I have descended from my Gorgeous throne and am\nnow but a #RUBSnormal#RUBEmere#REND king. I shall generously forgive\nsuch disrespect. Hang up a picture of kind me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1702108"
msgid "And anyway, if you descend from the throne,\ndoesn't that make you not a king anymore?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1702196"
msgid "What on Earth is this \"Gorgeous\" and \"Normal\" stuff?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1702252"
msgid "Still, it is good that you reflected and\nattributed failure not due to your Servant, but\ndue to your own inadequacy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1702372"
msgid "That is your strong point. Your disposition\ntowards constantly asking questions is menial,\nbut you are also discerningly humble."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1702504"
msgid "Is this what they call \"submissive\"? What that \n#C236196003Lancer#CDEF said was correct. It Gorgeously stirs up\none's sadistic inclinations."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1702648"
msgid "Hm? Did you say something?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1702676"
msgid "I shake my head in denial, \"nuh uh.\"\nAs if I want to deal with such a dangerous\ntemplate as his."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1702776"
msgid "This person is carrying secrets.\nIf I can bring them to light,\nI should be able to understand\nthis Servant on a deeper level…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1702904"
msgid "The #C000246204SG#CDEF, or whatnot? I have no past in need of a\nburial, but I do carry as many secrets as there\nare stars in the sky."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1703040"
msgid "A king is one who gathers pleasures from all\nover the world. I lack not in love affairs.\nStill, none of it should the people hear of."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1703176"
msgid "That is what I tired of that, too. \"Too much of\na good thing,\" and such. They are not things to\nbe spoken of proudly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1703296"
msgid "After all, others recite the king's legend. If\nyou are not greatly deluded, then believe that\nI will not speak of them, myself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1703424"
msgid "Though it seems #C236196003#SVT#CDEF has an #C000246204SG#CDEF as well, I may as well\ntry to catch a star than ask them to talk\nabout it."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "1703564"
msgid "Access to #C236196003#SVT#CDEF's #C000246204SG#CDEF granted."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "1703628"
msgid "To draw out your Servant's secrets,"
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line2
msgctxt "1703664"
msgid "it's essential to develop your relationship."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "1703712"
msgid "In My Room, be active in developing"
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line2
msgctxt "1703748"
msgid "your relationship with your Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1703788"
msgid "A second #C000246204SG#CDEF from #C236196003Rin#CDEF as well, huh…\nAnd Money Worship, no less.\nSuch a cute face and greasy fetishes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1703924"
msgid "Currency itself has no intrinsic value. Likely,\nfunctional \"gold\" cannot be created until a\ncountry establishes its open trust in it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1704060"
msgid "Well, #C236196003Rin#CDEF may be a little different, though. She\ndoes not indulge herself; she seems to trust…\nadmire money for its worth to her heart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1704216"
msgid "Yes. She cannot avoid being criticized for her\ngreed, but it is quite fitting to say that #C236196003Rin#CDEF\nalways puts the cart before the horse."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1704368"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF's dream, in the end, may be for a bathtub\nof rolled bills. She is a woman who wants―\nwill be swimming in money."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1704504"
msgid "According to a theory, the concept of economics\nwas developed not by men, but by women,\napparently."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1704604"
msgid "Especially when it comes to extravagance:\nwomen wish to thoroughly rationalize it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1704688"
msgid "Not counting necessary expenditures in daily\nlife, they seem to loathe wasting money\non hobbies."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1704788"
msgid "Basically, it's in a man's nature to waste; it's\nin a woman's to save, you could say. Hm?\nWhy am I talking about all this, you ask?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1704920"
msgid "Being a married man is tough. It's incredibly\npainful to be held by the wallet. In that\nregard, just be prepared, is what I mean."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1705052"
msgid "…well, err, you know. I'm not saying that #C236196003Rin\nTohsaka#CDEF isn't the only one who's strange, but…\nLook. If you're a girl, please overlook this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1705212"
msgid "A diary under the bed,\na secret video folder on a hard drive,\na miracle poem from middle school days…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1705316"
msgid "The day an acquaintance―one even considered a\nrival―sees these, the only options are to kill\nthem or move to a land far, far away."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1705452"
msgid "This may be sudden, but I will speak to you\nof what currency is. Mongrel.\nSettle yourself and listen diligently."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1705568"
msgid "Right after we returned to our room,\n#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF started talking with a haughty attitude."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1705672"
msgid "…I've gotten used to the unbelievable.\nThese sorts of developments don't seem so\nstrange anymore."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1705772"
msgid "Money is but a system. Standard values, ways to\ncirculate, ways to preserve worth. That which\nhas these functions can be called currency."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1705912"
msgid "A myriad of ideas, cultures, arts, and great\ntreasures are born, not because currency itself\nis wealth, but by the system of exchange――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1706052"
msgid "That is known as \"wealth.\" Many have lost\nsight of this original intent, and speak filth:\nof accumulating mere \"peace of mind.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1706180"
msgid "However――Rarely. Only rarely, there are also\nconnoisseurs who have understood what wealth is,\nand currency, and are partial to it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1706316"
msgid "I take it upon myself to conclude that it is a\nhigh class taste, characteristic of one who\nresides in a city-state managed by money."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1706452"
msgid "I do not mean, \"gain authority through riches.\"\nTruly feel the world by burying that desire,\nmoney. Burden yourself with a greater duty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1706592"
msgid "Like how a city-state's ruler would. A mount of\npiled bills is also the dew upon the city. While\nglaring, transfix on the city's future path…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1706736"
msgid "That woman is exactly that. She is noteworthy,\ndespite her foolish wretchedness. Does it not\nmake you want to permit her various insults?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1706876"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF gives a stifled laugh.\nIt sounds like #C236196003Rin#CDEF made a good\nimpression on him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1706992"
msgid "We obtained the first #C000246204SG#CDEF. The \"#C000246204Desire to\nControl#CDEF\" is another peculiar preference.\nBut the real problem is #C236196003Lancer#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1707156"
msgid "To be beautiful forever, huh? Any person, no,\nanyone woman would think about this\nat some point…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1707256"
msgid "She won't permit it otherwise.\nShe can't live otherwise.\nShe doesn't know how else to live, I think."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1707360"
msgid "Ah, don't get me wrong. I don't intend on taking\nher side. If we end up fighting, I'll beat her\ndown without any reservations."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1707488"
msgid "We safely extracted her first #C000246204SG#CDEF. She claimed\nto have no secrets, but this means that #C236196003Rani#CDEF's\na girl too, as we can see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1707640"
msgid "But… the problem here is #C236196003Lancer#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1707692"
msgid "She's a demon infatuated only with her own\ndesires. No need to hesitate beating and \nexterminating her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1707796"
msgid "…but you know, we're partly to blame.\nTo us guys, stuff like \"being beautiful forever\"\nis nothing more than a selfish desire."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1707924"
msgid "That said, this is a struggle to survive.\nListen here, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. Don't be fettered by\nthat appearance of hers."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1708052"
msgid "We safely extracted her first #C000246204SG#CDEF. She claimed\nto have no secrets, but this means that #C236196003Rani#CDEF's\na girl too, as we can see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1708204"
msgid "But the problem here is #C236196003Lancer#CDEF. I'll tell you\none thing. There's no poor support here, Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1708316"
msgid "I'm talking about you. Behind that prim face of\nyours, you may be thinking something like,\n\"I want to try listening to #C236196003Lancer#CDEF.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1708460"
msgid "Please spare me from hearing something like\nthat you sympathize with her as a fellow woman."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1708552"
msgid "Also, aren't words like [forever beautiful]\njust ill-natured fantasy? As I see it, girls\nwho get excited by this are to be pitied."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1708684"
msgid "We got one of the embarrassing secrets\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF can't tell people♪ Here's hoping for\nmore amusing #C000246204SGs#CDEF from now on～"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1708832"
msgid "…however, our current issue is that lizard\nwoman. Like me, she may be an anti-Heroic Spirit\nconsidered a threat to other people, but――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1708972"
msgid "…and anyway, how long is she going to act like\na girl who's always dreaming about things like\n\"being beautiful forever\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1709096"
msgid "That means being beautiful up until one's very\ndeath. Looks like that princess needs a #RUBS brutal#RUBEteensy#REND\nre-education."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1709228"
msgid "But… with our current fighting strength,\nwe can't possibly stand up to a #C236196003Lancer#CDEF who\ngoes all out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1709344"
msgid "…it all comes back to this dress. I rather\nlike the design, but there's no reason to be\nwearing restraint gear forever."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1709468"
msgid "We're in a spot where we don't know what will\njump out at us next. For now I just about want\na little \"freedom to undress\"…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1709596"
msgid "First thing is to remove this restraint gear.\nWe've been busy and postponing it, but I want to\nhandle things like I used to and soon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1709732"
msgid "Consult the Student Council. An excellent\n#ROFS0001#RUBS  Magus#RUBE#C000246204Wizard#CDEF#REND joined, though her personality\nisn't as great. You'll find a solution."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1709900"
msgid "Hmm. Even if we close the experience point gap\nby earning little by little, the problem is with\nthis restraint gear, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1710024"
msgid "We have to find a method to remove that\nrestraint gear, so that #C236196003#SVT#CDEF can fight freely―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1710132"
msgid "Extracting the first #C000246204SG#CDEF was a simple thing.\nThe controlled puppet desires to\ncontrol… truly my kind of irony."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1710260"
msgid "That #C236196003BB#CDEF makes my stomach churn, but that\nLabyrinth is amusing. I like it better than the\nNear Side's #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1710412"
msgid "The quality of #C236196003Lancer#CDEF's acting is lousy, but\nwhen she's in that Labyrinth, she flourishes.\n\"To be beautiful forever.\" Quite sad, no?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1710564"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. You perceived #C236196003Lancer#CDEF's desire as\nbeing \"evil,\" but it's not so simple. For you\nsee, her wish has already come true."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1710724"
msgid "Ah. It would surely spoil things to give you\nthe answer now. Take in that woman's sorrow\nfirsthand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1710824"
msgid "In any case, a confrontation can't be avoided.\nShe's already deviating from being a Servant\nthis time around."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1710936"
msgid "#C236196003Lancer#CDEF fights to realize her own ambitions.\nYou, being so virtuous, can't admonish her\nfor that, can you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1711060"
msgid "He doesn't see #C236196003Lancer#CDEF with hostility.\nIn regards to #C236196003Lancer#CDEF, who proclaimed that she\n\"betrayed her Master,\" he admits that \"it happens.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1711228"
msgid "She captures and makes food out of Masters\nto make herself look more attractive.\nOn top of that, she even says\nshe'll use the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF for her selfish desires."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1711408"
msgid "There's no way we can let her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1711440"
msgid "But… with our current fighting strength,\nwe can't possibly stand up to a #C236196003Lancer#CDEF who\ngoes all out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1711556"
msgid "Ah, that was a problem as well. If I'm defeated,\nyou'll be taken to the Torture Chamber. If you\ndon't want your blood drained, endeavor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1711696"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF is laughing like it's\nsomeone else's problem."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1711768"
msgid "…where does his calm composure come from?\nOnce we fight #C236196003Lancer#CDEF, he'll be the first\nto go down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1711880"
msgid "I've been doubting it up to now, but is he not\nafraid of the difference between his strength\nand #C236196003Lancer#CDEF's?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1712004"
msgid "Naturally. This isn't my fight; I haven't the\nslightest attachment to it. I'm an outsider\nmerely spectating."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1712116"
msgid "I told you, didn't I?\nVictory and defeat are yours."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1712168"
msgid "It doesn't matter to me which one happens.\nTo admire the result―that is all I enjoy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1712256"
msgid "To witness the conclusion of his contracter,\n#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF. That was the principle\nbehind #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF's behavior."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1712404"
msgid "I knew that all along, but really?\nHe doesn't care if he's defeated in\nthe course of things…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1712500"
msgid "Even among Servants, he has the merit of having\nthe strongest class. A King of Heroes among\nHeroic Spirits, clad in golden armor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1712632"
msgid "Despite having such an incredible title,\nhe said that \"being defeated is okay.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1712712"
msgid "…I'm coming to understand him even less."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1712756"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF is a person crueler than #C236196003Lancer#CDEF,\nbut at the same time, I feel like he's\nnot evil at all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1712888"
msgid "Rehabilitating this debilitated #C236196003King of Heroes#CDEF\nmay be important, but I want to know who\n#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF really is, and I think it's just\nas important―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1713072"
msgid "So now we're able to change clothes, huh?\nBut our problems are still mountain-high.\nHow can I ONLY have two essential outfits?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1713200"
msgid "All maidens must devote themselves to variety.\nBy this impetus, I wish to search\neven for swimsuits."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1713304"
msgid "At long last we finally procured a closet.\nA myriad of outfits to adorn myself with―――\nI look forward to them, Praetor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1713428"
msgid "But good job getting me a new one. It's just a\ntiny change, but this means we've reduced #C236196003BB#CDEF's\ncontrol over us in one way."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1713568"
msgid "This doesn't make for a very urgent development,\nbut we can't let our guard down.\nIn that way, let's scour the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1713692"
msgid "Jeez, all this ruckus for one change of clothes.\nI've got my hands full babysitting you\nand your womanly whims…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1713808"
msgid "Well, this fight won't be pointless. Thanks to\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF, we got my original Mystic Code back.\nGoodbye, tasteless restraints."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1713948"
msgid "Ah, but―――\nYou having the same preferences as #C236196003BB#CDEF puts us\nright back where we started."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1714056"
msgid "Man. I'm not asking for you to have\nan artist's level of taste, but I at least\nexpect a common set of tastes, Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1714176"
msgid "This is what I mean.\nI catch a break only to find this abuse."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1714240"
msgid "My memory is hazy, but I think having this Servant\nalways lecturing me like this was a\ndaily routine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1714344"
msgid "I won't deny that I'm inexperienced, but I'll\nshow him one day. That was the moment when I\ntook that new oath."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1714456"
msgid "We did it!\nAt last, the clothing change event has\nbeen unlocked!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1714524"
msgid "Thanks to #C236196003Sakura#CDEF, I have my original clothes\nback. If my Darling desires though, don't\nhesitate to have me wear those other clothes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1714676"
msgid "How strange. It sounds like #C236196003Caster#CDEF is saying\nthat she prefers these restraints more than\nher original dress."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1714804"
msgid "Oh, you know. I'm attached to my old clothes\nsince they give a sense of \"me.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1714884"
msgid "Well, anything looks good on me.\nKeep collecting more and more Mystic Codes\nthat fit me, #RUBS  Master#RUBEDarling#REND!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1715008"
msgid "Mm―it kind of feels like I currently have my\nends and means reversed, but whatever happens,\nwe'll say it's a wife being sweet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1715136"
msgid "I wish to be a cute wife who is always sending\nher husband's heart aflutter鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1715216"
msgid "…you wish to ask about my preference in\nclothes? You wish to change my Mystic Code?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1715304"
msgid "Good. Do as you please.\nAs long as they're clothes fit for a king,\nI won't stop you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1715392"
msgid "This golden outfit is merely a charm against\nevil. So long as there's no petrifying serpent\ndragon or a great ox, I have no need for it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1715532"
msgid "According to #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF, he equips this golden\narmor to resist petrification."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1715628"
msgid "Other than that, it's a Mystic Code that he likes,\nbut that doesn't necessarily mean it's his \"main\" outfit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1715740"
msgid "I only use it for battles where I stake my\ndignity. But these events are just a game to me.\nI don't care what appearance I'm in."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1715872"
msgid "I prefer not to fight hand-to-hand in the first\nplace. When I need to flex my true power, I only\nneed my body and the key to my treasury."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1716012"
msgid "When he was talking with #C236196003Rani#CDEF,\nwas it kind of on this topic…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1716092"
msgid "Yes, my vocal cords are fine.\nIt would be a great loss to mankind for my\npeerless throat to deteriorate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1716200"
msgid "My singing voice is once again the\n#RUBS         Muses'  #RUBEGods of the Arts'#REND melody. Rest easy, Praetor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1716316"
msgid "However, I felt so numb. I don't understand\nwhat the purpose of the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF would\nbe if I couldn't speak with you!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1716456"
msgid "That lowlife #C236196003BB#CDEF. She looks like she's playing\naround, but she strikes right at our weak point.\nWe must account for her craftiness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1716604"
msgid "…phew. That was pretty awful. No, not about\nhaving our discussions banned. I'm talking\nabout having to make that detour."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1716728"
msgid "You feel weird in any way? If you don't use your\nvocal cords or muscles, they deteriorate. Do\nsome vocal exercises later for me, won't you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1716868"
msgid "But damn that #C236196003BB#CDEF… Even a kid could come up\nwith her level of ideas, but it's a serious\nthreat when she actually executes them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1717012"
msgid "I wonder if she gets a free pass to intervene\nin the system in exchange for not having\nany fighting ability."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1717124"
msgid "It really weighs on me.\nLooks like this sort of harassment is going\nto keep on happening."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1717216"
msgid "Phew. I finally feel better.\nHow about you, Darling?\nIs your voice coming out fine?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1717300"
msgid "Ah. Hmhmhm. My fox senses are tingling."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1717340"
msgid "This won't do at all, Darling.\nYou need to care about your body,\nprrrooopperrlyy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1717424"
msgid "Ah, #[he][she]# ran away. Hey!\nYou put on some sort of mask?\nWhere in the world did you get that?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1717524"
msgid "Howweverr… It seems that I can't stand that\n#C236196003Dark Sakura#CDEF doing whatever she fancies anymore.\nThough, I never stood for it to begin with."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1717680"
msgid "For a while, I was wondering what would happen\nto me, but my voice came back to normal."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1717768"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF said she was \"killing time,\" but her interference\nthis time came right as we were nearing the goal."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1717888"
msgid "If we can just get past #C236196003Rani#CDEF's Relief,\nwe'll be able to escape to the\n\"Near Side\"―where #C236196003BB#CDEF can't touch us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1718028"
msgid "The problem is, how are we going to get our\nhands on #C236196003Rani#CDEF's #C000246204SG#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1718124"
msgid "…I won't solve this by mulling over it alone.\n#C000246204Let's try asking Leo and the others for advice#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1718236"
msgid "Now then, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nThere's nothing wrong with being too quick.\nDecide the punishment, now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1718344"
msgid "\"For what,\" you ask?\nFool! It can only be one thing!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1718400"
msgid "Daring to look down on ME,\nwith vile breasts grown larger than necessary,\nthe paltry avatar of a crafty woman―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1718516"
msgid "What sort of punishment shall we give that Dark\nSakura, the scum \"#C236196003BB#CDEF,\" once we seize her!? Know\nthat half-hearted torture won't be allowed!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1718672"
msgid "The honorable #C236196003Gil#CDEF shrieks."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1718716"
msgid "I can't believe #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF, who never showed\nhis serious side due to being always being\nsluggish, is laying his emotions bare this much…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1718872"
msgid "Having his speech prohibited seems to have\naggravated him greatly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1718940"
msgid "But… it's not like him to ask me to decide a\npunishment."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1719000"
msgid "If he can't forgive #C236196003BB#CDEF, wouldn't the\n#C236196003King of Heroes#CDEF handle things himself,\nwithout involving #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1719160"
msgid "What nonsense is that?\nWho to forgive or not forgive is YOU, mongrel!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1719232"
msgid "Hmph. I changed my mind.\nI did say that I wouldn't sever our contract.\nThat was a #RUBS  correction#RUBElie#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1719348"
msgid "If you tarry in punishing #C236196003BB#CDEF,\nI'll promptly and gladly sever our contract.\nKeep that in mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1719460"
msgid "Basically, he's saying that if I don't defeat #C236196003BB#CDEF,\n#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF will kill #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1719596"
msgid "…but I want to refuse that.\nSure, #C236196003BB#CDEF is the culprit here, but I feel that\nit's too hasty to decide that she's the\n\"bad guy who MUST be defeated.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1719760"
msgid "There's no room for you to argue.\nI'm declaring that she's a pure evil threat\nto humanity."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1719852"
msgid "If your morals deem that \"evil must be\ndefeated,\" then there's no need to hesitate\nor comprehend: pass the death penalty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1719976"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF is vilifying #C236196003BB#CDEF this much,\nwhile not having any intent to kill her.\nIt feels like―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1720108"
msgid "…well now.\nFor a mongrel, you've grown a sharp eye,\nhaven't you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1720176"
msgid "Just as you thought, I won't pass my judgement\nonto that #C236196003BB#CDEF. Since I have no reason to."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1720280"
msgid "Presently, #C236196003BB#CDEF qualifies for neither. Therefore,\nI left the punishment for you to execute.\nListen. As I said, do not make her death easy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1720436"
msgid "Against the glare of his red eyes,\nI reflexively nodded."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1720496"
msgid "…I stare at the golden Servant,\nthough my mind is off somewhere else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1720568"
msgid "There are conditions for #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF to kill a person…\nAfter hearing that, I felt like I came to see\nanother thing about him that wasn't visible before."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1720736"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh, the King of Heroes#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1720784"
msgid "A cold-blooded despot, who possesses every\ntreasure and has experienced and enjoyed every pleasure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1720884"
msgid "Deep down, though he may be prejudiced,\nhe seems to be made out of a human logic―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1720972"
msgid "…no, more importantly, I need to tackle this Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1721032"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF said she was \"killing time,\" but her interference\nthis time came right as we were nearing the goal."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1721152"
msgid "If we can just get past #C236196003Rani#CDEF's Relief,\nwe'll be able to escape to the\n\"Near Side\"―where #C236196003BB#CDEF can't touch us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1721292"
msgid "The problem is, how are we going to get our\nhands on #C236196003Rani#CDEF's #C000246204SG#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1721388"
msgid "…I won't solve this by mulling over it alone.\n#C000246204Let's try asking Leo and the others for advice#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1721500"
msgid "Some troublesome enemies popped up, huh,\nPraetor? But it's not all misfortunate.\nI'm relieved about one thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1721612"
msgid "Relieved?\nWhat could #C236196003Saber#CDEF be relieved about in all this?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1721688"
msgid "My condition is hazy as well, but what\nyou're missing runs much deeper."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1721760"
msgid "To be honest, it's painful. Being replied to\nnow and then as if I'm a stranger takes me\naback, and it hurts."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1721872"
msgid "However―――Being in such a state is all\nthe more befitting of my Praetor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1721948"
msgid "You don't look away from difficult situations.\nEven when you run into a dilemma, your heart\ndoesn't give in."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1722060"
msgid "Even if darkness awaits us, as long as I have\nthat star that goes by your name,\nI have nothing to fear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1722164"
msgid "Even if your memories haven't returned,\nyou're still my #[lord][lady]#. I've confirmed that.\nIt's the one thing I'm relieved about."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1722296"
msgid "That's why you should relax and get some sleep.\nOur fights will continue, but at least\nwe get suitable rewards like this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1722420"
msgid "So #C236196003Saber#CDEF asserts, not with the usual\ntone brimming with self-confidence, but with\na voice filled with deep affection."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1722556"
msgid "…that's right. No matter what despair stands\nbefore me, #C236196003Saber#CDEF will still be here with me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1722664"
msgid "I'll believe in that and give my body a rest―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1722716"
msgid "…now then. Things have gotten even more\nchaotic, but there's at least one piece of good\nnews. Want to hear it, Master?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1722836"
msgid "Since we settled things with #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF,\nI think it's only been bad news."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1722928"
msgid "There is. This child before me may have lost\ntheir memories, but as a Master, they're a\n#[man][person]# with promise."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1723048"
msgid "Your very essence hasn't changed.\nOur battles up until now have been enough\nto make me really feel that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1723156"
msgid "Eliminating #C236196003BB#CDEF, rescuing #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF and the\nothers, it's all pretty important in\nof itself though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1723288"
msgid "His words imply a few things, but #C236196003Archer#CDEF's\nvoice carries a sense of respect."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1723384"
msgid "You don't get a perfect score, but you pass.\nWe'll leave the topic of what\nyou lack for the distant future."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1723492"
msgid "Without saying a word, #C236196003Archer#CDEF gives\na smile filled with resolute faith in me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1723588"
msgid "…that's right. No matter what despair stands\nbefore me, #C236196003Archer#CDEF will still be here with me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1723696"
msgid "I'll believe in that and give my body a rest―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1723748"
msgid "Pleasant?\nI end up turning my head in puzzlement at #C236196003Caster#CDEF's words."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1723832"
msgid "We did beat #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF, but our situation\nhasn't changed. New menaces also appeared,\nso our situation shouldn't be good in any way…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1723980"
msgid "That makes me happy. Despite having lost\nyour memories, you still trust me\nas your Servant…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1724076"
msgid "I can't help but feel happy about\nthose feelings of yours."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1724136"
msgid "I'm also happy.\nShe's doing everything in her power for me,\neven without my memories."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1724224"
msgid "That's why, one day for sure―――\nI have to get our fond days back, to truly make her happy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1724320"
msgid "I, #C236196003Caster#CDEF, humbly partake in this or\nthat if Darling so desires… no, no. I will\naccompany you come hell or high water!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1724456"
msgid "Alrighty! Down with #C236196003Dark Sakura#CDEF! Until our love\nhits the goal, I won't let anyone run about as\nthey please, no matter how many there are!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1724612"
msgid "…that's right. No matter what despair stands\nbefore me, #C236196003Caster#CDEF will still be here with me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1724720"
msgid "I'll believe in that and give my body a rest―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1724772"
msgid "Those women, \"#C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF,\" they were called?\nA collection of merits from impudent Goddesses:\n\"High Servants\"――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1724904"
msgid "Their repulsiveness is incurably bad, but it's\ninteresting. Strange mixes are good now and\nthen. That #C236196003BB#CDEF, she wants to get on my nerves."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1725060"
msgid "Despite who this Servant is, the appearance\nof the #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF seemed surprising,\nyet exciting to him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1725180"
msgid "I'm amazed, but also impressed, at how carefree he is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1725236"
msgid "For me, I don't feel as optimistic about the\nappearance of enemies who surpass #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1725344"
msgid "What are you talking about?\n#C236196003BB#CDEF isn't the one entertaining me.\nThe look on your face is, mongrel."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1725460"
msgid "Our battles until now have truly been for\nnaught. You rescued those two women, but two\nmore have come to hinder you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1725580"
msgid "Your memories have yet to return,\nand you have nothing to even compensate\nfor your #C000246204Command Seals#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1725696"
msgid "Moreover, the enemy is formidable\nand unknown to even me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1725756"
msgid "How does it feel? It would be natural for any\ndecent person to have their heart broken.\nAn average #C000246204Magus#CDEF all the more."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1725892"
msgid "However, it appears that my contractor,\nsurprisingly, does not consider this to be\na predicament."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1725992"
msgid "The one person within this school weaker than\neveryone else gazes at the heavens more\nintensely than anyone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1726104"
msgid "\"Man is a thinking reed.\"\nSo a philosopher once said.\nIt sums you up perfectly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1726184"
msgid "Be proud. Your tenacity is the only thing\nI have not. It's your one and only merit,\nso cherish and keep it close."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1726300"
msgid "Could it be…\nMaybe it's just my imagination,\nbut could it be that he just praised me…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1726392"
msgid "―――Damn.\nI know I'm misunderstanding,\nbut I still feel kind of happy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1726468"
msgid "Though, it doesn't matter which.\nWhat's important is that by #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF's casual\nremarks, my emotions instantly became excited."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1726612"
msgid "As he said, my memories are hazy,\nmy #C000246204Command Seals#CDEF have vanished,\nand my relationship with my Servant is terrible, but――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1726752"
msgid "If they had any #C236196003Ishtar#CDEF in them, I would have\nhad no choice but to unseal #C000246204Ea#CDEF…\nThat #C236196003BB#CDEF, she knows where my weak spots are."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1726924"
msgid "I interjected now and then, \"yes, yes,\"\nto look like I was paying attention,\nbut my eyelids started to grow heavy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1727040"
msgid "I close my eyelids, listening to #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF's\nvoice like a bedtime story."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1727132"
msgid "…maybe my tenacity really is something else.\nI have gotten used to his condescending\nattitude, like I am now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1727244"
msgid "Within the old school, where the sun never sets,\nthe sight of \"morning\" can't be seen,\nbut it does feel that an entire night went by."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1727380"
msgid "A good night's sleep took away my fatigue.\nWith this fresh start, we'll prepare\nfor our upcoming battles."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1727488"
msgid "So you're awake, #RUBS  Master#RUBEPraetor#REND.\nI rested well too. Let's proceed to the\n#C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF and work out a new plan."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1727640"
msgid "Morning, Master. Seems like you're well rested,\nbut you look half-asleep. Wash your face\nbefore we head to the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1727792"
msgid "Being beside Darling fully energized me, that's\nwhy I'm so brimming with energy. Okay!\nLet's go to the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1727936"
msgid "Human civilization entered\nits first period of transition."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1727996"
msgid "The power of many ancient things waned,\nwhile some new things sprouted forth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1728076"
msgid "Mysteries faded with the growth of man's wisdom.\nOn this planet, the laws of the universe began\nto gradually shift to today's laws of physics."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1728220"
msgid "As the principles of the land became defined,\naction on the Earth became a hardship for the\ndivine beasts and the mythical beasts."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1728352"
msgid "The gods who undertook the workings of the\natmosphere lost their direction and were\nreturning to pure, natural phenomena."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1728476"
msgid "\nThis, namely, was beginning of the age of the primates."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1728536"
msgid "\nThe gods left the Earth, and mankind commanded the land."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1728596"
msgid "Countless kings were born and fell to ruin.\nEach time, civilization progressed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1728676"
msgid "Simply put, it was the dawn of a new era.\nMankind, for the first time, had separated from\ntheir #RUBSfathers#RUBEgods#REND and began to walk their own path."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1728836"
msgid "…that's right.\nMankind―who had revered, feared nature―\nbegan to act as they willed #RUBS  as people#RUBEas humans#REND,\nand this era was the frenzied commencement of such."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1729012"
msgid "The blood of the gods, who had held dominion\nup to that point, coursed through him.\nThe blood of man, who would now hold dominion,\ncoursed through him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1729164"
msgid "He exhibited both,\nas an entirely different type of living being."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1729232"
msgid "\nHe passed judgement\nafter understanding each indiscretion,\nafter considering each perspective;\na paragon of neutrality."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1729356"
msgid "\nInitially, he loved the gods more than he did man.\nEventually, he despised the gods more than he did man.\nAnd in the end, he decided to observe all that man had to offer."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1729528"
msgid "And by observe, he meant to decide."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1729564"
msgid "He decided to ascertain which humans should live,\nbased on his sovereign standards."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1729648"
msgid "That was his cornerstone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1729676"
msgid "Here's a king who reigned over ancient Uruk.\nHere's a king who treated no one equally.\nHere's a king who judged without distinction,\nwhether one obeyed or disobeyed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1729844"
msgid "He rejected \"equality\" and mercilessly\nsnatched life after life."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1729912"
msgid "All that remained were weeping masses and desolated earth;\nthe desire to stay alive, and nature laid bare."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1730020"
msgid "Either made for an ugly, horrifying spectacle.\nIn that instant, a crucible of desires was born on this planet.\nAnd there was a king―who condoned it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1730172"
msgid "This was the age which birthed\nthose desires which make man human."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1730240"
msgid "Since the king who ordered that such a\nbestial nature be judged approved of man's desires."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1730332"
msgid "This wasteland is the consequence;\nhis garden of desires, where he\ncontinually laughed hideously,\nloathed, and passed judgement."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1730464"
msgid "Mired in that muck, he lifts the corners of his mouth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1730520"
msgid "\n\n―――I awoke from a distant scene, one #RUBS  which wasn't mine#RUBEI never experienced#REND.\n      It's as if I had an old dream."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1730656"
msgid "Awake, are we?\nWhat's wrong?\nYou look more dismal than usual this morning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1730732"
msgid "We're retreading the Labyrinth. Relax, I don't\nexpect anything out of you. Go parade your\nclumsiness as you like, as you have been."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1730864"
msgid "Let's start by going to the Student\nCouncil Room to figure out what's next."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1730940"
msgid "It's said that Masters get a glimpse of\ntheir contracted Servant's past."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1731016"
msgid "So… does that mean that the dream I\nsaw might've been of #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF's past?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1731108"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF urges me along out of the room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1731164"
msgid "…oh, yeah.\nThe #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF meeting is important,\nbut I'm also worried about #C236196003Sakura#CDEF, who's in the #C000246204Infirmary#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1731332"
msgid "I'll take a look at how she's\ndoing if I have some time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1731392"
msgid "However… This won't go so smoothly. You're\nfinally feeling like yourself again, too,\nbut the obstacles keep piling up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1731512"
msgid "It looks like returning to the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF\nwon't take any ordinary means to accomplish."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1731620"
msgid "My sword will clear any path out,\nand the Earth overflowed with thine milk and\nhoney will surely lead me―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1731732"
msgid "Yes, I've decided so.\nIncidentally, I memorized that phrase from some\nprovince in Rome."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1731820"
msgid "It seems practical, and the words are good,\nbrimming with hope. Good words, second only\nto \"debauchery.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1731928"
msgid "So, trust in me freely, and rest without worry.\nToday I'll treat myself to the usual two――\nA-actually, I'll let you practice on me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1732064"
msgid "#C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF, huh? What strange beings.\nA same model as #C236196003Sakura#CDEF appearing was a surprise,\nbut two are still… no, there's two more."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1732224"
msgid "Anyway, what we have to do remains the same.\nSurpass those girls and return to the\nNear Side of the Moon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1732332"
msgid "No matter the obstacle, bringing victory to the\ncontractor is a Servant's duty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1732412"
msgid "Our chances are poor, and it's not smooth\nsailing, but hey, it's no different than before.\nI'm used to looking out for you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1732536"
msgid "Alright, the road is long, Master.\nAfter you get some rest, we'll put our\nbest guard up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1732628"
msgid "Dinner, relaxation, a massage.\nIt's all ready for you. I shall guide you to a\nmoment of paradise―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1732732"
msgid "Eh? You don't need that sort of thing?\nYou're telling me to get to sleep too?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1732812"
msgid "But… I can't believe that they're cheating\nagain after cheating once! Those women are\nsorely lacking in principles!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1732932"
msgid "But well, what we need to do stays the same.\nCurse, smack, and curse again!\nI can't do anything else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1733036"
msgid "Technically, one can't separate such a thing,\nbut being mechanical is all AIs are good at.\nExtracting their affected parts seems easy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1733172"
msgid "They're fragments excised from #C236196003BB#CDEF, after all,\nbut they may already be different AI."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1733272"
msgid "The properties of the Servants scraped together\nare reconstructed in pieces, and they attain an\nindependent nature… a \"self.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1733400"
msgid "However, despite that, they have no freedom.\nNo matter how unlike #C236196003BB#CDEF they become, the core\nof their souls―the \"pieces\"―don't change."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1733552"
msgid "#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF, was her name?\nThe impulse driving that woman is a\n\"#C000246204mind which seeks#CDEF.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1733668"
msgid "Her generous appearance and character are only\nher exterior. Her true nature must be like a\nstarving beast. Bear that in mind, mongrel."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1733804"
msgid "Now we have the second #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nI think that next, we'll finally have a\nshowdown with her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1733908"
msgid "That girl is a composite of multiple Heroic\nSpirits. Thinking about it rationally, she's a\nfar more powerful being than I am right now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1734044"
msgid "Grr! I'm not talking about chests!\nI'm talking about basic abilities, specs,\ngot it!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1734132"
msgid "…anyway, she does have one flaw.\nHer personality is pretty unsuitable for battle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1734216"
msgid "Bridging the gap between our strengths will rest\non your insight and tactics. It's obvious at\nthis point, but I'm counting on you, Praetor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1734356"
msgid "#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF… Once again, while confronting\nher for the second time, she showed\nno intent of fighting."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1734476"
msgid "I had no hard evidence until now… no, I\ncouldn't truly believe it, but that girl\nreally does have feelings for you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1734596"
msgid "Though I think it's one of #C236196003BB#CDEF's pranks,\nit makes for one hell of an obstacle.\n#C236196003Lancer#CDEF wasn't THIS bad."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1734732"
msgid "I want you to be ready for this. It's harder\nthan you might think to reject one's affection,\neven if it's artificial, right to their face."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1734872"
msgid "Ahhh! I'm BEAT! Greeny's pestering fires\nmy stress off mach speed as it is,\nbut that OPM…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1734964"
msgid "She loves you? She said she loves you,\ndidn't she!? Her true nature is revealed\nat last…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1735056"
msgid "I have no choice but to learn my final skill―\nthe sealed Polygamy Castration Fist! Forget that\nuseless Sunlit Watery Heaven stuff!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1735188"
msgid "Though, I know that my Darling has a steel\ntemperance. #[He][She]# wouldn't let #[his][her]# guard down\naround some yandere, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1735320"
msgid "Riigghhtt?\nIsn't that right, Darrllliinngg?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1735364"
msgid "With a smile on her face,\n#C236196003Caster#CDEF puts an immense pressure on me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1735448"
msgid "…however. Practically speaking,\n#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF is a composite of who\nknows how many Servants."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1735556"
msgid "If I, a run-of-the-mill #C000246204Magus#CDEF,\nwere to be held down by her,\nI wouldn't be able to oppose her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1735668"
msgid "Ohohohohoho. I'll take your silence as a \"yes,\"\nso #C236196003Tamamo#CDEF will smile and trust her Darling ☆"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1735780"
msgid "As soon as I got back to our room, my knees\nlost their strength, and I sat down on the floor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1735876"
msgid "It takes everything I have just to maneuver\nagainst #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF, but we even had a forced\nencounter with #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1736016"
msgid "To be honest, I'm pushing my limits."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1736056"
msgid "Don't take this to be your bedding.\nYou'll gain a pittance of rest laying\non the ground."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1736148"
msgid "While saying something like that,\n#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF brazenly leans back into his chair."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1736244"
msgid "Really? Again, treating me with that royal demeanor,\nlike I'm not his Master―――\nWait.\nWas he showing concern over me…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1736368"
msgid "An #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF with no inclination to fight, huh?\nAlthough I'm interested in what end it will\nmeet, I'm on your side right now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1736512"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. About our confidential discussion\nwith #C236196003BB#CDEF. Why didn't you sever your\ncontract with me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1736640"
msgid "It was a fair trade. To you, I am the god of\ndeath whom you MUST separate yourself from\nwhen the end comes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1736748"
msgid "And the moment you sever our contract,\nI'll end your life―depending on my mood."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1736832"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF, though your current\ngoal is to escape from the Far Side, your\ncontract with me is your ultimate predicament."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1736976"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF said she would save you from that.\nYou wouldn't be able to escape, but instead,\nyou would no longer die as a Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1737112"
msgid "Not a bad deal, was it? And that's why I ask.\nFor what reason would you not sever\nour contract, considering those terms?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1737236"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF casually starting speaking,\nand his question ran more chills down my spine\nthan when I spoke with #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1737380"
msgid "If I give the wrong response,\n#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF's fight will end here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1737464"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF's look isn't daunting,\nbut that's what it explains to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1737548"
msgid "No type of lie will work on this Servant.\nThat said, speaking the truth won't necessarily keep me safe."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1737652"
msgid "But… despite all that,\nhonestly, I don't really know why myself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1737720"
msgid "I couldn't trust #C236196003BB#CDEF… no, that's not it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1737780"
msgid "My gut told me that the moment I\nsevered our contract, I would be\nkilled by #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF… which is correct,\nbut not the reason either."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1737932"
msgid "The way I felt at that moment was―――yeah, that's right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1737992"
msgid "Simply, I didn't want to lose my combat power, #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1738068"
msgid "Not to help with escaping the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF.\nBut AFTER escaping, if I don't want to lose to anyone,\nthen this Servant would be the best hand anyone could play."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1738252"
msgid "Khh, hahahahahahahahahahahaha!\nStop, restrain yourself, mongrel! Are you\ntrying to kill me with laughter, you dog!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1738368"
msgid "W-well, but that's good; the finest reply!\nYou said you valued me as your combat power!?\nA weapon, more important than your life!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1738500"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF roars with laughter, clutching his sides."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1738568"
msgid "…I had already noticed this before,\nbut this man seems to actually laugh at almost anything."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1738664"
msgid "…good grief. Here I am, answering earnestly and\nseriously, prepared for death,\nand now I feel terribly disrespected…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1738784"
msgid "Don't sulk so, I'm praising you. Despite how\nharmless you look, you are greedy, aren't you?\nAny #[man][woman]# who hauls in gold MUST be."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1738924"
msgid "That reply was sufficient. If it's as you say,\nI'm fine with it. For the time being,\nI'll see your battles through."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1739040"
msgid "We've taken up some time, I see. Pick any spot\nand go sleep. Next, we'll be settling our\nbusiness with the #C000246204Ego#CDEF, at last."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1739180"
msgid "After saying only what he wanted to,\n#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF seemed to grow weary and fell asleep."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1739284"
msgid "………all I can do is stare in blank amazement."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1739332"
msgid "I mean, I'm pretty sure this cold-blooded\nServant just looked at me and gave a reassuring laugh.\nThere's no way―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1739452"
msgid "I'll get a bit of sleep in My Room.\nOnce I wake up, it'll finally be time\nto settle things."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1739544"
msgid "This time we'll be fighting her, life and death…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1739596"
msgid "…hrm. This isn't the first time you've been\nsoft, but I'm warning you now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1739672"
msgid "She's the same as a lion out to get its fill.\nEven if she doesn't eat you, you'll get\ngrabbed by those claws and killed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1739796"
msgid "So long as she has those claws, you two are\nas oil and water… We would be fine if she\nalso understood this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1739908"
msgid "We're about to have our final battle, but I'll\nwarn you this, just in case:\ndon't converse with #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF anymore."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1740040"
msgid "We can't understand each other.\nLike how tigers can't live alongside humans,\nher existence itself is an enemy of yours."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1740160"
msgid "Darling. I understand how you feel, but you're\ntreating that #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF as a person―\nThat needs to end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1740280"
msgid "She's a bundle of immature emotions,\nborn only recently. She was born into that form,\nand she can no longer develop…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1740400"
msgid "If you go trying to understand her,\nyou're the one who's going to get hurt.\n…please keep that in mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1740504"
msgid "An impressive scene has been set at last.\nYou do understand, right #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF?\nThis next battle will differ from the rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1740640"
msgid "Twice previously, you fought to save. But this\ntime, you fight to eliminate. You'll finally be\npressed to take someone's life."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1740768"
msgid "Your enemy has a pure mind, bearing kindness\nto you―――I can't help but look forward to\nwhat the end will bring."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1740884"
msgid "Don't go off and show me any vulgar #RUBS   paths#RUBEchoices#REND\nlike \"sacrificing your own life.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1740988"
msgid "Maybe I'm still half-asleep,\nbut I can't clearly recall what happened.\nWe beat #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF, went further into a deeper layer,\nand then―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1741144"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF turned into a boss, then blasted you\nback with a rock-solid Shield. Yeah, I had\na good hunch that would happen."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1741280"
msgid "That worthless creature was registered\nas a #C000246204Sentinel#CDEF, and she blocked\nour way. Much to no one's surprise, really."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1741412"
msgid "So that's what happened… #C236196003BB#CDEF caught #C236196003Jinako#CDEF,\nand ended up turning her into a new Labyrinth Core."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1741540"
msgid "It seems that after I returned to the old school,\nI fell asleep out of fatigue from the fight with #C236196003Lip#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1741660"
msgid "Worry not, it's been about one day. The Student\nCouncil Room must be in operation now, too.\nOur rest is over. Let's go, #RUBS  Master#RUBEPraetor#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1741812"
msgid "You slept an entire day.\nYou should be fully recovered by now.\nPlease go drop by the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1741920"
msgid "You had a plentiful sleep over a full 24 hours."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1741968"
msgid "I felt lonely being neglected, but it's all in\nthe past now. I'm a Servant who puts her\nMaster first, so it's okay."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1742084"
msgid "You slept like a log, and after an entire\nday and night, no drowsiness should assail you.\nGo answer the call."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1742196"
msgid "Though we do have to deal with #C236196003Jinako#CDEF,\nthere's also the matter with our recovered memory data.\nLet's hurry #C000246204to the Student Council Room#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1742364"
msgid "………hm? A-ah. Sorry. I was thinking―\nabout a plan. No, there's nothing you need to\napologize for, Praetor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1742476"
msgid "Rather than keep pushing the pursuit to defeat\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF, it may be better to be indirect―\nlike luring her into defeating herself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1742624"
msgid "…but it's not something I like to do.\nWatching someone while sneering at their \ndegenerate state and whatnot."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1742736"
msgid "If anyone can drag her out of the shadow of\n#C236196003BB#CDEF's mantle, I want to believe it's you.\nNo, I DO believe you can."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1742864"
msgid "What? I'll deal with #C236196003Launcher#CDEF.\nThat guy's got no pizzazz―nothing at all,\nactually!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1742964"
msgid "Though he has me beat in firepower,\nMY beauty beats out his."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1743028"
msgid "It's not the strong who survive to the end;\nindeed―――it's those who are loved by all!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1743120"
msgid "#C236196003Saber#CDEF clenches her fist tight,\nready for our rematch with Launc―#C236196003Karna#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1743224"
msgid "Seeing #SVT[her][him][her][him]# like this truly is reassuring.\n#C236196003Karna#CDEF may be a formidable adversary,\nbut he still likely has some weak spot we can act on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1743396"
msgid "After all, we've fought against superior enemies\ncountless times―and we've overcome them all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1743492"
msgid "If something is bothering you, then \nlet it be heard. I'll make almost any\nproblem go away."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1743584"
msgid "…I know why I'm looking so bleak.\nIt's because I have yet to sort out the\ncontents of the memories I got back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1743696"
msgid "Memories of the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF came back to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1743760"
msgid "But even so, I can't recall the crucial \"reason I'm fighting.\"\nWhat kind of #ROFS0001#RUBS  Magus#RUBE#C000246204Wizard#CDEF#REND was I,\nand for what purpose did I seek the #C000246204Holy Grail#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1743964"
msgid "My background, my life, so to speak."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1744004"
msgid "I can't recall my past, the pedestal of my existence.\nThat gives rise to uneasiness in my mind, even now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1744112"
msgid "Even I'M a bad person.\nBefore I even realized it, I had hurt people.\nOut of some impulse, I committed grave mistakes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1744232"
msgid "Even if all of your memories have yet to return,\nwho you are hasn't changed a bit. As far as I\nknow, you support the greatest star here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1744372"
msgid "I want you to believe in me for now.\nAny memories you're missing now will come\nback in a flash once we escape the Far Side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1744496"
msgid "I'll endure 'til then. Besides, my own memories\naren't clear either. It wouldn't be very fair\nif only you got to recall everything."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1744628"
msgid "We vowed to soar across the skies together.\nFor now, that's all I could want you to know."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1744720"
msgid "…I see.\nNow that #C236196003Saber#CDEF's said all that for me,\nmy unease curiously disappears."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1744816"
msgid "So long as my memories are incomplete,\nmy anxiety probably will come back.\nNonetheless, I can now come to terms with my uncertainties."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1744952"
msgid "…alright, we have to get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1744992"
msgid "We only just began #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's Labyrinth.\nWe need to free her from #C236196003BB#CDEF's clutches\nand escape the Far Side as soon as possible―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1745152"
msgid "#C236196003Karna#CDEF… huh? The hero of charity extolled\nin the \"Mahabharata.\" …and archrival to the\ngreat hero #C236196003Arjuna#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1745292"
msgid "I expected him have a bow. Guess we have to\nchalk up him being summoned as a Lancer as one\nof the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF system's peculiarities."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1745448"
msgid "And yet… something feels off about him,\neven since the beginning. He's a lot different\nthan who I thought he was."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1745564"
msgid "No, I'm not trying to say, at this point,\nthat #C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF and #C236196003Karna#CDEF are conspiring to\ndeceive us as to who he really is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1745724"
msgid "…kidding. Don't get so tilted. We'll think up\nsomething after a night's sleep. Next time, I'll\ngive his prim face something to frown about."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1745868"
msgid "#C236196003Archer#CDEF clenches his fist tight,\nready for our rematch with Launc―#C236196003Karna#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1745976"
msgid "Seeing #SVT[her][him][her][him]# like this truly is reassuring.\n#C236196003Karna#CDEF may be a formidable adversary,\nbut he still likely has some weak spot we can act on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1746148"
msgid "After all, we've fought against superior enemies\ncountless times―and we've overcome them all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1746244"
msgid "What's wrong? Can't sleep?\nI'll give you advice about anything you're\nworrying about."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1746332"
msgid "…well, looking at your expression,\nI can guess what it is you're worrying over.\nThe memories you got back, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1746448"
msgid "…the reason I can't relax is because\nI have yet to sort out the\ncontents of the memories I got back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1746552"
msgid "Memories of the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF came back to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1746616"
msgid "But even so, I can't recall the crucial \"reason I'm fighting.\"\nWhat kind of #ROFS0001#RUBS  Magus#RUBE#C000246204Wizard#CDEF#REND was I,\nand for what purpose did I seek the #C000246204Holy Grail#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1746820"
msgid "My background, my life, so to speak."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1746860"
msgid "I can't recall my past, the pedestal of my existence.\nThat gives rise to uneasiness in my mind, even now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1746968"
msgid "――――Okay. Yeah, I guess that could be.\nIn a far-off world, in a completely\ndifferent dimension."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1747068"
msgid "……he hasn't played along with me\nsince the very beginning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1747132"
msgid "Although #C236196003Archer#CDEF seems to unquestioningly\ntrust #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF, precisely because\nhe DOES is why he doesn't understand\nwhy this is so painful for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1747316"
msgid "Even I'M a bad person.\nBefore I even realized it, I had hurt people.\nOut of some impulse, I committed grave mistakes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1747436"
msgid "There isn't a single person who hasn't hurt\nsomeone; a single creature that hasn't made\na mistake. It's fine, Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1747556"
msgid "Maybe you're feeling uneasy right now,\nbut at least the way I remember you is…\num, you know."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1747652"
msgid "It's hard for me to say with you right in\nfront of me… but you're what they would call\nthe \"ultimate partner,\" basically."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1747776"
msgid "I want you to be proud of that.\nJust so you know, I'm an ally of justice.\nI don't get on well with bad people."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1747888"
msgid "…although, my own memories are similarly\nfragmented here and there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1747960"
msgid "We're both a bit broken, so while we get\nfixed up, we just need to keep fighting."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1748044"
msgid "What? Once we get back to the Near Side\nof the Moon, I'll be fully restored, see?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1748128"
msgid "…I see.\nNow that #C236196003Archer#CDEF said all that for me,\nmy uneasiness curiously disappears."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1748228"
msgid "So long as my memories are incomplete,\nmy anxiety probably will come back.\nNonetheless, I can now come to terms with my uncertainties."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1748364"
msgid "…alright, we have to get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1748404"
msgid "We only just began #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's Labyrinth.\nWe need to free her from #C236196003BB#CDEF's clutches\nand escape the Far Side as soon as possible―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1748564"
msgid "Good work today, Darling. And so the NEET\nturns tiger. This Labyrinth turned out\nto be a real pain, in a lot of ways."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1748684"
msgid "Well, it's more like #C236196003Jinako#CDEF HID behind\nthe tiger though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1748760"
msgid "I wasn't able to keep up with #C236196003Launcher#CDEF,\nbut the Labyrinth has only just begun."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1748856"
msgid "I'll show him that if I try hard enough,\nI can reflect that optical weapon of his\ntwice back at him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1748960"
msgid "Although, my#ROFS0002#RUBS vessel#RUBE body#REND might be a taaad too small\nto take out a sacred treasure that can reflect\nthe entire universe."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1749104"
msgid "#C236196003Caster#CDEF clenches her fist tight,\nready for our rematch with Launc―#C236196003Karna#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1749212"
msgid "Seeing #SVT[her][him][her][him]# like this truly is reassuring.\n#C236196003Karna#CDEF may be a formidable adversary,\nbut he still likely has some weak spot we can act on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1749384"
msgid "After all, we've fought against superior enemies\ncountless times―and we've overcome them all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1749480"
msgid "Acting in her easygoing way,\nshe sees right through me and into my worries."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1749556"
msgid "…I couldn't help feeling down because\nI have yet to sort out the\ncontents of the memories I got back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1749660"
msgid "Memories of the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF came back to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1749724"
msgid "But even so, I can't recall the crucial \"reason I'm fighting.\"\nWhat kind of #ROFS0001#RUBS  Magus#RUBE#C000246204Wizard#CDEF#REND was I,\nand for what purpose did I seek the #C000246204Holy Grail#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1749928"
msgid "My background, my life, so to speak."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1749968"
msgid "I can't recall my past, the pedestal of my existence.\nThat gives rise to uneasiness in my mind, even now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1750076"
msgid "I mean, even a god can't tempt you. Just how\nasexual ARE you? Wait, isn't that evil? You have \nan innocent fox twisted around your finger!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1750216"
msgid "Your standards for good and evil are messed up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1750264"
msgid "Even I'M a bad person.\nBefore I even realized it, I had hurt people.\nOut of some impulse, I committed grave mistakes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1750384"
msgid "So please have confidence in yourself.\nThe flame ingrained within you won't go out,\neven if it hasn't come back to you yet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1750508"
msgid "So for that reason, please rest without\nworry tonight.\nI'll be right beside you the entire time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1750608"
msgid "…I see.\nNow that #C236196003Caster#CDEF said all that for me,\nmy uneasiness curiously disappears."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1750708"
msgid "So long as my memories are incomplete,\nmy anxiety probably will come back.\nNonetheless, I can now come to terms with my uncertainties."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1750844"
msgid "…alright, we have to get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1750884"
msgid "We only just began #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's Labyrinth.\nWe need to free her from #C236196003BB#CDEF's clutches\nand escape the Far Side as soon as possible―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1751044"
msgid "That accursed #C236196003Karna#CDEF. Two of his decisive\nadvantages are sealed, yet he wields such\ndivine might. He aggravates me to no end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1751188"
msgid "It's a pity that his Master has issues.\nThat mass of blubber can't make full\nuse of his power."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1751284"
msgid "Did you know, mongrel?\nThe lance he holds is a masterpiece―\nused by no one, and known to no one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1751384"
msgid "That is to say, it was noted in legend\nas having \"existed,\" but there isn't a single\naccount of it having been \"used.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1751504"
msgid "Thus, that lance doesn't exist in my catalog.\nSo long as something is \"unspoken of,\" I can't\nknow if it qualifies to be my treasure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1751640"
msgid "Is his god-slaying martial art truth\nor fiction―――I'm looking forward to\nthe moment we clash."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1751740"
msgid "While cheerfully laughing,\n#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF readies for his rematch against Launc―#C236196003Karna#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1751856"
msgid "Even though he's stuck purely to defense,\nhis unwavering confidence, honestly, is a little reassuring."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1751960"
msgid "#C236196003Karna#CDEF may be a formidable adversary,\nbut #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF is an inexhaustible Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1752072"
msgid "I think that since he has yet to go all out,\nthen in terms of ability, these two are a match for one another.\nI'm still left with some anxiety,\nbut I think we have a good chance of success."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1752264"
msgid "With that, the only issue left―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1752304"
msgid "Concerns the memories I finally got back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1752348"
msgid "Though still fragmented,\nmy memories of the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF came back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1752436"
msgid "But even so, I can't recall the crucial \"reason I'm fighting.\"\nWhat kind of #ROFS0001#RUBS  Magus#RUBE#C000246204Wizard#CDEF#REND was I,\nand for what purpose did I seek the #C000246204Holy Grail#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1752640"
msgid "My background, my life, so to speak."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1752680"
msgid "I can't recall my past, the pedestal of my existence.\nThat gives rise to uneasiness in my mind, even now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1752788"
msgid "You brood over the most foolish things.\nWhether you're evil or good, it doesn't change\nthe fact that you're a mongrel."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1752908"
msgid "To you, you're a life which was\ncast into the dark.\nTo me, your life was one I picked up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1753000"
msgid "Even if your memories were to return,\neven if your past becomes known,\nthat won't change."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1753092"
msgid "And anyway, you haven't matured enough to\nbecome evil. If you're going to speak of\natrocities, first commit acts of good."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1753216"
msgid "If you are unable to do so, then perish.\nThe moment you are crushed under your anxiety,\nthis sideshow will end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1753328"
msgid "Regaining my past is important,\nbut I have an even bigger problem looming over me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1753412"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh, the King of Heroes#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1753460"
msgid "This uncontrollable Servant is\nabsolutely NOT my ally.\nHe's a demon who will take\n#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF's life in the end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1753592"
msgid "This Servant won't permit any whining in his presence.\nRegardless of how anxious, how scared I am,\nI have to hold firm and press on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1753728"
msgid "Though that's not necessarily the case.\nEven I recognize the value of whining. I mainly\ndon't permit disrespect towards me―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1753860"
msgid "Your memories of the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF have\nreturned. Your memories before that are, as of\nyet, still a mystery."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1753988"
msgid "If you're a nobody, then you seem to be\ngetting squashed by your sloppiness.\nMoreover, you're relying on ME."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1754100"
msgid "Don't you dread that? You may be able to escape\nthis fear if you obey #C236196003BB#CDEF. Why would you\nrely on me at THIS point?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1754232"
msgid "Even if I'm uneasy and scared,\nso long as I have hope,\nI have to suck it up and move forward."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1754328"
msgid "―――Heh. Optimism over desire?\nYet again, it seems my estimate of\nyou was wrong."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1754412"
msgid "Well, that's fine too. It doesn't change\nthe fact that this is just an occasional\npleasure to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1754512"
msgid "Act as you see fit for the time being.\nIt's been quite a show so far. I expect further\nclumsiness from you, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1754648"
msgid "Following his lead, I turn onto my side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1754692"
msgid "Alright. I have to get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1754728"
msgid "We only just began #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's Labyrinth.\nWe need to free her from #C236196003BB#CDEF's clutches\nand escape the Far Side as soon as possible―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1754888"
msgid "Where the days passed quietly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1754920"
msgid "I was always going through them, or rather,\nit's like I had gone through them at some point―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1755016"
msgid "How many days had I spent there, I wonder."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1755060"
msgid "It was a fairly long time,\nbut looking back on it now, it was all so fleeting―\nIt feels like it ended in the blink of an eye."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1755188"
msgid "That's something that certainly happened."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1755232"
msgid "I spoke with her for many days inside that Infirmary,\nabout the days that were passing by."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1755324"
msgid "To her―who would eventually disappear―\nand to me―who had nothing―that time was precious."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1755420"
msgid "Since I lost them―― Since they were erased,\nthere must be some meaning to it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1755500"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF suppressed these memories for some purpose."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1755564"
msgid "Memories of what happened over just a single day\nbefore the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF started."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1755664"
msgid "I awake from a long dream."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1755692"
msgid "No, that was no dream.\nGetting my memories back is affecting me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1755760"
msgid "Everything I experienced in the preliminary was fake.\nThe dream I was shown because of #C236196003BB#CDEF\nwas of a fabricated preliminary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1755900"
msgid "I could always recall what happened during\nthe preliminary ever since I woke up in the\n#C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF.\nBut now that I have my memories back,\nscenes which hadn't crossed my mind now start to."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1756116"
msgid "Like how during the preliminary,\nI tended to #C236196003Sakura#CDEF by the entrance."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1756204"
msgid "Like how after that, my daily routine\nbecame chatting with her in the Infirmary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1756288"
msgid "…but, the memories I got back are evidence that\nthese memories couldn't have happened."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1756376"
msgid "Putting the preliminary stuff aside for a second,\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF served all the Masters in the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF's\nfinal selection equally as an \"impersonal\" AI."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1756560"
msgid "The only thing I spoke to #C236196003Sakura#CDEF about was the day\nthat I tended to her by the entrance, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1756676"
msgid "And so no matter how I look at it,\nthese fragmented events I just saw\ncouldn't have possibly occurred."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1756780"
msgid "…I don't know what the meaning behind\nthis contradiction is right now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1756852"
msgid "It's inexplicable, but I don't have time\nto ruminate over it right now.\nI take a deep breath\nand leave My Room with #C236196003#SVT#CDEF beside me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1757000"
msgid "So, loneliness―――\nIt's said that loneliness is a crucial element\nin the breeding grounds of art."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1757100"
msgid "Through the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF, this immense library,\nI gained the form of a Servant\nand answered your call."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1757216"
msgid "Then, I came to know the value posterity\nattributed to the myriad works I produced. I was\nable to find out if I had made ripples."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1757348"
msgid "Yes. It's hardly satisfying.\nI pay no mind to the fact many judge these\nworks as poor or rubbish."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1757448"
msgid "However, those who extol my works are TOO few!\nAnother thousand, no, a hundred―no, I won't ask\nfor much. At least, three more people! No!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1757588"
msgid "Hey. Why do you laugh?\nI presume you're a true hobbyist who\nunderstands my art, yes?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1757676"
msgid "…no matter.\nLoneliness is the spark of creative works.\nIt, in and of itself, is not a bad thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1757776"
msgid "Loneliness and art. Loneliness and philosophy.\nLoneliness and discipline. Loneliness and\ninvention. None make for bad pairs."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1757904"
msgid "Do you #[sympathize with][take pity on]# him at all?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1757960"
msgid "He's flawless, therefore his servile Master\nwon't accept him?\n…how unlucky can a guy be?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1758052"
msgid "I wonder who's experiencing the deeper\nloneliness: the Master, or the Servant…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1758132"
msgid "…shouldn't we toss these two into a chatroom\nor something and have them talk\nto each other for a while?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1758240"
msgid "I'll just be talking to myself,\nso if you hear anything, please ignore it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1758316"
msgid "…well, honestly, it's about her.\nI understand #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's misfortune\na little too much."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1758420"
msgid "What disgusts me about #C236196003BB#CDEF is how she chooses\nvulnerabilities that we've all faced\nat some point."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1758536"
msgid "Although everyone is different,\nwe have universal weak points…\nVanity and loneliness; feeling helpless."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1758644"
msgid "When all that gets complicated,\nnormal people especially have a hard time\nbreaking out. That said…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1758744"
msgid "You know of the weakness an \"unchosen\" person\nhas, Master. If there's anyone that can cheer\nup #C236196003Jinako#CDEF, I think it's only you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1758888"
msgid "\"Whether you escape, whether you have friends,\neveryone will end up in the same place,\"\nshe says?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1758988"
msgid "Delightful, isn't it, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF?\nMaybe it's coincidence,\nbut that mongrel's jest is dead on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1759096"
msgid "I was able to divine her next #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nWhat she, who has glanced into the abyss,\nsuffers are diseases: lies and loneliness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1759232"
msgid "She may be a woman of little import,\nbut I say we don't want to miss\nwhat shall unfold in the next Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1759344"
msgid "Strive to bring forth a development of my liking\nas well, and don't let her best you at that. I\nwould hate to see her beat you in buffoonery."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1759488"
msgid "……so. Now we've recovered #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's final #C000246204SG#CDEF,\nand all that remains is to tear down\nthe Labyrinth's Relief. Yet…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1759636"
msgid "Her―――Her situation could be described like\nan atonement, being overwhelmed with shame."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1759728"
msgid "And then there's that man.\n#C236196003Monji Gatou#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1759784"
msgid "I'll ask you this straight:\nPraetor, what say you about #C236196003Gatou#CDEF's passing?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1759876"
msgid "I regret it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1759892"
msgid "…I'm regretting it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1759916"
msgid "He's the only one who had an answer from the very start;\nhe's the only one who was daring enough…\nfoolish enough to actually see it through."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1760060"
msgid "It frustrates me that I didn't pick up on his plan."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1760112"
msgid "It frustrates me that I couldn't get with\n#C236196003Gatou#CDEF and figure out a different way out of this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1760220"
msgid "There's no need to cleverly deflect the issue.\nUntil their last breath, humans are incapable\nof familiarizing themselves with death."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1760356"
msgid "Besides, how I grieve over the\ndeceased is by taking vows for the future."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1760432"
msgid "For example… I won't allow my Praetor to be\nleft alone in the end like him. I, too,\nwon't become alone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1760540"
msgid "I see―――Then that's fine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1760572"
msgid "If that man, who lived heartily and whimsically,\nknew that at the very, very end, he would bear\neverything around him on his shoulders…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1760712"
msgid "Then he may have said, \"Goddamnit!\"\nand would have come back. And then I think\nhe would start complaining."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1760820"
msgid "His behavior in the end was unbefitting of\nhis character."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1760880"
msgid "He said, \"That's what life pretty much is.\"\nHowever, acting like he did, anyone would\nmistake his act for something lofty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1761004"
msgid "Judging by the end of this man, who laughed life\naway: is the meaning of anything found in death?\nI think even #C236196003Gatou#CDEF would turn bleak at that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1761164"
msgid "…hm? You're surprised that I\nspeak well of him?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1761216"
msgid "I got carried away; never did I think the\nwords would fly from my tongue, but I praised\nthat man's virtue."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1761324"
msgid "All I'm really saying is that everything about\nhim conflicted with who I am, is all.\nHe has his silver lining."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1761436"
msgid "Well, enough of that.\nLet's end the day and go sleep like logs.\nHopefully that will ease us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1761532"
msgid "I'm tired. Tomorrow we'll certainly feel\nfresh as a newborn, but just for tonight,\nlet's depart for sleep as the dead do…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1761656"
msgid "So Mr. Council President himself told us to go\nrest. Even a lawful person would want to chat\naway, hearing that. It's human nature."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1761788"
msgid "I hardly need to mention that this sun is\nalways setting on this school building.\nIt's kind of rejuvenating."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1761900"
msgid "By the way―――\nHave you ever felt like this: that you're the\nonly one having a rough time?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1761996"
msgid "Anything like that ever gnaw at you?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1762036"
msgid "I don't have those thoughts."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1762068"
msgid "Why would I?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1762084"
msgid "I don't buy it.\nIs that true?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1762116"
msgid "Do you despise the situation you've\nbeen placed in? Do you want others to\ntake the blame?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1762208"
msgid "No, I really don't think so."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1762240"
msgid "I've thought about that… a little."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1762276"
msgid "….please just tell me you have.\nI'm trying to make a point here.\n#[This won't be some silly male bonding thing.][This won't be some after school chat.]#"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1762432"
msgid "Is that so? That's a bit of a relief.\nWell, don't worry about it.\nThis is just chitchat."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1762524"
msgid "Humans, individually, aren't so different.\nWe just live going with the flow of the world."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1762616"
msgid "It's just that sometimes, something hits the\nwrong button of our beliefs.\nThose are the links that changes a person."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1762736"
msgid "The best ability for a person to have has to\nbe perseverance. The strength to keep sending\nyour thoughts out externally, internally――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1762872"
msgid "#C236196003Monji Gatou#CDEF explained the conviction behind\nfinding his own god…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1762956"
msgid "That may have been a blessing.\nDepending on the recipient, those words\nthemselves may have been salvation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1763064"
msgid "But what were those words to #C236196003Jinako#CDEF?\nWas something right about them?\nWas something in it a trigger for her?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1763188"
msgid "I get the sense that she's still putting it off.\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF has one option left―she needs help\nfrom the people around her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1763324"
msgid "I spaced out for a second there."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1763360"
msgid "Something on your mind?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1763384"
msgid "Is it about Gatou?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1763404"
msgid "I'm really sorry.\nThat was uncalled for…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1763448"
msgid "But, at least he had a #RUBS      peaceful death#RUBEwell-deserved rest#REND…\nSounds like taking advantage of his death, huh?\nBut you're too kind for that, Darling."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1763616"
msgid "Knowing you, I wouldn't be surprised if\nyou ended up having nightmares in your sleep.\nI mean, not that I'd allow such a thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1763744"
msgid "If a curse god wants some of you,\nI'll cast them back from whence they came.\n……that aside……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1763840"
msgid "Envious of that foolish man who sacrificed\nhimself for #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's selfishness like that…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1763944"
msgid "I think maybe he's grateful and really\nregrets that it wasn't him instead."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1764020"
msgid "Of course, Servants can't go throwing\ntheir lives away willy-nilly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1764088"
msgid "But if I knew it would definitely save\nmy #RUBS  Master#RUBEDarling#REND, if we better understood each other,\nenough to have such conviction…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1764232"
msgid "I almost certainly wouldn't hesitate―――\nYes, I'm aware that you have no desire\nfor that to happen, Darling."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1764344"
msgid "…my ears are a bit red with shame now.\nPlease forgive me. Now is a good time\nto get some rest, please go ahead."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1764460"
msgid "Tomorrow… that barbaric Student Council\nis going to start working us #[man][woman]# and Servant\nto the bone, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1764580"
msgid "Well, I have no need for sleep.\nAlthough, YOU probably need some time\nto grasp who that man was."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1764680"
msgid "\"#C236196003Monji Gatou#CDEF,\" was it? The reason I have no\ndisdain for religion is because, now and again,\nthere are those who reach such a caliber."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1764832"
msgid "By that I mean someone that explains, teaches,\nguides their pupils on the right path. So long\nas one hasn't lost their sanity, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1764968"
msgid "The moment he accepted his death was\nthe moment he cast away the vow he had made:\nthe vow \"to seek the gods he believed in.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1765096"
msgid "Without his selfishness, all that remained\nin that man was the virtue he cultivated,\namassed over many years."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1765208"
msgid "Humans are beyond control. One cannot attain\nenlightenment when one is selfish and doesn't\nseek the lofty height of losing selfishness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1765344"
msgid "That is the one thing even a messiah can't\nevade: one's karma, one's suffering.\nThat's why―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1765444"
msgid "What man leaves with his footprints are worthy\nsights to behold."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1765512"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF is the same.\nWhere will her self-resignation take her?\nLet's ascertain the answer."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1765628"
msgid "The instant I got back to my personal room, fatigue hit me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1765688"
msgid "My knees lose their strength,\nand I start to fall to the floor with a thud."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1765764"
msgid "Woah! Be careful!\nI'm surprised you suddenly collapsed.\n…hmm, you should come rest on this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1765860"
msgid "Wh―are you okay? I guess your fatigue\ncame out all at once.\nLie on the bed, properly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1765948"
msgid "So #C236196003Rin#CDEF's candid advice was correct.\nYou appear healed on the exterior,\nbut you're extremely weary on the inside."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1766080"
msgid "Clear your mind and sleep.\nI'll have to allow you to use the bed.\nIt WAS yours to begin with."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1766176"
msgid "The bedding feels soft,\nbut my ability to think is slowly waning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1766244"
msgid "So #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF tells me, then I practically collapse,\nplacing my body onto the bed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1766344"
msgid "The bedding feels soft,\nbut my ability to think is slowly waning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1766412"
msgid "Before I fall into tranquil sleep,\nthe battle between #C236196003Leo#CDEF and #C236196003BB#CDEF comes to my mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1766528"
msgid "…frustratingly, everything about #C236196003BB#CDEF is overwhelming."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1766600"
msgid "Until now, we've fought within fields prepared\nby the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF under fixed rules.\nThat applied to our enemies #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF and #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF too.\nThough they were illegally modded to some extent,\nthose two were powerful enemies we\nfaced while \"under the rules.\"\nBut―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1766916"
msgid "―――But, #C236196003BB#CDEF is different.\nAt this point, she's becoming one with the system itself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1767020"
msgid "She's a being who made the entire Imaginary Number Space\nof the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF her possession\nand fused with the #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF system."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1767188"
msgid "Isn't that precisely what\nwe could recognize as a god?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1767244"
msgid "If that's the case, the very chance of\nwinning in our battle doesn't exist―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1767328"
msgid "…I'm sorry.\nOn account of my cowardice,\nI put this heavy burden on your shoulders."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1767412"
msgid "I deserve to be criticized for\nbeing a failure of a Servant…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1767476"
msgid "No way.\nI raise myself and immediately reply,\n\"That's not true.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1767544"
msgid "I-is that so? Yes, it is so!\nI knew I was the best Servant!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1767604"
msgid "However, be quiet for now.\nDon't get up, is what I mean.\nAllow me to tend to you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1767688"
msgid "Her face lit up, #C236196003#SVT#CDEF measures my temperature,\nand… she's singing… me… some sort of… lullaby…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1767804"
msgid "Looks like she can't hold\nback her joy in nursing me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1767860"
msgid "With the way she's acting now,\nI can't respond to #C236196003#SVT#CDEF with anything.\n…the cowardly one is me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1767972"
msgid "If I had more knowledge and technique,\nmaybe I could think of a way to counter #C236196003BB#CDEF's skill."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1768080"
msgid "So long as our strategy is sound,\n#C236196003Saber#CDEF's victory is assured."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1768160"
msgid "…oh, you. I can tell what you want to say\nwithout you saying it. It's actually a bit\nof a pain for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1768264"
msgid "But I'm grateful.\nHmph. What am I thinking, getting all timid!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1768328"
msgid "It's inevitable that you would rely on me\nto that degree."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1768388"
msgid "If that #C236196003BB#CDEF is equivalent to a god,\nthen watch me destroy that god! For the sake of\nnone other than my lovable Praetor!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1768524"
msgid "#C236196003Saber#CDEF emphasizes by clenching her fist."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1768580"
msgid "The usual arrogant and majestic #C236196003Saber#CDEF is back.\nNow that I have peace of mind… it seems I can sleep…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1768700"
msgid "However… there's still one more thing\nI have to apologize for."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1768764"
msgid "I swore to attain victory with you,\nand I promised to obtain the #C000246204Holy Grail#CDEF.\n―――That is no longer―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1768888"
msgid "Nevertheless, I shall fulfill my final duty.\nI shall escort you back to the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, \nwithout fail. That alone is my final―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1769040"
msgid "………what's wrong? You must be tired.\nAre you not going to sleep, Master?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1769116"
msgid "…I can only respond with a vague reply and a shake of my head.\nIt's not that I won't go to sleep, it might be that I can't."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1769244"
msgid "It's the gap between our abilities and #C236196003BB#CDEF's.\nThe future from this point on makes me so uneasy I can't sleep.\nEven though I know #C236196003Rin#CDEF and the others\nare trying their hardest…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1769452"
msgid "No, that's fine. It's only natural to have\ndoubts and fears as a human being."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1769532"
msgid "It'd be a problem if you avoided confronting\nthat fear. You're doing just fine. It's my job\nto change your fears into confidence."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1769664"
msgid "His voice is quiet, yet firmly resolute.\n#C236196003Archer#CDEF is renewing his will to fight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1769760"
msgid "…of course. I wasn't the only one that lost to #C236196003BB#CDEF.\nHe also lost, unable to lay even a finger on her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1769880"
msgid "Moreover, #C236196003Archer#CDEF is silently taking a vow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1769940"
msgid "A vow to bring his Master victory, for sure next time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1769996"
msgid "In any case, everything starts tomorrow.\nI'm the Servant you chose. Please have faith in\nthat choice and your strength."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1770116"
msgid "Because as far as I know, you've got the top\nrank in not knowing when to give up. A dilemma\nlike this is an everyday thing for us, no?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1770252"
msgid "So long as #C236196003Archer#CDEF has faith in me,\nI have to meet his expectations. That's it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1770348"
msgid "The instant I realized that simple fact,\nmy eyelids grew heavy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1770412"
msgid "Ahh―――I'll be sleeping sound… tonight―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1770460"
msgid "…asleep now? Alright. I've got another big job\nstarting tomorrow. I just have to do my third\nrate thing and work my ass off, but―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1770596"
msgid "…defeat #C236196003BB#CDEF, return to the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF\ntogether, advance to the very end―――\nAll that, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1770728"
msgid "Sorry, Master.\nLooks like I'm going to drop the ball\non one of those promises."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1770808"
msgid "But I'll show you how tenacious I can be.\nI'll definitely get you back to the proper\n#C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1770932"
msgid "Err, between the both of us, I'm the only\none who will get any enjoyment from that.\nSorry."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1771024"
msgid "If concerns over that wicked woman\nare weighing on your mind, then please\nlift your head and listen."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1771128"
msgid "Certainly, she's a mighty obstacle for us.\nHer inception was merely a tiny #RUBS    bug #RUBEmistake#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1771236"
msgid "However, before anyone realized it, she grew―\nAnd now she's become a dark cloud,\npractically enveloping everything."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1771356"
msgid "Nevertheless, it's too early to quit\njust because of that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1771416"
msgid "…indeed. You won't be suffering an\nordeal like THAT one ever again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1771488"
msgid "There's nothing to worry about.\nAs always, regardless of the outcome that\nawaits us, I will be by your side―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1771604"
msgid "#C236196003Caster#CDEF's words are warm, and as if they were warmth itself,\nthey permeate through my tense body and mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1771728"
msgid "I'm soon visited by serene sleep,\nand I start falling into a dreamless world."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1771808"
msgid "…yes, that's precisely right. A way out is\nsure to exist within whatever fate awaits us,\nwithin whatever rules we're under."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1771936"
msgid "I'll protect Darling, return #[him][her]# to the #C000246204Holy\nGrail War#CDEF, and hand #[him][her]# the #C000246204Holy Grail#CDEF―――Yes,\nI'm going for none other than a Happy Ending!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1772128"
msgid "I, #C236196003Tamamo#CDEF, will smash a destiny or two with\ntime to spare―if it's for the benefit\nof Darling and me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1772248"
msgid "Not necessarily so. What you regard as a \"god\"\nis not omnipotent. No perfect thing exists\nthroughout the entire universe, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1772380"
msgid "If there were, I would have to say it may be me,\nbut, that's a given. I don't need to explain the\ndifference between omnipotence and perfection."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1772528"
msgid "Even if she really is a god of the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF,\na flaw or deficiency is certain to appear.\nYou humans must ascertain her weak point."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1772676"
msgid "Toss away any foolish sense of duty you may\nhave. Shamefully struggle away as you do,\nmongrel. You'll find a chance at the very end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1772812"
msgid "In any case, that's all you're capable of.\nFight as you see fit, lose as you see fit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1772900"
msgid "I listened to his voice,\nwhich was brimming with confidence,\nand then my lips involuntarily curled into a smile."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1773016"
msgid "Despite the fact that what #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF\nis saying is unreasonable,\nit mysteriously eases my emotions."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1773132"
msgid "With extreme arrogance, he instructs me\nto do something obvious:\n\"Do what you can do.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1773220"
msgid "I'm being dumb, worrying this much over\nwhether his argument is valid or not."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1773300"
msgid "My eyelids close out of relief."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1773332"
msgid "How do I put this…? It's been a long time,\nbut it seems that tonight I can\nfinally get some sound rest―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1773444"
msgid "…but never forget: our contract was formed\nin the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF. Upon returning to\nthe Near Side, our contract will terminate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1773596"
msgid "When that happens, you're destined to\nbe visited by an inescapable death."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1773672"
msgid "Will you return to the Near Side or remain in\nthe Far Side? That choice belongs to you alone.\nAlways bear that in mind―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1773800"
msgid "Unable to do anything else about this, I apologize:\n\"Sorry.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1773864"
msgid "Also, about #C236196003Lancer#CDEF…\nI have to admit, I understand where\nshe's coming from."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1773956"
msgid "Understand?\nI was personally pretty surprised by the whole\n\"#ROFS0001#RUBS    Sweets#RUBELovestruck#REND\" thing with #C236196003Lancer#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1774100"
msgid "When one entices the masses,\nand they admire your looks――\nIt's a rather nice feeling."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1774188"
msgid "However, no matter the endless applause one\nreceives… There are times when words from\nthat one, special someone mean the most."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1774316"
msgid "Therefore, it's not out of place for #C236196003Lancer#CDEF,\nwho covets beauty more than anyone,\nto also covet love."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1774436"
msgid "Despite talking about her rival,\nshe's actually gazing back at her own life―――\nThat's the kind of impression I'm getting from this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1774572"
msgid "Still, I won't be handing over my Praetor!\nNot to #C236196003Lancer#CDEF, not to that #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1774688"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF―――\nWhen I look at her―I don't want to recall it,\nbut―she reminds me of my mother."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1774804"
msgid "She's a vile woman who ruins men.\nNo, she's a vile woman who cripples her lovers.\nWatch out for her, Praetor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1774916"
msgid "You go easy on both enemies and allies.\nIt's beautiful to see you face everything\nso commendably, but there's a limit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1775036"
msgid "…well, I can't help myself from enjoying\nthat side of you, but it still does worry me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1775124"
msgid "Until we unravel the mystery behind her\ninvincibility, let's aim to not encounter\nthat woman."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1775220"
msgid "First #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF, then #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF, huh? Oddly\nenough, you HAVE become more respectable, but\nit also kind of bit you in the ass, no?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1775384"
msgid "You must be EX class in having no luck with\nwomen. In some ways, I pride myself in\nhaving bad luck, too―but your case is BAD."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1775512"
msgid "As a man, I'm delighted that women are approaching me,\nbut I would say THESE two are using some \"unique\" approaches."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1775632"
msgid "Hahaha. Nah, not really. They may have some\nfoul weapons on them, but that's what ladies\nwho become aware of love are like."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1775756"
msgid "Ah. In that way, this makes for a solid\nlife lesson for you. It'll help once you get\nback to Earth. Well, IF you have a partner."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1775888"
msgid "He's sticking his big fat nose where it doesn't belong.\nI can't really stand how nosy he can be."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1775988"
msgid "………this has turned into one hell\nof a mess."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1776036"
msgid "Right after we enter the room,\n#C236196003Archer#CDEF starts stressing out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1776112"
msgid "My Servant, who's supposed to protect his Master,\nhas the enemy―of all people―declare their love to him,\nand as soon as I think he was pretty cool in pushing back,\nwe enter our room he just starts whining.\nIt's a calamity."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1776340"
msgid "I really wonder about this guy sometimes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1776384"
msgid "The first thing I want to do is smack him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1776428"
msgid "Oops, no, no.\nFirst, I tell him to calm down.\nThe situation needs to be analyzed with a cool head.\n#C236196003Archer#CDEF needs to, not me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1776568"
msgid "Y-yeah… I confess, I'm not used to enemies like\nthat. I'm afraid I might not be able to draw out\nmy full strength when we fight #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1776728"
msgid "Ohhh? \"That kind of enemy,\" he says?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1776768"
msgid "How about he just be honest and say it:\n\"I'd have a hard time fighting someone smitten with me.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1776868"
msgid "Wha…!\nThat's NOT what I'm saying! There's a\nsubtle difference between that and this!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1776956"
msgid "…besides, who are you to talk?\nYou did a great job wrapping #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF\naround your little finger."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1777072"
msgid "If you've got a problem with me, then how about\nwe trade places? You be #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF's Master,\nI'll be #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1777224"
msgid "――――――.\nSorry, I went way too far with that one, I admit\nit. Please don't look at me like that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1777328"
msgid "Prudent as he is, his tongue slips―and tumbles.\nFor him to say that, he must be confused over this situation.\n…I'll give him the benefit of the doubt."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1777484"
msgid "If this is how it's going to be, then I should've\nnever wished for Archer to have these lady issues――\neven as a joke."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1777604"
msgid "And I shouldn't have felt the need to mock\nyour misfortunes, if this is how it's going\nto be."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1777700"
msgid "\"*sigh*…\"\nBy sheer coincidence, our sighs coincide.\nSo perfectly coincided that we couldn't help but lightly\nchuckle at one another."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1777836"
msgid "…this doesn't change what I gotta do.\nFirst, they'll go for you.\nThen, I'll stop them in their tracks."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1777940"
msgid "Sorry about all that, I'm fine now.\nEspecially because of what we're dealing with,\nlet's keep as composed as we can."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1778060"
msgid "It's about time you get some rest.\nSeems like we'll really be in for it\nstarting tomorrow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1778152"
msgid "Bwaaahh! Just thinking about that girl\nwith the spikes makes my skin crawl!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1778228"
msgid "What does she MEAN, \"invincible\"!?\nThe only thing she's invincible\nagainst is gaining curves!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1778324"
msgid "Upon entering the room, #C236196003Caster#CDEF's ramblings\ngush forth like a broken dam."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1778416"
msgid "She grabs a pillow that was laying around―\nand creates a scuffle out of swings and throws."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1778508"
msgid "Right, isn't that right, Darling!? You NEVER\nhave thoughts like, \"flatties are nice, too,\nevery now and then,\" RIGHT!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1778628"
msgid "Pressed by her fearsome intensity, I go along with her:\n\"Yep.\"\nWith that, the daggers #C236196003Caster#CDEF stared at me become dull."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1778764"
msgid "Really? That's wonderful, indeed鷙\nPhew. That a load off my shoulders.\nNow this means I can relax."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1778864"
msgid "She's a vile woman who ruins whomever she\ncaptures. Please, and again PLEASE, be cautious\nand DON'T trust her―for realsies!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1778992"
msgid "…I've been reflecting on my actions\nduring that whole affair."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1779056"
msgid "It may have been my instincts that drove me to rescue her,\nbut I know all too well that the slightest difference\ncould've ended that in disaster."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1779204"
msgid "Quite so. But you also wouldn't be the Darling\nI know and love unless your body goes moving\nbefore your head thinks!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1779324"
msgid "On the topic of horn-girl―it wasn't you that\nshe wanted. I say she wanted someone she could\ndepend on to pamper and cherish her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1779456"
msgid "…well, I won't knock her for wanting to be\nloved, wanting to fall in love. Still, NO wrong\nideas or being merciful, got it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1779584"
msgid "If you can at least keep that in mind for me,\nit should all work out in the end.\nPlease go and get some rest for now♪"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1779704"
msgid "Now that I think about it,\nyou have quite the magnetic pull, don't you?\nWhat's the count up to, four? No, five women?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1779824"
msgid "And all troublesome women, at that.\nThe nerve, to entangle so many to this extent.\nI suspect your past life had a hand in this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1779952"
msgid "Now that I think about it again,\nthat's more than enough people to play basketball with."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1780044"
msgid "Well, it's nothing to fret over. The present two\nare impediments to be surmounted. No matter the\nsecrets they hide, you need only defeat them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1780188"
msgid "Flip your perspective on this. They're two \nleopardesses, whom know not their place. You'll\nforce them to submit when the battle closes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1780328"
msgid "Though, I don't know what it is you do\nwithin those Reliefs."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1780392"
msgid "To barge into a woman's unwilling mind and tear\nher walls down from within―what envies I feel,\nnot sharing your skills here, Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1780528"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF punctuates the sentiment with an unsettling smirk."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1780608"
msgid "I wonder if the #C236196003King of Heroes#CDEF has someone\nin mind whose #C000246204SG#CDEF he wants to expose."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1780720"
msgid "At this stage in tackling these girls-turned-#C000246204Sentinels#CDEF,\nit seems that I've potentially become,\nfor lack of a better word, their \"prize.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1780876"
msgid "…nevermind. That's EXACTLY what's happened."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1780924"
msgid "Alas, I shouldn't speak of this\npurely in amusement."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1780980"
msgid "#C236196003Lancer#CDEF's love isn't so terror-inducing.\nIt's the whining of a dragon and no more.\nBest to face it directly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1781104"
msgid "However, #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's love is another thing.\nIt mustn't be touched. Try, defend against it\nwith a shield―you'll dissolve along with it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1781260"
msgid "Listen. As I'd warned you prior, don't be swayed\nby an #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF. They are monsters that cannot\nunderstand humans, nor be understood by them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1781420"
msgid "Ughh… I had one too many calories…\nI can barely move…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1781480"
msgid "As I return to the room,\nI stagger towards the bedside and take a seat.\nIt would be hard to say that this #C000246204SG#CDEF came easy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1781616"
msgid "Your response is only natural.\nYou ate three courses in one go, you know.\nThat would be difficult, even for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1781728"
msgid "Hey. Don't sleep so soon after eating so much.\nYou'll turn into a cow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1781800"
msgid "Wait. Sleep in that state and you'll puke.\nPuke first, then lie down.\nDon't dirty my bed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1781892"
msgid "While rubbing my belly―which feels bloated with data―\nI reminisce… on the events today concerning #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF's #C000246204SG#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1782044"
msgid "We've directly dealt with her countless times at this point,\nbut the more I learn about her―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1782144"
msgid "The more I experience her secrets,\nthe more I get the sense that she's a normal girl.\nShe was more of a curiosity when we first met her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1782284"
msgid "It's probably natural to think that, as well.\nEven infamous knaves or tyrants seem normal,\nif you don't know them. It happens often."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1782420"
msgid "To think you could treat her as a normal girl\neven after taking that assassination dish…\nYou sure are fearsome, Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1782544"
msgid "But you'd best not think that's all there is to\nit. You haven't forgotten all the things\n#C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF has done up until now, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1782692"
msgid "I took her for a#ROFS0004#RUBSvillainess#RUBE sadist#REND, but she was really\na#RUBS tsundere#RUBE maiden#REND――She had that image change planned!\nI seriously underestimated that horn-girl…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1782888"
msgid "But listen, Darling. No matter how nice she\nappears, a person's nature doesn't change so\neasily. In the end, that young girl is―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1783024"
msgid "Nonsense, don't jump to conclusions.\nNo matter the creature, all living things have\nstrengths and weaknesses. It's like that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1783152"
msgid "Functionality, spirituality. A lifeform's\nnature, a culture's nature. Creatures who enact\nevil also mix it with good. Such are humans."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1783288"
msgid "Certainly, #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF herself is not evil.\nHowever, she's half dragon.\nDragons, simply in being, consume humans."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1783416"
msgid "That delusion you just entertained\nwould bring her pain surpassing what a million\nspears could do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1783516"
msgid "If the whole cooking thing is one side of her,\nthen the whole capturing and torturing\nNPCs thing is another side of her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1783640"
msgid "If her intrinsic view that\n\"people are merely tools to serve her beauty\" isn't rectified,\nthen we'll never see eye-to-eye…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1783764"
msgid "The most precious things to me right now are my\nPraetor and our contract. So long as those are\nconstant, my path shall also stay constant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1783904"
msgid "…let's leave it at that.\nYou were exceedingly valiant today.\nI think it's about time to get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1784008"
msgid "That won't do. I'll instruct you on a\nspecial regurgitation technique I know, then.\nNo worries, it won't hurt."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1784120"
msgid "W-well, that's going a bit far…\nThe lovely Romans can go ahead and eat until\nthey vomit if they want to. I'll pass."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1784240"
msgid "I escape from the mildly disappointed #C236196003Saber#CDEF\nand down a Sakura-brand antacid."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1784336"
msgid "It's fine as long as you understand.\nYou have a tendency to read too far into\nother people's affairs."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1784440"
msgid "When conversing it's fine, but in battle,\nit'll turn into a shackle that binds you.\nThat swollen belly serves as a good lesson."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1784568"
msgid "It's true. I may have gone overboard in\nacquiring an #C000246204SG#CDEF this time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1784652"
msgid "While hoping that this won't last into tomorrow,\nI down a Sakura brand antacid."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1784732"
msgid "It's fine as long as you understand.\nYou have a tendency to read too far into\nother people's affairs."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1784836"
msgid "When conversing it's fine, but in battle,\nit'll turn into a shackle that binds you.\nThat swollen belly serves as a good lesson."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1784964"
msgid "Are you… laughing at the shape of a lady's belly…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1785020"
msgid "Lately, he's been way out of line with the disrespect, I think."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1785084"
msgid "…it's a lot better than being treated\nas if our relationship were formal, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1785168"
msgid "While praying that I don't put on more excess#RUBS   fat  #RUBE data#REND,\nI down a Sakura brand antacid."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1785276"
msgid "Yes, indeed so! That's why you mustn't\nhave thoughts like, \"oh, how horrible,\" or\n\"oh, how adorable.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1785380"
msgid "She's a dragon, I'm a fox―but she has animal\ntraits AND is a good-wife!? She can take votes\nfrom me, but she won't take my #RUBS  Master#RUBEDarling#REND…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1785540"
msgid "Okay, Darling. #C236196003Cas-ko#CDEF will offer to rub\nyour back until you feel better,\nif you'd like鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1785648"
msgid "Th-thanks…\nI can't help but feel she has dark, ulterior motives,\nbut for today, I'll indulge this conduct."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1785756"
msgid "It's just been one surprise after another.\nFirst, it was #C236196003BB#CDEF encroaching on the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF.\nThen, it was going into a mental dungeon!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1785920"
msgid "I wonder how many people's minds that #C236196003Sessyoin#CDEF\npeered into using that Code Cast. Hm.\nI'm envious, but I also think it's silly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1786064"
msgid "I'm fine with just having a taste.\nAn embrace is performed by touching skin.\nFlesh really is the best for me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1786176"
msgid "Phew… I was worried there for a bit,\nbut it's good that we wrapped it all up cleanly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1786264"
msgid "It helps that our test subject was an AI.\nA regular person's mind isn't that stable."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1786352"
msgid "If it weren't her, the mental world would've\nprobably been constantly changing, unstable.\nOur level of effort wouldn't have been enough."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1786492"
msgid "Although, I mainly want you to wash that smell\noff you. There's no need for our love nest\nto be smelling of another woman!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1786616"
msgid "Well, that aside. #C000246204Multi-Colored Tranquility#CDEF…\nThat's terrifying… Entering someone's mind\nmeans yours can be entered in turn."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1786760"
msgid "You can spiritronize a sleeping person's soul\nand invite them inside yourself… Now THAT\nmakes for an inescapable underworld."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1786888"
msgid "You've infiltrated minds on numerous occasions,\nbut I never thought you would\ndive into a body itself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1786992"
msgid "However, if you look closely, a digital\n\"human body\" is a \"reconstruction\" with a\nsoul anchored to it via Spiritrons."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1787112"
msgid "It's practically a dungeon. The soul, something\nwhich is metaphysical, is given meaning and\ndesigned using quasi-Spiritrons."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1787240"
msgid "This era's mental intervention may surpass what\nthe #C000246204Magi#CDEF of the old world of magic could do.\nI suppose that they value mind over matter."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1787396"
msgid "I speak with #C236196003#SVT#CDEF over thoughts\non our dive into a Cyber Frame."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1787476"
msgid "I certainly never expected to have an experience like that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1787536"
msgid "…the internal structure isn't the only thing left\nin my memory. I also recall us settling things with #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1787668"
msgid "I'd be lying if I said I didn't sympathize\nwith her in the slightest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1787740"
msgid "Letting the exhaustion shut my eyes, I see her final moments――\nHer furious expression the moment she was trapped\nstays on the back of my eyelids."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1787888"
msgid "Be it in the Far Side of the Moon or the Near\nSide, farewells have brought you pain\nmany times. I know that better than anyone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1788016"
msgid "…get some good rest tonight.\nI'll be by your side, and I'll even\nkeep the nightmares away."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1788108"
msgid "That's reassuring.\nI think I can sleep without worry."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1788164"
msgid "Right? I'll even sing you a lullaby if you wish.\nIn the end, we never did have that singing\nmatch. My beautiful voice has no other outlet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1788304"
msgid "Before she starts offering me more options,\nI gently shut my eyes again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1788380"
msgid "I feel a firm touch on my shoulders.\nAt some point, they had been drooping."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1788456"
msgid "I feel a light touch on my head.\nAt some point, I had been staring at the floor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1788540"
msgid "My Master mourns over farewells more than\nothers. But each time #[he][she]# gets over it, #[he][she]#\ngrows. …I've seen it happen plenty of times."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1788688"
msgid "To help with that, you should get some sleep.\nC'mon. Don't worry. With how tired you are,\nyou won't even have any dreams."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1788812"
msgid "…I wonder if I can get away with kicking #[him][her]#.\nMy Master IS pretty insensitive―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1788908"
msgid "I treat #C236196003Archer#CDEF's excuses and complaints like a lullaby\nand gently shut my eyes once again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1789016"
msgid "#C236196003Caster#CDEF pokes her face into my field of view,\nwhich has been pointed towards the ground."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1789120"
msgid "Honestly, I try to pinch myself awake when I see\nyou concerned over other women when I'm right\nthere… but I like that about you, Darling."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1789260"
msgid "If you're ever sad, don't hesitate to turn to\nme. It's a chance for me to caress you; dote on\nyou; wipe your tears; lovingly comfort you!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1789400"
msgid "I'm not being vague about the stuff I talked\nabout back inside the body, as if it were\nabout rainbows and butterflies."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1789520"
msgid "I purposely keep my quip to myself\nand gently shut my eyes again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1789588"
msgid "No need for the remorse. The victor remains;\nthe loser leaves. So long as you keep to that\nlogic, you'll never be in the wrong."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1789716"
msgid "Anyway, you're in no position to be\nlamenting over your enemy's demise."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1789788"
msgid "That #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF was no more than the opening act.\nA truly troublesome foe awaits you.\n#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF is formidable."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1789932"
msgid "If you have time to worry, you have time to\ndevote to your training and my rehabilitation.\nThe battles to come will be harsher than ever."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1790072"
msgid "…I wonder if #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF, in his own way,\njust showed a little concern for me.\nHis derision just now lacked that bite it usually has."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1790224"
msgid "Suddenly, I thought about the Near Side of the Moon, so far away.\nI may only be met with another farewell there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1790340"
msgid "Nevertheless――\nI have a strong desire to travel towards\nthis future that I still can't determine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1790440"
msgid "I'll travel together with this Servant,\nwho walks with me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1790500"
msgid "Ever since we came to the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF,\nit's been a barrage of events.\nIn the end, the fatigue must've piled on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1790640"
msgid "…isn't that… a bit too much salt…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1790680"
msgid "…wait… you've got it all wrong…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1790716"
msgid "The Labyrinth ends with the next layer…\nwhich means we'll face off against #C236196003BB#CDEF. There's\none enemy we must defeat first, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1790860"
msgid "Do you remember, my dear? When we reunited\nin this old school building, you and I\nexchanged our first vow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1790968"
msgid "Umm, if I recall correctly… hm?\nWhat was it again?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1791020"
msgid "D-dummy! You really can't recall it\nimmediately!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1791072"
msgid "We mustn't lose to #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF, coming to trample\nbetween us with her dirty… her bladed feet.\nLet's end her for good next time, Praetor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1791228"
msgid "…although, I understand why she's so smitten\nwith you. I'm certain it would be fun to have a\nnight of drink and talk with her, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1791364"
msgid "One more floor and we catch up to #C236196003BB#CDEF.\nThere's a mighty wall standing in our way\nbefore that happens, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1791492"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF: the #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF who professed that\nthe world needs no one else in it but you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1791612"
msgid "I'm curious as to where that fierce affection\nstems from, but there's no time to look into it.\nHer first love is ending in heartbreak."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1791748"
msgid "Well, for YOU, it's a matter of life and death.\nI got used to dealing with women like her\nbefore you were even born."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1791868"
msgid "……*sigh*. We only have one floor left before\nwe catch up to #C236196003BB#CDEF, but there just HAD to be one\npain in the neck left to deal with."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1792016"
msgid "#C236196003Archer#CDEF's shoulders droop, and he lets out a sigh.\nSeems like this is a huge drag for him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1792124"
msgid "Personally, the thought of finally being able to\nresolve this issue actually gets me fired up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1792220"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF: the #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF who professed\nthat the world needs no one else in it\nbut her and her lover."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1792356"
msgid "I'm curious as to where those obsessive\nemotions stem from, but there's no time\nto look into it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1792456"
msgid "I'm counting on you, Master. I won't be able to\nintercept #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF on my own. I'm hopeful\nthat you'll lead me with a cool head."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1792604"
msgid "It's fine. Next time, we'll be settling things regardless.\nI'm banking on the results of #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF's analysis―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1792756"
msgid "Well done today, #RUBS  Master#RUBEDarling#REND.\nThe #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF is only a little further.\nHowever…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1792880"
msgid "You know, right?\nThere's this one little poisonous bee in need\nof a thorough thrashing, first."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1792976"
msgid "I, of course, speak of #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF. She's been\nlooking down on us from far above up until now,\nbut that ends after tonight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1793116"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF and the others must be concocting a\nbreakthrough plan right about now. Next time,\nthis all ends. Seriiooousssllyy…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1793252"
msgid "How can she just claim that someone's Darling\n\"completely belongs to her\"!? It makes me\nsuper jealo―I mean, I won't tolerate it!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1793384"
msgid "Yeah. Seriously, who doesn't know I have rights?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1793436"
msgid "Alright now. Get plenty of rest tonight.\nLet's be ready for tomorrow's carnage."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1793516"
msgid "We may be at the doorstep of the #C000246204Moon Cell's\nCore#CDEF, but we've run into a\npesky wall right before it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1793632"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF. She gives everything to her love,\nwhich leads to her even destroying\nthe object of her love."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1793756"
msgid "A title like \"siren\" suits her. If the goddess-\nes were as devoted as she was, they wouldn't\nhave been criticized over their promiscuity."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1793896"
msgid "Hm? I suppose so. She's not what I like to see\nin a woman, but I don't find fault with every\naspect of her. I feel the same towards #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1794048"
msgid "Neither #C236196003BB#CDEF nor #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's dispositions are\nall that bad. They may have gone rogue,\nbut they're rational."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1794188"
msgid "Don't understand? Their methods to realize\ntheir love may be arrogant, but they have their\neyes set on one person only."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1794308"
msgid "Makes one think of them as innocent flowers,\ndoesn't it? Could any man truly resent them?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1794400"
msgid "If \"the way\" #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF looked at #C236196003BB#CDEF and the #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF\ncame as a surprise, his kindness was just as big of a surprise."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1794568"
msgid "I never would've guessed that he was so considerate…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1794624"
msgid "In that respect, they're the kind of\nfanatics I love to see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1794688"
msgid "Their obstinate emotions are those of maidens\nperpetually in love. What flowers are there\nmore worthy to send scattering?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1794812"
msgid "We'll be confronting #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF now, at last.\nJust how disgraceful will her final moments be―\nI can't contain my excitement."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1794956"
msgid "…I take back what I said.\nThe #C236196003King of Heroes#CDEF hasn't a shred of kindness in him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1795056"
msgid "Like #C236196003Gil#CDEF says, we're going to face\noff against #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF… but now I feel a little sorry for her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1795188"
msgid "\n\n\n　　　　　　#C080080080Suddenly, I heard strange words.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1795252"
msgid "#C080080080\"Hey. Looks like things are getting rough over there.\"#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1795324"
msgid "#C080080080There was no voice.\nIt was like I was being directly spoken\nto not through sound, but through text.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1795440"
msgid "#C080080080\"We're almost at the finale on our side.\nWe can't start without you.\"#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1795528"
msgid "#C080080080We got through the finale and came to the end.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1795592"
msgid "#C080080080The battle is over.\nAll we can do now is give up.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1795660"
msgid "\n\n#C080080080\"Give up? What are you saying?\nHumans give up from the start, since they aren't omnipotent.\nWe're creatures that can only live while giving up.\nDon't tell me, you're giving up NOW?\"#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1795860"
msgid "#C080080080I'm a ghost, too. I'm observing the cage of the faithful.\nOn the rightful stage, I await the final victor.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1795984"
msgid "#C080080080I'm sure that I've never met this person.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1796044"
msgid "#C080080080…not yet.\nEven if one day I definitely will,\nwith no choice but to meet and fight them. But not yet.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1796164"
msgid "#C080080080\"I can't tell what's going on over there from here.\nOnly that I saw something abnormal.\nYou have to get out of that deadlock on your own.\"#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1796320"
msgid "#C080080080A deadlock.\nThis is no deadlock. This is eternity.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1796388"
msgid "#C080080080As long as we give up, we can call this a perfect world.\nEven if it's a far too small, closed off world.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1796512"
msgid "#C080080080That's not giving up. That's a conclusion.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1796572"
msgid "\n#C080080080―――A conclusion.\n      A decision that there's no future.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1796652"
msgid "#C080080080\"Suppose there's a picture here. I'm one piece.\"#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1796720"
msgid "#C080080080\"Puzzle pieces. An open hole in a picture.\nA void yet to be filled.\"#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1796808"
msgid "#C080080080\"So long as #RUBSa blank is#RUBEI'm#REND here, the picture won't be completed.\nThat's why I continued on as one piece.\nOnce the picture gets completed, that'll be the end.\"#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1797000"
msgid "#C080080080A picture that never changes and a picture that never ends.\nWhich one represents the concept of 'eternity' better?#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1797132"
msgid "#C080080080\"Naturally, the goal is to complete one's life.\nAll life and all civilizations one day end.\nWe're heading towards that end.\nEven now, everyone else included.\"#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1797308"
msgid "#C080080080\"However, the picture you're drawing now is―――\"#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1797376"
msgid "#C080080080\"Can you say it's#RUBS a beautiful design#RUBE an Art Graph#REND worthy of #RUBS  completion#RUBEan ending#REND?\"#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1797508"
msgid "\nThe true meaning of these words are too sublime\nfor me to understand. These words are the perspective\nof one who is above humans: a messiah."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1797652"
msgid "There's only one aim behind it that I could gather.\nAs it is, I―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1797724"
msgid "I won't change."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1797740"
msgid "I won't end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1797756"
msgid "\nI won't change. I'm fine like this.\nI'm no match for #C236196003BB#CDEF.\nThe world outside has long since been destroyed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1797880"
msgid "So, I should keep sleeping inside this cradle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1797928"
msgid "I have no worry.\nWhen I awake, another unchanging day will begin anew."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1798000"
msgid "This place isn't right.\nThis situation isn't right.\nThis isn't the end yet, I think."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1798088"
msgid "I'm shocked.\nUltimately, I guess that's the one thing my mind can't do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1798160"
msgid "The reason why is―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1798184"
msgid "The reason why is:\neven if my mind were to break, my sword is still in hand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1798264"
msgid "\"――――Those very words are everything you are.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1798316"
msgid "Mhm. I'll say nothing, just cheerfully prepare\nto head out. I have to work around my\nPraetor's feelings."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1798424"
msgid "Go ahead, fall in love with me again.\nI can be pretty considerate, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1798504"
msgid "I see. I don't know how your sleep went,\nbut I can see that you've sprung\nback to your feet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1798600"
msgid "Then how about we set out?\nThis isn't the time to be shutting\nourselves up in here, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1798692"
msgid "Good morning, Darling. I'm humbled and joyed\nthat you'll keep my company, but have you\nreally gotten enough rest?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1798808"
msgid "You were all like,\n\"I'm dead tired. Please let me sleep.\"\nThen you collapsed onto the bed―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1798904"
msgid "Please forgive me.\nYou've rested well, then. I can certainly\ntell by the look on your face."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1798996"
msgid "…hmph. That was the enlightened one from the\nNear Side who gained the savior Servant.\nAiding his greatest enemy? How eccentric."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1799128"
msgid "How do you feel? Oh―――You've got one\neye open. We've gotten that far, huh? The gloom\nin your eyes is gone, it looks like."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1799256"
msgid "You're still groggy, but at least I see\nyou're back on your feet.\nYou're a sturdy #[man][woman]#."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1799356"
msgid "Enough rest then. Share some of that over-\nbearing enthusiasm with those women being all\npessimistic over at the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1799492"
msgid "The final battle, at last."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1799520"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF is about to seize control of the\n#C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF and unleash humanity's Ego."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1799628"
msgid "And our seemingly short-lived yet drawn-out\ngame of hide-and-seek with her is soon about to end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1799728"
msgid "Praetor, have no fear. I always bring\nvictory to you. So I have done,\nand so I shall do again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1799824"
msgid "I'm the supreme emperor, talented in all things.\nIt's extremely disrespectful that you forgot―\nI was marvelous in the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1799976"
msgid "In any case, if we don't defeat #C236196003BB#CDEF, we'll lose\nthe #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF. Which means I won't be\nable to maintain my existence."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1800132"
msgid "――Our fleeting world is pervaded with plots,\nbetrayals, and carnal thoughts at its forefront,\nbut you're different."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1800252"
msgid "Until the day you remember my True Name,\nI'll be by your side.\nIn the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, too. I'll bet on it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1800376"
msgid "…mhm, truly glorious days.\nRest for now so you can be ready.\nThis will be our final night."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1800468"
msgid "Yeah, this is the end. If there's anything\nstill bugging you before our final battle,\nyou can talk to me about it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1800584"
msgid "When it matters most, you don't want to be\ngoing, \"oh, by the way.\" Might cause my hand to\nslip when I'm delivering the final blow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1800716"
msgid "No, I've got no more worries."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1800748"
msgid "Alright.\nThen there's nothing left to discuss.\nWe need to be in tip-top shape for tomorrow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1800840"
msgid "So let's get plenty of sleep.\nOnce we wake up, one hell of a showdown\nis going to be waiting for us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1800944"
msgid "Darling, are your shoulders feeling stiff at\nall? Please let me know if you have need of\nanything, while we have the chance."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1801072"
msgid "Actually, just lie down.\nPlease let me help you loosen up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1801132"
msgid "This is our final battle, after all. I can't\nhold myself back anymore―You'll be singing\nfrom my special, thorough massage!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1801256"
msgid "Wait. I know I always say this, but relax."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1801300"
msgid "Our final battle is RIGHT around the corner.\nCan't she keep her cool for a little while longer?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1801396"
msgid "And have some self-restraint? And be more soothing?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1801448"
msgid "Ahh, I'm perfectly A-OK! Hee hee hee hee.\nYou might not remember, but I'm built different."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1801540"
msgid "The darkness I hide within is not like that\nof other Servants. The likes of #C236196003BB#CDEF is nothing \nworth fearing. Probably. Pretty sure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1801688"
msgid "―――Yes, now I can come out and say it: I am\nthe Moon's strongest Servant! My power,\npopularity, the depth of my love is the best!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1801824"
msgid "You don't say, your greatness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1801856"
msgid "Then I'll just let #C236196003Caster#CDEF handle it all.\nI'll be taking my rest now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1801944"
msgid "Substituting #C236196003#SVT#CDEF's familiar voice for a lullaby,\nI lay down in bed and close my eyes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1802048"
msgid "…sleep comes to me swiftly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1802080"
msgid "This will be my final slice of tranquility.\nAn unavoidable battle awaits me once I wake up―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1802180"
msgid "The final battle, at last."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1802208"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF is about to seize control of the\n#C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF and unleash humanity's Ego."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1802316"
msgid "And our seemingly short-lived yet drawn-out\ngame of hide-and-seek with her is soon about to end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1802416"
msgid "Along with our contract.\nDo you remember, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF?\nThe fate that awaits you in the end?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1802520"
msgid "To the Student Council―――for the Masters left\nbehind here in the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF,\nthe goal is to defeat #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1802668"
msgid "That's right. There's one Master here who,\nby all rights, no one expected\nto have ever woken up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1802768"
msgid "This person repeated fabricated preliminaries\ncountless times. Occasionally feeling out of\nplace, realizing the world was fake."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1802896"
msgid "Each time, this person would be swallowed\nby black mud, lose consciousness, then again\nspend peaceful days in those preliminaries."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1803028"
msgid "However―――After \"realizing\" one too many\ntimes, this person went on a rampage\nunforeseen by the world's creator."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1803144"
msgid "Not wanting to be engulfed in the black mud,\nthey threw themselves into the\nImaginary Number Ocean."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1803244"
msgid "Must have been all the repetitions. Unaware,\nthey had become stagnant.\n\"I shouldn't be okay with this world.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1803356"
msgid "Faith can move mountains, as they say. To defy\nthat world's creator, this person went so\nfar as to throw their life away."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1803480"
msgid "That must be #C236196003BB#CDEF's gravest mistake. This person\nslipped through her fingers and disappeared\ninto the Imaginary Number Ocean."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1803620"
msgid "However."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1803632"
msgid "However, I didn't disappear.\nWithin an abyss of death,\nI heard this Servant's voice and offered him everything I had:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1803752"
msgid "My three #C000246204Command Seals#CDEF――a Master's \"proof\" of life.\nBy using them up, #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF\nnarrowly escaped death."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1803896"
msgid "―――Or, more precisely―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1803924"
msgid "That's right. You'll never get those\n#C000246204Command Seals#CDEF you exhausted back, and I don't\nexist in the Near Side of the Moon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1804060"
msgid "Once this ordeal has been resolved,\nyou'll certainly have no future left.\nTruly, you DON'T want this to be resolved."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1804180"
msgid "You'll have no #C000246204Command Seals#CDEF nor a Servant upon\nreturning to the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF. Most likely,\nyou'll simply lose and be slaughtered."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1804348"
msgid "It's as if you fight so that you can meet your\ndeath. ―――#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nI will only ask you this once:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1804464"
msgid "In spite of that, do you still seek to return\nto the Near Side of the Moon?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1804540"
msgid "These are the eyes of the king who\nwitnesses all impartially―with neither scorn nor pity."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1804632"
msgid "I can't come up with a solid reason.\nI have nothing to say that will convince him."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1804716"
msgid "Never expected YOU to ask that, Gil."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1804756"
msgid "――――I see.\nWell, a king certainly wouldn't bother\nchecking such things."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1804832"
msgid "That's absolutely right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1804860"
msgid "I'm fine, no need for concern.\nEven if my contract with you ends, even if I lose everything.\nOnce I get back to the Near Side, I'm sure I'll get by somehow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1805020"
msgid "Baseless confidence IS one weapon you\ncan use over there.\nYou make my own pride look small-time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1805120"
msgid "\"I WILL survive\"――\nSuch vanity is proof that you're a human being."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1805192"
msgid "The essence of being human is to accept\none's certain defeat while doing everything\npossible to escape death."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1805304"
msgid "As he talks about how vile all that is, he laughs.\n\"To be anything else would be lying to oneself―\"\nAnd in saying this, he gives affirmation to the\nway countless people live their lives."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1805492"
msgid "…that's absolutely right.\nI'm not particularly special,\nand what will happen isn't so special."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1805588"
msgid "It's natural to fight for the sake of one's death.\nHuman beings are constantly deferring their doom\nto another day."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1805704"
msgid "I was bored, initially―but this summoning\nproved to be beyond what I had imagined."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1805788"
msgid "At what point would you burn out? Incredible\nhow I enjoyed that question alone. Now the die\nhas been cast. So what is this but a sham?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1805924"
msgid "Humanity's final destination lies in challenging\nthe gods. #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF. Your life is\none worthy of a Master of mine to have."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1806068"
msgid "Fight as you see fit.\nWhen it's all settled and done,\nyou may give what is owed unto me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1806160"
msgid "I answer, \"you got it,\" then go to rest.\nSubstituting his arrogant voice for a lullaby,\nI lay down in bed and close my eyes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1806288"
msgid "…sleep comes to me swiftly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1806320"
msgid "This will be my final slice of tranquility.\nAn unavoidable battle awaits me once I wake up―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1806420"
msgid "It's still early. I don't think I slept for even an hour.\nI may just be antsy before our big battle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1806524"
msgid "Maybe I'll go for a walk until I settle down."
msgstr ""

#. popupYesNo_line1
msgctxt "1806572"
