msgid "acquired. View now?"
msgstr ""

#. popupStd
msgctxt "1807088"
msgid "Access to #C000246204Information Matrix#CDEF granted."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1807144"
msgid "I can't get enough of that outdated uniform too.\nShe makes me want to swiftly indulge in her\nas if she were a virtuous, white lily."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1807276"
msgid "With a bewitching smile, #C236196003Saber#CDEF reaches\nout into the empty air with one hand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1807372"
msgid "She gestures as if enjoying herself with a wine\nglass in hand; as if going to pluck a graceful\nflower right in front of her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1807500"
msgid "…she may be my Servant, but her mood is puzzling."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1807552"
msgid "It IS reassuring to know that #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF\nbecame our allies, but to #C236196003Saber#CDEF, is it really\nsomething to be this joyous about…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1807728"
msgid "Naturally. I've had my eyes on these flowers\nfor some time, and now they're in the palm\nof my hand. It's enlivening."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1807848"
msgid "If we weren't in this mess, I'd be erecting a\ndeluxe side estate and throwing parties day and\nnight. Hey, did you forget what my style is?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1807988"
msgid "Weird… Somehow I feel like I can recall\nsomething, but I also feel like I don't WANT\nto recall, either."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1808096"
msgid "I get a feeling it's sort of like a really stupi―――\nno, a really headache-inducing opinion she holds."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1808204"
msgid "Uhh, I thought she…"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1808228"
msgid "…likes pretty little boys…?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1808260"
msgid "…likes pretty little girls…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1808292"
msgid "Hmhm. You're a mean one.\nYou know who I am, yet still urge me to be\nmoderate. The words I hate the most are――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1808404"
msgid "I remember well, O' despot of mine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1808440"
msgid "I'm pretty sure those words are \"frugality,\"\n\"ruin,\" and \"rebellion\"… right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1808520"
msgid "Yes! There's no issue to address then.\nAll beauteous things belong to me.\nI adore pretty young boys AND girls the same!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1808640"
msgid "Of course. Before beauty, gender is, yes, but\nthe difference between regular and limited first\nedition. I don't mind. Cute is imperial, see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1808784"
msgid "This is the first I've heard of such a proverb,\no' despot of mine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1808852"
msgid "\"My preference is both beautiful young boys AND girls!\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1808908"
msgid "…it feels like #C236196003Saber#CDEF has been making such\nheadache-inducing declarations since long back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1809016"
msgid "Even that red #C236196003Lancer#CDEF. I don't despise her just\nbecause she's our enemy. If she mended her\nwicked ways, she would well be to my tastes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1809168"
msgid "Boys are to be enjoyed with one's ears and girls\ntasted with one's eyes. I'm open to many loves.\nCuisines are the better the more there are."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1809312"
msgid "Ha. No one tops the number of beautiful children\nwho wait upon me. Well, no one can top me\nin anything―period. I AM an almighty genius!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1809452"
msgid "#C236196003Saber#CDEF throws out her chest, as if saying:\n\"How's THAT?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1809524"
msgid "…I see. She fundamentally \"hates losing.\"\nWhen an #RUBS   rival#RUBEopponent#REND worthy of competing against pops up,\nshe becomes eager to one up them any way she can."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1809696"
msgid "I don't know if it's her own personality speaking\nor if this is due to her skill: Imperial Privilege."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1809800"
msgid "It's as you say, Praetor. When faced with\na foe I can't afford to lose to, my soul burns.\nIts blaze is enough to stifle my headaches."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1809936"
msgid "Perhaps it's because I had no one outside of\nmy dear harem to cross swords with that things\nsoured so. Where else could I go 50-to-1?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1810072"
msgid "50 people? That's pretty astounding, I'll say.\nSince this is #C236196003Saber#CDEF we're talking about, I don't\ndoubt that she was lauded for her beauty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1810228"
msgid "……yeah, that's right.\nTo a person like #C236196003Saber#CDEF, I must look like a――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1810316"
msgid "…indeed. You're my Praetor: a warrior sworn\nto chastity for the sake of our contract.\nI couldn't possibly invite you into my harem!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1810452"
msgid "…to be completely honest, it's a… damned\nshame. But! I have to look out for myself in\nthese trying times! And, besides――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1810580"
msgid "You're no one-night stand to me! Err…\nTo grow and mature together is… n-no, it's too\nsoon, still! First, we get our memories back!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1810716"
msgid "D-d-d-dummy! Of course! It's because you\nabsolutely belong to me! As if I would hand you\nover to some other Heroic Spirit!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1810840"
msgid "Ahem! I should warn you: don't get cocky just\nbecause you're my Master. Nepotism has no place\nin my harem!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1810948"
msgid "I treat all of my charges equally! Since you're\nmy lowest officer, I order you to stay by my\nside at all times. To keep you in line!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1811084"
msgid "Y-yes. When I get tired, you'll massage my\nshoulders. If I sigh, you'll give me a smile.\nWhen I grieve, you'll bring fruit to my lips."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1811220"
msgid "You'll assist me with both bathing and changing.\nHard labor is a valid form of worship, but you\nmay also spoil and embrace me on occasion!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1811360"
msgid "Actually, I want to spoil YOU. I won't let you\nleave my side for even a moment, like a quiet\nlamb! Be enthralled with me at all times!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1811496"
msgid "I'm not sure that counts as underling treatment.\nIf anything, it sounds like you've unlocked a\nnew, even weirder form of nepotism."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1811628"
msgid "Well! I, for one, digress!\nIn any case, it's reassuring that #C236196003Rani#CDEF and\n#C236196003Rin#CDEF have joined us in this battle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1811768"
msgid "It looks like our search of the Labyrinth\ntruly begins here. I'll steel myself once again.\nAlso――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1811868"
msgid "I'd hate to emulate #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF so closely,\nbut I have my own secret that I'd like to\nconfess as well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1812004"
msgid "To you, with your memory lost, my words must\nsound outlandish. For that, I sincerely\napologize."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1812100"
msgid "Praetor. As you can see, my nature is one of\nvast love. And, I understand that my love is a\nfury that burns me and others to cinders."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1812236"
msgid "Stronger stimulation. Hotter love.\nThat's how my soul is. I chase glory and ruin―\n'tis the life of a flame."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1812348"
msgid "…that's all I had to say.\nI thought that, since our fates our shared,\nI wouldn't be able to hide this for long."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1812464"
msgid "Choosing me means being prepared for\na supreme ovation and a gruesome end.\nIf you'll walk beside me, knowing this――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1812584"
msgid "Then I won't speak with any more doubt.\nAs a sword fit for you to rely on, I will show\nyou how I slay swaths of enemies and dangers."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1812720"
msgid "Using a gentle voice, #C236196003Saber#CDEF spoke her truth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1812784"
msgid "I still can't recall her True Name.\nShe won't elaborate on her birthplace nor her\npast, either."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1812880"
msgid "Not only light――\nbeing with her also invites ruin into my life."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1812948"
msgid "It's such a pity that I, without my memories,\ncan't comprehend the weight of the resolution\nhidden behind her words."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1813068"
msgid "That should be enough, for now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1813100"
msgid "Now that she's revealed her secret to me,\nI have to work to meet #C236196003Saber#CDEF's expectations.\nI need to be worthy of wielding her――my sword."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1813252"
msgid "Is that so? Yes, I like that look, #RUBS  Master#RUBEPraetor#REND!\nSo be it. Take this emotion from me!\nThis is my secret, firstly!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1813384"
msgid "From #C236196003Saber#CDEF herself, she presented to me what could\nbe considered a Servant's pride:\nher #C000246204SG#CDEF…!"
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line2
msgctxt "1813512"
msgid "has been obtained."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1813532"
msgid "This is a good opportunity.\nI'll give this present to #C236196003Saber#CDEF to show her\nmy appreciation for always fighting for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1813664"
msgid "Let's start by cutting off our outside connection."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1813716"
msgid "It's easy to imagine that #C236196003Saber#CDEF will be pleased with it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1813792"
msgid "Hm? What's wrong, Praetor? You're looking\nat me timidly… what? You wish for me to change\ninto my initial restraints?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1813912"
msgid "\"Yeah,\" I reply.\n#C236196003Saber#CDEF, suspecting nothing, answers, \"Very well.\"\nThen, she reaches into the closet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1814032"
msgid "I'll take this opportunity to cut off all\nexternal connections."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1814096"
msgid "Now that she mentions it, my breathing IS somewhat ragged.\nMy throat is bone-dry, and I can't come up with any\nclever lines."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1814224"
msgid "What's wrong? You're fidgeting and blushing.\nI personally can't get enough of this, but I\nhave absolutely no clue what you'r―――Hm?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1814360"
msgid "My dear, what do you have there…?\nC-could it be? One of those? What a bride wears\nduring a wedding ceremony!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1814472"
msgid "She got a look at it before I actually held it out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1814524"
msgid "#C236196003Saber#CDEF's eyes shine like never before.\n…it's a shame that I can't think of a cool line to whip out,\nbut at this point, I'll just say it straight…"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1814688"
msgid "Thanks for everything, Saber."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1814720"
msgid "You can't ambush people like this! What maiden\ncould receive a gift like this and not leap with\njoy!? I take it you want to see me cry!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1814856"
msgid "#C236196003Saber#CDEF keeps prattling on while looking very menacing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1814928"
msgid "Dummy! It's not late! Nothing could make me this\nhappy―not a million roses or the thunderous\napplause of a lively theater―I'm choking up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1815068"
msgid "And a laurel wreath design? You know me so well!\nThis is what the long line of emperors\nwould wear―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1815176"
msgid "This means, you're suggesting that I be a bride\nAND an emperor? You've magnificently won not\nonly my heart, but my dreams, as well!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1815308"
msgid "I figured if I gave #C236196003Saber#CDEF the veil she wanted,\nshe would be happy; but I didn't think this\nwould lead to an #C000246204SG#CDEF too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1815456"
msgid "Brides are adorned with a veil during a wedding.\nWhich means, #C236196003Saber#CDEF's second #C000246204SG#CDEF is―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1815580"
msgid "M-mhm. You've seen straight through me,\nso there's no point in hiding it. …so, um.\nI longed to be a bride during my lifetime."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1815708"
msgid "I intended to experience every joy I could\npossibly imagine, but there was one thing I\nnever obtained: this small blessing here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1815840"
msgid "#C236196003Saber#CDEF gazes at the veil now in her\nhands as if cherishing it―as if tending\nto the remains of a dream that never came true in her lifetime."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1815996"
msgid "…I'm a little frustrated.\nI'm sure if I was the me from before I lost my memories,\nI would've understood her sadness―even just a\nfragment of it―and would've been able to console her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1816184"
msgid "I won't speak my own True Name. That's what I\nhad decided. However… but just this little bit\nshould be fine: I became emperor at sixteen."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1816324"
msgid "After that, the little girl of cursed birth\nthat I was perished, and I rose to power simply\nbeing me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1816428"
msgid "…from that moment on,\nthe future I saw for myself when\nI was a little girl vanished."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1816516"
msgid "But I didn't abandon the dreams I had as a\nlittle girl. I was an emperor and a maiden. I\nhid a desire to love and marry a companion."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1816652"
msgid "Abdicating my throne, living happy as a little\ngirl… that won't do. Listen. I will become the\nhappiest, most supreme emperor-maiden EVER!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1816792"
msgid "#C236196003Saber#CDEF clenches her fist, delivering her speech loudly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1816864"
msgid "…that's it.\nI smack myself on the head.\nI actually felt the tiniest bit of \"sadness\" in her?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1816960"
msgid "No matter what misery befalls her,\nshe brings satisfaction into her life\nby shining brighter than her sadness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1817072"
msgid "That's how she lives her life.\nIt's how she lives during her lifetime;\nit's the pride she holds even now;\nit's the way her soul is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1817204"
msgid "M-mhm. But, hey. This is the one aspiration\nof mine that I can't enjoy alone. I-I need\nsomeone worthy to partake in it with."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1817332"
msgid "I'm amazing, but the partner who will strum me\nmust be even more amazing. They must accomplish\ntwi… no, three times the deeds of Hercules!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1817472"
msgid "We're talking about wedding an emperor, after\nall! Thus is my imperial command: become the\nbest person you can be!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1817588"
msgid "#C236196003Saber#CDEF orders me with her usual arrogance\nwhile her face is flushed bright red."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1817684"
msgid "Holding back her embarrassment while she\nacts tough―that's #C236196003Saber#CDEF for you.\nI stand in front of her and―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1817812"
msgid "What is this!? W-wait, don't push me!\nWhat's gotten into you all of a―――awawah!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1817896"
msgid "…we lock eyes in silence for a few seconds."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1817944"
msgid "I feel like if I were to touch #C236196003Saber#CDEF, she would burst.\n…I'm not even sure myself how to describe\nthis expression of hers, but that's how elated\nshe is under me right now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1818132"
msgid "An audible gulp comes from #C236196003Saber#CDEF's throat."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1818192"
msgid "W-why would I ever be nervous!?\nThis is an everyday thing to me!\nWho do you think I am!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1818284"
msgid "Normally, she's assertive when she makes\nadvances on me, so why is she acting passive\nonly now?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1818380"
msgid "Could it be that #C236196003Saber#CDEF, this whole time, was pure―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1818452"
msgid "…this is bad.\nI don't know the reason why myself,\nbut the words she just spoke echo in my head."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1818552"
msgid "I feel like I might end up forgetting about the\nentire situation we're in.\nRight now, all I see is #C236196003Saber#CDEF―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1818680"
msgid "You can be forceful when you need to be, huh?\n…mhm. It lacks elegance, but I like it. Oddly,\nI find that seriousness to be pleasing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1818816"
msgid "…what are you waiting for? I want you to\nunlock my restraints with your hands.\nOpen my lock with your fingers."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1818928"
msgid "Tempted, I clutch #C236196003Saber#CDEF's hand.\nIn it is the lock to her restrained clothing―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1819028"
msgid "Who goes there―――!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1819052"
msgid "Heyyy, Student Council Room heeerrree. We don't\nactually need anything, we're just in the middle\nof testing that we can launch calls～♪"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1819192"
msgid "If you hear this call, then that means the\nfunction is operating normally in your room!\nPlease let us know later, thaaannkkss鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1819320"
msgid "…how awful.\nNothing compares to how awful that was."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1819376"
msgid "Regardless if #C236196003Rin#CDEF had the tiniest bit of malice\nbehind doing that or not, my enthusiasm instantly flatlined."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1819504"
msgid "The future of mankind is at stake right now.\nThis is no time to be off in our own little world."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1819600"
msgid "…it's REALLY frustrating, but this isn't the time to be…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1819660"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF, heavens does she have NO awareness…\nNo, she's the type of woman to gauge situations.\nIt was a tactless yet sound order she made."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1819812"
msgid "I don't see any of her previous elation in her expression.\nShe's a top-class Servant.\nThis is proof that she has cooled down\nand pivoted towards what needs to be done."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1819980"
msgid "…why are you looking at me like that?\nDon't be so disappointed. There are many things\nI'm getting tired of waiting for as well!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1820112"
msgid "Let's give #C236196003Rin#CDEF our thanks.\nFor when one achieves their dearest wish,\nthey lose the will to fight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1820228"
msgid "We'll continue this once you've regained\neverything you lost and we've returned\nto the Near Side alive!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1820332"
msgid "Seeing #C236196003Saber#CDEF act all bold puts an involuntary\nwry smile on my face."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1820416"
msgid "If she says so, then I mustn't go around looking disappointed.\nAll I can do right now is make a promise."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1820524"
msgid "I'm a different person now than who I was when\nI handed her the veil. Right now, there are words\nfrom the bottom of my heart that I wish to impart to her."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1820680"
msgid "Yeah. One day, I'll make Saber's dream come true."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "1820732"
msgid "SG, \"Bouquet of Laurel Wreaths\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1820764"
msgid "…our final battle draws near.\nWhether we win or lose, we'll only be here\nin the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF for a little while longer."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1820912"
msgid "Defeat #C236196003BB#CDEF and turn the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF back to normal.\nWhat will become of us after that happens?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1821036"
msgid "Will I be back in the Near Side safe and sound with #C236196003Saber#CDEF?\nI'm more concerned over that than over my memories returning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1821176"
msgid "…man, this girl. With full confidence yet\nwithout knowing what I'm thinking,\n#C236196003Saber#CDEF draws a conclusion out of nowhere."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1821312"
msgid "Sure, what happened with #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF still bugs me,\nbut what I'm worried about right now is―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1821428"
msgid "Hrm, is that so? She said she would replace the\nentire world in loving you. Despite being our\nenemy, I couldn't bring myself to hate her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1821568"
msgid "…wait. I can say the same of #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF and\n#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF. Our enemies were girls who martyred\nthemselves over different aspects of love."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1821736"
msgid "But among them, you know―the form #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's\nlove took resembled my own a bit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1821836"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF and #C236196003Saber#CDEF, resembling each other…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1821916"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF, who would erase everyone beside her and her love…\nOr rather, turn the entire world into \"herself\" and offer it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1822060"
msgid "Resembling #C236196003Saber#CDEF, a shining example of virtue and optimism?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1822136"
msgid "Everyone is born different. There must be some\nwho rule and some who are ruled; some who fight\nand some who are protected."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1822260"
msgid "I pay no mind to others. I view the world with\nmyself at its center. Honestly, so long as I and\nmy praisers are happy, nothing else matters."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1822404"
msgid "H-her remarks were beyond absurd."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1822440"
msgid "If that's true, then she must have been a\ntyrant during her lifetime."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1822512"
msgid "…I don't get any sense of \"evil\" in her though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1822564"
msgid "#C236196003Saber#CDEF may be a tyrant,\nbut she has absolutely no desire to reign supreme."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1822656"
msgid "Citizens obey their emperor. Emperors govern over their citizens.\n#C236196003Saber#CDEF sees this as natural.\nSo she may see \"ruling\" as a duty rather\nthan a desire―like a job."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1822836"
msgid "Also, I get the feeling that her sense of\njustice and sense of duty as a ruler, fortunately,\nwas considered just by many of her citizens."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1822976"
msgid "…yeah, I bet that's it.\nThe reason I'm thinking about all this is because\n#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF knew her True Name."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1823104"
msgid "In the Near Side of the Moon's #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF,\nI fought alongside #C236196003Saber#CDEF. That's why even without memories,\nI remember what kind of person she really is―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1823296"
msgid "My teacher told me once when I was alive:\n\"You look like a flame, but you're\nfrozen solid on the inside.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1823404"
msgid "He was talking about the balance of good and\nevil. My sense of morality is a little twisted.\nFor example―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1823516"
msgid "Even if toxicity were to pervade my cities,\nso long as no harm came to me or my citizens,\nI figured it didn't hurt."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1823632"
msgid "One is free to do evil or good―――\nThat's how I see it. I don't think that\none is evil for committing a crime."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1823748"
msgid "I also don't think one is good for doing good.\nThere could be a good man who one day\nsuddenly kills a child."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1823860"
msgid "I have intense likes and dislikes,\nbut the way I gauge good and evil isn't\nvery human."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1823948"
msgid "…I suppose one could call me \"coldhearted.\"\nI just couldn't understand the morals\nmy citizens approved of."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1824056"
msgid "The same thing happened when I served as a\njudge. I couldn't judge a criminal's crime,\nall I could do was judge the outcome."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1824184"
msgid "\"Is this beautiful or not beautiful?\"\nI stick only by my personal ideas.\nConsequently―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1824276"
msgid "I can't conclude that #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF is evil.\nShe tried to kill the world for you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1824372"
msgid "Others may think she's evil, but to me,\nI thought that the form her love took was\nbeautiful. Not her methods―her determination."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1824504"
msgid "#C236196003Saber#CDEF says that beauty is her standard for good and evil."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1824580"
msgid "…that's extremely dangerous thinking.\n#C236196003Saber#CDEF will recognize any bad person,\nso long as they're beautiful―――?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1824708"
msgid "Of course. Even bad people have lovable aspects.\nRecognizing someone and approving of them\nare two different things, Praetor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1824836"
msgid "I recognize #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's beauty.\nHowever, her actions were evil and\nrequired judgement."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1824940"
msgid "…that's how far beauty gets you. So long as\nthe standards for beauty are subjective,\nnot everyone will give recognition."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1825064"
msgid "A beauty approved by everyone would be the\nultimate beauty. I've always sought it… but\nwell, I don't know if I ever attained it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1825196"
msgid "My art was, erm, well… I wouldn't claim it\nwas favored among the masters per se,\nbut it wasn't unpopular either… per se…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1825320"
msgid "#C236196003Saber#CDEF struggles to clarify her thoughts."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1825380"
msgid "#C236196003Saber#CDEF's artistic sensibilities were certainly…\n\"avant-garde,\" to say the least."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1825480"
msgid "…anyways. The \"ultimate beauty,\" was it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1825524"
msgid "Something accepted with zero regards to whether it\nwas good or evil. Does such a thing really exist?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1825628"
msgid "Be it a gold coin,\nbe it a night on the town,\nor be it the figment of a dream."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1825708"
msgid "Whatever it is, when anyone sees it, their\nface will beam bright like a flower―――\nThat's what I think the ultimate beauty is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1825840"
msgid "She resembles a mother, watching her child grow.\nOr a young girl with idealizations of world peace.\nDistant dreams left unrealized in her lifetime."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1825988"
msgid "My love is boundless! I love all that I see.\nI end up giving recognition to all that I see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1826080"
msgid "Thus, I can't reject her single-minded desire\nfor her love. If you weren't her target,\nI would be cheering her on!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1826196"
msgid "#C236196003Saber#CDEF hides her shame with\na huff before turning away."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1826268"
msgid "…what a selfish, optimistic view of life."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1826312"
msgid "If it's wrong for politicians to love their people\nto the point of foolery, then she is nothing more\nthan a foolish emperor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1826440"
msgid "The ultimate beauty.\nSomething that can bring smiles to all at\nfirst glance."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1826520"
msgid "She became frantic in trying to craft something modest\nyet grand. No matter how hard she was laughed\nat or insulted, she persisted, cheerily dreaming\nof broad smiles on the peoples' faces."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1826712"
msgid "…yeah. I still can't remember her True Name,\nbut it doesn't matter."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1826784"
msgid "She appraises her own art to be supreme,\nwhile extolling the beauty of all that she lays eyes on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1826884"
msgid "Mhm. Needless to say, while many things in this\nworld are amazing, I'm even MORE amazing!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1826976"
msgid "――――I reckon that's what she wanted to say\nall along."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1827036"
msgid "#C236196003Saber#CDEF puffs her chest with pride.\nI loosen up and compose my response."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1827124"
msgid "I-is that so? I see. Hee, heeheehee…\nThat's right! With you as my Master,\nobviously I'll be the best!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1827228"
msgid "I smile back at the puzzled #C236196003Saber#CDEF to reassure her,\n\"It's nothing.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1827312"
msgid "It was stupid of me to worry about whether\nwe would return to the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF together."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1827420"
msgid "…#C236196003Saber#CDEF and I will always be together.\nOnly thing to do now is trust in her and keep fighting\nalongside her."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "1827548"
msgid "SG, \"Love for the People\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1827576"
msgid "Startled, I stiffen up at hearing the\ntopic #C236196003Saber#CDEF opens up with."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1827660"
msgid "I was wondering what she was pouting about\nthe moment we walked into My Room.\nSo it was this all along…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1827768"
msgid "I understand the intent.\nI can't be doubting #C236196003Leo#CDEF's strategy at\nthis point."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1827860"
msgid "But why am I not in the picture!\nJust how badly can one miscast the role of your\nlover, giving it to anyone other than ME!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1827984"
msgid "She really has been ignoring\nthat detail up to this point…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1828044"
msgid "That hardly raises my spirits!\nDon't tell me, am I not good enough for you,\nPraetor? Am I not good enough!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1828152"
msgid "What!? What's wrong with me!? My style?\nBecause I pestered you for new clothes? Because\nI stare at your sleeping face every night!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1828284"
msgid "T-thanks, #C236196003Saber#CDEF.\nBut #[please ][]#calm down#[.][, won't you?]#"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1828364"
msgid "It's nothing more than a strategy.\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF is qualified, so she was picked\nout of the bunch, is all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1828480"
msgid "Hmph. I'm not convinced. If need be, I would\nbe willing and prepared to even disguise myself!\nI, I can be as fat as #C236196003Jinako#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1828620"
msgid "#C236196003Saber#CDEF shakes her head while pointing out these\nthings floating in her mind.\nNevertheless, #C236196003Saber#CDEF can't play this lover role.\nThat's because…"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1828796"
msgid "We have a closer bond than that, #[right][no]#?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1828844"
msgid "Regardless of that hasty role, wielding my\nsword for you and speaking with\nyou is my privilege. How could I forget!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1828960"
msgid "Yes, so this time… for this time only, I can\nturn over the lover role to #C236196003Jinako#CDEF. Naturally,\nI won't be leaving my Praetor's side!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1829108"
msgid "#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF can't be dealt with by any normal means.\nWith #C236196003Saber#CDEF and #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's help, we'll catch her for sure…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1829268"
msgid "I wasn't expecting the food to be homemade…\nFor her to once again impede me mayhap means she\nhas transcended conventional rivalry."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1829400"
msgid "You don't know what I'm talking about? It's\nabout #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF, naturally. Her home cooking is\nthe expression of a desire she holds."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1829548"
msgid "But, I mustn't engage in home cooking.\nAs highly skilled as I am, an emperor mustn't\nsnatch away work from a chef."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1829664"
msgid "For that reason, I envy #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF.\nI, too, want to show off my…… to you…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1829756"
msgid "Mmm… If I had some kind of tool like that,\nI could perform a higher level of showing off…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1829848"
msgid "Simple…… suffices.\nI wonder if there's anything, like, bridal\nrelated laying around somewhere…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1829948"
msgid "By my blade, I'll cut down all fetters impeding\nyour path. So, just believe in me\nfor now and press on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1830052"
msgid "There's nothing to be concerned about.\nYou've faced constant peril, but in the end,\nyou always grabbed onto hope."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1830168"
msgid "I'm glad we managed to get #C236196003Rin#CDEF back to normal.\nAbout the money stuff, you know… just drop it.\nNo need to pour salt on a girl's wounds."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1830320"
msgid "…I see. No, I'm sorry.\nI'm the one who told you not to fret over it.\nIt was an asinine question. Forget it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1830432"
msgid "The more fighting there is, the more lives are\nlost. The same happened in the Near Side.\n…don't let it drag you down too much."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1830560"
msgid "All things considered, we have been dragged into\nrather strange events. Who would have known a\nplace like the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF existed…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1830720"
msgid "Well, if I think of it as gazing at Diana's\nback, it is alright. Good, rather. The smooth,\nwhite back of a beauty is richer than gold."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1830856"
msgid "You too should be feeling as carefree as that.\nFretting about this and that over your memory\nwill bring you naught."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1830972"
msgid "The path we both walked down has disappeared.\nHowever, that too is but a temporary thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1831064"
msgid "I am your sword. You are my life.\nEven if we lose our memories, these truths do\nnot change, you see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1831168"
msgid "I will return you to the Near Side of the Moon.\nAnd then we shall seize victory in the #C000246204Holy\nGrail War#CDEF. Nothing left to worry over, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1831324"
msgid "…hm. You and I are not in our greatest\ncondition, it seems. Let us abstain from\nfighting recklessly, #RUBS  Master#RUBEPraetor#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1831460"
msgid "I'm astonished that SHE is a Sentinel. She's\nanother strange breed of danger compared to #C236196003Rin#CDEF.\nYou must be feeling down as well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1831604"
msgid "Feeling down―――more like, this is almost\nthe worst thing that could happen."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1831684"
msgid "Although my memory is hazy, I don't exactly\nfeel good about exposing the secrets of people\nI recognize."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1831788"
msgid "The feeling of guilt isn't the same as when it's\nexposing a male's secret. When I look at the ever-tough\n#C236196003Rin#CDEF, I feel it even more."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1831936"
msgid "Although we broke through it, it caused me great\nmental anguish. Maybe #C236196003BB#CDEF was right, it really is\na revolutionary firewall."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1832076"
msgid "…don't look so troubled, Praetor. I understand\nthat you feel hesitant about making contact\nwith #C236196003Rani#CDEF's mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1832204"
msgid "Since, as I recall, you were greatly concerned\nover #C236196003Rani#CDEF. Though, I was thinking about\nleaving her be."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1832324"
msgid "However, you haven't forgotten our objective,\nhave you? Our highest priority right now is to\nreturn to the Near Side of the Moon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1832456"
msgid "You and I, and―――with everyone else here.\nNeedless to say, with #C236196003Rani#CDEF, too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1832552"
msgid "The only one capable of achieving that, is you.\nIsn't that why you endeavor so?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1832632"
msgid "I'm opposed to seeing #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secrets,\nbut this isn't the time to be complaining."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1832732"
msgid "Hehe. Your face is glowing now.\nThat's the Praetor I know. I might break\ninto a smile too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1832824"
msgid "If you feel that way, then let's take back #C236196003Rani#CDEF\nfrom #C236196003BB#CDEF's clutches. No hesitation with her #C000246204SG#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1832968"
msgid "A maiden's secrets―her #C000246204SG#CDEF, huh… It's a very\ntroublesome thing, but it has a pleasant\nring to it. I like it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1833096"
msgid "\"#C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF,\" are they?\nMaking more pawns by cutting off parts\nof herself―that #C236196003BB#CDEF is quite the shrewd one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1833236"
msgid "I thought this time for sure we would return\ntogether to the Near Side… I suppose we'll\ncherish Diana's back for a while longer."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1833368"
msgid "I thought with rescuing #C236196003Rani#CDEF, we would be able to\novercome the Labyrinth, but now a new enemy\nappeared, the \"#C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1833524"
msgid "That aside, #C236196003BB#CDEF's #RUBS   program#RUBEtechnique#REND was terrifying.\nIf #C236196003Rani#CDEF wasn't there, what would've happened?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1833672"
msgid "Yeah. That program which forced affirmation towards #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1833744"
msgid "I think #C236196003Saber#CDEF said something like,\n\"Take me as your enthusiastic associate\"…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1833840"
msgid "Besides, I would never approve of acting on\nsuch a sloppy stage!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1833908"
msgid "To win me over, one would need to gather a\nColosseum-grade stage and a Seneca-grade poet.\nNot to mention―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1834020"
msgid "―――If you're not my Praetor, then I\ndefinitely won't rise to the stage."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1834096"
msgid "Putting that aside, about how it's foul play,\nisn't it…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1834156"
msgid "What's wrong, Praetor? Your face is red?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1834200"
msgid "Straightforward, unwavering emotions of trust.\nHaving them directed to me, I instinctively\nhide my now warm cheeks."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1834316"
msgid "…since she trusts me this much, I won't give\nin to something like an #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF popping up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1834424"
msgid "Yes. No matter the enemy, or who stands in\nour way, I will show you how I run them\nall down with this blade."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1834536"
msgid "I'm counting on your direction, Praetor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1834580"
msgid "We don't know any details about the #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF.\nDon't lose focus, Praetor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1834672"
msgid "Unbelievable. #C236196003BB#CDEF just keeps coming up with\none new plan after another.\nShe's inventive, I'll grant her that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1834800"
msgid "But, I'm rather weary of it all!\nIf I'm going to learn someone's secret,\nthen I want to learn yours."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1834904"
msgid "Even if you wanted to, how can I have secrets\nwhen my memory is hazy…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1834976"
msgid "There must be something.\nFor example―oh, I know―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1835032"
msgid "With #C236196003Saber#CDEF giving me this cat-like smirk,\nI start unpleasantly sweating.\nWhat on Earth is this Heroic Spirit going to ask?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1835172"
msgid "Me, #C236196003Rin#CDEF, #C236196003Rani#CDEF, and #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\nWho among them are you most attracted to?\nOf course――I mean in a sexual way."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1835328"
msgid "\"Being loving\" vs. \"being in love\" aside, I'm\nsimply and plainly implying about bodies. That\nshould be easy enough even for you to answer."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1835468"
msgid "That actually makes it harder to answer…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1835512"
msgid "But based on #C236196003Saber#CDEF's demeanor,\nit looks like she won't let me\nleave here unless I reply."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1835620"
msgid "I just have to go for it, and say honestly―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1835672"
msgid "Sakura"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1835680"
msgid "I have no preference."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1835704"
msgid "Hehehe… It must be agonizing to restrain\nyourself before a girl as beautiful as me.\nEvery day you endure this austerity, no?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1835832"
msgid "In that case, sometimes we, erm…\nAs a reward… no. To grant is my duty as\nan emperor. I-I'm not hesitating right now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1835952"
msgid "Very well, you shall receive your reward.\n…I'll pamper you with my―*this*."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1836032"
msgid "…what's wrong?\nIs my… lap pillow not good enough for you…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1836096"
msgid "T-that's ridiculous!\nNot at all. I'm unworthy of this honor.\nI shall humbly accept the offer!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1836192"
msgid "Hehe…\nYour head is actually pretty small, isn't it?\nI can clearly see the swirls in your hair."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1836288"
msgid "#C236196003Saber#CDEF's small, pale hand strokes my head."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1836348"
msgid "She uses her hands tenderly, as if soothing an infant.\nI breath a sigh of relief from the bottom of my heart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1836460"
msgid "…it seems that I was very tired, without realizing it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1836516"
msgid "It's the battles we fight every day.\nA little tranquility like this from time to\ntime isn't such a bad thing, is it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1836636"
msgid "Yeah, not bad at all―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1836664"
msgid "From this unexpected reward, I was able to obtain\nwhat is unmistakably tranquility―\neven if it was only for a short time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1836788"
msgid "Yes, #C236196003Rin#CDEF is a good choice.\nWith her spirited eyes and legs like a doe,\nI would also say she's worthy of admiration."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1836920"
msgid "Oh? #C236196003Rani#CDEF?\nSo you prefer physiques so straight you could\npractically see the horizon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1837024"
msgid "Yes, #C236196003Rani#CDEF is a good choice. With her tan\nskin and gloomy eyes, I almost can't stop\nmyself from wanting to protect her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1837160"
msgid "Yes, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF is a good choice. Her plump breasts\nmakes her look maternal, and her sweet, little\nface makes me want to coddle her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1837308"
msgid "…you're not going to spout some\ndrivel like, \"2D only,\" I imagine?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1837376"
msgid "…but it's just a joke.\nI just don't seem to see the women\nI fight alongside with in that light, at all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1837484"
msgid "You're saying they're comrades. Gosh, just how\npure and honest of a man are you? Giving in\nto desire now and then is good for you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1837616"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF, #C236196003Julius#CDEF, #C236196003Gatou#CDEF, or #C236196003Shinji#CDEF.\nWho among them are you most attracted to?\nOf course――I mean in a sexual way."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1837792"
msgid "\"Being loving\" vs. \"being in love\" aside, I'm\nsimply and plainly implying about bodies. That\nshould be easy enough even for you to answer."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1837932"
msgid "Come now, this is what they call \"girl talk.\"\nI always wanted to try it once.\nNow's a good chance, no?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1838036"
msgid "M-me!? Having such a LUSTY girl talk―――!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1838084"
msgid "That thought came across my mind,\nbut well, everyone does it… I guess. Yeah."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1838164"
msgid "I just have to go for it, and say honestly―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1838216"
msgid "I have no preference."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1838240"
msgid "Oh? #C236196003Leo#CDEF?\nSo you say you like flower buds which\nhave yet to fully bloom?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1838328"
msgid "Yes, #C236196003Leo#CDEF is a good choice. One can never tire of\nwatching a handsome boy. Best of all, you can\nenjoy gradually sharing your \"tricks.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1838480"
msgid "W-what the hell does this Servant\nthink she's saying to me―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1838548"
msgid "Oh? #C236196003Julius#CDEF?\nSo you say you like the flower which\nquietly blooms in the shade?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1838644"
msgid "However, I don't like him much.\nHe's a bit too toxic. The smell of\nblood doesn't come off of him…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1838744"
msgid "His head, not so much. I'd prefer chatting with\na myna bird over him. Think again on that one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1838840"
msgid "…#C236196003Shinji#CDEF, huh?\nWell, his face… no, let's not go there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1838912"
msgid "He has way more bad about him than good. If made\ngood use of, he might actually impress at\ntimes… I have to say, you're a real gambler."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1839052"
msgid "Yes, it was too wide a selection for a young\nlady to make, I see. I was being mean\nin asking as well. Forgive me, Praetor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1839176"
msgid "Now I got a good grasp on your secret.\nWith this, I can recover a little from all the\njunk that's been wearing out my stomach."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1839304"
msgid "No worries, I'll keep this new secret\nlocked up in my heart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1839368"
msgid "I only asked to get an idea of what you find\nattractive, for future use.\nI won't make it public. Rest assured."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1839480"
msgid "I want to know YOUR #C000246204SG#CDEF, too…\nWhen we get the chance, I want you and I\nto have a nice, long chat."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1839596"
msgid "We've suffered a terrible blow from losing #C236196003Leo#CDEF\nand #C236196003Julius#CDEF, but mourning them won't help us.\nKeep your eyes forward, Praetor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1839756"
msgid "We're assuredly pressuring #C236196003BB#CDEF. I mean, look no\nfurther than #C236196003Lancer#CDEF's reappearance.\nWe're not out of options yet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1839904"
msgid "Certainly, being President is a serious task.\nBut it's nothing to worry over alone. You have\n#C236196003Rin#CDEF, #C236196003Rani#CDEF, and #C236196003Sakura#CDEF. And of course, me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1840088"
msgid "#C236196003Saber#CDEF's eyes narrow, looking at me tenderly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1840152"
msgid "It's as though she took notice of how\nconsiderably heavily the position of \"President\"\nhas been weighing on my mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1840272"
msgid "Turn to me when you're about to give in.\nWhat Servant doesn't keep their Master in mind?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1840364"
msgid "Of course. I wouldn't have it any other way.\nI don't mind her depending on me whenever."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1840452"
msgid "Mhm. Now let's make a fresh start and\nconquer the Labyrinth.\nI'm counting on you, our new President."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1840556"
msgid "We must forge our own path,\nfor both #C236196003Leo#CDEF and #C236196003Julius#CDEF's sakes.\nI expect much from you, our new President."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1840692"
msgid "Don't relax for even a moment.\n…hm? Are you listening, Praetor!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1840760"
msgid "To be honest, I've been worried about how #C236196003BB#CDEF was just acting."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1840840"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF acted with her usual enthusiasm.\nI can't pin her for anything there, but―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1840940"
msgid "This is about how #C236196003BB#CDEF was acting strange?\nOne could say the way you try to understand\neven your enemies is one of your charms."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1841084"
msgid "But let it go this time. You'll cloud your own\njudgement if you show #C236196003BB#CDEF any quarter.\nSympathy is a luxury we can afford no longer."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1841232"
msgid "…what will I ever do with you?\nI still like you the way you are, which is why\nI can't make light of #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1841364"
msgid "You know what I mean.\nI will protect you without fail.\nUntil the end, you'll see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1841448"
msgid "If she insists that badly, I guess I have to.\nI'll keep this lonely ruler company for the time being."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1841552"
msgid "Are you calling me a lonely rabbit!? But, mhm.\nI'll forgive you because of your smile. You'll\nkeep me company for as long as I want, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1841692"
msgid "Seeing #C236196003Saber#CDEF snuggle up to me so happily,\nI can't help but let out a smile."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1841784"
msgid "I'm still concerned about #C236196003BB#CDEF's strange behavior,\nbut for now, I'll just keep my thoughts on this\ngirl here―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1841916"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF… She's more troublesome\nthan any of our enemies have been so far.\nDon't get distracted, #RUBS  Master#RUBEPraetor#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1842064"
msgid "This situation is a desperate one, certainly.\n#C236196003BB#CDEF has truly become a deus ex machina…\nA mechanical god."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1842184"
msgid "However, all stories must end convincingly\nfor the audience. Who wants to hear a story\nfilled only with despair and absurdity?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1842312"
msgid "People seek stories BECAUSE they always\ncontain that single ray of hope."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1842388"
msgid "#RUBS      Despite it all, everything is resolved#RUBE         \"Deus ex machina.\"#REND\nA convenient ending perfectly suffices."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1842516"
msgid "How about we go ask #C236196003BB#CDEF what she thinks\nabout the truth in that? We'll ask her who\nexactly benefits from her ending."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1842648"
msgid "So long as I meet the end together with you,\nI'll accept anything that happens. That said,\nI won't accept that end if you don't."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1842780"
msgid "Now, Praetor. Follow me and let's head out―\nto the end of our story.\nTo the #RUBS future#RUBEending#REND you wish for."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1842900"
msgid "I told you, did I not?\nI am your sword. You are my life.\nNo matter where we go, it will be together."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1843004"
msgid "So fear not. You can place your faith\nin the flame burning within my blade.\nRace forward without reservation, #RUBS  Master#RUBEPraetor#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1843148"
msgid "―――Good.\nThis outfit really does fit me well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1843200"
msgid "Clad in the bright red clothes that she's used\nto wearing, #C236196003Saber#CDEF nods as if satisfied."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1843304"
msgid "Looking at her now back in her original clothes,\ncompared to those restraints, I pick up\nan odd nostalgia for it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1843420"
msgid "It pains me to cast away the pure white, which\nbore no stains. But, adorning myself in deep\ncrimson, which signifies mettle, suits me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1843556"
msgid "That restraint was quite something, as well;\nwith that bridal motif―#RUBS  nuptiae#RUBEweddings#REND, Praetor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1843668"
msgid "If you so wish, I can fight while wearing it\nfrom now on. Naturally, I'll then assume that\nmeans we'll be married, right―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1843796"
msgid "Dashing off together, fighting together, laughing together,\ngetting angry together. She's been by my side through\nthick and thin. Our bond still held, even here in\nthe #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1844004"
msgid "I can't believe I forgot those important memories―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1844060"
msgid "Her sullen voice brings me back to Earth.\nI looked around in a panic to find\n#C236196003Saber#CDEF bright red and furious. I should apologize sincerely."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1844216"
msgid "…well, I can tell what you were thinking of.\nProbably, you saw me in these clothes and became\nimpassioned over your lost memories, no?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1844352"
msgid "If you think of me, then smile like a twinkling\nstar―then brighter still, to eclipse even your\nmissing memories. This is a Master's duty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1844492"
msgid "#C236196003Saber#CDEF is definitely right.\nIt must be hard even for a Servant to let\na gloomy face be when it's right beside them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1844624"
msgid "This is a good occasion, where we finally got\nto switch outfits. I should've said something tasteful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1844728"
msgid "So, I'll say―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1844748"
msgid "Put on the white and be my bride."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1844784"
msgid "Yes! The optimal color for drawing the eyes of\ncrowds―a heart-pounding, passionate red!\nThis color was truly made for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1844908"
msgid "I'm pretty sure there was someone else whose trademark\ncolor was red… I wonder if that person is also\npounding hearts or whatever."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1845040"
msgid "Parts that shouldn't be shown are transparent,\nand parts you would want to hide are\nsticking out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1845140"
msgid "How many times must I tell you. I'm showing off!\nMy body is peak art. Concealing it could bring\nharm to my citizens."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1845260"
msgid "It doesn't look like she knows what 'TMI' means."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1845312"
msgid "Does #C236196003Saber#CDEF not have any words like \"shy\" in\nher dictionary―――!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1845396"
msgid "I can't just accept it when it comes straight at\nme, I feel embarrassed. Ah, this must be those\n\"marriage blues,\" \"prenuptial doubts\"!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1845532"
msgid "Yeah, she's off the rails big time,\nbut seeing her cute reaction is good enough for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1845620"
msgid "I see #C236196003Saber#CDEF's face, who readily swaps around outfits."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1845692"
msgid "…………\nT-this―I have to admit, even for me, this is…\nDamned #C236196003BB#CDEF, what a dreadful thing this is…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1845808"
msgid "She asks me to close my eyes while she changes.\nSome time passes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1845876"
msgid "Judging by what I hear from her,\neven though she's putting it on,\nit seems that this swimsuit demands\na fair bit of courage to wear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1846012"
msgid "What on Earth could be making even #C236196003Saber#CDEF lose her nerve――!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1846092"
msgid "A string? What kind of string?\nSuperstring theory?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1846144"
msgid "Ugh, my imagination is running wild…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1846184"
msgid "I'd rather use a #C000246204Command Seal#CDEF than be teased any more―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1846264"
msgid "I hear her give me permission as I open my eyes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1846316"
msgid "The room's interior light hits my eyes,\nwhich had been tightly shut. And I see―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1846404"
msgid "…d-does it look good?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1846428"
msgid "There are well-ripened fruits of paradise."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1846472"
msgid "They'd probably fit just right in the palm of one's hand.\nThat cloth does a pitiful job at covering her superb size―\nAt a glance, it only covers five cent… no,\nfour centimeters across."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1846660"
msgid "Ideally, I'd do five millimeters less.\nI'm sure we can risk it――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1846728"
msgid "…h-hey, Praetor.\nYou're staring at me far too intensely…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1846788"
msgid "I feel a zeal within me that I've never felt before."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1846844"
msgid "#C236196003Saber#CDEF would normally assert, \"I'm showing you on purpose!\"\nwhile having no shame in her clothing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1846960"
msgid "With the addition of her hanging her head in embarrassment,\nmy zeal rapidly increases.\nMy bursting libido won't stop."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1847080"
msgid "――I have a small question.\nWhat's the back of that swimsuit look like?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1847156"
msgid "The back? The back, um, is really\ndigging into me.\nIt like, almost shows everything…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1847244"
msgid "What… did she say…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1847268"
msgid "#C236196003Saber#CDEF! Turn around as fast as you can, right n―――!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1847340"
msgid "―――!?\nH-hey, Praetor!?\nYour nose is bleeding like a fountain!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1847408"
msgid "My nose vigorously spurts red,\ncausing my consciousness to fade.\nLooks like my days as a wholesome\nyouth have come to an end…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1847536"
msgid "Ooohh nooo! Praetor!\nDying now would be so pathetic.\nGet a hold of yourself!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1847616"
msgid "As my consciousness gradually clouds,\nthese words come to mind:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1847680"
msgid "…………………\n…………………\n…………………it's nothing but thin string."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1847756"
msgid "Heh, hahahahaha! Even the gods who reign over\nthe heavens would find themselves spellbound!\nHas my ART stolen your breath?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1847880"
msgid "That crimson cloth barely covers one's essentials.\nYet here #C236196003Saber#CDEF is, wearing it and roaring with laughter…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1848008"
msgid "…I bear no shame over my own body.\nI can wear this. It may even be praised as\nsupreme art. I can wear this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1848120"
msgid "…I can tell you're embarrassed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1848156"
msgid "It's natural for the beauty of my flesh to be\nadmired. I can wear this. My body must be\nblessed with Venus' love. I can wear this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1848288"
msgid "Let me say it one more time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1848320"
msgid "―――I can tell you're embarrassed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1848360"
msgid "―――Phew, we're on the same page then."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1848404"
msgid "Let me revise my statement."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1848432"
msgid "―――She MAY be a full-on exhibitionist."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1848476"
msgid "What do you think, Praetor?\nDo I look good?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1848520"
msgid "…it's lovely.\nSans any flattery, #C236196003Saber#CDEF, changed into her\nnew outfit, looks super adorable."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1848628"
msgid "After I sincerely share my impression,\na smile blossoms over #C236196003Saber#CDEF's face."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1848720"
msgid "Hehe. Is that so?\nYou probably won't feel uncomfortable if\nI'm beside you while wearing this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1848816"
msgid "Man. When she looks like this,\nit's hard to see her as anything but a normal girl."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1848900"
msgid "Yeah, normal―――No burdens on her shoulders,\nno being a Heroic Spirit; just a girl."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1848988"
msgid "Maybe we would have been able to go\nshopping, eating, playing together."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1849060"
msgid "Sometimes worry about love, or quarrel."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1849100"
msgid "Maybe we would have been able to live an\nordinary yet dear daily life together―――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1849188"
msgid "…I do reflect on the path I took in life,\nbut I have no complaints about it. Though\nregrets and disappointments aplenty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1849312"
msgid "My heart skips a beat at her words."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1849348"
msgid "It's written all over your face.\nCertainly, something like living a normal\ncitizen's life with you wouldn't be so bad."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1849468"
msgid "However, think carefully.\nHypothetically, if I wasn't a Heroic Spirit,\nI wouldn't have met you, see?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1849572"
msgid "Therefore, it would be contradictory to\ndeny how I came to be."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1849636"
msgid "I'm sure this girl feels responsible for\nsomething larger than anything I could\npossibly imagine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1849736"
msgid "To go off and decide to take pity on such a girl\nwould doubtlessly be showing her a lack of respect."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1849840"
msgid "…that said, Praetor, even if for only a\nmoment, you considered me as a normal girl――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1849928"
msgid "That makes me very happy.\nI don't know what it is I'm feeling,\nbut it must be a feeling of warm love."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1850032"
msgid "#C236196003Saber#CDEF's smile as she said so was like a\nsweet, white flower, freshly bloomed\nfrom the morning's light."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1850152"
msgid "This is my original form. It's a Mythical Mystic\nCode modeled after the primordial flame; the\nemperor's garb that will lead you to victory."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1850292"
msgid "…well, I've prattled on enough about that.\nWhat do you think, Praetor?\nDo I look good in it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1850388"
msgid "…yes, that is the question.\nIt's at these times that I'm reminded\nthat she's a girl at heart."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1850484"
msgid "…it's not see-through enough."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1850516"
msgid "This is practically art. I figured your\neyes might explode from seeing something packed\nwith divinity, but my worries were needless."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1850652"
msgid "She looks great in it, but compared\nto her old clothes―this is kind of \"traditional.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1850740"
msgid "―――Where are the bare legs behind see-through laces?\n―――Where is the butt I can glance at when she turns around?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1850860"
msgid "So long as I'm donning this Mystic Code,\nI promise you a spectacular, triumphant victory.\nNow, let's be off, Praetor!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1850980"
msgid "Come to think of it, there was a considerably\nrare enemy among the ones we defeated recently,\nno? Praetor, did you notice it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1851108"
msgid "A fine thing it was.\nIt was, like… how do I put it?\nDispatching it felt incredible."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1851196"
msgid "It was exhilarating, as if I had become an\ninvincible swordsman―――a hero without rival!\nI felt like Atlas the titan even!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1851324"
msgid "Most importantly, this proves that we're\nregaining our strength.\nLet's both hone our skills, Praetor!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1851428"
msgid "…do you have a moment, Praetor?\nAbout those rare enemies―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1851492"
msgid "Now, sure, I said I wanted us to both\nrelish in defeating them. I said we would\nhone our skills together."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1851600"
msgid "But you've gone too far!\nDo you not know of the word \"limit\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1851664"
msgid "Your conquest concluded before I had even\nrealized it was underway. Hunting down EVERY\nrare enemy is just too much, though…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1851792"
msgid "Well, it IS the government's duty to cull wild\nanimals to appropriate levels. You put me,\nan emperor, to shame, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1851912"
msgid "I wonder what I'll get.\nMaybe some kind of special item?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1851972"
msgid "…heeheehee. It's a special present,\nthe likes of which you've never seen before."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1852056"
msgid "Naturally, I'll compose the song.\n―――Heh. My talent, cherished by the gods,\nis something else. Also frightening."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1852172"
msgid "This is coming from #C236196003Saber#CDEF, an #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF sympathizer.\nWhich means one can easily guess what her\nsinging ability is like!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1852324"
msgid "Hearken well, Praetor.\nTonight, my Golden Theater will open for you―\nA heavenly hell will rise from the earth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1852436"
msgid "My melody of love would send even\nApollo to tears.\nWell, then―――Listen closely!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1852520"
msgid "My Room was supposed to be tranquil.\nIt's turning into a recital of terror."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1852596"
msgid "I clutch my ears in pain as insanity slowly takes hold.\nAt least #C236196003Saber#CDEF's affection was well conveyed to me…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1852724"
msgid "Oh, you want to know how the song was?\nGo ask the shattered window glass."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1852800"
msgid "Maybe her stomach isn't feeling well?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1852840"
msgid "Gah! Worrying is not my style! Praetor.\nI want you to show me that treasure you\nrecently obtained in the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1852956"
msgid "Oh, is that all?\nI was sure her stomach wasn't feeling well or something―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1853036"
msgid "By \"recent treasure,\" I guess she's talking about this\nrare item?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1853104"
msgid "Mhm, that's right. You catch on quick, Praetor.\nThis is proof that we understand one another\neven without words."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1853220"
msgid "At any rate… mhm. This IS a fine treasure.\nAmong all of our provisions, this one has a\nremarkable gleam to it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1853332"
msgid "Rarity is beauty. And that beauty will serve\nyou well in time. Continue devoting yourself\nto collecting treasure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1853448"
msgid "Admirable work, Praetor. I didn't think you\nwould collect THIS many rare treasures from\nthat intricate Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1853564"
msgid "I guess she's talking about those rare items.\nIt appears that I've collected a fair\namount without even realizing it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1853684"
msgid "Treasure is a fine thing. Especially when it's\nrare. Sweet on the eyes and good for the mind\nwhen used. Two birds with one stone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1853816"
msgid "Sooo, basically…\nShe LOVES rare items because they're all\nnice things in her eyes.\n…or something like that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1853928"
msgid "And of course, you're a rare treasure to me,\ntoo. Sadly, you don't always treat me well――\nBut that's part of why I cherish you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1854060"
msgid "And consider ME a rare treasure the likes\nof which you'll never come across again."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "1854144"
msgid "Total money squandered:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1854168"
msgid "…Praetor. You have no gaudiness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1854204"
msgid "The way you spend money. Your moderation in\npurchasing is so, how should I put it… like…\nYour ways are mediocre."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1854320"
msgid "Understand? You come across things only once in\nyour life. Once you have decided, grab it\nthen! Use it then!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1854432"
msgid "Think about what will happen after, and you may\nlet something great slip by in that time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1854524"
msgid "That is how I emptied the national treasury. I\nhave not a shred of regret. Rather, I praised\nmyself on how I used it all so wonderfully."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1854664"
msgid "What a thing for a monarch to say…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1854704"
msgid "And actually, I want her to tell me how someone\ncan spend so much money that they empty a\nnational treasury."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1854816"
msgid "Hm? Simple.\nIf I feel like raising a park or a palace or a\ncolosseum, then―――Hey, enough about me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1854920"
msgid "Anyway, I displayed true beauty by the very use\nof that money itself. I'll be expecting\nextravagance fit for a ruler from you."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "1855048"
msgid "Total money squandered:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1855072"
msgid "What stupefying extravagance! What squanderance!\nThis method of throwing money about in sheer\ndesperation was made for me…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1855200"
msgid "Mhm. You and I together could readily empty\nthe coffers of one or two―no, three countries."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1855292"
msgid "Luxury and decadence driven expenses… how\nfortuitous that I would contract one who gets\nthe beauty of it! There's nothing as fun!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1855424"
msgid "I'm happy to see her so moved,\nbut if she's going to splurge THAT outrageously,\nthen I'd prefer she learn some self-discipline."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1855552"
msgid "What need is there for self-discipline? If money\nis not used, then all it achieves is stifling\ncirculation. Fret not; slake your desires."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1855692"
msgid "Look, if you run out of money, then simply\namass more. When that time comes, you may\nlet me do the heavy lifting!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1855808"
msgid "Hm. You're yet unrefined when it comes to\nbattle, but it appears that you've\nrecalled how to fight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1855908"
msgid "Brute force won't serve to defeat enemies.\nThere will be times when finesse is called for."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1856000"
msgid "For example―――When you can't see all of your\nopponent's moves that turn, using skills can\ninterrupt the flow of battle in your favor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1856140"
msgid "You're still a novice, but from now on, be\naggressive with utilizing skills. I look forward\nto seeing your actions in the coming battles."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1856280"
msgid "Hrmm…\nI didn't expect to see you become such\na hardened tactician. I'm in awe."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1856360"
msgid "If only I had a tactician of your prowess in my\nlifetime, I would've immediately put you as my\nmilitary advisor. How vexing; utterly vexing!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1856504"
msgid "To possess such a gift, you must be loved by\nthe goddess of war-strategy, Minerva.\nI expected no less from the #[man][woman]# I chose."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1856640"
msgid "When we are together, my technique grows all\nthe more masterful. I'll be depending on\nyou in the future, Praetor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1856756"
msgid "A rather bellicose one, aren't you? I refer to\nthe scores of enemies we've defeated within\nthe Labyrinth. Already we have passed ○○."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1856892"
msgid "Sidestepping encounters is always an option,\nbut you purposefully engage every time.\nYou're one of those perfectionists, I see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1857020"
msgid "However, just don't push it too far.\nIt would sadden me to see you get hurt."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1857100"
msgid "Magnificent, Praetor!\nThe number of enemies we've defeated has at\nlast hit a new pinnacle!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1857192"
msgid "With this, even Mars would flee before\nyour vigor. You don't intend on becoming a\nnew god of war, do you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1857300"
msgid "Then I shall serve as a sword worthy to that\nend. I must be diligent myself too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1857384"
msgid "Ahh, one more thing. As praise for your valorous\nefforts, I wish to bestow you with a prize――\nIs there anything you would like?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1857516"
msgid "Social status, honor, and money"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1857548"
msgid "Goodness, you're so forthcoming with \nyour wants… that's my Praetor.\nI've been struck with admiration!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1857652"
msgid "………!\nD-do I not already belong to you?\nI needn't even say it at this point."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1857732"
msgid "That said, all I can furnish for you now is\nthis. It's but a small thing, but it would\ngladden me to see it be of use to you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1857860"
msgid "I take a break in My Room.\nI sit down, stretch out my back,\nand loosen up my shoulders."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1857948"
msgid "………♪ ～～～～♪ ～～～～♪"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1857980"
msgid "I ask what he's doing, and he says…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1858020"
msgid "Regardless of whatever I say, it's just as it\nlooks. I'm restoring some stuff that broke.\nThe vacuum cleaner here is in bad shape."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1858152"
msgid "He replied with the most invigorating\nsmile anyone can give."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1858216"
msgid "…well, I don't have any comments\non the things he likes to do.\nI'll just lay back and do my own thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1858320"
msgid "I can just leave him, and he'll clean the room up,\nrepair the furniture, and prep some brownies.\nLife doesn't get any more pleasant than this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1858464"
msgid "………you're slacking off.\nI didn't want to scold you for this, but it\nlooks like you need some advice."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1858568"
msgid "Recently, you've been sloppily handling stuff,\nno? Even ordinary consumable items contain\ntheir maker's ingenuity and principles."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1858700"
msgid "I'm not exactly telling you to \"go thank items,\"\nbut how about considering things like,\n\"how was this made?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1858812"
msgid "Please exercise your imagination a bit.\nThe little details are where you\nfind life's joys."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1858904"
msgid "And here we go.\nThis Servant goes off on a lecture whenever\nhe gets the chance."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1858984"
msgid "#C236196003Archer#CDEF doesn't just stress discipline in being practical,\nbut he even narrows in on how items should be handled."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1859116"
msgid "…huh?\nJust now, was that an #C000246204SG#CDEF reacting…?\nMaybe I should use this topic to work him up a little more…?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1859240"
msgid "…this chance won't come again. I'll work him up."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1859292"
msgid "…I don't play with fire. I'll ignore this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1859336"
msgid "Alright, let's draw it out.\nThis is my chance to get this rude Servant's secrets.\nHe only sees his Master as a \"troublesome #[kouhai][child]#.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1859480"
msgid "Are you even listening?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1859504"
msgid "I nod in honesty, \"of course I'm listening.\"\nI'll handle items with more care from now on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1859596"
msgid "So, what are you #[doing there][up to]#, #C236196003Archer#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1859664"
msgid "Looking over the vacuum cleaner, like I said.\nI have time while my Master takes a break, so\nI'm taking it apart then reassembling it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1859800"
msgid "#C236196003Archer#CDEF's hands keep moving while he talks.\nI pop up and peek over #C236196003Archer#CDEF's shoulder\nand see the disassembled pieces of the vacuum cleaner."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1859972"
msgid "…now that I think about it,\n#C236196003Archer#CDEF does this sort of maintenance\nfor all sorts of stuff."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1860080"
msgid "What? Maintaining tools starts with taking them\napart. It's the easiest way to get the structure\nand it's interesting. It's getting the gist."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1860224"
msgid "\"Interesting\"…. \"Interesting,\" he says, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1860272"
msgid "\"So then, what's the most interesting\nthing about taking stuff apart?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1860344"
msgid "Pfft. That's an easy one.\nThe king among disassembly and assembly\nis the handgun. It's nice. Really nice."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1860452"
msgid "If Japanese swords are crafts of tradition and\nengineering, handguns are crafts of finesse.\nIron and functional; ingenious and rational."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1860592"
msgid "Rifles and up, you can't dance around the fact\nthat they're weapons of war. But handguns are\nreasonable as weapons and artistic as tools."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1860732"
msgid "Because they have the bare minimum\nfunctionality in terms of weapon shape,\nthey can sometimes harbor a soul within them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1860856"
msgid "Samurai of the Edo period.\nGunslingers of the Wild West.\nRapiers of the Middle Ages were the same way."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1860960"
msgid "They were killing tools, but in duels, they\nwere art, displaying one's pride and ancestry.\nMaybe because life was cheap back then."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1861092"
msgid "Giving a higher price than one's life to a\nweapon one depends on… a man's world, indeed.\nHandguns are the last remnants of it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1861220"
msgid "That said, ultimately what was wanted most from\ncombat tools was durability.\nTough and strong was considered premium."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1861340"
msgid "So even though I praise them as works of art,\nthey're still pretty crude, aren't they?\nIt's a mysterious thing, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1861460"
msgid "A gun barrel made solely in the pursuit\nof durability is so beautiful that it makes\nme let out a sigh."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1861564"
msgid "As a result of wanting the most extreme, some\nvalue is born outside of durability. It doesn't\njust stop at how smooth the metal is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1861696"
msgid "There's the impeccable action of the simplified,\ninternal structure. The attention to balance,\ndependent on mere millimeters."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1861824"
msgid "That shape was created as the result of\nsearching for more stability, more effective\nfiring. It pandered to no one specifically."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1861956"
msgid "Wild animals are the same way.\nWhat's beautiful is what's there, that's it――\nIt's man's kind of romance, indeed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1862072"
msgid "Of course, every gun has its peculiarities.\nOne can tell from the workmanship, even between\nsame models, whether they're quality or not."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1862212"
msgid "But that's still just another good aspect.\nA gunsmith's one-off creation, and a mass-\nproduced creation have different appeals."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1862340"
msgid "The former is a miracles from an artisan's\nskill. The latter, a miracle born from chance in\nthe factory… hm, what's wrong?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1862464"
msgid "That was incredible.\n…and not a damn was given for his listener's intentions…\nA passionate talk."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1862564"
msgid "? Well, I use guns if they're necessary…\nbut our opponents have Spiritron bodies, see?\nGuns aren't any more effective or anything."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1862696"
msgid "And anyways, you have to really burn magical\nenergy to use a gun. They excel at suppression,\nbut it's hard to inject magic into bullets."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1862836"
msgid "What's critical in Servant battles is to find\nout how to break through the enemy's Spiritron\ndefense. You can only distract using guns."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1862972"
msgid "Although, if I were a Heroic Spirit who's\norigin was in always using modern weapons,\nit would be a different story."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1863088"
msgid "I didn't know… So then what was he on\nabout with that fiery speech?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1863160"
msgid "He knows an awful lot about handguns,\ndespite not favoring them.\nMaybe he's not talking about the real thing,\nbut imitations… maybe he really likes model guns?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1863324"
msgid "Model guns are alright… but when I realize they\nhave no usability, I lose interest. No thanks.\nIn the end, I only ever bought one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1863456"
msgid "Well, the thorough disassembly DID pay off.\nThe theory behind my projections is the same.\nLet's call them the six beats of projecting."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1863592"
msgid "#RUBS         What must it be?  #RUBEThe ideal of the creation#REND, #RUBSWhat is the purpose?#RUBEthe basic idea#REND,\n#RUBS        What will be used? #RUBEthe structural material#REND, #RUBS     What is being improved?#RUBEthe crafting technique#REND,\n#RUBS       What is the thought?#RUBEthe learning experience#REND, #RUBS        What piled up?#RUBEthe accumulated time#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1863972"
msgid "By #RUBS   tracing#RUBErecalling#REND these, higher quality\nreproductions are possible. To me, maintaining\ntools is indispensable work."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1864108"
msgid "Indispensable work for helping with battle…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1864156"
msgid "It seems like he usually only maintains household stuff…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1864216"
msgid "I-I just happened to be working on that kind of\nthing. I constantly tinker with guns and bows\nand whatnot while you're sleeping."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1864348"
msgid "So, what? I won't be impressed by someone\nscoffing at household appliances. For example,\nlook at this vacuum cleaner."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1864468"
msgid "It uses a centrifugal separator! What!?\nForget garbage, this thing has the drive to\nsuck up every last molecule around!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1864588"
msgid "It's from a twentieth century manufacturer.\nDyson… is how the name is written, but it's a\nGerman company. No doubt."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1864708"
msgid "There's a theory I swear by.\nThe Japanese and Germans are perfectionists,\nbut I think their orientations differ."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1864824"
msgid "Japanese seek the best in convenience.\nGermans seek the best in functionality.\nPick one of them if you ever buy electronics."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1864952"
msgid "Also, I got hooked on cookware recently.\nI was dumbstruck by electric pressure cookers.\nBeef stew in THIRTEEN minutes? Get outta here!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1865088"
msgid "It's so good. Amazing. The day after I used it,\nI rushed to buy another to take apart. My dream\nis to have my own brand of cookware one day…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1865232"
msgid "I saw before me a deplorable Servant,\nejecting disappointing remarks with an\nexpression brimming with exceptional youth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1865356"
msgid "Ulp, hrm―――Y-you think so? Guess I got\njust a little too talkative. Today in\nparticular, I just felt like wanting to talk."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1865484"
msgid "Anyway, handle your things with care.\n…also, you know. I don't think my level of\nobsession is that out of the ordinary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1865608"
msgid "I nod with a straight face, \"yeah, ok.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1865648"
msgid "…*sigh*.\nI tried to take hold of his weak point to expose his #C000246204SG#CDEF,\nbut it turned out to be such a plain secret…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1865780"
msgid "This half-ass embarrassment of his won't make\nfor much of a weapon against him.\nJust how earnest IS this Heroic Spirit, #C236196003Archer#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1865928"
msgid "I can't take a lecture when I finally got some time off.\nLet's get this over with by just meekly agreeing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1866036"
msgid "Okay. As long as you understand. Don't get lazy\nwith keeping your things neat and organized\nfrom now on. And plan out your shopping."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1866172"
msgid "NEVER buy items you don't need, or Mystic Codes\nwith no utility. Do light stretches before you\nsleep, and don't forget to brush your teeth―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1866316"
msgid "The ticket's issuer is: \"#C236196003BB#CDEF Corporation.\"\nYep, this one's going in the shredder.\nI grab the ticket to do so and…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1866448"
msgid "Wait a sec. I thought you promised not too\nlong ago to treat your items with respect. If\nyou're just going to rip it up, I'll take it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1866584"
msgid "Let's see here…\n\"Mini-Monument☆Sakulabyrinth Entry Ticket.\nAdmit One Servant―Valid One Hour\"…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1866684"
msgid "…it's a door. The instant #C236196003Archer#CDEF took the ticket\nand read the contents of it out loud,\na mysterious door appeared inside My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1866832"
msgid "I would like to ignore it, but there isn't\nany indication hinting that it'll go away.\nI make eye contact with #C236196003Archer#CDEF in such a way as to tell him,\n\"YOU brought it here, YOU go take a look inside.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1867048"
msgid "#C236196003Archer#CDEF looks fine.\nI guess there was nothing dangerous inside…\nHm? Why's this Servant looking kind of #[upbeat][chipper]# now?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1867192"
msgid "So hey, Master. How's your stomach feeling right\nnow? No, I'm not talking about damage or\nanything like that. Just if you were hungry."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1867328"
msgid "We're automatically supplied with the\nbare minimum amount of energy necessary\nto move about."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1867424"
msgid "That said, one's \"hunger\" and \"nutrition\" don't\nusually line up, do they? So, when he asks me,\n\"are you hungry,\" it's no wonder he asks it with\na fierce, predatory look on his face."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1867608"
msgid "If you're hungry, we'll find you a meal.\nOne of a Servant's duties is to keep his\nMaster in working order."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1867716"
msgid "Without so much as bothering to hear my reply,\n#C236196003Archer#CDEF up and left through the mysterious door."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1867828"
msgid "Well, well! This is some nice chili bean paste.\nAnd tofu? Let's use that, I guess.\nLightly fry, throw in some fried rice…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1867952"
msgid "We're strapped on time, so I'll only get to fit\ntwo snacks in. Let's top this off with shumai\nand sesame balls."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1868064"
msgid "A ticket for making a Servant's wish come true?\nI wonder if they added that to throw some spice\non the Master-Servant relationship."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1868196"
msgid "But you flopped this time, #C236196003BB#CDEF. I was actually\nright at the end of my rope. Sometimes, you just\ngotta take a pan and go all out!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1868340"
msgid "Hm? Pumpkin, spotted. That'll do nicely for\nsome fiber. The sweetness from the seeds\nwill cover up the skin's bitterness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1868464"
msgid "A meal isn't made to please the chef――\na meal is made to please the consumer.\nIt exists to heal their body and mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1868584"
msgid "Food is the root of all medicine. It is its most\ncrucial component! I'll work to ensure my\nMaster tastes this truth for #[him][her]#self!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1868724"
msgid "Is this a good thing or a bad thing? Who knows.\nMy feelings on this are going to be mixed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1868816"
msgid "I quietly shut the door."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1868844"
msgid "Might be best to act aloof for the next hour or\nso until he wraps it up in there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1868928"
msgid "Food's ready. Get it while it's hot. Oh, I'm\npreparing peach oolong tea for after your meal.\nIt should cleanse your palate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1869052"
msgid "I take a seat at the readied table with a nod.\nThe table cloth appears brand new, and each of\nthe neatly prepared dishes looks scrumptious."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1869192"
msgid "That said, there was only enough to serve one,\nand poor #C236196003Archer#CDEF is just standing there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1869296"
msgid "Don't worry about me. Just eat your fill.\nThat'll leave me most fulfilled for the effort."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1869388"
msgid "…and that's how it went."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1869416"
msgid "Was that my second #C000246204SG#CDEF?\nWelp, you got me, but what do we call this one?\n\"Pro Chef\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1869516"
msgid "Well, he's awfully hospitable…\nI have to wonder―― was #C236196003Archer#CDEF prone to this sort of\nactivity in his lifetime?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1869644"
msgid "Maybe he was a butler or something."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1869680"
msgid "…hm? Oh. Yeah.\nI worked as a butler too and picked up\nsome tutoring gigs on the side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1869768"
msgid "While I wouldn't call it a \"job perk,\"\nI did find myself protecting a fair number\nof women along the way."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1869876"
msgid "Acting as a bodyguard or a tutor proved to be an\neasy ticket to access persons of interest.\nOf course, some exceptions did exist."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1870008"
msgid "My main profession was――\nwell, no, \"professionals\" get paid, don't they―\nanyways, you could say I was a fighter."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1870124"
msgid "I touched on this in the Near Side of the Moon,\nbut promise you won't laugh when you hear this:\nI was a Hero of Justice."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1870248"
msgid "After I heard the term, but before I was hit by\na wave of laughter born from its absurdity,\nan indescribable pain shot through my person."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1870388"
msgid "A Hero of Justice?\nThose don't exist in the real world."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1870444"
msgid "Look me, musing over how comical and tragic it\nmust feel for him to tell me this pipe dream of\nhis like it \"really happened.\" Like I'd know."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1870588"
msgid "I started out a good Samaritan to help the weak.\n\"I'll never bow to tyranny! I have morals!\"\nSo on, and so forth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1870704"
msgid "But then, a certain incident―accident, rather―\nthrew me off course."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1870776"
msgid "I could no longer believe in \"justice for all,\"\nand my \"justice\" turned blind for it.\nI had given in to a tyrannical, magical force."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1870912"
msgid "I was a monster then. One could call my\njustice \"hideous\" and \"merciless.\"\nYou can guess how well it prevailed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1871024"
msgid "Ah, this doesn't make for delightful table talk,\nnow does it. In better news, I racked up a fair\namount of experience points on the stovetop."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1871168"
msgid "\"For sure,\" I say, stuffing my face with the snacks."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1871224"
msgid "I thought he said he worked as a teacher.\nI wonder if he remembers any wild students\nin particular."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1871324"
msgid "Yeah, I somewhat remember them. 2nd place\ngoes to a girl I was grouped with while I was\nin a Middle Eastern #ROFS0003#RUBS     resistance      #RUBEanti-government group#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1871500"
msgid "That girl was such a wrecking ball of impulse,\nshe had me at my wit's end, constantly scolding\nher for wearing a miniskirt into the desert."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1871640"
msgid "Otherwise, she was a brilliant student, so my\njob was easy. If we mean a hard time, 1st place\ngoes to a kid in that Asian caravan."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1871772"
msgid "A heck of a rookie, that one. Zero regard for\ntheir own safety―kind of like you. But I\ncouldn't tell you their name. Been too long."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1871908"
msgid "Now I see.\nSo basically, he went pretty hardcore when he taught.\nNo wonder his second #C000246204SG#CDEF is what it is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1872028"
msgid "Once I wrap up the last few bites of this\ndelicious meal, I clap my hands and loudly\ndeclare my thanks."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1872132"
msgid "Thanks. Once you finish your tea and wind down,\nlet's get back to exploring. We may get lucky\nand land on another ticket."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1872256"
msgid "I smile in return.\n\"That would be nice.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1872300"
msgid "But, it IS a #C236196003BB#CDEF thing. I wouldn't be\nsurprised if the next ticket had\nan exorbitant price tag…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1872412"
msgid "How kind of you.\n…I know. If you want to show me some thanks,\nyou can serve me up something next time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1872516"
msgid "I'd like to taste your cooking if the chance\ncomes along. You're at a ripe age for a girl to\nshow off some decent skills, aren't you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1872652"
msgid "But I resist my spiral reflex to actually reply as such.\nIf I did, I wouldn't deserve to be here as\na Master―no―as #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1872804"
msgid "…ugh. I wonder if there's some instructional software\nlying around somewhere, like a cookingpedia that\nanyone can follow…"
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "1872928"
msgid "SG, \"Serving Constitution\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1872956"
msgid "Despite this not being the first time, my heart is drumming."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1873020"
msgid "Wh―――what's with all this tension?\nIt's like one of those scenes from the movies,\nbeside the riverbank on the way home from school,\nand it's as if―――\nhe's going to say something important―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1873220"
msgid "I know this kind of thing needs to be discreet,\nbut I just can't take it anymore. You're an\nattractive woman. That's why I want to talk."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1873360"
msgid "I'm unable to reply verbally.\nI heard that when this happens, I'm supposed to\naudibly gulp―but my throat doesn't budge.\nAll those romantic dramas, rom-coms―all LIES."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1873528"
msgid "If my throat isn't working, then how can I speak?\nSo I just give an exaggerated nod to say \"okay.\"\nThen―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1873640"
msgid "Thanks. I'll go have my turn then.\nMan, this is just what I needed!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1873708"
msgid "See, I got bathed in poison in our battle\nagainst #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF the other day. I won't relax\nunless I wash myself off well with a shower."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1873860"
msgid "? What's wrong, Master? Why are you banging your\nhead against the wall? Why are you punching the\nwall repeatedly… is this some training?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1874000"
msgid "…I sense intense bloodlust.\nMaybe it's just my imagination…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1874064"
msgid "Obviously there's no bloodlust.\nI clear my throat with an \"ahem,\"\nthen rub my brow in frustration as I speak:"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1874176"
msgid "Doing swell, are we?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1874200"
msgid "In a good mood, are we?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1874224"
msgid "…if that's what it looks like, then I\napologize. It appears that I unknowingly\noffended the good lady again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1874336"
msgid "\"Again\"?\nDid he just say \"again\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1874372"
msgid "He told me before that a butler's life would be good\nenough for him―but although he LOOKS conservative,\nmaybe he's actually a Don Juan…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1874512"
msgid "…hey. Why are you readying a #C000246204Command Seal#CDEF?\nI think there's a misunderstanding,\nI'm not that conservative."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1874636"
msgid "As long as no laws are broken, men and women\nshould be proactive in relationships. Humans are\nanimals after all, it's just how it is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1874772"
msgid "…this refined man is something else.\nEven a hunk wouldn't be allowed to say what he said.\nYet he said it with nihilism, and as if he was right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1874920"
msgid "He also deftly deflected the truth with that response.\nLet's carefully go over what he said again step-by-step."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1875032"
msgid "Q. He seems conservative, but is he actually a Don Juan?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1875092"
msgid "A. You misunderstand. I'm not necessarily conservative."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1875148"
msgid "…see? This is important.\nAll he did was reject the assumption.\nHe didn't actually answer the question…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1875256"
msgid "Woah, you're right. Okay, sorry, sorry.\nI didn't realize. I don't get the sense\nthat I'm some kind of womanizer…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1875372"
msgid "Compared to regular guys, I seemed to always\nhave an easy time getting chummy.\nYou've heard of James Bond, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1875488"
msgid "That's what my relationships were like. I have\nto have a relationship with a woman if it's work\nrelated. But after work―it ends there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1875624"
msgid "I don't know about this James dude,\nbut I get what #C236196003Archer#CDEF is saying."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1875712"
msgid "Basically, when it comes to work,\nhe can instantly nab a girlfriend,\nmaybe in an hour and a half?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1875812"
msgid "Yeah. In the end, I would always get robbed,\nshot at, or she's actually the chief's daughter,\nor they come at me with a dump truck, etc."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1875952"
msgid "#C236196003Archer#CDEF checks through his past records.\nHis eyes quickly turn dark,\nfill with despair―and finally, he hides his face in his hands."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1876100"
msgid "―――Yep.\nI don't know exactly know what's going on,\nbut it feels like my rage has subsided."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1876196"
msgid "Alright, forget all that.\nIt's all in the past now.\nFrom now on, I'm living in the future."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1876288"
msgid "#C236196003Archer#CDEF recovers while shaking his head in denial."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1876356"
msgid "He looks like an Afghan Hound that got caught in the rain.\nI could almost cry.\nOut of sympathy, I blurt out:"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1876468"
msgid "What do you like in a girl, Archer?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1876504"
msgid "What about your private life?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1876536"
msgid "Out of sympathy, I blurt out:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1876568"
msgid "\"What do you like in a girl, #C236196003Archer#CDEF?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1876624"
msgid "I didn't mean to say it, but it just came out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1876672"
msgid "Hm?\nAnother curious question. I like anyone\nas long as they're cute, personally."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1876756"
msgid "This guy! He's clueless AND he's an enemy to all women!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1876812"
msgid "Out of curiosity, I blurt out:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1876844"
msgid "\"Any lovers in your private life, outside of work?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1876896"
msgid "I just voluntarily stepped on a landmine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1876940"
msgid "It was same way back when I was in school.\nWe would date for half a year and then break up.\nWomen were dumping me left and right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1877072"
msgid "…but I know now that I was the one at fault.\nApparently, I'm way too pessimistic of a person."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1877168"
msgid "I would be living in bliss―then suddenly,\nI would feel like screaming."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1877240"
msgid "Every time I felt happiness,\nI would want to strangle myself out\nof resentment."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1877320"
msgid "…see, I had survived a certain disaster.\nEver since, I was afraid that I wasn't making it\nup to those who hadn't survived."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1877444"
msgid "I didn't deserve happiness. I was an undesirable\nwho watched as countless lost their lives.\nStuff like that. Absurd, compulsive ideas."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1877580"
msgid "When I was young, I never told anyone\nabout that. I held it all in; it was a personal\nproblem."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1877676"
msgid "After all, women are perceptive creatures.\nHide as I may, they probably saw through me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1877764"
msgid "That's why they all left me for\nthe same reason:\n\"This is too much for me.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1877840"
msgid "It's no wonder.\nIt's not that they gave up on me;\nit's just that I didn't believe in others."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1877936"
msgid "…there's nothing I can say for him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1877976"
msgid "And that's because I don't know what kind\nof past he had in his lifetime,\nor how he felt when he met his end and became a Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1878108"
msgid "We'll escape the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF,\nand once we reach the end of the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF,\nif I can just know one sliver about him by then,\nthen I may have something I can say for him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1878324"
msgid "\"Sure, the way you were living ended up\nhurting the people around you.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1878396"
msgid "I mean, it's because a guy like him became\na Heroic Spirit that one life, my life, got saved."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1878492"
msgid "So, well, the bottom-line is that I've got\nbad luck. That's the takeaway here.\nSame thing with #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF―――Nevermind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1878632"
msgid "Looks like my Mystic Code is done drying.\nSorry I held us up for so long."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1878708"
msgid "This topic took an unexpected turn,\nbut let's not dwell on it.\nLet's keep at it, Master."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "1878800"
msgid "SG, \"Bad Luck With Women\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1878828"
msgid "So, how's it feel?\nGetting a girlfriend all of a sudden?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1878888"
msgid "I can hear #C236196003Archer#CDEF smirking.\nMust be about this strategy\nwhere #C236196003Jinako#CDEF and I are lovers."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1879008"
msgid "What can I say…?\nWe're lovers temporarily, so that we\ncan catch #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF.\nI have no thoughts like,\n\"Do we look like a convincing couple?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1879168"
msgid "You're not being very resourceful here.\nEven if this IS a strategic move, you're still\ngoing to be a couple, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1879288"
msgid "I say you gotta show some chivalry.\nSomething like, \"I'll keep you safe,\nrain or shine!\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1879380"
msgid "…#C236196003Archer#CDEF is just saying this because it's not him…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1879448"
msgid "Besides, #C236196003Jinako#CDEF is too much to handle.\nTo accompany the boundless depravity which is #C236196003Jinako#CDEF,\none has to have the domestic capability to\nattend to her every need;\nthe fortitude to keep cautioning her repeatedly;\nand be tolerant, like an older brother."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1879732"
msgid "To find a man like that would be quite―――hm?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1879780"
msgid "…hey. Why are you looking at me with\nthose wide eyes?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1879836"
msgid "Him, I can see HIM doing it…!\nThe figure of #C236196003Archer#CDEF, grumbling to himself\nwhile he cleans up after #C236196003Jinako#CDEF,\ncooks her meals, and gallantly takes care of her!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1880028"
msgid "Has a better couple ever existed?\nWell, now we HAVE to introduce them to one another.\nHey #C236196003Jinako#CDEF, it's me! Come marry my Servant!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1880176"
msgid "That's not being a lover,\nthat's being a caregiver!\nSince when did my class turn into \"Helper\"!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1880276"
msgid "Thanks to all this, my nerves really calmed down.\nLet's head to the Labyrinth and get this operation going."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1880384"
msgid "………………nothin'.\nI don't have the teensiest care in the world\nabout this lover strategy thing, like at all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1880496"
msgid "Ahh, the thing with #C236196003Jinako#CDEF…\nWhat other choice do we have? It's all we can\ndo right now to catch #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1880640"
msgid "It's a strategy that can take anyone who fits\nthe bill. This time around, #C236196003Jinako#CDEF fit. No deep\nmeaning to it, don't let it get to you."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1880792"
msgid "Doing this with Archer would've been great."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1880836"
msgid "Jeez… and here I was thought you were worried\nabout this strategy's chance of success.\nNo sweat, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1880940"
msgid "Your doubts are well warranted,\nbut #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF… well, AIs must not really\nhave a preference when it comes to gender."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1881076"
msgid "Puff up that modest chest and just take the\nrole of the man with dignity.\nThen everything will be A-OK."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1881180"
msgid "Probably the bit about puffing\nout my modest chest, I think?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1881244"
msgid "Hmm. Now that's an unexpected comeback.\nDid you get poisoned? Or have a fever?\nIs #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF getting to you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1881372"
msgid "Well, I'll give you points for hitting\nhard with that one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1881432"
msgid "Traveling together is typical for us, no one\nwould see us as lovers. Not much of a strategy\ndoing that. Make sense?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1881548"
msgid "#C236196003Archer#CDEF really opened up a can of worms\nafter saying \"anyone will do.\" \nSo, I think he could be a little\nmore courteous in helping me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1881700"
msgid "………………………………I think it's a great idea!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1881752"
msgid "*sigh*…\nYou're being a real pain today,\nfor whatever reason. Though, I guess…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1881832"
msgid "And as long as you are, I'll keep you safe.\n…so, any complaints?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1881900"
msgid "I got shot with something I never\nsaw coming, and I lost my breath.\nHe IS #RUBS  an Archer#RUBEa bowman#REND… He's trouble, he really is trouble."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1882048"
msgid "Switching emotional gears,\nI give my fevered cheeks a slap."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1882108"
msgid "…alright.\nLet's buckle down and catch #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF. Yeah."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1882184"
msgid "Test text. My Room, SG extra. Archer Version.\nIf you found this text, it's cause you were\ndigging through data! Well, here we are. -JS"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1882320"
msgid "You don't intend on secluding yourself in\nthis room, right? I'm ready to go when you are,\nMaster."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1882420"
msgid "Looks like #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF is fine and back\nto her normal self, but…\nFor the time being, give her some space."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1882544"
msgid "No woman would ever have the secrets of her\nmind revealed and leave in a good mood.\nDon't go rubbing salt into her wounds."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1882668"
msgid "Master. After our battles so far,\nhave you remembered anything?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1882732"
msgid "So long as there's conflict, there'll inevitably\nbe victims. It's natural to be anxious about it.\nLament and learn from it what you can."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1882872"
msgid "Things have take a turn for the strange, though,\nhuh. An old school in the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF?\nThere's such a thing as being too nostalgic."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1883032"
msgid "Let's put a lid on this fiasco and get back to\nthe Near Side of the Moon ASAP.\nGot it, Master? …Master?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1883140"
msgid "…haa. You may be thinking about your\nlost memories, but it's just a waste of time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1883224"
msgid "There's nothing we can do about the whole memory\nthing. Rather, aren't you lucky that you got to\nforget all of your many blunders?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1883356"
msgid "Well, so much so that it hurts to say out loud.\nShame there's not enough hours in a day to tell\nof you about how much I toiled."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1883484"
msgid "After all those times getting worked to the\nbone, I wake up and find myself in this #C000246204Far Side\nof the Moon#CDEF. Were my labors recognized?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1883636"
msgid "―――Hm. #C236196003Leo#CDEF and the other Masters were also\ndragged into this affair. Maybe there's a\nhigher power involved here?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1883768"
msgid "Wow. You look more like your old self now.\nYou always looked #[better][nicer]# with your chin\nup than with your head down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1883892"
msgid "Lost memories and experiences can be made up\nfor, and who knows? If we find a rhythm,\nour past might resurface."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1884004"
msgid "We should prioritize our return to the Near\nSide of the Moon. As your Servant, I'll get\nyou back into the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF. No worries."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1884156"
msgid "I'm surprised.\nWho expected #C236196003Archer#CDEF to say something like this?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1884236"
msgid "Only his clear yet sarcastic and patronizing\nwords linger in the memories I was able\nto hang onto."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1884336"
msgid "I see. The me in your memories seems to be a…\ncrude distortion of the truth.\nNot that it's \"wrong\" or anything."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1884452"
msgid "What is this feeling?\nM-my brain is vehemently rejecting those words!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1884524"
msgid "Hmph. Listen. A leopard can't change its spots.\nWith or without past memories,\nthe person you are deep down doesn't change."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1884648"
msgid "Even without memories, we're a team.\nWon't that suffice for now?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1884716"
msgid "After #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF comes #C236196003Rani VIII#CDEF, huh.\nShe doesn't seem to have an obsession for money,\nbut she looks tough in her own right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1884876"
msgid "Are we having what they call \"trouble with the\nladies\"? Whatever happens, don't be\ndiscouraged. This, Master, is war."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1884996"
msgid "\"Trouble with the ladies\" is an understatement.\nThis is a hormonal nightmare!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1885076"
msgid "Although my memory is hazy, I don't exactly\nfeel good about exposing the secrets of people\nI recognize."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1885180"
msgid "The feeling of guilt isn't the same as when it's\nexposing a male's secret. When I look at the ever-tough\n#C236196003Rin#CDEF, I feel it even more."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1885328"
msgid "Although we broke through it, it caused me great\nmental anguish. Maybe #C236196003BB#CDEF was right, it really is\na revolutionary firewall."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1885468"
msgid "Don't look so troubled, Master. I know you're\nas worried about #C236196003Rani#CDEF as you were about\n#C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1885600"
msgid "But, you haven't already forgotten\nour top priority, have you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1885664"
msgid "Break out of this school and return any and\nall survivors to the Near Side of the Moon.\nNaturally, that includes #C236196003Rani#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1885800"
msgid "The only one who can do that is\nthe one who can make contact with those #C000246204SGs#CDEF.\nYou. Isn't that right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1885916"
msgid "I'm opposed to seeing #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secrets,\nbut this isn't the time to be complaining."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1886016"
msgid "A firewall being a maiden's secrets?\nWhat a cumbersome security system. For an AI,\n#C236196003BB#CDEF has an interesting handle on people."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1886156"
msgid "\"#C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF,\" huh…?\nIf they're parts of #C236196003BB#CDEF, then they're\nguaranteed to be troublesome opponents."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1886288"
msgid "I was hoping we'd get back to Near Side by now,\nbut it looks like our return won't come so easy.\nThe #RUBS show#RUBEfight#REND must go on, I suppose."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1886440"
msgid "I thought with rescuing #C236196003Rani#CDEF, we would be able to\novercome the Labyrinth, but now a new enemy\nappeared, the \"#C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1886596"
msgid "Yeah. That program which forced affirmation towards #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1886668"
msgid "Now that he mentions it, #C236196003Archer#CDEF said he\n\"sees #C236196003BB#CDEF as the same type of girl as #C236196003Rin#CDEF.\"\nDoes he mean to admit that he has a type?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1886844"
msgid "I don't have a \"type\" per se, but… how should I\nput this: I feel a force compelling me to look\nafter people of a like nature to those girls."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1886988"
msgid "\"Compelling force,\" my foot."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1887020"
msgid "I get it. #C236196003Archer#CDEF likes those bossy girls\nbecause they'd push him around."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1887112"
msgid "I told you, that's not it!\nIf――if we WERE going to talk about what kind\nof people I like, I'd much prefer…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1887224"
msgid "――――Wait, hold on a second!\nHow did we get to this conversation!?\nYeah, I'll pass on this one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1887324"
msgid "I don't see anything good coming\nout of this conversation.\nI'd better plead the fifth for my own health."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1887432"
msgid "Jeez, it's like you enjoy pushing people around.\nWhen'd you get such a playful side, Master?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1887528"
msgid "…even without memories, you're still you.\nI just got a real good affirmation of that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1887616"
msgid "So, if you can run your mouth off this much,\nI can take it that you've got plenty of energy?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1887712"
msgid "Anyways, it's time you taught those #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF a\nlesson, isn't it? Don't play too rough, Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1887828"
msgid "Yeah. That program which forced affirmation towards #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1887900"
msgid "It almost feels like he had a better gauge\nof my wit in this conversation\nthan I first thought."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1887996"
msgid "Hahaha. Did I say something like that?\nYou're probably hallucinating from fatigue.\nI suggest you get good rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1888108"
msgid "……yep.\nThere's that feigned innocence I know and love.\nWell done, Gentleman Pervert."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1888196"
msgid "Hey, what's with the shameful pet name?\nReading into my Master's state of health is my\nbasic duty as your partner."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1888312"
msgid "I have NO ulterior motive. Besides, I doubt\nanyone would take what I said sexually if his or\nher mind wasn't in the gutter to begin with."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1888452"
msgid "Hey, wait a moment.\nDoes that include my… my weight… by any chance?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1888524"
msgid "Of course. Weight and body fat percentage do\naffect combat performance, so it's imperative\nthat we keep them in check."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1888644"
msgid "―――Hey, a chair!? Why are you lifting that\n chair!? AND you're swinging it arou―gwaggh!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1888740"
msgid "…the evil has been destroyed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1888772"
msgid "Prying to learn a woman's weight?\nI wouldn't be the first to imply that that\nwould make a person the lowest of the low."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1888892"
msgid "We don't have enough information on this\n\"#C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF.\" Proceed with caution, Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1888992"
msgid "I have to give credit to #C236196003BB#CDEF for her tenacity.\nShe knows how to keep her dominoes lined up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1889100"
msgid "#C236196003Archer#CDEF's right. With the way all these #C000246204Sentinels#CDEF\nkeep lining up to produce Labyrinths,\nI worry there'll be no end in sight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1889256"
msgid "Can we truly clear the Labyrinth and return to\nthe Near Side of the Moon once and for all?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1889348"
msgid "What makes you ask that, #C236196003Archer#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1889400"
msgid "Nothing. I'm simply chewing the fat.\nYou're in school, aren't you? I thought students\nall got kicks out of this particular topic."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1889532"
msgid "And how apt is this backdrop?\nWe're in a wooden building with an afterschool\natmosphere. Surely, I'm on the right track."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1889656"
msgid "That's #C236196003Archer#CDEF for you: stumbles on the\nbackpedal. A smile slips out of me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1889748"
msgid "It wouldn't hurt to play along for a bit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1889792"
msgid "Let's cut to the chase, shall we? Between\n#C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF, #C236196003Rani VIII#CDEF, and #C236196003Sakura Matou#CDEF,\nwho would you say is your type, Master?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1889964"
msgid "Hrmm. Looking at it from a strictly\ninnocent lens, I suppose I――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1890032"
msgid "Sakura"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1890040"
msgid "I have no preference."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1890064"
msgid "#C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF? She does seem perfect at a glance.\nIf this were a normal school setting, she'd be\nthat honor student whom everyone admires."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1890220"
msgid "She has to at least pretend to be friendly.\nThough, personally, I think she's way more\ncharming AFTER she lets her guard down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1890348"
msgid "Given her attitude, she wouldn't go easy on her\npartner, but working to win a girl like her\nmight be what spices your life."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1890472"
msgid "#C236196003Rani VIII#CDEF, eh?\nA girl whose worldly fashion\nand intellect are her charms."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1890564"
msgid "If one wants abundant wealth, SHE'LL make it\nhappen. She's the personification of thriftiness\nand management. Her one and only flaw is…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1890704"
msgid "Has to be in regards to her clothes, I'd say.\nI would want her to reconsider her peculiar\nstyle, but that's just me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1890824"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF? Ah, I see. Family oriented and meek.\nA \"Yamato Nadeshiko\" character to a \"T\";\nshe's the perfectly demure woman."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1890960"
msgid "She won't go on many exciting adventures and\nisn't good enough of an investor to amass a\nfortune. But there's merit to those points."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1891096"
msgid "Average wealth and average savings.\nShe has no outlining skills to speak of, instead\noffering you a quiet, easy life. However――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1891228"
msgid "Girls like her bottle their feelings easily.\nIf she's into you too, you need to give her\nthe right attention."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1891340"
msgid "Hm. You say none of these ladies line\nup with your aesthetic tastes?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1891412"
msgid "Hrmm. Looking at it from a strictly\ninnocent lens, I suppose I――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1891480"
msgid "I have no preference."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1891504"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF?\nSo young boys are your thing, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1891560"
msgid "He's got that upper class vibe, that intellect,\nthose handsome features, that money――!\nI mean, there's a lot to consider there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1891692"
msgid "Oh, I get it―― \"Only if he's handsome.\"\nHaha, no need to hide it from me. I don't put\nother folks' preferences on blast."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1891816"
msgid "Gah! He turned this against me――\nall with that smug grin on his face.\nThis Servant is not one to reckon with!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1891928"
msgid "Personally, I can't pinpoint a single aspect\nin him that a woman might like.\nHrm. Muscles, maybe? Just his muscles?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1892044"
msgid "Oh? Your flattery has improved.\nUnfortunately, this one's a swing and a miss.\nThat won't work on me this time, Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1892164"
msgid "Seriously. Super seriously. Giga-seriously."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1892208"
msgid "Alright. Sorry.\nThat's not something people tell\nme straight to my face all the time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1892296"
msgid "Maybe it's just me, but #C236196003Archer#CDEF looks\na little flushed behind the ears."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1892384"
msgid "That was a rather curious sight to see.\nLooks like he falls apart in the face\nof such direct approaches."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1892492"
msgid "I see. So you're still around that age where\ngirls dream of Prince Charming.\nActual men are just a pain to deal with."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1892612"
msgid "According to #C236196003Archer#CDEF, this \"nonsense\" conversation\nwe had proved itself a healthy diversion."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1892720"
msgid "In any day and age, people usually get excited\ntalking about their likes and dislikes, it seems."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1892820"
msgid "Though talking about who you like and dislike\nis best savored while you CAN choose people."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1892912"
msgid "There are Servants like me, who get summoned\nto a Master they can't refuse―no matter who\nthey are."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1893012"
msgid "…jeez, what do I call this?\nBeing politely patronizing, or what?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1893080"
msgid "This is a Servant who isn't ever honest\nabout his true feelings,\nbut I know he's kind―in his awkward way."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1893188"
msgid "Without verbalizing my gratitude for it, I savor the\nfortune of having gotten stuck with this Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1893292"
msgid "So we're going for #C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF's #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nShe's got this negativity we're not\nused to seeing. Let's go turn it positive."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1893444"
msgid "It's a shame that we lost #C236196003Leo#CDEF and #C236196003Julius#CDEF,\nbut we don't have the time to mourn over them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1893568"
msgid "For #C236196003Leo#CDEF and #C236196003Julius#CDEF' sake, we MUST\nget everyone safely back to the Near Side―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1893684"
msgid "That'll do. But getting overeager on\nyour own won't. You've got allies fighting\nby your side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1893780"
msgid "You were named the new President. One of your\nduties is utilizing your subordinates well.\nDon't shoulder all the responsibility alone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1893916"
msgid "Your comrades share in your failures and\nsuccesses. Come on. Even if we blunder,\nthe girls will still follow us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1894032"
msgid "Looks like you were able to cheer up.\nAlright, how about we go tackle the Labyrinth\nagain?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1894124"
msgid "I still can't believe you're the new President.\nAn odd choice out of #C236196003Leo#CDEF. I guess this means\nthat boy changed in coming to the Far Side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1894280"
msgid "She has none of the weaknesses our previous\nenemies had. Flawless in both ability and mind,\nwe're facing the perfect #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1894424"
msgid "I absent-mindedly nod to what #C236196003Archer#CDEF is saying."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1894488"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF is definitely a tough enemy.\nBut more importantly, right now I'm―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1894588"
msgid "…you're wondering about #C236196003BB#CDEF.\nIt's written all over your face."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1894668"
msgid "Like #C236196003Archer#CDEF says―in all honesty,\nI've been worried about how #C236196003BB#CDEF was acting."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1894780"
msgid "She always has her usual enthusiasm.\nI can't knock her for anything there, but―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1894868"
msgid "…geez. What are you, a philanthropist?\nYou must have a lot of free time if you're\nworrying about your enemy's leader."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1894988"
msgid "Listen, Master.\nIf you pay your enemy any mind, you'll\njeopardize your life by an equal amount."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1895084"
msgid "If you fully understand that, yet still make\nthose remarks, then I have nothing to else\nto say. Do so at your own risk."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1895204"
msgid "…although, this wouldn't be such a pain\nfor me if you were a Master who\nlistened like an adult."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1895304"
msgid "I'm sure anything I say will be pointless.\nDo whatever you want. …discussing #C236196003BB#CDEF may even\nyield some insight, who knows."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1895444"
msgid "Either way, I'll do my job and that's it. I'll\nwalk with you―fight by you―wherever your wish\ntakes us. That's the kind of promise we have."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1895588"
msgid "We're taking a break, right?\nWe don't have long, but get some good rest.\nThis Labyrinth is a tough one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1895692"
msgid "The world is on the fast track to doomsday,\nyet you can still look so determined."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1895776"
msgid "…honestly speaking, all we can even do right\nnow is struggle. The gods must be looking at us\nlike, \"now this is just disgraceful.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1895908"
msgid "But insistent defiance is what humans do.\nYou're fine the way you are. We fight and gain\nknowing that suffering comes with it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1896036"
msgid "…you haven't changed since you first\nsummoned me. You never give up. That's\n#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF's strongest weapon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1896164"
msgid "Okay, let's go, Master.\nLet's get this fight underway the\nsame way you always do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1896248"
msgid "Whether we like it or not, this is the\nfinal layer. Make sure to tie up any loose ends."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1896336"
msgid "Yep, these clothes are still the very best.\nIt even feels nostalgic."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1896408"
msgid "After saying that, #C236196003Archer#CDEF let out a deep\nsigh of relief."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1896484"
msgid "I thought he looked #[amusing][funny]#, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1896532"
msgid "Then maybe I should ask #C236196003Sakura#CDEF to remake\nsomething like that for my Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1896624"
msgid "Come on, don't be shy.\nHave a taste of that #[amusement][funniness]# yourself.\nLaugh enough to get a headache and pass out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1896748"
msgid "I apologize. I spoke out of line.\nI respectfully decline."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1896808"
msgid "Something so fashionable is right up #C236196003Archer#CDEF's alley.\nA chicken like me simply could never look good in that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1896936"
msgid "See, now you get it.\nThose clothes had a conflict between being\nshameful and stirring curiosity."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1897036"
msgid "Anytime you feel like it, I can put it on.\nLet's just say that I won't flat out say \"no.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1897128"
msgid "He really did take a little liking to those clothes…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1897184"
msgid "A swimsuit, huh?\nI never did have many chances to wear one…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1897248"
msgid "――― #RUBS  Ya wanna do it?#RUBEYa ra na i ka#REND?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1897304"
msgid "You're insipid. Do you always react like that\nwhen skin starts showing? How about giving me\nan original joke once in a while?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1897432"
msgid "At some point, #C236196003Archer#CDEF―presently criticizing me―came to\nbe gripping his twin swords in his hands."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1897548"
msgid "Still, bikini swimwear…?\nI'm personally more of a boxers kind of guy…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1897620"
msgid "The two of us are alone in My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1897656"
msgid "Before me is a Servant with\na nice body wearing a bulging bikini."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1897724"
msgid "#RUBS    HE ☆ N ☆ TA ☆ I  da#RUBEIT'S☆A☆PER☆VERT#REND―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1897792"
msgid "Police, we've got a fine #RUBS  HENTAI#RUBEPERVERT#REND here!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1897856"
msgid "I'm not doing anything to be treated like a\npervert for! Look at it, all you should be\nseeing is a normal swimsuit and my iron abs!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1897988"
msgid "All I see is a #RUBS HEN ☆  TAI#RUBEPER☆VERT#REND.\nIt's so important, I'll say it again:\nA #RUBS HEN ☆  TAI#RUBEPER☆VERT#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1898120"
msgid "*kgh*… You're going to push it that far?\nThen there's only one thing I can do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1898200"
msgid "I'll keep wearing it―――intentionally.\nI'll fulfill my duty as your Servant\njust as well. While wearing this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1898312"
msgid "H-his masculinity is something else.\nI didn't want to make him show it off\nat a time like this…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1898412"
msgid "Well, personally, I would've liked boxers.\nThe only advantage bikini swimwear has\nis less water friction."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1898520"
msgid "I haven't worn clothes like this in a while.\nI'm not letting my guard down, but I can't\nhelp but feel like I'm #RUBS  on holiday#RUBEoff today#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1898672"
msgid "Above, he's wearing a black T-shirt;\nbelow, black slacks. And over his face―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1898756"
msgid "Are those… glasses…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1898780"
msgid "Yeah, they're just for show, though. No\nprescription. I was thinking this would be nice\nto wear now and again… something wrong?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1898912"
msgid "Well, I never really imagined #C236196003Archer#CDEF\nwith glasses, so it surprised me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1899000"
msgid "Seeing him in this, he gives a noticeably different impression.\nHe looks like the neighborhood student everyone looks up to,\nwho's repeating the year in college."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1899164"
msgid "Repeating the year, huh? Doesn't sound so bad.\nOne year―if I had that time to reexamine\nmyself, I would try a bit more to―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1899296"
msgid "No, it's not important. Enough fantasizing. That\naside, if you get skinny repeats, then your\ncountry has an effective educational system."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1899436"
msgid "You look Japanese for sure, but I thought the\nJapanese government was wiped out. Which means,\nyou emigrated to Western Europe?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1899564"
msgid "No, I can't recall anything around that time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1899612"
msgid "The kind of life I lead on Earth before joining\nthe #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF―――\nI can't recall the memories of it as of yet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1899748"
msgid "Ah. But hey, if this outfit is familiar to you,\nyou may come from the same place. Who knows,\nmaybe the one repeating years was you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1899880"
msgid "Gah… Now that he mentions it,\nI'm starting to feel like it might be the case…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1899960"
msgid "Glasses―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1899976"
msgid "Sacred items that can boast of having\ntremendous support from some women."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1900052"
msgid "These revered objects are pretty much microcosms in and of\nthemselves. On various levels, it would be no exaggeration to\nsay they're on par with Anti-World Noble Phantasms."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1900228"
msgid "People sum up characters wearing glasses as \"glasses characters,\"\nbut there are various lines drawn in THIS sand.\nFirst, characters who always wear glasses:\nthe definition of the character changes greatly\ndepending on whether they take them off or not.\nWe'll leave this for the next lecture,\nso be sure to jot this down somewhere in your #RUBS  notes#RUBEmemory#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1900596"
msgid "At any rate, the profundity of glasses\nalone can make all sorts of fantasies possible.\nWhen characters who always\nwear glasses take them off: First Impact.\nWhen characters who normally\ndon't wear glasses do: Second Impact.\nFinally, when characters who normally\ndon't wear glasses take them off: THIRD IMPACT―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1900912"
msgid "Hey, Master!\nWhat are you looking at!?\nI mean, where is your MIND at right now!!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1900996"
msgid "It kind of feels like my mind drifted\noff to an all too distant utopia…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1901072"
msgid "…thank goodness. You good now, Master?\nI was worried for a second there. I was even\ngetting ready to see a game over screen."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1901200"
msgid "I was also a little worried about what might happen.\nI can't believe a single pair of glasses riled me up this much."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1901320"
msgid "Hrm… If it's going to be this mentally\ndraining for you, then best not to wear\nthem from now on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1901420"
msgid "No! Please wear them!\nI mean, without them you'll lose 90 percent charisma!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1901496"
msgid "If it takes a measly #C000246204Command Seal#CDEF\nto have you wear them from now on, fine by me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1901596"
msgid "I'm begging you,\nplease don't spend a #C000246204Command Seal#CDEF\non something like that…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1901688"
msgid "I'm your Servant.\nIf you order me to wear them or take them off,\nI'll go along with it. So, um…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1901788"
msgid "Can you relax a bit? Your reaction is so far\ndifferent than back with the restraints\nthat I just don't how to deal with this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1901916"
msgid "Sure, it does feel like I upped my heart rate for no reason."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1901980"
msgid "I can sense my #RUBSghost#RUBEsoul#REND whispering to me,\nto speak a little more on the profundity of glasses―\nbut let's call it a day for now…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1902128"
msgid "So this is that Heroic Spirit's Root Mystic\nCode… his primordial form. I'm a hero without\na name. I figured I had no origin, but―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1902264"
msgid "I get it. This isn't a Heroic Spirit from the\npast, but one who gets defined in the future.\nNo wonder I've never seen this Mystic Code."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1902400"
msgid "This isn't who I was in my lifetime;\nthis seems to be my form from when I finally\nbecome a Guardian."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1902504"
msgid "These are the feelings of the countless unheard\nmade manifest, though I think it's a bit over\nthe top. Wearing this, I don't get to lose."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1902644"
msgid "Hey, you have a second, Master?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1902676"
msgid "You know that rare enemy we fought in the\nLabyrinth recently?\nThey're dangerous opponents to be taking on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1902784"
msgid "One wrong move and we could end up dead.\nThere's no need to voluntarily\nexpose ourselves to any more danger."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1902896"
msgid "Your top priority is getting back to the\nNear Side of the Moon. Please don't forget it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1902984"
msgid "…that said, if that were enough to get you\nsettled down and focused,\nthen I wouldn't be here suffering."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1903092"
msgid "This Servant opens his mouth and all that ever comes out is sass.\nStill, #[I guess it shows][that does mean]# he's worried about me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1903228"
msgid "In any case, watch out for those rare enemies.\nI expect you to make wise decisions, Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1903320"
msgid "His awkwardness manages to get a giggle out of me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1903372"
msgid "Well, yeah.\nThe way he's acting is weird to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1903420"
msgid "I didn't expect to see him worry over me so much.\nIt kind of just made me feel all fuzzy inside."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1903520"
msgid "Hm? What's the matter, Master?\nYour face is flushed. Do you have a fever?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1903596"
msgid "I mean, when he stands right next to me and acts like THIS,\nit's bad for my heart―both as a person and as a girl!\nI want him to stop it already!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1903744"
msgid "…it's not like I'm doing this because\nI want to. I have to do what I have to do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1903828"
msgid "Now I feel like I just went and said something mean.\nBut who can blame me? I'm just not used to this.\n(Also, he'll probably never seem natural acting like this.)"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1903992"
msgid "Anyway, for the sake of my foulmouthed worrywart of a Servant,\nI'll be more careful about encountering rare enemies."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1904112"
msgid "This takes the cake.\nSeriously? You beat ALL the rare enemies?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1904176"
msgid "They say faith can move mountains, but your\nperseverance is stunning. I'll be just be\nhonest and congratulate you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1904292"
msgid "You did a great job making it out of that high-\nrisk battle. For your efforts and skill, you\nhave my respect. There, I congratulated you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1904432"
msgid "Hm? What, you expected me to give you a gift?\nSo sorry, but souvenirs from the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF\ndon't reach the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1904596"
msgid "I bet #C236196003Andersen#CDEF will sing praises of you:\n\"Busting your own chops in vain for naught―\nThat's gamer brain for you!\" and whatnot."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1904740"
msgid "…although, ending it like this isn't very\ninteresting for me as a Servant, either."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1904824"
msgid "I figured this might happen, so I prepared a\nreward in case you ever went above and beyond.\nIt's not much, but be happy."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "1904948"
msgid "Perfect Battles:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1904968"
msgid "That battle a while ago was a perfect victory,\nwasn't it? Is your intuition on point again,\nor is the system on this side just easy?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1905104"
msgid "Well, whichever it is, it's a welcome outcome.\nNo need to fuss over perfect victories,\nbut I will ask that you keep leading me well."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "1905240"
msgid "Perfect Battles:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1905260"
msgid "Hey, about some of our battle records.\nAre you one of those perfectionists?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1905336"
msgid "I'm seeing an odd number of shutout victories.\nIt's very unlikely that any normal person\ncould achieve these numbers."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1905456"
msgid "Don't tell me―did you contract some weird virus\nwhile I wasn't looking? No, wait. I would never\njeopardize your health as long as I live…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1905596"
msgid "Although, sure.\nI try to get as many perfect victories as possible…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1905668"
msgid "…ahh, so this is because of our previous chat.\nI thought I said not to fuss over this.\nYou get stubborn over the strangest things."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1905800"
msgid "Although, stubbornness alone doesn't get you\nstats like these. You're mediocre as a magus,\nbut you have an expert's eye for combat."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1905932"
msgid "True. My Master is adequate. However,\nthat means that if we lose, it's going to be\nbecause this Servant was too weak, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1906060"
msgid "I don't want to be losing to you.\nI'm going to concentrate and not let\nyour direction one-up me, Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1906168"
msgid "Just to be sure, just in case,\nI want to ask something…\nAre you doing this on purpose?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1906256"
msgid "I only took all that damage because you lack\nexperience. You made a few mistakes.\nJust be careful next time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1906368"
msgid "Although, I think this'll be the same story\nwhen you get your memories back. I guess the\njoke here is that it was always like this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1906500"
msgid "He doesn't seem to be taking a liking to the\namount of damage he's been dealt.\nAs per usual, he was circuitous about stating it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1906632"
msgid "…which means, as the inexperienced Master here,\nthere's only one thing to do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1906712"
msgid "Whaaaaat? Nah, c'mon, man.\nMy Servant is always doubting me, man.\nHehehehehehehe."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1906796"
msgid "…I'm trusting you, Master.\nPlease, try to battle normally. We don't gain\nanything from me taking damage."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1906904"
msgid "It hurts to see him complaining in silence."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1906948"
msgid "…well, I know what he's on about\neven if he doesn't verbalize it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1907016"
msgid "'cause if you don't, then there must also be no\nreason why I've been taking all this damage.\nThis is well beyond mere coincidence."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1907148"
msgid "Well, sure, maybe his total damage taken is a\ntiny bit higher than it should be,\nbut also maybe not…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1907252"
msgid "It's a lot. Way too much!\nDo you have any idea how much damage\nyou've made me take so far?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1907344"
msgid "Hm, let's see―――.\nBased on my napkin-math… around #VAL083."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1907408"
msgid "Wha―――That's the exact value! I knew it!\nYou're having a yourself a great time making me\ntake all this damage―on purpose!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1907536"
msgid "Having myself a great time? Now that's just disrespectful.\nI did nothing more than test his endurance.\nLike what they do in the F-1."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1907672"
msgid "I am most definitely NOT getting some\npayback for my lovable Servant's sassy mouth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1907756"
msgid "Tsk. Here we go with the F-1…\nYou're pushing my buttons is what it is…\nCan't deny it's \"an endurance test,\" though…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1907876"
msgid "From now on, every time I take damage, it's a\ntactical failure on your part. Each time,\nI'll add a smidgen more salt to your food."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1908008"
msgid "So you know, a \"smidgen\" is as much as one\ncan hold between my thumb and index finger.\nIt's less than a pinch. Remember that well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1908140"
msgid "If this continues… you'll learn first hand the\nconsequences. Heh… high blood pressure hurts."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1908236"
msgid "From now on, every time I take damage, it's a\ntactical failure on your part. Each time, I'll\nup the calorie count of your food a bit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1908372"
msgid "Just so you know, \"zero-calorie\" doesn't\nactually mean there are 0 calories."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1908452"
msgid "Happy food is followed by the demon of weight…\nHeh… I'll send you to a nightmare where you'll\nscream at the mere sight of a weight scale."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1908592"
msgid "What a terrifying counterattack…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1908628"
msgid "No one would ever even THINK of this\nunless they had superior housekeeping skills!\nWhat an absurdly petty attack!!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1908744"
msgid "It's not petty, it's thoughtful!\n…alright, all jokes aside.\nPlease be more considerate of me, Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1908848"
msgid "If I take damage as a joke and can't protect my\nMaster when it counts most, I'll die with pure\nregret. Then I'll come back to haunt you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1908988"
msgid "From now on, I'll be as careful as I can."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1909032"
msgid "Hm. You not only use skills, but frequently\nitems too. You have a well-balanced\nfighting style."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1909128"
msgid "Items are our lifeline in a pinch. Make it\na habit to check your inventory before you\nattack anything in the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1909248"
msgid "Hm… I did say to use items frequently,\nbut still, aren't you using up a tad\nmuch, Master?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1909340"
msgid "Use when appropriate, but save when you can\nmanage without. I think any first-rate Master\nshould be capable of doing that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1909464"
msgid "I'm getting the slight sense that…\n#C236196003Archer#CDEF may actually be quite the family man."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1909564"
msgid "You could've just said \"knows how to\nbalance a budget.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1909620"
msgid "You're spending all your wealth to brute-force\nyour way through battles… Reminds me of a\ncertain #C236196003Archer#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1909744"
msgid "A fighting style revolving around blowing\nthrough all your cash… huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1909816"
msgid "I would like to try that out sometime,\nbut I just don't have enough savings.\nLet's rethink how we're using our items."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1909936"
msgid "Still, it's not often that one finds a common\nServant capable of balancing a budget."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1910024"
msgid "What a coincidence. I was also thinking about\nhow blessed I am to have such a run-of-the-mill,\n\"extraordinary\" Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1910144"
msgid "Damn him… He always has a comeback…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1910184"
msgid "But hey, it is actually pretty fun to chat with\na sarcastic Servant. I'll give him that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1910276"
msgid "Man. I was wondering what we were doing\nfrantically searching around the Labyrinth.\nSo, rare items, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1910384"
msgid "And now we've obtained a fair number of them.\nNever knew my Master was such a collector.\nI think we've been through this before…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1910516"
msgid "No, it's not fair to talk about events from the \nNear Side. Rare enemies are one thing,\nbut rare items are a plus in combat."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1910644"
msgid "Get more if you have time to spare, just don't\nhurt yourself. Also, make sure to slip me any\nrare weapons under the counter."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1910772"
msgid "We made it this far, so I've got nothing\ncynical left to say."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1910836"
msgid "You gathered ALL these rare items…?\nRather, I should be telling you off for\ncollecting in the middle of that one battle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1910960"
msgid "Your passion for going all-in on these rare\nitems is genuine and pure.\nLet me give you some applause."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1911064"
msgid "Well, to be frank, I kind of like collecting\ntoo. That said, I never collected rare things.\nAlways junk."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1911172"
msgid "Now that I mention that,\nthere's some stuff I left unfixed, didn't I――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1911248"
msgid "For some reason, I can't bring myself to call his attention.\nSo, let's leave our conversation at that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1911352"
msgid "I went into the room to rest when I felt a strange gaze behind\nme. Needless to say, it's #C236196003Caster#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1911468"
msgid "Normally she would get up and\ncome over to talk about whatever,\nbut today it looks like she's fed up about something."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1911588"
msgid "…this is bad.\nNow she just straight up said her sound effect.\nI'm afraid of what will happen if I ignore her.\nI ready myself and break the ice\nby saying to #C236196003Caster#CDEF, \"What?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1911780"
msgid "Oh? Saying \"What?\" also counts as a weak\nway of arguing with me, doesn't it?\nMy sadistic side is about to stir up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1911896"
msgid "Perhaps, Darling,\nyou have feelings of guilt over something?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1911960"
msgid "Feelings of guilt…?\nI wonder what's she talking about…\nI can't think of anything in particular."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1912060"
msgid "But have no fear. I, #C236196003Caster#CDEF, shall take any\namount of physical damage for my Darling\nand be totally fine! Though it does hurt!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1912204"
msgid "If you can't think of what to feel guilty over,\nthen let's have you listen and I tell you―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1912300"
msgid "Frankly, Darling? About the people you've\nbeen associating with recently.\nIsn't there a biiitttt too much variance?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1912416"
msgid "Worrying about #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF is fine,\nbut what kind of honest Master would care\nabout #RUBS     Oppai Monster#RUBEthat O-P-M#REND?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1912580"
msgid "It's like, there's too much STUFF I have to\nprotect you from! Next time, please try as hard\nas you can to flat out ignore her!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1912708"
msgid "She gives a \"hmph.\" She really does hate her now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1912760"
msgid "Sure, I wasn't able to deal with\n#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF very level-headedly.\nBut―――\nIf #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF are fine,\nthen what's so bad about #C236196003Lip#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1912956"
msgid "Huh? W-well, you know, she's our enemy, right?\nThis time, I could say that #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF\nare merely side dishes in comparis―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1913116"
msgid "#C236196003Caster#CDEF is awfully antagonistic towards #C236196003Lip#CDEF.\n…this is unusual.\nThough #C236196003Caster#CDEF IS scathing towards anyone\nbesides her Master, her M.O. is more like:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1913312"
msgid "\"Well, as long as they don't enter my sight, whatever.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1913368"
msgid "I would expect her to ignore them, that easily."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1913416"
msgid "She despises people similar to her?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1913452"
msgid "Is it true that she's a woman of curses?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1913496"
msgid "No curse can absorb bust size, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1913540"
msgid "Don't lump me in with her!\nSure, I'm a little yan, a little dere,\nbut not as shameless as she―――oops!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1913648"
msgid "She covers her mouth with her hand\non account of her blunder, but it's too late now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1913736"
msgid "…like #C236196003Andersen#CDEF said, #C236196003Caster#CDEF and #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF\nseem to share the same sort of characteristics."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1913876"
msgid "Huh? #C236196003Andersen#CDEF? He says I'm the same type\nof woman as #C236196003Lip#CDEF ? \"But her chest has\nto get mercy ruled out (LMAO)\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1914020"
msgid "#C236196003Caster#CDEF trembles with rage,\nclenching her fists tightly saying, \"grrr.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1914108"
msgid "She can't dance around this fact anymore,\nthat she's the type who puts curses on others."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1914200"
msgid "I won't be absorbing anything.\nI'm not jealous.\nHer pointlessly large size is fine as it is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1914296"
msgid "…actually, Darling. Am I right in thinking\nthat you're just teasing me, already knowing\nthe reason why I hate #C236196003Lip#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1914428"
msgid "#C236196003Caster#CDEF casts a fussy glance at me with\nher brow wrinkled, letting off an annoyed \"hmmm.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1914536"
msgid "…I'm sorry. I regret the teasing…\nStill, like #C236196003Andersen#CDEF said,\nthere's no doubt that she and #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF\nhave the same sort of characteristics."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1914712"
msgid "………*sigh*.\nYEAH, it's true. YEAH, I can't talk my way\nout of it, I'm a land mine kind of woman."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1914812"
msgid "Usually, my cover's blown and I get dumped or\nmy true nature slips and I run away on my own,\nso sometimes my own preferences scare me…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1914948"
msgid "But I'm repentant for it, see? That's why this\ntime, I turned over a new leaf and was as\npure a #C236196003Tamamo#CDEF as I could be for Darling…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1915096"
msgid "That tiddy monster! She thinks nothing of your\nloving wife and so long as you don't get caught,\nit's a-okay in her book if you jump her!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1915236"
msgid "I'd forgive you if you had #C236196003Rin#CDEF or #C236196003Rani#CDEF for\ndessert up to three times, but THAT woman I\nwon't allow! My dark side is about to awaken!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1915404"
msgid "Maybe it's a hatred for her own kind sort of thing.\nThen, maybe #C236196003Caster#CDEF's #C000246204SG#CDEF is―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1915524"
msgid "…I want to be with the person I like.\nI want to stand by my love. Otherwise, I can't\nhelp but feel sad, so sad―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1915644"
msgid "It's a tender #C000246204SG#CDEF, fit for a good wife\nwho waits long and wholeheartedly\nfor her husband's return."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1915760"
msgid "…teehee.\nSaying it out loud like this is kind\nof embarrassing鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1915828"
msgid "#C236196003Caster#CDEF acts silly, sticking her tongue out embarrassingly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1915904"
msgid "―――This is bad.\nThe moment she made that gesture,\nI couldn't help but feel something stir inside me―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1916016"
msgid "What the―!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1916032"
msgid "This is―――her #C000246204SG#CDEF, reacting!?\nBy calling out her resemblance to #C236196003Lip#CDEF,\nit seems I was able to acquire #C236196003Caster#CDEF's secret."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "1916200"
msgid "SG, \"Monopolizing Desire\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1916228"
msgid "…\"Monopolizing Desire\"… Well what do we have here…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1916284"
msgid "「Among the many #C000246204SGs#CDEF, this one is an A-Rank hazard.\n  She wants her heart's desire to be only hers.\n  In other words, she wants a monopoly.\n  Anyone who may get in her way, she deems a nuisance,\n  and curses them to death―――Such is this fiendish #C000246204SG#CDEF.」"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1916572"
msgid "Kya☆\nI can't believe Darling found out!\nOh, how embarrassed #C236196003Tamamo#CDEF is鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1916664"
msgid "…this is just terrifying…\nTender? More like a tenderizer of an #C000246204SG#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1916752"
msgid "But… if this is the case, then one simple question\ncomes to mind."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1916820"
msgid "Then, what would happen if I cheated on you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1916868"
msgid "I'd kill, of course鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1916892"
msgid "I'd kill鷙 So please, be very careful not\nto let that happen, okay? If it does, I cannot\nguarantee what will seriously go down鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1917024"
msgid "…I didn't have the courage to ask if she\nwould kill the cheater's partner\nor the cheater themselves. I was too scared to ask."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1917152"
msgid "All I can do now is stop inquiring any further into this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1917212"
msgid "I engrave these two details into my heart,\nthen cheerfully leave My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1917288"
msgid "P-please don't respond to questions I didn't ask!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1917340"
msgid "Could―could this be\nthe feminine powers of a #ROFS0003#RUBS   yandere#RUBEcurse user#REND…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1917436"
msgid "I feel hungry all of a sudden."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1917468"
msgid "Food isn't required when you have a digital body.\nI'm supplied with all the energy I need\nto maintain myself by merely being inside the #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1917632"
msgid "Maybe this is an after-effect of #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF's food."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1917700"
msgid "I normally don't think about food,\nbut for some odd reason, now I can't help but be interested."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1917796"
msgid "That's the \"make\" I'm talking about."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1917836"
msgid "When we were dealing with #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF,\n#C236196003Caster#CDEF spoke about taking cooking classes.\nTruth is, I was curious about that,\nand before I knew it, I became aware of my empty stomach."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1918044"
msgid "Understood! I figured you may ask at some point,\nso I'll just grab this bento from #C236196003Sakura#CDEF I was\nsecretly keeping―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1918180"
msgid "W-well, but home meals take time; how your\nstomach fares is a HUGE deal; does my fortune\nshow bad luck or gap coverage for my Zodiac―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1918316"
msgid "To put this bluntly, how about we meet\nhalfway and settle for a mapo tofu bowl at\nthe Commissary? I don't want to cooook!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1918440"
msgid "If your reputation for being a good-wife Servant\nisn't a big fat lie, then I want you to show me\nsome smarts and some sweets!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1918568"
msgid "Urk―guhhh…!\nThat gaze―it's pure anticipation!\nH-how can I feel anything but thrilled…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1918660"
msgid "…*sigh*. Actually, I wanted to improve a bit\nbefore I treated you, but how can I turn you\ndown when you straight ask me to make food?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1918796"
msgid "It slips my mind from time to time,\nbut #RUBS   Casters#RUBEMagicians#REND are one hell of a class.\nShe seems to be pretty good with stuff like remodeling,\nwhich she did a little with My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1918992"
msgid "Thank you for waiting.\nThough hurried, I put my whole heart and soul,\nmy absolute max into this endeavor!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1919100"
msgid "With this, #C236196003Caster#CDEF brought a small table to serve on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1919172"
msgid "On the menu is…\nwhite rice and clam miso soup,\ngrilled Saikyo-style mackerel,\nsimmered pumpkin tossed with minced chicken and Ankake sauce,\nand chopped Daikon salad with plum sauce."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1919356"
msgid "#C236196003Caster#CDEF's expression is devoid of confidence.\n…I also get a little nervous,\nwith her making that face at me and all,\nbut this doesn't look so bad. It's incredible, actually."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1919548"
msgid "It's not flashy, but it all harmonizes―\nIt reminds me of a beautiful Japanese garden."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1919636"
msgid "Anyway, I need to start digging in.\nI put my hands together and thank her for the food,\nthen bring some bites to my mouth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1919760"
msgid "―――How do I put this?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1919788"
msgid "The seasoning and doneness of the grilled Saikyo-style\nmackerel is good enough for me.\nThe outside is crispy and fragrant, and the meat is sweet,\nsoft, and flaky."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1919952"
msgid "The simmered pumpkin tossed with minced chicken\nand Ankake sauce is good too.\nNot only was the pumpkin simmered carefully,\nthe minced chicken and Ankake sauce were also prepared simple,\nmaking it a superb, a la carte dish."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1920176"
msgid "The crisp and packed Daikon salad is delicious\nand serves to cleanse the palate of the main dish's sweetness.\nThe plum sauce makes it even more refreshing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1920332"
msgid "This is Japanese cooking with an \"autumn\" theme.\nOne would assume #C236196003Caster#CDEF to be a person who goes big to show off,\nbut her true nature clearly shows in her quietly\nattentive personality―when it comes to the little details."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1920572"
msgid "…I-I knew it was lacking…\nI've been polishing my skills every day since I\nmade my contract with you, Master, yet…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1920692"
msgid "I apologize for not meeting your expectations.\n…I've been exposed as a poor cook…\nThis, too, is an #C000246204SG#CDEF, isn't it…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1920828"
msgid "#C236196003Caster#CDEF's shoulders droop as if apologizing\nfrom the bottom of her heart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1920920"
msgid "According to her, her second #C000246204SG#CDEF is apparently \"Poor Cook.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1920996"
msgid "I faintly remember that back in the Near Side's #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF,\n#C236196003Caster#CDEF was frantically trying to memorize the\n\"five fundamental culinary seasonings.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1921180"
msgid "Which means, she didn't even know the basics not too long ago.\nI think going from that to making this level of food\nis incredible progress…"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1921324"
msgid "Do you hate yourself for being a poor cook?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1921368"
msgid "It's not her cooking skill that makes her sad,\nit's being unable to bring joy to her Master…\n#C236196003Caster#CDEF is despondent, claiming herself\nto have failed as a good-wife."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1921548"
msgid "…what do I make of that?\nIsn't that line of thinking itself proof that\nshe's a good wife?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1921640"
msgid "Umm, did it not suit your tastes? If so,\nthe next time I can make, uhh… French? I'll\ntry my hand at Diavolo-style or something…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1921772"
msgid "I flatly refuse, then finish #C236196003Caster#CDEF's food, as is good manners."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1921852"
msgid "……………………*sigh*.\nWhat's the matter with me…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1921908"
msgid "Everyone's morale has gone up since we got that\nMythical Mystic Code, so what's worrying her…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1922004"
msgid "That Mystic Code IS the problem! We have a way\nto counter #C236196003BB#CDEF, yay♪―and all that jazz,\nbut think about it! This means…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1922144"
msgid "………no, never mind.\nI just need to be strong and deal with it,\nand that'll be the end of that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1922244"
msgid "Alright, Darling. Over here鷙\nAren't you tired? Toss your trifles into a dark\ncorner and come get some good rest鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1922360"
msgid "…#C236196003Caster#CDEF insists that it's nothing,\nand I find that suspicious,\nbut I also don't sense any ulterior motive."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1922484"
msgid "#C236196003Caster#CDEF let something slip out just now,\nand I think it was something that she really wants to hide.\nI think pressing her on it would prove me a failure\nof a Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1922668"
msgid "Our final battle is at hand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1922700"
msgid "Let's take up #C236196003Caster#CDEF's advice and get some rest.\nThen we'll go back to the old school and get ready―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1922824"
msgid "#C080080080\n―――Suddenly, I'm moving backwards.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1922880"
msgid "#C080080080It creeped on as I laid down to close my eyes.\nWithin a light dream, I meet a thin mist or wall\nof water as it drizzles down from a sunny sky.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1923040"
msgid "Oh, yes… You intended to descry your future.\nInstead, your past is now on display. Hm…\nLooking closer, it does pique my interest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1923172"
msgid "#C080080080\nThe light is bright enough to burn my eyes.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1923236"
msgid "#C080080080It's dazzling so, I can't open my eyes.\nThe air is humid.\nLight flickers through a thick veil of fog.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1923356"
msgid "…ake. Hearken to me, flea. Shall you not wake?\nYou stand in my presence. Shall it prove wise\nto forgo pleading for your life?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1923484"
msgid "#C080080080\n――――A familiar voice provokes a squint.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1923548"
msgid "#C080080080Did the lights dim, or have my eyes simply\nadjusted? A sweet voice invites me to open\nmy eyes.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1923660"
msgid "#C080080080There, I see――#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1923696"
msgid "Well, well! At last, you wake! Now, come near.\nKnow that I may obliterate you at a whim.\nYou'd do well to flatter me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1923816"
msgid "I can't believe what I'm seeing.\nThis place is a far step from reality."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1923888"
msgid "I want to pinch myself to see if I wake,\nbut I can't manage a single blink,\nlet alone a budge of a finger."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1923996"
msgid "I'm inside a giant, truly unfamiliar structure.\nA shrine, maybe? No. Judging by the ornate\nwall decor, one might call it a palace."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1924128"
msgid "The air here is laden with #ROFS-016#RUBSmagical energy#RUBEether#REND,\nunfamiliar to a digital Magi, but anyone with\na modicum of intellect knows one thing:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1924288"
msgid "That this is an inviolable, sacred ground――\na demonic temple from whence no souls return,\nfor they are surely devoured."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1924412"
msgid "Speak ill, and I shall churn you with a breath.\nTurn away, and I shall raze you with a look.\nOho! A horrible death awaits either way."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1924548"
msgid "And, the depths of this primordial,\ndemonic temple harbor something unimaginable."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1924632"
msgid "She appears as a woman of unrivaled beauty.\nAs if she knew her looks could kill,\nshe looks on with a murderous expression."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1924756"
msgid "I see a vortex of magical energy behind her.\nA golden array of lights, like that of the Sun,\nsways behind her like tails."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1924880"
msgid "If this place is a sanctum, then the being\nresiding here must be a Divine Spirit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1924964"
msgid "Only, she is different――neither Divine nor\nHeroic, she is a merciless Great Monster that\nabhors humanity with all her being.\nShe could kill #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF with a look."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1925152"
msgid "…I can't so much as muster a blink.\nOne unmannered movement and I run the risk\nof being scorched with nary an afterthought."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1925280"
msgid "Not that it matters.\nAt this rate, I might as well die from\nlack of oxygen."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1925356"
msgid "Oh, how pale and unripe is your countenance!\nYou refuse to speak, yet refuse to squirm――\nwould you stand so still as you were slain?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1925492"
msgid "……hmph. I first took you for a mite,\nbut now, I've no doubts of your devotion.\nVery well, I shall treat you as human."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1925612"
msgid "My suspended breathing resumes in force.\nThe moment she told me to \"act freely,\" my\ninstincts kicked in faster than my head did."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1925744"
msgid "What is it? I granted you freedom. If you will\nto do naught, then what need have you of five\nsenses? Shall I proceed with the filleting?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1925884"
msgid "It takes all of my willpower to keep from\nshaking as I behold the towering deity above me.\nLooking straight upward, I ask:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1926008"
msgid "Oh? You inquire into the truth of me?\nNever has there lived so base a species as Man."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1926096"
msgid "Fiiine. Do you wish to heed my rhetoric and\nperish as blood gushes from your earlobes?\nThen, heed my #RUBS  name#RUBEstele#REND, and you shall――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1926244"
msgid "――――Hmm?\nMy name escaped your memory, but has\nsince been made known to you somehow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1926332"
msgid "You went so far to make a fool of me? So crafty!\n…hmph. You have guts, and from those guts I too\ncan think of something delectable to craft."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1926476"
msgid "The giant's smile twists into an unsavory grin\nfrom which canine teeth jut out like blades."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1926568"
msgid "I think she finds me appetizing,\nand not in the fun way…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1926628"
msgid "…but wait.\nShe said that I already know her name."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1926680"
msgid "Then, um…\nI was trying my hardest not to consider this,\nbut she really does remind me of――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1926776"
msgid "Mhm. The one known to you as \"#C236196003Caster#CDEF.\"\nYour perceptiveness delights me, \"Darling.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1926876"
msgid "T-that's what I thought,\nbut it makes absolutely no sense…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1926940"
msgid "Well, now you have your tongue out. Does this\nmean you have recollected yourself? Oho,\nirritating as it is, you have good reason."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1927072"
msgid "I shall honor your courage. I am the true nature\nresiding within the one-tail's consciousness.\nThis is a past distant from your present."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1927212"
msgid "Verily, I have witnessed the extent of my future\nself's asininity whilst dozing here. It\ndispleased me, hence I called her companion."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1927348"
msgid "\"One-tail\"… I guess she's referring to #C236196003Caster#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1927412"
msgid "Which makes this #C236196003Caster#CDEF's past self…\nNo, apparently this is #C236196003Caster#CDEF's \"origin.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1927524"
msgid "So she happened to be half-awake, saw her future self,\nand got annoyed. Then she reached into future space-time\ntowards the Master #C236196003Caster#CDEF was serving―――\nShe nabbed #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF\nand brought #[him][her]# into the past…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1927780"
msgid "#C236196003Caster#CDEF's origin doesn't give a rat's ass about\nanything! Isn't she worried about time paradoxes\nand stuff!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1927904"
msgid "Don't flatter me so, for it keys up my ears.\nAnyway, I only came to see the future because\nyou came upon my root."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1928020"
msgid "I doubted even my own sight. After ages of\nbetrayal, she would invite yet another\nepisode by serving another human―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1928144"
msgid "It enraged me, though it be a matter most\npersonal. I nearly sprang to slay the one-tail\nwhen I then took notice of her partner."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1928276"
msgid "However, such a dull creature you turned out\nto be. Now, then―――What shall I do with\nthis puny creature?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1928384"
msgid "As she looks down on me with a coldhearted\nexpression, she audibly licked her lips."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1928468"
msgid "This is how a carnivore acts in front of their\nprey. I say―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1928536"
msgid "You would disobey your Darling!?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1928572"
msgid "Please, wait! I have problems with her, too!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1928620"
msgid "Ohoho. Good, good. Boldly said.\nOne must always possess such spirit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1928692"
msgid "Yet sadly, mere words contain no power. What\n\"Darling\" could be of such small stature? First,\nperhaps grow to the size of one of my nails."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1928832"
msgid "Gah… the perfect comeback.\nI want to reply with―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1928884"
msgid "But I know if I say that, I'll definitely end up\ndead. So all I can do is take this one on\nthe chin."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1928988"
msgid "Absurd. You are but a flea to me.\nWhat use is there to consume a thing I\ncould crush with a single finger…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1929100"
msgid "Hmph. Still, I get famished when I wake. There\nis enjoyment in relishing morsels. Shall I boil\nand chew you up? Or roast and crunch you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1929240"
msgid "Hm? You also take issue with her? Perhaps\nyou object to some of the one-tail's behavior?\nNot bad… You pain me in striking there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1929372"
msgid "You, too, have suffered her… I commiserate.\nThe days spent being wielded by that imbecile\nsurpassed any other pain in this world…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1929504"
msgid "Mhm. Though, I shall not apologize. For the one-\ntail's naivety is at fault. Laugh and forgive.\n…well, in earnest, it seemed a tad amusing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1929648"
msgid "In any case, you shall not be returning alive.\nOnly a painful death awaits you.\nSay your prayers."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1929748"
msgid "Bloodlust emanates faintly from her\nand towards #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1929828"
msgid "The lord of this demonic temple\napparently wants to kill #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF.\n…but why?\nWhy does she want to kill #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF so badly…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1930000"
msgid "And what of yourself?\nWhy do you entertain the one-tail's whims?\nYou know who she TRULY is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1930092"
msgid "Though but of a sliver of a Divine Spirit,\nwhen betrayed by man she became a great evil \nthat destroyed many lives, many countries."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1930224"
msgid "She presents herself to you as virtuous, but her\ntrue nature is of an unruly, Great Monster; \nan Evil Spirit unworthy of your regard."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1930360"
msgid "…ah, yes.\nI shall ask of a matter before I devour you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1930416"
msgid "Why have you faith in her? She is not even\nhuman. Does she not stand as a sinful\ndemon in the eyes of you humans?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1930532"
msgid "…well… I'm not sure how to put it myself.\nAnd that's because I lost the memory of #C236196003Caster#CDEF\ntelling me her True Name."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1930668"
msgid "Still, no matter how much #C236196003Caster#CDEF may have sullied her hands,\nI would bet that she had her reasons."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1930784"
msgid "She's committed atrocities. She has to be punished for them.\nStill, I'm sure there were reasons.\nShe's not some demon that would\nspread destruction for no good reas―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1930956"
msgid "Hahahahahaha!\nHow gullible you are! You would fare\nbetter as a Shinto priest than a magus!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1931048"
msgid "But hearken well. There is good and evil.\nLaw and lawlessness. The strong and the weak.\nAggressors and victims."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1931160"
msgid "Such reasons do not apply to me. I am but an\never-present Evil of Man. Gods are but ever-\npresent phenomena topical to the age."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1931288"
msgid "Us gods are assembled only by notions. Be they\nprayers for peace or hatred from slaughter,\nthe zeal behind these ideas differs not."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1931420"
msgid "If an age deserves peace, then we shall let\npeople live, nurture them, and gather followers."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1931516"
msgid "If an age deserves strife, then we shall incite\nthe people, slay them, harvest their ire."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1931608"
msgid "Has it reasoned in you yet? The good and evil\nof gods is decided by the age and the humans\nof it. Whereas―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1931720"
msgid "The one you love so transforms herself depending\non the age. Your love is irrelevant.\nShe becomes a demon that kills humans."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1931848"
msgid "Shall you still love that one-tail despite that?\nNever knowing when she shall turn monster, when\nshe shall turn calamity, inviting ruin?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1931988"
msgid "…………so that's how it is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1932020"
msgid "\"You're going to die anyway, so I'll kill you here and now.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1932084"
msgid "That was her motive behind summoning #C236196003#FAMILY\n#GIVEN#CDEF here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1932160"
msgid "This is #C236196003Caster#CDEF's true nature; I stand in the presence\nof the embodiment of a ruinous beauty beyond human\ncomprehension."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1932296"
msgid "…we spent all this time fighting together.\nShe held wholehearted faith and affection towards me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1932396"
msgid "Taking that into consideration, this time,\nI glare at the deity and reply:"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1932472"
msgid "Still, I'll stick by her until the end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1932512"
msgid "I'm going to do all I can to stay by #C236196003Caster#CDEF until the very end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1932592"
msgid "After all, I have faith in #C236196003Caster#CDEF.\nI believe in her, and in the me that cares for her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1932696"
msgid "If there ever comes a time to part with her,\nit'll be of my own volition."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1932772"
msgid "――――Well now.\nI see, this is beyond me. Only a dullard is\nfit for a simpleton, I suppose."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1932868"
msgid "This bores me. I anticipated reveling in the\nsight of you cowering in fear, but if you shall\nnot do so, then my business with you is done."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1933008"
msgid "Her intense bloodlust, which once constricted\nme, has since waned."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1933076"
msgid "The lord of this demonic temple yawns,\nas if to announce her loss of interest,\nthen flops down atop her bedding."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1933192"
msgid "Leave at once. I shall return to my nap.\nI have no time to spare on some insolent human."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1933284"
msgid "#C080080080The divine aura filling the room grows farther away.\n#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF#C080080080's consciousness is returning\nto its original time period.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1933456"
msgid "#C080080080I get the vague sense that I'm going to awaken from a dream.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1933536"
msgid "In my own way, this was a mercy. Steel yourself.\nFor one day, for all the trust you place in her,\nshe shall ultimately become as I am now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1933676"
msgid "One day, your very soul shall writhe with\nregret. Your days shall be spent seeking pardon\nfrom all who live."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1933788"
msgid "Can a virtuous soul withstand such penance…?\nPerhaps I shall satisfy my ennui by observing\nuntil this dream's closure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1933908"
msgid "Darling!?\nPlease pull yourself together, Darling!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1933960"
msgid "There are no more traces of the place I was in.\nAll I see is a rampaging fox straddling me,\nhands clasped around my collar… oh. That's just #C236196003Caster#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1934128"
msgid "#C236196003Caster#CDEF hugs me with tears in her eyes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1934184"
msgid "She's genuinely glad to see that I'm okay.\nI place my hands on her shoulders and speak:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1934272"
msgid "\"Morning, #C236196003Caster#CDEF.\nSo, my right cheek hurts. Any reason why?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1934352"
msgid "Huh? Ah, erm, see… I may have lost my composure\nand hit you with a blunt force skill…\nPlease. Forgive. Me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1934464"
msgid "But the situation was dire and called for it.\nYour body was turning translucent, Darling…\nAlso, a nasty and divine aura wafted about…"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1934600"
msgid "I had a dream about a feral-looking Caster."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1934644"
msgid "AAAGGGHHH, I KNEW IT! What was \"I\" thinking!?\nShe went as far as to get in the way of\nher own love life! How yandere can you get!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1934776"
msgid "Seems like #C236196003Caster#CDEF knows about what happened,\ndespite me not explaining anything."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1934876"
msgid "\"Hey, hey, relax. It all worked out in the end.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1934928"
msgid "I say to try and comfort her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1934960"
msgid "#C236196003Caster#CDEF is honestly embarrassed.\nHer worn-out, listless tail is undeniable proof of that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1935068"
msgid "…she wants me to tear apart her tails,\na representation of what level of power her spirit is at."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1935168"
msgid "#C236196003Caster#CDEF is still down.\nAs her Master, this is where I say\nsomething to pick her back up―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1935280"
msgid "I like Caster no matter how she looks."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1935320"
msgid "Yeah, please don't turn nine-tailed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1935360"
msgid "Saying this while looking her in the eye would be embarrassing,\nso I instead whisper into #C236196003Caster#CDEF's ear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1935480"
msgid "Woah… Woaaah! Have I won big this time!?\nThis means we've cleared my ending, doesn't it,\nDarling?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1935580"
msgid "I'll keep my hands to myself until we defeat #C236196003BB#CDEF.\nStill, count on me in the coming battle, Master.\nMy mind is clouded no longer!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1935724"
msgid "At that time, I shall unveil my primordial\nform without shame! My primal form is a most\nbeguiling sight to behold!鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1935844"
msgid "Yeah, let's refrain from assuming that form.\nI suddenly recall #C236196003Caster#CDEF telling me this in the Near Side:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1935964"
msgid "\"When I get serious, I can take out a near\nhundred Heroic Spirits with ease!鷙\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1936044"
msgid "I vow to strictly observe this rule, so long as\nnothing major happens! Don't come crying to me\nwhen you find yourself in a pinch, Darling!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1936184"
msgid "And thus, #C236196003Caster#CDEF and I came to a\ntacit understanding about her \"Origin\"\nand kept the matter to ourselves."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1936308"
msgid "I'm sure I'll have to deal with what her Origin\nwas talking about after this battle is over."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1936404"
msgid "For now, I'm going to believe in #C236196003Caster#CDEF\nand focus on our final battle―――"
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "1936496"
msgid "SG, \"Golden-furred Beauty\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1936524"
msgid "Darling, I implore you for a discussion."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1936568"
msgid "#C236196003Caster#CDEF swaps to being on her knees.\nLooks like there's something serious to discuss."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1936672"
msgid "The truth is…\nI think I would like to take some time off."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1936732"
msgid "Huh!?\nEven though we're about to kick\noff our strategy to catch #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1936824"
msgid "Urgh. That's it, that strategy exactly―――\nBecause you'll begin your strategy of\nbeing lovers with #C236196003Jinako#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1936952"
msgid "I'm siding with #RUBS    Oppai Monsters#RUBEthe O-P-Ms#REND here.\nSiding with the \"Darling Chasers.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1937056"
msgid "Don't go siding with whatever those are!\nNow you're missing the point of this strategy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1937144"
msgid "And anyway, regardless if you go fussing over\nstuff like this lover strategy, you'll be there\nwith me for every moment of it, #C236196003Caster#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1937296"
msgid "Gah. That's true… but even I want to hear\nthe sweet ring of words like sweetheart鷙\nor date鷙 every now and then!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1937412"
msgid "While beating against the bed,\n#C236196003Caster#CDEF keeps the complaints coming."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1937496"
msgid "Thank you for going along with this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1937536"
msgid "Yeah.\nAlthough, I can't take her out anywhere\nother than the Labyrinth right now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1937620"
msgid "If we call our dungeon explorations \"dates,\"\nthey might become… a little more pleasant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1937712"
msgid "Hrmm…\nI sort of feel like I'm getting\nplayed, big time…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1937772"
msgid "Whatevz. If it's a date with my Darling,\nanywhere is okay鷙 Let's get to some tiddy\nhunting and find some big ones!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1937888"
msgid "Despite saying she doesn't like it,\n#C236196003Caster#CDEF didn't stop the Student Council\nfrom going with this strategy.\nShe's probably not even serious\nabout pressing the issue. Probably."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1938080"
msgid "We can't stop the operation at this point.\nSo, I wanted to at least give her my\nthanks for going along with this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1938196"
msgid "…ehehe. I got ahead of myself.\nI, of all people, losing my wifely composure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1938276"
msgid "A nice opportunity may be snatched from me, but\nstaying close to Darling is my duty. I'll have\nthe honor of going with you, as always."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1938412"
msgid "…great.\nLooks like #C236196003Caster#CDEF's in a good mood again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1938480"
msgid "Now we just need to execute the strategy.\nLet's get ready, then #C000246204meet up with\nJinako on the ninth floor of the Labyrinth#CDEF…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1938620"
msgid "Texting, testing～ #C000246204SG#CDEF extra☆ #C236196003Caster#CDEF version鷙\nMy, my! If you're reading this……\nyou must be up to something naughty! ―Itsu"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1938780"
msgid "One way to live happily is to shut out\nthe world and spend one's days in peace."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1938860"
msgid "Still, what I want is the happy ending you seek.\nI shall follow you until we reach that ending,\n#RUBS  Master#RUBEDarling#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1938988"
msgid "I'm just glad that #C236196003Rin#CDEF is back to normal.\nShame that we won't be seeing anymore hardcore\ncheapskate antics, but it is what it is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1939136"
msgid "I, #C236196003Caster#CDEF, may be a teeeensy bit sad about it,\nbut I honestly don't mind. Let's take our sweet\ntime getting those memories back!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1939284"
msgid "You don't exactly rock the gloomy look, Darling.\nWhere there's battle, there will be casualties―\nLike it or not, Near Side or Far."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1939416"
msgid "We have been drawn into a truuuly queer affair.\nLittle Kaguya must also be surprised by this\nrabbit-less \"#C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1939564"
msgid "Ah, but hear this. If we think of this as a\nhoneymoon break from the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF,\ndoesn't it just sound fantastic?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1939700"
msgid "Though this is the time to be considering and\ncaring for my memory-less Darling, I will surely\nturn wild during our trip."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1939824"
msgid "Better yet, I have been hoping that we\ncould \"flip the script!☆\" Please feel free to\nchange into a beast at your will, Darling鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1939956"
msgid "I don't know what you mean by \"script.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1939996"
msgid "And first off, before we talk about honeymoons―\nwe aren't even married. Even without my memory,\nI still remember that clearly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1940124"
msgid "Kuu… always with the cool quips! Incredible,\nDarling. It hurts! It hurts so much! #C236196003Tamamo#CDEF is\nin tears now. *sob, sob, sob*"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1940264"
msgid "…alright.\nWhether we are serious or playing, let us set\nthat aside."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1940336"
msgid "No matter if we are here or there, I am my\nDarling's Servant. Please trust me for that one\nthing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1940436"
msgid "The smart, beauteous me will do your bidding,\nperfectly☆. I will whisk you back to the Near\nSide, then we can conquer the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1940592"
msgid "I spoke of a honeymoon, but I am actually more\nresolved to our new relations than you would\nthink. Please fall in love from my efforts鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1940732"
msgid "This is embarrassing for me, but I am unable to\nshow you my former strength. I was reset, you\nsee, with this being a sequel and all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1940868"
msgid "Darling, you're in the shape you were before\nthe three-action battles. Let us take\nthings slow, very slow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1940976"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF was kiindda high-spirited. I see she's\nanother, different kind of trouble compared\nto #C236196003Rin#CDEF. Darling, are you alright?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1941132"
msgid "Feeling down―――more like, this is almost\nthe worst thing that could happen."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1941212"
msgid "Although my memory is hazy, I don't exactly\nfeel good about exposing the secrets of people\nI recognize."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1941316"
msgid "The feeling of guilt isn't the same as when it's\nexposing a male's secret. When I look at the ever-tough\n#C236196003Rin#CDEF, I feel it even more."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1941464"
msgid "Although we broke through it, it caused me great\nmental anguish. Maybe #C236196003BB#CDEF was right, it really is\na revolutionary firewall."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1941604"
msgid "…first of all, fix up that natural posture\nwith your chest puffed out, #C236196003Caster#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1941700"
msgid "Well, I understand that you are troubled.\nExperiencing a maiden's secrets must be dealt\nwith extreme consideration―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1941824"
msgid "When the fur on #C236196003Caster#CDEF's tail stands up a bit,\nit scares me a little."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1941912"
msgid "Okaaay! Enough with the needless worry!\nDarling. Our most important goal is to return\nto the Near Side of the Moon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1942028"
msgid "Darling and I, along with everyone else\nin this school. Of course, with #C236196003Rani#CDEF as well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1942132"
msgid "Only Darling can do that. That's why we need\nto act immediately before we brood. Let's think\nabout #C236196003Rani#CDEF AFTER we rescue her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1942276"
msgid "I'm opposed to seeing #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secrets,\nbut this isn't the time to be complaining."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1942376"
msgid "Making a wall out of a person's mind…\n#C236196003BB#CDEF herself is a disgusting person, but\nthat idea is brilliant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1942496"
msgid "The contents of a person are dark and heavy.\nSuch is a woman's secret. A man's secret may be\nhideous, but a maiden's is a different story."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1942636"
msgid "And here I thought I would finally return to the\nNear Side together with Darling this time,\nfor sure… How disappointing. *sniffle*"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1942768"
msgid "I thought with rescuing #C236196003Rani#CDEF, we would be able to\novercome the Labyrinth, but now a new enemy\nappeared, the \"#C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1942924"
msgid "That aside… along with the #C236196003Sakura#CDEF Labyrinth,\nthat #RUBS   program#RUBEtechnique#REND from before is quite formidable.\nWe can't make light of that #C236196003Dark Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1943116"
msgid "Yeah. That program which forced affirmation towards #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1943188"
msgid "I think #C236196003Caster#CDEF said something like,\n\"We can even create a good-wife harem\nof darkness together.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1943304"
msgid "Kyaa! Please forget it, Darling! If you don't,\nI'll suffocate your face with my tail until your\nmemory fades! Into a \"who am I\" ☆ state!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1943444"
msgid "Wait a second, #C236196003Caster#CDEF.\nThat fluffy punishment may be novel,\nbut if you're careless, someone will end up dead."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1943572"
msgid "First off, losing any more memory\nwouldn't be a good thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1943632"
msgid "C-certainly, back then I may have been like,\n\"that might be kinda nice,\" but that\nREALLY was just a delusion!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1943744"
msgid "I still want Darling to be my Darling only.\nSharing you with someone is no joking matter.\nAlso, any harems are getting broken up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1943876"
msgid "Agh, I've had it! I won't forgive you, #C236196003Dark\nSakura#CDEF! I WILL pay you back for what you've\ndone. Mainly in ways I can't say aloud!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1944020"
msgid "Ways she can't say aloud… Can I ask what those are like?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1944080"
msgid "Okay鷙 Please leave the wiles of cursing to me.\nIf I get serious, cursing someone far away\nto death is a piece of cake鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1944204"
msgid "I look at #C236196003Caster#CDEF laughing adorably with a giggle,\nand a cold sweat runs down my back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1944308"
msgid "Let's leave #C236196003Caster#CDEF's serious side\nlocked up a little while longer."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1944392"
msgid "Agh, I can't do this any more. One by one,\nthe #C000246204Sentinels#CDEF just keep coming. I get no time\nto nurture the love between Darling and me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1944544"
msgid "I feel her pain.\nWhen the hell are we going to be\nable to clear this Labyrinth…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1944628"
msgid "And if I have to learn about people's secrets,\nI want to know about Darling's!\nOther people's secrets don't satisfy me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1944748"
msgid "Regardless of what she wants,\nhow can I have secrets with my memory being so hazy…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1944836"
msgid "I would think you have some. For example,\nlet's see―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1944896"
msgid "With #C236196003Caster#CDEF giving me this bewitching smile,\nI start sweating unpleasantly.\nWhat on Earth is this fox going to ask?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1945028"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF, #C236196003Rani#CDEF, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF, and I: between us, who do\nyou prefer the most? I don't mean in terms of\npersonality―I mean in terms of our bodies."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1945212"
msgid "Yes. Please think of it merely as a survey about\nyour preferences. Ah, but don't include me as a\nchoice; I need this for reference. Ohoho."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1945352"
msgid "…certainly, it doesn't seem to hold any\nulterior motive if we call it a \"survey\"…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1945436"
msgid "But based on #C236196003Caster#CDEF's demeanor,\nit looks like she won't let me\nleave here unless I reply."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1945544"
msgid "I just have to go for it, and say honestly―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1945596"
msgid "Sakura"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1945604"
msgid "I have no preference."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1945628"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF, you say? I don't know what's better:\nher going commando or her vertical-ness…\nIt's a tough call to make…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1945760"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF, you say? She's got a lot of MASS\nfor a nice, gentle girl… When it comes to\nfleshiness, she must have an A-Rank."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1945900"
msgid "Darling, I don't want to, erm, believe this…\nAre you one of those \"2D is my waifu!\"\nkind of people?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1946004"
msgid "…but it's just a joke.\nI just don't seem to see the women\nI fight alongside with in that light, at all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1946112"
msgid "Comrades, you say? Goodness, Darling.\nYou truly are pure of heart.\nPlease open up to your desires a little more."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1946228"
msgid "And of course, I mean in terms of their bodies."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1946276"
msgid "Indeed, our girl's talk hereby commences鷙\nIt's a common topic among girls,\ndon't you think?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1946372"
msgid "M-me!? Having such a LUSTY girl talk―――!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1946420"
msgid "That thought came across my mind,\nbut well, everyone does it… I guess. Yeah."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1946500"
msgid "I just have to go for it, and say honestly―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1946552"
msgid "I have no preference."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1946576"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF? Shotas―――em, quite the gray area,\nisn't it? I see.\nDarling is into handsome boys… apparently."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1946696"
msgid "#C236196003Julius#CDEF? Hrm. He has a nice face, but doesn't\nit look thin? Ah, that's what you like about it.\nI see…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1946816"
msgid "Yeaaahh. Not exactly a large selection, is it?\nOr to put it bluntly, no one here has a chance."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1946912"
msgid "I'd turn back instantly if I partied with them.\nI would straight up give them the email address\nto a bogus dating profile instead of my own☆"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1947056"
msgid "In any case, your humble #C236196003Caster#CDEF has received\nDarling's secret in full. Thanks to that,\nmy motivation has been greatly rekindled♪"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1947204"
msgid "No need for concern.\nThis conversation is a secret between\nDarling and I. I shall speak of it to no one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1947312"
msgid "One of my dreams came true, and I owe it\nto you, Darling. Thank you very much."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1947392"
msgid "I wonder if Darling has an #C000246204SG#CDEF as well?\nSomething like, \"mikos are moe,\" or\n\"fluffy ears are moe,\" or \"pink is moe.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1947524"
msgid "I do want to see it if the chance arises, but\ndefeating #C236196003Jinako#CDEF comes first now, right? Which\nmeans we'll leave the main course for later鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1947680"
msgid "*sigh*. Really? That little horn girl again?\n#C236196003Dark Sakura#CDEF is scraping the bottom of the barrel\nnow, huh, Darling? …Darling?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1947820"
msgid "I jolt up from #C236196003Caster#CDEF asking me a question."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1947880"
msgid "\"Sorry, I was just thinking about some stuff―――\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1947932"
msgid "Rather, be as resolute as they were and\ncontinue forward. Let that be your tribute\nto them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1948024"
msgid "#C236196003Caster#CDEF may be right.\nI can't just sit here and mourn.\nIt's important to move forward, even if only slightly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1948152"
msgid "As the new president,\nI HAVE to get everyone back to the Near Side―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1948228"
msgid "Oh, Darling. I don't like when you get all\nweirdly fired up like this. Come now, turn that\nbrow-frown upside down!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1948344"
msgid "#C236196003Caster#CDEF takes her finger and smooths out my creased brow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1948420"
msgid "Her thin finger is a little cold and feels nice.\nI unknowingly let out a sigh from her gentle caressing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1948528"
msgid "It's good that you've renewed your determination\nto fight. However, there isn't the teensiest\nneed to bear the heavy burden alone, you see?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1948668"
msgid "Darling, you have #C236196003Rin#CDEF, #C236196003Rani#CDEF, and #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\nAdmittedly, it's a little frustrating\nthat it's not only me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1948820"
msgid "That's right.\nI have everyone fighting with me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1948868"
msgid "Now then, let's have ourselves a fresh start.\nPlease display to #C236196003Caster#CDEF your magnificent\nLabyrinth-clearing skills, #RUBS  Master#RUBEDarling#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1949032"
msgid "If you're the new president, then I guess\nI HAVE to be the vice president鷙\nOh, but #C236196003Rin#CDEF is already that… *tsk*"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1949160"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF… the #C000246204Ego#CDEF who nonchalantly treated\nyou like you belonged to her. Grr… I feel more\ntails coming out just thinking about it!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1949328"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF… It's certainly the case\nthat her obsession with me is abnormal.\nBut more importantly, I'm―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1949456"
msgid "Like #C236196003Caster#CDEF says―in all honesty,\nI've been worried about how #C236196003BB#CDEF was acting."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1949568"
msgid "She always has her usual enthusiasm.\nI can't knock her for anything there, but―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1949656"
msgid "I know that your heart is deeper than the ocean\nand vaster than the sky. However, I don't think\nit's wise to show warmth to your enemies."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1949796"
msgid "For real!? Kyaa! Wai―first, a shower! I'm going\nto go take a shower and get myself all ready,\nso please wait for me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1949916"
msgid "Wait. Why are you going to take a shower…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1949960"
msgid "Do you prefer me in a scarlet undershirt?\nOr maybe a western style bathrobe?\nAh, a single bath towel is okay, too☆"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1950076"
msgid "I mean, it's not as if I'm going to let that\nchilly yandere lay a single finger on you.\nDon't underestimate a fox with deadly curses."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1950212"
msgid "I knew you had it in you, Darling. Even in these\ntrying times, you never keep hope from your\nsight. I find it to be a rare quality."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1950344"
msgid "This world is currently under #C236196003BB#CDEF's control.\nHowever, it's much too soon to delude ourselves\nthat it's all over. There's still hope yet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1950496"
msgid "I serve as your Servant, Darling.\nI'll follow you even to the depths of hell.\nPlease trust in me and push onwards."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1950612"
msgid "It's the finish line at last.\nOur final battle. Love brought this trouble\nabout, and love shall bring it to an end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1950728"
msgid "Between #C236196003BB#CDEF and I, shall we see whose love\nis deeper, purer, more evil… than the other's?\nThe time has come for us to find out!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1950872"
msgid "Are these clothes more to your liking?\nI also feel that these fit me the best, but in\nthis day and age, it kind of lacks boldness…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1951004"
msgid "To be honest, my old noggin's been reckoning\nthat something more enthusiastic would make\nmy Darling fall head over heels☆"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1951128"
msgid "After all… Darling…\nThe sight of me tied up like I was restrained…\nis something you like, no?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1951228"
msgid "Alright, I've decided. I just made my decision."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1951276"
msgid "By #C000246204Command Seal#CDEF, I order you:\n#C236196003Caster#CDEF can never change outfits ever again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1951384"
msgid "I'm begging you, Darling. You understand, right?\nA woman's heart is in need of trying on\ndifferent clothes now and again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1951508"
msgid "…is that really all there is to it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1951548"
msgid "Of course. I swear on these perky ears: I'm not\nconsidering that the best cure against becoming\nstale is probably some SEXY clothes. No way～"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1951692"
msgid "…there's a few things there that concern me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1951740"
msgid "But well, I'm also aware of how fun it can be\nto change clothes, so I'll retract my clothing ban."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1951840"
msgid "Whether I like it or not…\nI'm having trouble finding a safe way to look."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1951916"
msgid "Particularly when it comes to the cloth\ncovering her chest. I think it may be a tad small…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1952008"
msgid "Ahn… please stop it.\nWhen you look at me like that, I get\nembarrassed. I can't take it…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1952100"
msgid "*kgh*… Don't tell me the sexy character\nis getting embarrassed over a swimsuit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1952184"
msgid "…what do I do?\nThis gap-moe is kind of making me dizzy…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1952244"
msgid "…hee hee hee. Looks like this worked. I dub\nthis strategy, \"Ba-dum☆I saw gap-moe on you\nat the beach and now my heart is pounding鷙\"!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1952380"
msgid "C'mon! Lower the pink curtains!\nLet's go behind the curtains to a dazzling\ntheater of love and―――OUCH!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1952488"
msgid "Looks like I was under her usual wicked spell―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1952540"
msgid "…you were about to take me.\nDarling, you were definitely just about to\n#RUBS take#RUBEkill#REND me, weren't you!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1952656"
msgid "Well, whatever.\nIf Darling wants a life risking dangerous love,\nthen that suits me just fine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1952752"
msgid "Does this swimsuit look good on me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1952788"
msgid "…it truly laments me to\nsay this―it's as if I'm giving in―but I know\nwhat my answer is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1952880"
msgid "I think #C236196003Caster#CDEF looks unbelievably cute in that swimsuit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1952956"
msgid "――――――! Oh, you.\nThat studly soul you have really\nis too much for me…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1953036"
msgid "Alright! Even in a swimsuit, I'll do my best\nto show you what an ideal, traditional\nwoman I can be!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1953136"
msgid "I could wear something like this once in\na while. What do you think, Darling?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1953216"
msgid "I couldn't peel my eyes off of her for a good while.\n#C236196003Caster#CDEF is looking just like a typical girl."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1953332"
msgid "Oh? Ohhhhhh? And here I thought\nthese clothes were a little too normal and\nnot something that would draw Darling's eye…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1953456"
msgid "So you have a liking for normal looks like\nthis, huh? I stumbled upon an unexpected\nblind spot of yours♪"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1953564"
msgid "―――Hey, Darling?\nWhen we're next to one another like this―――\ndon't we look like a sappy couple?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1953668"
msgid "#C236196003Caster#CDEF nestles up beside me,\nmaking my heart beat faster."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1953744"
msgid "\"Sappy\"? Did you really have to add \"Sappy\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1953792"
msgid "Well, I am a girl.\nWe can't just be a couple."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1953840"
msgid "Don't sweat the little stuff!\nIf two people love one another, they're a\ncouple鷙 Forget what's conventional!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1953952"
msgid "How her soul cries out―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1953984"
msgid "Y-you have a point.\nEven two girls can―――wait, I'm getting ahead of myself!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1954064"
msgid "*tsk*. Your rationality won't budge.\nThis would've been easy\nif you just went with the flow…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1954160"
msgid "So, how about we head to the Labyrinth for\na date now? Darling. Hehe.\nI feel a little refreshed♪"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1954260"
msgid "…well…\nI guess this isn't so bad to see,\nonce in a while."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1954320"
msgid "How do you like my Mystic Code, Darling?\n…to be honest, showing it to you makes me\nfeel a little embarrassed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1954432"
msgid "Embarrassed? Why?\nWhen #C236196003Caster#CDEF wears her Mythological Mystic Code,\nshe looks astonishingly like a deity."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1954552"
msgid "Yeah, it makes me realize what a vastly\ndifferent being she is compared to me…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1954632"
msgid "You know how my Original Self is―so being\nlumped together with her leaves me with a\nheavy heart. I'm a totally different person!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1954764"
msgid "Even when I dress into my primordial form,\nmy heart still belongs only to Darling!\nPlease make no mistake in that regard."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1954888"
msgid "I don't know what she's keeping from me that's worrying her,\nbut if that's how it is, then I won't entertain\nany silly thoughts."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1955020"
msgid "Regardless of what #C236196003Caster#CDEF looks like, she's still #C236196003Caster#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1955112"
msgid "You're the greatest, Darling!\nOooh, my tail won't stop wagging!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1955176"
msgid "Patience be damned, I say \"Let's make love\nde gozaru!\" We can just skip to the morning\nafter to save the game's rating…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1955300"
msgid "Wait wait wait wait.\nSpare me the fake, old-timey samurai-talk."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1955364"
msgid "This is about when we subdued that rare enemy\nrecently. You maneuvered us gloriously, Darling."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1955460"
msgid "Simply recalling it send my heart racing.\nListen: it's as if our lips are gravitating\ntogether…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1955560"
msgid "Agh, OUCH!\nNo yanking my tail! NONE OF THAT!\n#[He][She]#'s running the ropes! ―――Kyan!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1955652"
msgid "I give her soft and fluffy tail a measured tug."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1955700"
msgid "You little scamp.\nLong hath the whereabouts of thy\nweak spot been known to me―\"de gozaru.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1955792"
msgid "Hitting me back with fake samurai-talk!?\n….phew, anyway, that was close…\nI almost inadvertently gained a new fetish."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1955912"
msgid "Anyway, congratulations on subduing that\nrare enemy, Darling."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1955976"
msgid "They may be fairly strong, but they're as\ngood as paper scraps before our love.\nOr maybe as good as food scraps?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1956092"
msgid "Congratulations, Darling! Your rare enemy\nsubjugation score is… *drum roll*\nFull☆Systematic☆Suppression!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1956200"
msgid "I am undaunted.\n#C236196003Tamamo#CDEF truly feels indomitable.\nCome get a piece of THIS, #C236196003Dark Sakura#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1956320"
msgid "I see you're an avid walker, Darling.\nWe've gone quite a distance around the\nLabyrinth, haven't we?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1956420"
msgid "Nothing could replace the joy I get from\nfollowing you as you zealously race to and fro,\nDarling."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1956520"
msgid "Just remember to stop and take a breath\nwhenever you get tired, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1956592"
msgid "I'll even offer you my Special Sweet Lap Pillow\n(Darling's use only)! One nap on it will heal\nyou to your very core, so don't miss out!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1956728"
msgid "Your racing passion just won't stop.\nIt's nonstop love. I want to understand those\nemotions you have, Darling."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1956840"
msgid "However, our total distance traveled across\nthis dungeon… has hit a considerable\nrecord, hasn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1956944"
msgid "I like how you can be so enthusiastic about\none thing, but aren't you tired?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1957024"
msgid "If you ever get tired, please lean on me.\nPhysically, and mentally. I'll show you a secret\nritual that'll heal you top to bottom鷙"
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "1957156"
msgid "Item Folders opened:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1957180"
msgid "You've opened a sizable number of Item Folders,\nDarling. One, two, three… yep, the current\ntotal is 50♪"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1957288"
msgid "You've got a real thing for opening these,\nI think. At this point, are you going to try\nand collect them all?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1957400"
msgid "It makes me ecstatic to watch our fortune\ngrow… After all, I'm in charge of the\nhousehold finances!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1957504"
msgid "…well, I still don't control the passbook or\nthe signature stamp, but one day those two\nthings AND Darling will be mine…!"
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "1957628"
msgid "Item Folders opened:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1957652"
msgid "U-unbelievable! Who would've thought you would\nopen over 100 Item Folders by this floor…\nYour enthusiasm is no joke, Darling! No joke!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1957788"
msgid "But if possible, I'd like it if you could direct\na teeeensy bit of that persistence towards\ncollecting my love鷙 Jusssst a thought…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1957924"
msgid "…*sigh*. You just can't take a joke.\nI think that part of you is wonderful\ntoo, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1958016"
msgid "Amnesia or not, you never cease to deliver,\nDarling. You don't seem to have any issues\ndefeating hostile programs."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1958132"
msgid "I was a little concerned that I might get\nin the way, since my mileage can sometimes\nvary…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1958224"
msgid "But it turned out that I was worrying over\nnothing. You're still the Darling I know.\nThat hasn't changed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1958332"
msgid "Please send me out to the fray as needed. I'll\nshow you some grand cursing action and great\nvengeance with a few words of #C236196003Tamamo#CDEF-lish!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1958484"
msgid "…h-how am I supposed to reward such a\nmajor achievement…? Master, you're so\namazing it's scary…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1958584"
msgid "Considering how surprised #C236196003Tamamo#CDEF is,\nit must've been something, alright…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1958676"
msgid "I'm talking about all those hostile programs\nyou subdued! Wowza! More than #VAL085!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1958760"
msgid "You've already become a legend in the eyes\nof the hostile programs.\nThey call you a monster."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1958856"
msgid "Although, I would REALLY like it if you\ncould \"maneuver\" me in a different way…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1958940"
msgid "But that's a separate discussion.\nI have a small gift for you.\nIt's not much, but please have it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1959040"
msgid "I proved myself a liability in our previous\nbattle. I apologize, Darling."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1959116"
msgid "You ended up having to bail me out… If I were\njust a little stronger, you only would've\nhad to focus on driving our tactics."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1959244"
msgid "This meager Caster shall devote herself to\nbeing of use to you. I can't give the excuse\nthat \"my mileage will vary\" anymore."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1959372"
msgid "You've used so many Code Casts because of me.\nI must be a lousy fox to have around…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1959460"
msgid "I'd like to stop getting in the way, but I can't\nseem to grow strong enough to avoid it.\nI'm getting frustrated with myself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1959588"
msgid "That's not true! How does #C236196003Caster#CDEF of all people\nnot realize how much of a help she's been just\nby being here?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1959716"
msgid "And not just in combat! She cheers me up in times like these\njust by talking to me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1959800"
msgid "I give #C236196003Caster#CDEF a reassuring nod,\nwhich causes her tail to spring straight up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1959896"
msgid "The way her tail wags tells me\neverything about how she's feeling.\nIt's very cute."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1959980"
msgid "Hehe! Hehehehe!\nI'm in a better mood all of a sudden!\nI really am That Fox, huh!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1960064"
msgid "Heck YEAH!\nI'm not spending a single second more with\nmy head down!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1960132"
msgid "I'm going to give it my all for you, Darling!\nI might just need to show you my WILD side!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1960224"
msgid "It's a relief to see her back to her usual self.\nYep, she's not #C236196003Caster#CDEF unless she acts like this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1960340"
msgid "Still, she exudes a different kind of\ncharm when she's all sullen―――\nBut let's not tell her that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1960444"
msgid "―――Here we go."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1960464"
msgid "The information I gathered was useful,\nand I got to take in a part of #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF's legend."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1960572"
msgid "He was born as a mighty child king,\nhad a goddess for a mother,\nand his blood was two-thirds divine, one-third human."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1960692"
msgid "From the very beginning,\n#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF was a hero who was granted many privileges."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1960788"
msgid "I guess it's natural that he called\nhimself the \"King who rules over heroes.\"\nThere's a clear line distinguishing him\nfrom other Servants; several actually."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1960948"
msgid "Hm? What is it, mongrel? You have a fervent\ngaze pointed towards me. Did it finally happen?\nYou just now succumbed to my Golden Rule?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1961084"
msgid "Succumbing to his Golden Rule,\nbasically means that one is entranced by his money."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1961168"
msgid "So far, I haven't fallen into any nightmare like that.\nI'm interested in something very different."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1961268"
msgid "If we're going to fight together,\nwe should have a mutual understanding…\nI know that won't happen,\nbut I at least want to know about my partner's personality."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1961428"
msgid "For that purpose, I looked into his legend―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1961480"
msgid "Well now. So you analyzed the anecdotes\nabout me. So what? Did you regret to find\nout that your contracted partner is a demon?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1961608"
msgid "As if.\nMy regrets are long gone.\nNow it's just the usual for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1961676"
msgid "What I'm interested in knowing is\nwhether the legend is true or not."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1961748"
msgid "But, knowing if your interpretation is true is\nforever out of your reach. Very well. You're\nadmirable, so I will permit one question."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1961884"
msgid "If there's something you don't understand,\nthen ask. I'll get some entertainment\nout of answering you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1961988"
msgid "I didn't expect this to happen.\nThough my life will be at risk if I ask something stupid,\nthis is a rare opportunity."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1962108"
msgid "So I'll ask―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1962128"
msgid "Was your mother really a goddess…?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1962164"
msgid "Being a \"child of the gods\" is just fluff, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1962216"
msgid "Naturally I'm interested in this fact."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1962256"
msgid "That since #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF's talent was so superior,\nhe disregarded others and made many of his subjects suffer."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1962380"
msgid "According to the epic,\n\"#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF left fathers with no sons,\nmothers with no daughters.\" That?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1962492"
msgid "Yes, that legend is true. If those who\nrule over countries with brutality are tyrants,\nthen I am most certainly a tyrant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1962616"
msgid "For you see, I was a man created to be so."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1962660"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF was the son of a king before him.\nIt sounds like something isn't lining up here…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1962768"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF has a heritage containing divine blood."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1962836"
msgid "So the material said, but is it really true?\nWhat is this \"divinity,\" anyway?\nHe's called mankind's oldest king,\nbut does that mean that in 2,600 B.C.,\nthere were \"gods\" running around?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1963024"
msgid "It's natural to doubt. The Age of the Gods has\nlong since passed; this planet is now steadied\nby the laws of physics that mankind knows."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1963164"
msgid "To humans, gods are no more than a system to\nestablish religion. To all of YOU, being in this\nsystem is not common knowledge."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1963292"
msgid "For the time being, anyway.\nBut let's not speak of the future.\nYou're asking about the past."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1963388"
msgid "There are two kinds of gods:\nthose who existed and became gods,\nand those who were reborn as gods."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1963488"
msgid "All Mesopotamian gods were the former. They were\nnatural phenomena who possessed will and\na personality. These were the ancient gods."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1963624"
msgid "I was created from such an ancient god and\na human king. I was something between an ancient\ngod and a modern god."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1963740"
msgid "Ancient gods were like nature being worshiped;\nthey were on this planet from the beginning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1963832"
msgid "On the other hand, if I'm following this right,\nmodern gods are a system which emerged from\nhuman cognizance and technology."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1963960"
msgid "That makes his \"in between\" phrase make sense."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1964008"
msgid "If modern gods are a \"human\" invention,\nthen that makes #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF―born between\nan ancient god and a human―an invention\nof a \"god.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1964160"
msgid "Do you know how the planet can deter versus how\nhumans can deter? You don't? That's fine.\nIt's not important, forget it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1964284"
msgid "I'm going to talk about how it was up until\nmy birth. Your sorrowful eyes are so pitiful;\nI'll let a few details slip out of me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1964416"
msgid "Gods and men. Having the perspective of both,\nI would be the king of a new era."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1964496"
msgid "Lifeforms have an instinct to make wherever\nthey live into a comfortable environment.\nIt should be called \"survivability.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1964620"
msgid "The ancient gods lacked this. Regardless of how\nmuch energy they possessed, they were merely\n\"things that were there.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1964740"
msgid "In contrast, humanity's survivability is\nextraordinary. Small individually, but there\nare many humans, and the average is high."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1964868"
msgid "None have any super, excelling trait that holds\nany supreme authority, but each have a higher\nlevel of intellect than other lifeforms."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1965004"
msgid "Whereas, no matter how powerful these gods are,\nthe personality, ingenuity, and awareness they\nacquired are not so different from humans."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1965144"
msgid "Understand? Even if they had omnipotent\nintellect all added up, they had only one\nembodied personality."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1965248"
msgid "On that point, humanity's count was a threat.\nThe difference was in the amount cognizant…\nno, in adaptability."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1965360"
msgid "Man's desire knows no end, doesn't stop,\nand isn't held back. The world\ntransforms as they desire."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1965460"
msgid "\"If humans keep proliferating, the rules of\nthis planet will change. The time is coming,\n#ROFS0003#RUBS   natural phenomena#RUBEwhen we gods#REND shall need no will.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1965628"
msgid "The ancient gods feared that future. As a\nresult, they desired a ruler who would be on\nthe humans' side and aligned with the gods."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1965760"
msgid "To that end, a goddess gave herself to a human\nking. Foolishness. It was to prolong the dying\nage; in reality, it was an ugly death knell."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1965900"
msgid "And by that, what was created was a new ruler,\npossessing both divine and human blood."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1965988"
msgid "The gods would call it their lynchpin. To\nprevent humans and themselves from collapsing,\nthe Heavens drove a lynchpin into the Earth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1966124"
msgid "From the beginning, my limbs were designed to\ncontrol and admonish mankind\non behalf of the gods."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1966224"
msgid "A created being―――#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF doesn't\ndisparage himself for being a human life\ncreated by the gods' intent… though I wonder."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1966368"
msgid "Why exactly would I?\nDo you have some preconception\nthat \"human rights\" exist?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1966448"
msgid "Be it an animal or a puppet,\nall life is created from its parents' intent.\nIn my case, it's just that it was the #RUBSplanet#RUBEgods#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1966588"
msgid "Listen. All life in this world was created\nby the hands of those who came before.\nOnly souls spontaneously generate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1966708"
msgid "The moment you awoke―resisted―was the moment\nyou acquired your very own originality. Don't\nthink that THAT was created by someone else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1966848"
msgid "How our bodies… no, our lives are was\ncreated by those who came before us.\nThe only things that spontaneously generate are souls…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1966980"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF was created to be a middleman."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1967040"
msgid "Humans moved away from worshiping nature,\nso the gods who feared that ultimately\ncreated a transcendent being on their\nside who had the perspective of both man and the divine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1967216"
msgid "It was the correct action to take.\nThe problem was that this middleman\ndidn't act the way they wanted him to."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1967328"
msgid "Certainly, this body was initially created to be\na king. But that was all. Their intent, and me\nbeing king, had nothing to do with each other."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1967472"
msgid "To me, I think of life only in terms of:\nis it something that will \"die very soon\"?\nOr something what will \"eventually die\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1967600"
msgid "If I decide \"this life must perish now,\"\nthen my judgement will be passed―whether it\nbe on a wise man, a god, or otherwise."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1967728"
msgid "Listen. My way of ruling is simple. I acquire\nsuitable treasure and guard it. I exterminate\nanything that gets in the way of my pleasure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1967868"
msgid "That's all there is to me. Don't fret over\nwhether I'm a devil or like a storm. My mother\nis a goddess, no? Obviously I'm not human."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1968004"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF gulps from his glass while stifling his laughter."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1968080"
msgid "That marks the end of thi… what?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1968116"
msgid "Well, now. That was an #C000246204SG#CDEF?\nNow that I think about it, I never told\nanyone the story of my birth, did I?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1968236"
msgid "Here. This is as a reward for surviving\nthis long. Take it with pride."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "1968308"
msgid "SG, \"Lynchpin of Heaven\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1968336"
msgid "But wait, what's going on? This isn't a very\nimportant story to #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF. Aren't #C000246204SGs#CDEF more like,\nyou improve your friendship with one another,\nthen finally get a glimpse into who they are….?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1968560"
msgid "Simpleton. There's no such friendship here. As\nof now, I've less desire than \"I\" used to. That\nincludes any desire to socialize with others."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1968704"
msgid "…*sigh*. This Heroic Spirit came from the\nage of the gods, feared no one,\nand lived only by his desires."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1968812"
msgid "It doesn't sound like he's acting\nany way differently in the present\nworld as a Servant compared to when he was alive."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1968932"
msgid "…suddenly, my vision dazes and grows dark."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1968976"
msgid "It's like I'm suffering from anemia.\nIt's probably due to the fatigue I accumulated\nfrom our explorations of the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1969100"
msgid "*tsk*. You're far too feeble, but if you faint\ninside the Labyrinth, it'll prove troublesome.\nGet some rest here. I won't take offense."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1969236"
msgid "The way he said it stung,\nbut it's also rare for #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF\nto show concern for my well-being."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1969348"
msgid "I respond to the king's whimsical remark\nwith an \"alright\" before I lay down in my bed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1969436"
msgid "\n…the moment I laid down, I quickly became sleepy.\n…it seems I was exhausted to my very core."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1969532"
msgid "I surrender myself to a despondency\nthat seems to wash over me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1969596"
msgid "\nThis is but a brief respite\nfrom my reality of constant battle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1969664"
msgid "Let's have a deep dream,\neven if only for a little while…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1969724"
msgid "\n\n\n     ―――I was born out of a lump of earth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1969776"
msgid "Shaped out of clay by the hands of gods.\n                 I was created as a tool which can\n                 transform into limitless things."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1969920"
msgid "The first sight I beheld was of sprawling land and the sky.\nThen, I saw a towering fortress city in the distance."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1970036"
msgid "It wasn't my mother's finger or\nmy father's rebuke that roused me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1970104"
msgid "My father was the king of the gods, Anu.\nMy mother was the goddess of creation, Aruru."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1970192"
msgid "They bestowed me with great power,\nbut they were unable to breathe into me a soul."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1970276"
msgid "For that reason, for a few years after I awoke,\nmy life consisted merely of dashing\nacross the plains alongside the beasts."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1970400"
msgid "However, I had an objective.\nFor when my mother created me, she had given me a mission."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1970488"
msgid "However, I had no soul within me.\nAll I could do was live in the wild."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1970560"
msgid "\nI was in bliss, simply running across the plains\nwith the animals day in and day out.\nI wasn't complete, but I wasn't missing anything either."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1970704"
msgid "Occasionally, I would stop and look over at\nthat far-off fortress. From across the wilds,\nsomeone was calling."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1970816"
msgid "Whose voice is that, I wonder."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1970848"
msgid "It's not my father's.\nIt's not my mother's."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1970892"
msgid "I felt like someone very different was calling me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1970944"
msgid "Lamenting over me and my lack of rationality,\nmy father gave me a woman.\nTo me, someone who had never even seen a mirror,\nthis humanoid served as a good teacher to help me know myself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1971132"
msgid "A soul was breathed into me, one that helped\nme carry out the mission previously created for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1971232"
msgid "And thus, I had spoken my own name for the first time.\nIn that moment, my world transformed\ninto something extremely simple."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1971360"
msgid "I must impart the god's ire unto the arrogant #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1971436"
msgid "My heart fluttered with joy.\nI dashed through the wilderness like a meteor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1971512"
msgid "To deliver divine retribution to a puppet\ncreated by the gods, just like me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1971592"
msgid "But when I found him, he was still young."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1971636"
msgid "He's still in his childhood."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1971668"
msgid "I hear the call coming from inside there.\nI kept my impatience in check and counted\nthe days as he grew up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1971776"
msgid "As a child, he possessed an outstandingly\nkingly disposition, more so than anyone else in the world."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1971880"
msgid "He was tolerant, thoughtful, fair, and had morals."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1971932"
msgid "Everyone walking down the streets would praise him.\nThey were captivated. They saw in him the ideal, boy king."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1972044"
msgid "…if there was any problem,\nit was only with the fact that while he showed respect\nfor the gods, he was not obedient to them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1972172"
msgid "Years passed, and the boy grew into a young man."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1972224"
msgid "I came to acknowledge the gods' apprehension.\nIn the few years that passed, he became a different person."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1972332"
msgid "Dictatorship. Tyranny. Coercion. Levies.\nProsperity wholly out of self-interest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1972416"
msgid "The gods were puzzled.\n\"We didn't anticipate it to this degree.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1972484"
msgid "…however.\nI could understand, painfully so,\nthe reason behind his sudden change."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1972568"
msgid "He had been born with a conclusion.\nHe was a lone being―neither god nor human.\nHaving gained traits from both,\nhis perspective was too broad, too distant.\nEven the gods couldn't understand\nthe things he set his eyes on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1972792"
msgid "His excessive strength brought forth excessive solitude."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1972852"
msgid "Yet, he had never abandoned his position as the king.\nHe had never deserted the mission he was charged with."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1972964"
msgid "He earnestly respected the gods and loved man.\nThe conclusion was that he chose to walk a\npath where he despised the gods and loathed man."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1973104"
msgid "We met before the building where sacred marriages were held."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1973168"
msgid "\"That's right. By my hand, I shall reform your hubris.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1973224"
msgid "I should have said \"solitude\" instead of \"hubris,\"\nbut I couldn't bring myself to do so.\nI didn't want to injure his pride."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1973348"
msgid "I could transform into limitless things.\nAgainst me, he mustered all the strength he possessed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1973444"
msgid "\n\"You swine―――\nYou, a lowly lump of earth, thinks they can match me!?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1973520"
msgid "He had encountered someone equal to him for the first time.\nWas it surprise or anger?\nDuring the battle, he took his prized treasures in hand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1973664"
msgid "For him to bring out his stored treasures,\nprecious as they were, was likely nothing\nless than humiliating to him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1973780"
msgid "Initially, he did so out of necessity. He was cornered.\nYet in the end, he had fun freely adding\nin more of his treasures."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1973904"
msgid "He had at last emptied his last stores,\nand I had lost nine-tenths of my clay."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1973984"
msgid "I couldn't even make clothes for myself―\nI must have looked seedy.\nHe looked at me with wide eyes, let out a roaring laugh,\nthen fell onto his back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1974136"
msgid "I, too, fell to the ground and took a deep breath.\nTo tell the truth, I could've only gone one more round."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1974244"
msgid "\"There's only one thing left for us to do.\nIf we can no longer defend ourselves,\nthen we'll just line up as two foolish corpses.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1974376"
msgid "I don't understand what he truly meant by that, even now.\nDid he want to say, \"let's call it a draw\"?\nOr maybe that \"this was so foolish\nthat there should only be one corpse.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1974552"
msgid "\"Come, now. If my opponent is one\nwhom I must use them on, then using them isn't so bad.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1974644"
msgid "From that point on, I traveled with him.\nThe days seemed to race by."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1974716"
msgid "He still had his usual collector's mindset,\nbut he had learned to use what he had every now and then.\nIt's one of my few achievements."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1974852"
msgid "There was a monster named Humbaba.\nWe joined our powers and defeated him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1974928"
msgid "I asked him something:\nwhy did he decide to defeat Humbaba?\nHe had no such mission from the gods to do so.\nOn the other hand, I didn't think it was\nfor the benefit of the people of Uruk."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1975116"
msgid "\"No, it WAS to protect Uruk.\nIf I don't defeat all the evils in this land,\nthe people will starve.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1975216"
msgid "\"Why?\" I asked further.\nThe people of Uruk suffer under his tyranny.\nWhy would he care for the people?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1975320"
msgid "\"I don't think it's that strange.\nI was born to be the protector of man.\nIt's the king's duty to erect this planet's#RUBScivilization#RUBE future#REND.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1975476"
msgid "As he said so, his gaze was extremely far-off.\nSo far-off that I couldn't understand what he was looking at,\ndespite being created the same way he was."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1975628"
msgid "\"There are various kinds of protectors.\nIt's not enough to simply protect.\nSometimes, one needs the north wind.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1975744"
msgid "At that moment, I understood him completely."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1975792"
msgid "\"I see.\n So basically, you value the path of discernment.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1975852"
msgid "He laughed shyly.\nHe had a refreshing smile on his face―the one from his\nchildhood he would occasionally show to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1975972"
msgid "…I came to understand why he preferred solitude.\nThe path he chose to walk was one he had to walk alone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1976080"
msgid "He said he was protecting\nthe act of looking off into the distant future."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1976156"
msgid "If he has to despise the gods and hate humans to do so,\nthen the king must be alone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1976244"
msgid "The more he liked the people's futures,\nthe less relevant he was in them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1976320"
msgid "The one who judges is also the one who reaps."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1976368"
msgid "And all the king gets back is results."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1976408"
msgid "The \"glorious course\" those results give birth to\nis something not even he, someone superior to humans,\nmust intervene in."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1976532"
msgid "\"Well, these results look like they'll make for dull fabrics.\nUntil I decide they are for sure,\nI'll indulge them until the end.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1976664"
msgid "He bragged, and unable to endure it, I spoke up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1976716"
msgid "\"I'm a tool. There's no need for you to judge me.\nI can continue being by your side until the world ends.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1976824"
msgid "I think the look of relief on his face then was\nsomething I had never seen then or since."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1976916"
msgid "\nThis will be the last story."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1976948"
msgid "Talks broke down between #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF and the goddess #C236196003Ishtar#CDEF.\nWe fought against the Bull of Heaven that #C236196003Ishtar#CDEF unleashed.\nThis story is about my final moments."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1977156"
msgid "Using that weapon, #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF drove away the Bull of Heaven,\nbroke apart the dark clouds cast over the world,\nand saved the land from being flooded."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1977320"
msgid "As a punishment for defying the gods,\nI was to be turned back into a lump of earth.\nHe fervently embraced #RUBS         me    #RUBEthat lump of earth#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1977476"
msgid "\"You needn't be sad. I'm a weapon,\nbut a glint among your many treasures.\nIn time, greater treasures than myself will come\nto you. I was never worth your tears,\nnor was I ever a reason to shed them.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1977676"
msgid "That's right. I was a weapon. A tool.\nUnlike him. Despite being a child of the gods,\n#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF was a hero who continued to defy his birth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1977832"
msgid "He had a soul from the very beginning.\nHe was born with free will."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1977900"
msgid "A true being, unlike myself. I was expendable.\nHe had real worth. He shined as a star would."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1977996"
msgid "I remember what he said at that time.\nWhat he said when I declared that I was a tool."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1978084"
msgid "\"When you live with someone, talk with someone,\nfight with someone, they are neither man nor tool.\nThose are what we call our 'friends,' #C236196003Enkidu#CDEF!\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1978248"
msgid "\n\n\n\n                         ――Ahh.\n                         How sinful he was."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1978332"
msgid "No one understood him.\nHis greatest sincerity came in feigning ignorance."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1978408"
msgid "The rain gradually let up.\nI'm returning to my original form: a lump of earth\nfrom the wilderness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1978508"
msgid "All that remained of the king was his roar.\nAnd with it, he cried like the thunder."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1978592"
msgid "From here on, it's your future.\nYou, unlike me, are human――\nlet this be your story."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1978680"
msgid "\n…that's why I want to ask you a few things now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1978732"
msgid "\nDo you still love humans?\nDo you still remember your friend's name, even now?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1978812"
msgid "That mistake you made in that distant era―\nHave you already overcome it―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1978892"
msgid "Seems like he dozed off too.\nMaybe that dream rubbed off on me, because I called out to\nhim quite casually:\n\"Did you get any sleep?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1979028"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF's voice is lacking his usual pressure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1979096"
msgid "Now that I think about it, there's something that I heard about.\nMasters and Servants who form contracts are mentally linked,\nand when they're unconscious… when they're sleeping,\nthey sometimes share memories."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1979308"
msgid "I'm not sure, but I think that dream just\nnow was related to #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF's friend."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1979408"
msgid "…as I have this thought, I unintentionally start to speak."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1979468"
msgid "Do you remember that friend's name?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1979504"
msgid "That friend…? That's what you're asking about?\n\"That friend\"? Sounds like you misunderstand\nsomething."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1979608"
msgid "I was recalling my battle against the\nBull of Heaven. I had no dreams about friends."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1979696"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF spat his words out with displeasure.\nHowever, his voice didn't have even the smallest\ntrace of anger in it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1979832"
msgid "That reply alone tells me plenty about whether\n#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF remembers his friend's name or not."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1979944"
msgid "…I'll humor you. To assure you, you're\nnothing alike. What you two have in common is\nthat you both have eyes, a nose, and a mouth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1980076"
msgid "He flatly laid it all out on me.\nHowever, I get the sense that there was some\naffection in his words."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1980180"
msgid "\"You resemble no one.\nYou're the one and only #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1980260"
msgid "Uh oh. #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF stiffened up.\nHe looks horrified, but he's not.\nI see the #C236196003King of Heroes#CDEF got caught off guard\nand is left confused."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1980428"
msgid "………and here I was, wondering what you were\ngoing to say. Do I love humans, you ask? Have\nyour eyes been closed this entire journey?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1980564"
msgid "He got mad out of desperation.\nHe's acting like a sulking child who's lost for words. And―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1980656"
msgid "\"Look at how I treated you and figure it out―――\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1980708"
msgid "Hmph. Looks like you've recovered enough to\nspout nonsense jokes. Then no more rest for you.\nLet's go, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1980836"
msgid "Also, let me inform you that I was seeing the\ncourse of half my life. From when I was born,\nup until when I died."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1980952"
msgid "Initially, I accepted the gods and guarded man.\nWhen my childhood ended and I became an adult,\nI hated the gods and regarded man well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1981088"
msgid "The dream I saw was nothing more than that.\nEven if you did catch a glimpse of my memories,\nyou saw it from your own perspective."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1981220"
msgid "…that's right, the dream I just had\ncan't have been from #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF's perspective.\nIt wasn't his or #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF's dream―\nit was somebody else's."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1981404"
msgid "However.\nThe words spoken within that dream were undoubtedly true."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1981472"
msgid "\n\"Your worth won't degrade, not for all of eternity―――\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1981532"
msgid "That's the one thing the aloof king said that I'll remember."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1981596"
msgid "Along with the owner of that dream."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1981632"
msgid "Sorry to say, but your dream of wishing to be abandoned\ndoesn't seem like it'll come true―――"
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "1981728"
msgid "SG, \"Chains of Heaven\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1981752"
msgid "The golden king.\nThe Absolute who treated humans as lessers.\nThe man who gained control of the world\nduring the dawn of civilization."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1981888"
msgid "There have been plenty of great rulers\nand leaders throughout human history.\nSome were kings of conquest who raced across the east.\nSome were founding emperors who established massive empires."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1982084"
msgid "Yet one must admit, #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF stands out among them all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1982160"
msgid "He placed himself before his people and his country.\nHe had neither a lust for conquest nor a curious spirit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1982272"
msgid "Perhaps he possessed too many things right from the onset.\nWhich is why he would put himself first."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1982372"
msgid "Ultimately, he undertook a search for immortality."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1982424"
msgid "In mankind's oldest legend, \"#C000246204The Epic of Gilgamesh#CDEF,\"\nthere's an anecdote about his pursuit of a\nmiracle plant that granted eternal youth and life."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1982588"
msgid "Hm? What's the matter? You look gloomy.\nWorrying over some piddly matter again?\nGo ahead, tell me about it. I don't mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1982712"
msgid "Luckily for me, the #C236196003King of Heroes#CDEF seems to be\nin a good mood."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1982792"
msgid "Alright, then I'll ask.\nI don't feel very good about having\nunanswered questions before I head to the final battle."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1982908"
msgid "Why give up the plant of eternal youth and life?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1982960"
msgid "Well, why did he even want eternal youth\nand life in the first place?\nThe legend says \"he came to fear death,\" but―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1983084"
msgid "I won't buy it if I hear that this Heroic Spirit\njust \"had a praiseworthy disposition\"!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1983172"
msgid "However, that question touches on the depths\nof who I am. I can answer if you really want to\nknow, but are you prepared to hear it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1983304"
msgid "You've brought up a bothersome topic for me.\nThis will incur on you a debt you'll never be\nable to pay in your lifetime. Still insist?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1983440"
msgid "…I didn't expect this kind of response."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1983484"
msgid "Judging by #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF's tone,\nhe's neither livid nor enjoying this.\nI've never seen him speak so detached.\nBasically, this means he's serious."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1983644"
msgid "Then I'll tell you. No worries, it won't take\nlong. The details are already outlined in\nmy epic, after all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1983752"
msgid "Hey! He started without waiting for me to answer―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1983808"
msgid "Whatever he wants to do, we do.\nWhatever I want to do, we do what he wants to do instead.\nI never even had the choice of \"yes\" or \"no\"!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1983944"
msgid "Dim the lights.\nThis room isn't much of a stage,\nbut the mood still needs to be right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1984032"
msgid "I was born from #C236196003Lugalbanda#CDEF, king two generations\nbefore me, and the goddess #C236196003Ninsun#CDEF. I was given\nthe mightiest human body and knowledge of all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1984208"
msgid "I was said to be virtuous in my childhood. The\npeople of Uruk cherished me and were apparently\ndelighted to have gained such a great king."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1984348"
msgid "\"Said to be\"? \"Apparently\"?\nThat's not how one usually talks about their past."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1984428"
msgid "I know I'm not one to talk on memory loss, but what's the deal?\nDoes he not remember his childhood very well?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1984540"
msgid "Yes, not well. My child self and my present self\nhave vastly different dispositions. I can't even\ngrasp what my childhood self was like."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1984680"
msgid "Well, it's all just hypothetical though.\nI'm an adult now, and I've set my own course."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1984768"
msgid "I don't live as a king that governs his people.\nI live as a storm that remonstrates his people."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1984864"
msgid "The details after that follow what's written\nin my epic. I stole and collected as I saw fit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1984960"
msgid "The people and the country belong to me.\nI made the treasures they produced mine.\nI made everything feasible to acquire mine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1985088"
msgid "Why?\nIt's obvious: to aid me in adjudication."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1985136"
msgid "Humans are inventors, but they don't share a\ncommon standard. Well, it's BECAUSE they don't\nagree that they continue to produce novelties."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1985276"
msgid "Which is why an absolute standard is necessary.\nAn arbiter who is beyond humanity yet human,\ndivine yet not a god."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1985392"
msgid "I could be human when I needed to govern.\nI could be a god when I needed intimidation.\nThe gods ultimately never understood that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1985524"
msgid "An arbiter, huh… Now that I think about it,\nI recall #C236196003Karna#CDEF calling #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1985640"
msgid "One who ascertains. One who passes judgement.\nPunishment incarnate―detached from any\ninfluence from human values."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1985756"
msgid "This was before Ur-Nammu's Code's was\nestablished. That base #C236196003Hammurabi#CDEF expanded on it,\nbut they were laws for settling disputes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1985904"
msgid "I lived by my own standards. I amassed wealth,\nlaid with women, fought alongside my friend,\nand purged the land of evil."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1986028"
msgid "After I had completed my works, a certain\nperson turned back into dust.\nTo put it bluntly, they met their demise."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1986144"
msgid "According to the epic,\n#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF personally witnessed #C236196003Enkidu#CDEF's death.\nHe then became aware of his own mortality\nand became filled with terror."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1986320"
msgid "Eventually, so that he could escape death,\nhe went to visit a sage who HAD transcended death."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1986416"
msgid "It was the #C236196003King of Heroes#CDEF' final journey:\na search for eternal youth and life that led him\nto Kigal, the underworld."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1986552"
msgid "Death stole them, so I loathed it; feared it.\nFor the first time, I feared my mortality.\nMy resulting journey was, well, comical."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1986684"
msgid "I heard a man in the underworld had transcended\ndeath. I wandered the wastes in search of the\nunderworld for as many years as I had lived."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1986824"
msgid "Well? Just like the legend says, right?\nI crawled across the ground as a wretch\nwho wholeheartedly did not want to die."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1986944"
msgid "I had the same motive as you humans.\nBefore the face of death, even the child of\na god stands equal to a human."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1987056"
msgid "All the while not knowing why, for whom,\nand if I was trying to transcend death."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1987140"
msgid "However,\nI continued to glare at the sky:\n\"I will not accept oblivion.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1987212"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF wandered across wastelands for decades.\nHis pride as a king, his authority, and his influence\nwere set aside for this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1987360"
msgid "All out of fear of death, a wholehearted desire to not die."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1987420"
msgid "―――But is that what really happened?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1987460"
msgid "Why did he come to loathe \"death,\" anyway?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1987504"
msgid "Was he furious over his friend's death?\nWas he afraid because even someone as powerful as him died?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1987604"
msgid "…that's not it.\nI don't have any basis for this,\nbut I'm going to say those aren't the reasons."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1987704"
msgid "I bet he couldn't forgive himself for abandoning his duty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1987764"
msgid "He decided that he would be the one who bears witness.\nHe decided that he would be the one who judges the people."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1987880"
msgid "He decided that he would see where people's actions led them,\nrather than if their daily lives were filled with joy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1988000"
msgid "That's the way he ruled as a king.\nWhich is why―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1988056"
msgid "He sought an undying body so that he could exist\nuntil the world ended―to witness humanity's \"final moments.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1988168"
msgid "It was nothing special.\nThe sage had joined the ranks of the gods\nand gained for himself a long life."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1988272"
msgid "It was a farce. Half of the sage's body had\ntransformed into a plant. That's what it means\nto join the ranks of the gods."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1988396"
msgid "I couldn't be immortal and retain human desires.\nWhat's the point of living forever\nwith a body that cannot slake its lusts?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1988524"
msgid "I left the underworld. Hurrying back to Uruk,\nI was inclined to complete my treasure stores.\nHowever, there was just one thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1988652"
msgid "Or, maybe he wanted to alienate #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF,\nwho had rejected eternal youth and life from the gods―\nand see #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF be reduced to the same, sorry state."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1988840"
msgid "This is what the sage said:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1988868"
msgid "The sage told #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF that there was a way\nto obtain eternal youth and life without supplicating\nthe gods for their pity."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1989008"
msgid "Within an abyss grew the roots of a miracle plant.\nTHAT was the secret to obtaining eternal youth and life,\nhe said."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1989128"
msgid "Taking such a thing to one's lips will turn\none into a plant. That won't do it for me,\nbut it still makes for a rare treasure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1989256"
msgid "Those are all the details.\nI went back to Uruk, completed my fortress-city\nand treasury, then fell asleep."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1989364"
msgid "That's the reason why I sought eternal youth\nand life. Yes. Just as my legend describes.\nThat's the whole, unembellished truth!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1989492"
msgid "That ends our discussion today. I'll consider\nlong and hard about how you'll compensate me for\nthis question. Look forward to it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1989624"
msgid "Huh…? W-wait, that doesn't answer squat!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1989668"
msgid "I object to #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF trying to cut the conservation short.\nI wasn't asking about \"why he wanted eternal youth and life.\"\nI was asking about why he went through the trouble of getting it\njust to let it go!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1989892"
msgid "*sigh*… #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nHow many times do I have to tell you?\nIt all happened as my legend described it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1990008"
msgid "That serpent ate the miracle plant, gaining the\nability to molt; not eternal life, but rejuve-\nnation. Quite an elixir; it's why I have one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1990152"
msgid "Now I figured it out.\nThat's what had me curious―――\nor rather, that's what had been bothering me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1990256"
msgid "The mystery is, what happened after?\nHe never went back to the underworld again.\nHe returned to Uruk."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1990360"
msgid "He spent half his life chasing eternal life, so why just quit?\nI want to know what #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF was thinking in that moment."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1990500"
msgid "Oh, how you drivel―――Though, yes.\nIt is mysterious. I can't express my state\nof mind at the time very well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1990612"
msgid "I told myself that I had no need of imitating\nthe gods' eternal life. A part of me was still\ngiddy with anticipation to use the plant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1990748"
msgid "I returned from the underworld and smiled over\nmy accomplishment. Now, \"I can overthrow death.\"\n\"I can restore my friend's honor.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1990880"
msgid "I also imagined the voices of Uruk's people.\nIf I were to return with immortality, the people\nwould've extolled me like never before."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1991016"
msgid "But that's when my vanity surfaced.\nNot long after, I noticed my shabby state.\nI hadn't paid any mind at all before."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1991136"
msgid "I went to cleanse myself of my fatigue at\na nearby fountain before I returned to Uruk."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1991224"
msgid "The decades had weighed upon me. Like wind from\nthe heavens or snow from the sacred mountain;\nwarm, cool―the water gently healed me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1991360"
msgid "―――\"Tranquility,\" I suppose it's called.\nIt was as if the dregs long stagnant within\nme were washed from my mind and body."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1991488"
msgid "I had never been so drunk on\nmy own accomplishments before that moment.\nI was so intoxicated that I wanted to roar."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1991604"
msgid "However―――This was different.\nFor the first time ever, I was grateful to\nhave been born. I was in ecstasy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1991716"
msgid "I was freed from everything. I had neither doubt\nnor fear, attachment nor obligation―I shook\nfrom an overwhelming sense of being almighty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1991856"
msgid "This is what animates life; the reward for self-\nishness. This joy, a result produced by the\nuniverse, I could have forever as I wished."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1991996"
msgid "However, all that awaited that fool was a lowly\nserpent pilfering for food. I lost the miracle\nplant. The serpent gained a new body and left."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1992140"
msgid "―――At that time, I could only laugh.\nI laughed so hard that my sides twisted.\nI couldn't help it―it was so, so hilarious."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1992268"
msgid "\"Behold! This is the result.\"\nI had great laughter at the expense of\nmy own folly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1992352"
msgid "All I obtained, all I could boast\nof was \"nothing.\" Ah, but that doesn't\nmean I didn't gain anything."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1992456"
msgid "My first time ever feeling fulfilled;\nthe joy of my life―all gone in an instant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1992540"
msgid "This is what the realm of humans is about. This\nis what I must ascertain. How could an immortal\nbody ever understand the real thrill of this?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1992684"
msgid "Eternal life is just vulgar mismanagement.\nNothing but a dream of mongrels who can't\nwitness the end unless they live to see it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1992816"
msgid "I'm in that age and am already immortalized in\nit. Even without the passing of time, all I need\nto do is gaze into the far future."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1992948"
msgid "―――Humanity's oldest legend.\nAs long as I'm spoken of in later generations,\nthen my duty will have been fulfilled."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1993068"
msgid "That's all there is to say. I was born a human\non that day, and after tasting joy,\nI perished a human."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1993172"
msgid "It took nearly the whole of my life to mature.\nMy body was tempered in the days I spent with\nmy friend. My mind matured after this moment."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1993312"
msgid "――My long childhood finally came to an end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1993360"
msgid "Then, my body began to decay.\nBut humanity's#ROFS-006#RUBSunderstanding#RUBE world#REND kept expanding. One day,\nI would see a future billions of years away."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1993520"
msgid "I had collected everything I needed to collect.\nThere was nothing left for me to enjoy\nout of that era."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1993624"
msgid "So the only thing left for me was to perish with\ngrace. I'll go through death as many times\nas is necessary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1993736"
msgid "I'll come back to life just as many times\nafterwards. Each time, I'll ascertain a\nnew age. Until this world ends."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1993852"
msgid "Until the day humanity goes beyond my #RUBS garden#RUBEplanet#REND and\nrows across that dark ocean―――Until they\nreach the end of the sky; their conclusion."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1994012"
msgid "…that was the dream he saw in his final years."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1994060"
msgid "A snake stole #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF's miracle plant,\nand he had laughed it off.\nBefore he noticed, the sun had risen.\nHe laughed at the short-lived human joy\nthat had blossomed within him as he returned home to Uruk."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1994284"
msgid "After that, he governed Uruk as the king who\nruled over all heroes―then he departed from this world."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1994388"
msgid "He departed as humanity's oldest hero;\nas the first mighty king in this world\nwhom was penned into legend."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1994496"
msgid "Our long discussion comes to an end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1994536"
msgid "Since Masters and Servants are linked together,\nI can tell what #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF felt in his heart in that moment."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1994660"
msgid "―――Although, after I completed Uruk,\nI slipped back into that abyss to get more.\nIt IS a fairly rare treasure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1994776"
msgid "The #C236196003King of Heroes#CDEF wasn't freed\nfrom a single drop of selfishness…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1994864"
msgid "It never hurts to be prepared, right? You never\nknow when you might get into a mess where the\nonly way out is to revert back into a child."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1995004"
msgid "I guess.\nI pray that such a mess never comes about."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1995056"
msgid "Whether he makes firm decisions of\nweight equal to universal truths;\nwhether he gets black-out drunk\nand then takes poor administrative actions;\nwhatever he does will undoubtedly be\nthe arbitrations of a king."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1995268"
msgid "That's what it means to be an absolute king.\nThat's the true nature of the man who guided me this far."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1995372"
msgid "I flatly reject: \"I'm good.\"\nAlso, I definitely don't respect him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1995440"
msgid "I only understand #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF from a Master's perspective,\nand I only worked hard so I could use\nhim to my advantage in battle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1995584"
msgid "So, yeah, not much respect…\nNow I know that he's not that bad of a guy deep down,\nso I'm just a little happy is all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1995704"
msgid "Ah, well, having said that,\n#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF is definitely NOT a good person.\nHe's still a pain in the neck Servant―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1995836"
msgid "Heh. So you're the first to give in.\nThat reminds me of that one thing.\nMaybe you share #C236196003Rin#CDEF's #C000246204SG1#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1995968"
msgid "No need to try so hard.\nYou're making it more obvious than necessary.\nEven I'm feeling a tad abashed now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1996076"
msgid "But let's stop here. Old story time is over. Let\nus return to our battle. Any further discussion\nwould be pure self-conceit, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1996228"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF stands up with a delighted smile on his face.\nI clear my throat, pull myself together, then nod back:\n\"Let's go.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1996368"
msgid "Over the course of our brief break,\nI got my hands on the answer I was looking for."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1996452"
msgid "The only thing left to do is return to\nthe battlefield―together with #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF as his Master."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "1996564"
msgid "SG, \"Poison of Death\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1996588"
msgid "A lover strategy, huh? It's simple, but\ntraditional since ancient times. Make this\nas exciting as a farce can be, mongrel."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1996712"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF reclines in his chair,\ndispleased over something or another."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1996800"
msgid "I didn't think he would refer to the\nlover strategy, but… maybe there's\nsomething about it that doesn't sit right with him?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1996928"
msgid "Fool.\nYou going along with that woman means I'll\nbe going along with what you do as well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1997020"
msgid "Putting your tastes aside, that thing is a mass\nof flesh born from sloth. You go get flabby and\nsee what happens. I'll peddle you off."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1997156"
msgid "How harsh can one man be…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1997184"
msgid "I start to pity #C236196003Jinako#CDEF, so I instinctively defend her.\nSure, she's pretty much a human bed bug,\nbut she helped us out with #C236196003Rani#CDEF.\nI figure she's not all bad."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1997376"
msgid "When did I speak of good or evil people?\nI'm talking about taste. Lose weight.\nThen lose some more, is what I'm saying."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1997496"
msgid "If your unsightly mug ever becomes intolerable\nto me, I'll abandon you all to the Labyrinth.\nWhip yourself well into shape."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1997620"
msgid "He glares at me with those red eyes,\nso I nod by reflex. Knowing #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF,\nhe very well might do it. No, he will."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1997752"
msgid "Once this operation gets underway,\nI'll have to watch #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's back…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1997840"
msgid "Still, if #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF really didn't like #C236196003Jinako#CDEF that much,\nthen maybe he should have volunteered for the part instead."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1997992"
msgid "I let out a grumble,\nwhich then makes #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF look at me questioningly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1998084"
msgid "Oh? Seeking to leverage this turmoil to court\nme? Very well, go on. I'll hear you if\nyou put your soul on a diet in exchange."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1998212"
msgid "I didn't think he would hear that.\nNow I'm sweating bullets."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1998276"
msgid "Err, um, I just said that because #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF doesn't\nlike #C236196003Jinako#CDEF. There's no deeper meaning,\nI'm not courting anyone―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1998432"
msgid "You seem quite flustered.\nCome now, did you think a mongrel like\nyourself actually had a chance?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1998532"
msgid "Give up.\nThe closest you'll ever get to being by\nmy side is as a maidservant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1998612"
msgid "Gah…!\nDamn you, #C236196003King of Heroes#CDEF!\nYou're an enemy to all girls―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1998700"
msgid "I see a raider of tombs has fell upon my texts.\nTo attempt upon the king's treasure while they\nsleep, how bold of a human you are! -Aria"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1998840"
msgid "So, you think never giving up means never\naccepting what your future holds?\nWhat an arrogant #[man][woman]# you are."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1998960"
msgid "Listen. Struggle to your heart's content.\nI'll travel alongside you on the path\nyou wish and desire to tread."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1999072"
msgid "That red woman must be reflecting on her\ndisgraceful behavior right about now.\nShe's probably writhing from shame."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1999188"
msgid "Go see for yourself, if there's reason to. But\nshe's a woman of mettle; she'll recover quickly.\nThe chance will slip faster than you think."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1999328"
msgid "What?\nI have nothing else to to tell you.\nThis is your moment; wield me as you see fit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1999416"
msgid "Casualties are a given. Don't you know this\nis the #C000246204Far Side#CDEF, the land of the dead? It's the\nliving whom are a rare sight here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1999560"
msgid "It's time for you to make up your mind. Don't\nturn so grim just because some turn vanquished.\nLady Luck smiles only when one smiles back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1999700"
msgid "What is it, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF? Perhaps you are now\ninclined to sever our contract or something\nsimilar?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1999812"
msgid "Very well. With but one word we can have that\nhead of yours soaring.\n…well now. That is not the case?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1999916"
msgid "Then you should swiftly return to your search of\nthe Labyrinth. This miserable shed is only\nuseful for resting after our battles."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2000048"
msgid "There is amusement even in alighting to the\nground of the unwashed. I myself savor\nthis impairment. Dull me not with idle talk."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2000176"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF is the #C000246204Sentinel#CDEF this time around? Right\nafter #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF, it's another acquaintance\nof yours. Surprising. Is this coincidence?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2000360"
msgid "…a coincidence?\nFeels like this was inevitable, more like."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2000420"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF is an outstanding #C000246204Magus#CDEF.\n#C236196003BB#CDEF also said that #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF were the only magi\nshe could use as the Labyrinth's Core…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2000620"
msgid "Buffoon. I'm not talking about \"how the\nLabyrinth is created.\" I'm talking about\n\"how enemies are successfully created.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2000744"
msgid "I'll leave it be. You're free to choose how you\ndeal with that puppet. Do anything you please,\nas long as you end up saving her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2000876"
msgid "…now this is unexpected.\n#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF said \"save her.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2000948"
msgid "I thought this cruel Servant would order me to\n\"mercilessly kill her\" as if it were natural."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2001044"
msgid "Hm? If it were an enemy of mine, I would do so.\nI would certainly gouge and drill their flesh\nuntil it's entirely smashed to pieces."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2001180"
msgid "But she's not so much an enemy, as a rare item.\nQuite promising. If she commits no disrespect,\nshe may even prove to be an asset."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2001312"
msgid "Kill one another until you have your fill. I\ncare not who breaks in the end. Actually, it may\nbe amusing if you were both broken, rather."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2001452"
msgid "This truly is a shoddy shed.\nI need to remodel it to my liking at some point."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2001532"
msgid "No, what's more incorrigible is how that woman\nwith the aphrodisiac-reeking flesh ruined the\nimage of my ideal woman!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2001652"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF's bad temper isn't half-hearted.\nThe cause must be the \"second spiritual phenomenon\"\n#C236196003BB#CDEF cast on him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2001796"
msgid "I think he said some outrageous things,\nlike about no interest, no collateral,\nperpetual loans of his wealth.\nAnd about making #C236196003BB#CDEF his Queen."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2001956"
msgid "Don't give me that look, mongrel.\nIf you don't wish to feel my wrath, prostrate\nyourself in the corner or something!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2002076"
msgid "―――Now I've done it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2002100"
msgid "Well, look, it's just…\nI was surprised, but the truth is it was a little funny.\nI felt like seeing a bit more of it, too…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2002224"
msgid "Well now. So you enjoy basking in people's\nblunders? You're quite a warped #[man][woman]#. Surely\nyou must get along with that clerk."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2002360"
msgid "However, when the object of concern is ME,\nit changes everything."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2002428"
msgid "I don't mind drinking over the joy of\nmutilating you without killing you and throwing\nyou into contaminated filth to slowly rot."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2002560"
msgid "―――Hmph. You called me King and apologized,\nso I could let this one go…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2002636"
msgid "Did I hear you pronounce something strangely?\nI felt something unsettling…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2002712"
msgid "…I'm sweating unpleasantly.\nBest not to provoke #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF right now.\nI'll do as he said and go make\nmyself small in a corner…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2002856"
msgid "Gnnh. This won't appeal to me, after all.\nThis isn't the time to sit and quell my ire,\nit's time to run like lightning!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2002976"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, we're going to the Labyrinth!\nI won't be satisfied until I give that\nwoman an odious surprise!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2003096"
msgid "If you the time to curl up over there,\nthen quickly conquer a Labyrinth or two\nand tend to my rehabilitation!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2003208"
msgid "Ridiculous. Absolutely ridiculous.\nBut if I were to say that in objection―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2003288"
msgid "Ridiculousness is the King's privilege.\nObeying such is the duty of the many, no?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2003372"
msgid "…this is what I'm talking about.\nI can't handle this guy anymore."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2003440"
msgid "But regardless of the reason, it's a good thing\nthat #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF is showing eagerness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2003544"
msgid "I'll thank #C236196003BB#CDEF for that, in secret―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2003600"
msgid "Carry out my rehabilitation without any delay.\n#C236196003BB#CDEF… I won't be satisfied until I give that\nwoman an odious surprise."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2003736"
msgid "This sure is an unusual proposal to come out of #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF,\nbut I doubt it simply popped into his mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2003856"
msgid "Right now, we need to think about\nwhat to do with #C236196003Jinako#CDEF――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2003936"
msgid "My word. You're more tedious than that\nLabyrinth. If you had an #C000246204SG#CDEF, doubtless it\nwould be arid and bland."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2004060"
msgid "There's no changing that.\nVery well, the king himself shall make his move.\nRespond to my question, mongrel."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2004168"
msgid "Th-th-that came out of NOWHERE, King of Heroes!\n\"Pin down\"? Basically, like in THAT way―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2004264"
msgid "Of course. Are you implying that there's any\nother meaning? Ultimately, this is about a man\nand a woman―and nothing else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2004388"
msgid "…hm.\nHowever, alluding to women\nI'm unfamiliar with would spoil the fun."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2004464"
msgid "So how about we limit the women to those\nin the Student Council Room?\nWho among them do you fancy?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "2004564"
msgid "Sakura"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "2004572"
msgid "What does the king prefer?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2004600"
msgid "She IS pragmatic. Profit over comfort, eh?\nStout and sensible, her passion for wealth is\ncommendable! Still, a tad soft on the inside."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2004736"
msgid "Hmhm. Enjoy playing with dolls, do you?\nHeh, there's nothing wrong with that. Writing\non a blank slate does spark a certain joy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2004868"
msgid "I have heard of men in this world taking a\nhomunculus for a wife. Few will ever know of\nprofessing love to a doll. I'm not against it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2005004"
msgid "I see, you're one of those. You fancy voluptuous\nbodies, reminiscent of a maternal goddess.\n…*sigh*. A big-breasts man, are we?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2005136"
msgid "Our relationship doesn't come from a formal\nsummoning. Naturally, our tastes will differ.\n…but the rift between us is THIS vast…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2005268"
msgid "If that's all it takes to widen the rift between\na Master and Servant, then just how shallow is this bond―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2005380"
msgid "It matters not. Watch out for what lies\nwithin women like her, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2005468"
msgid "Women profess love through their expressions\nand seek truth through their wombs. Pent up\nemotions gather easily with her sort."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2005596"
msgid "Replying to a question with a question?\nLearn your place, mongrel.\nBut this is good timing―listen closely."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2005704"
msgid "What I'm really thinking is,\n\"Yep, you just can't help but blabber on, right?\"\nBut I'll keep that to myself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2005816"
msgid "For no reason at all, he's in a good mood.\nSo, I'll just stay quiet and listen."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2005896"
msgid "I fancy girls who are moderate in all ways.\nAnd not just in terms of their body. In other\nwords, those who are humble and chaste."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2006028"
msgid "Yes―――Overburdened with their ideals to the\npoint of stupidity; blonde, blue eyes; gallant,\na maiden knight of slim frame―perfection."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2006168"
msgid "But I think saint-like girls like that\nmust be one in a million."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2006236"
msgid "Likely so. If I were ever to meet one,\nI would MAKE her my queen. That's the one\nthing I wouldn't leave up to her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2006352"
msgid "Which man would you say you want to―embrace?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2006400"
msgid "Huh? What are you, stupid?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2006428"
msgid "…is what I feel like quipping with,\nbut I'll keep it to myself.\nThat came out of NOWHERE, King of Heroes.\n\"Embrace\"? Basically, like in THAT way―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2006580"
msgid "Of course. Are you implying that there's any\nother meaning? Ultimately, this is about a man\nand a woman―and nothing else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2006704"
msgid "…hm.\nHowever, alluding to men\nI'm unfamiliar with would spoil the fun."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2006776"
msgid "So how about we limit the men to those\nin the Student Council Room?\nWho among them do you choose?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "2006876"
msgid "I have no preference."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2006900"
msgid "Hitting me with another bizarre line? One cannot\ncall that choice merely preference for younger\nmen. That boy is nearly complete, after all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2007044"
msgid "Fancy a ghost? You gloomy woman.\nRethink that taste of yours.\nHe's so depressing, it's unbearable."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2007144"
msgid "I will tell you this for your own sake:\nwash out your eyes in a cold fountain, at ONCE.\nYour sense of aesthetics is broken."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2007268"
msgid "Moron. Don't pick the obvious answer.\nWe're killing time to enjoy ourselves;\nwhat will come of answering in earnest?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2007388"
msgid "Hmph. Well, there was no avoiding it. My kingly\naura must be affecting you, being so close.\nGo ahead and commit your irreverence."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2007520"
msgid "Hear me? I'll permit it this time. But give up.\nYou're far from what I fancy. Work on\nyourself for another 4,000 years first."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2007648"
msgid "Well now. You say there's no man here who\nsatisfies you? Sounds like my contractor\nhas very high standards."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2007756"
msgid "Hm. I won't say I was satisfied, but we did\nmanage to kill some time. Now I'll proceed\nto the Labyrinth with you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2007872"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF's Labyrinth is a failure's den―\na whirlpool of morosity and whining.\nWe had ourselves a fine respite, didn't we?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2008020"
msgid "We're out to capture a thick #C000246204SG#CDEF this time.\nIt's not to my liking, but one must hear out\nthe people's discontent every now and then."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2008168"
msgid "So she's recycling leftovers now? #C236196003BB#CDEF, that cur.\nShe could cut corners off spheres. She's a\ndisgrace to stay-at-home women."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2008308"
msgid "The dragon girl must resent her as well.\nBeing revived via an electr――no, a Spiritron\nmicrowave? Have respect for instant meals."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2008440"
msgid "Hm? Are you listening, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF?\nYour expression is somewhat grave…\nDid her lazy cooking traumatize you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2008564"
msgid "After #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF says that,\nI realize that I had my head hung down this whole time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2008664"
msgid "Not doing so would be disrespectful to #C236196003Leo#CDEF and #C236196003Julius#CDEF.\nFor their sake, I need to do everything I can\nas the new president―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2008824"
msgid "I see. The responsibly of being the new\npresident, huh? Leading a group certainly is\nheavy for a commoner's shoulders."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2008944"
msgid "Then consider it like so:\nupon our shoulders rests not the lives of\nseveral, but the lives of all humanity."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2009052"
msgid "Thinking so will comfort you, you know?\nFor you see, the moment you're defeated,\nall who rebuke you will vanish."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2009168"
msgid "Enjoy your battles, and you'll be able to lose\nwithout fear. To bear all means to\nfight alone against the world."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2009284"
msgid "There's nothing to fret over. If all the lives\nin this world are replaced with all evils, so be\nit. The only one who will punish you is you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2009428"
msgid "Wha―everything in the world? That's absurd."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2009476"
msgid "Is that so? You value staying low, where many\nwill question you, rather than be so high that\nnone can rebuke you? How mediocre, as usual."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2009616"
msgid "Then rack your brain, peon. Obviously, about\nwinning. Not responsibility. Despite being the\nthird time, the dragon girl is yet formidable."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2009756"
msgid "If I'm going to worry about something,\nI shouldn't worry about \"what can I do,\"\nbut rather, \"what must I do\"…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2009868"
msgid "It sounds like that's what #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF wants to tell me.\n…jeez.\nI wish he would explain it in simpler words."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2009992"
msgid "I hide my face, now grinning.\nBefore the king gets displeased with me,\nI move over to my corner of the room\nwhich is becoming my usual spot."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2010136"
msgid "#C236196003Lancer#CDEF, an anti-hero, fits in well here in\nthe #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF. She can levy magical\nenergy endlessly. Don't let your guard down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2010304"
msgid "I went back to the room and rested,\nbut this uneasy feeling inside me never went away."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2010392"
msgid "I can't knock her for anything there, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2010436"
msgid "Mongrel. Do you intend to make me tell you\nsomething even a child knows? Show no sympathy\nto your enemy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2010544"
msgid "All the more if it's about #C236196003BB#CDEF, which now\nmakes you a rampant idiot. So much so that none\nof the elixirs I possess can cure you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2010688"
msgid "There's a reason behind that #C236196003BB#CDEF's malfunction.\nYour concerns will change nothing about it.\nLeave it. She chose the path she now treads."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2010840"
msgid "Besides, your goal is to defeat #C236196003BB#CDEF\nand return to the Near Side of the Moon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2010932"
msgid "Eliminate any obstructions to your goal,\nposthaste. If you don't, you'll endanger\nyour chances of survival."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2011040"
msgid "I may just be imagining it, but behind his\nmerciless eyes lies some concern for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2011124"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF is now my enemy, as well.\nThere's no longer any reason for me to\naccommodate your softness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2011236"
msgid "Know that pointless pity will lead to\nyour downfall. Understand, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF? Burn\nmy words into that unworthy brain of yours."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2011376"
msgid "So, we face yet another another #C000246204Ego#CDEF?\nIf #RUBS   children's author#RUBEthat Caster#REND were still alive,\nI wonder what he would say about #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2011560"
msgid "Would he condemn her beautiful malice? Or extol\nher repulsively pure love? I would describe her\nas a pure love that will never emerge."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2011696"
msgid "No matter how brutal she appears, her emotions\nfar exceed those of our previous enemies.\nDon't let yourself be engulfed, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2011844"
msgid "Struggling even in the face of despair―――\nYou never change, do you? Just like back when we\nmade our contract in that starry sky."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2011976"
msgid "You've come this far.\nI'll be setting you straight no longer.\nFollow what path you desire."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2012068"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF―――That fool, claiming herself\nto be a neo-god, is in need of a\nraking over a field of coals."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2012184"
msgid "Creating the world and discovering man is man's\nrole. This transgression is beyond what that\nwoman can bear. Let's make that clear to her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2012324"
msgid "How extremely unfortunate. What's the use\nin wearing such clothes as these without a place\nto swim? #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, do something about it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2012472"
msgid "I can't really do much about that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2012508"
msgid "A place to swim…\nI think there's a pool somewhere inside the school, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2012584"
msgid "Are you saying I should settle for that\nmeasly pail of water?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2012648"
msgid "If you wish to make me content… ah, yes.\nProvide me with a Waku Waku Splash facility.\nThose are nice."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2012752"
msgid "What's that?\nIt sounds like the name of one of those\nyear-round, indoor water parks."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2012840"
msgid "That's a surprise.\nYou don't have those in your era?\nWell, there weren't any in Uruk either."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2012936"
msgid "Waku Waku Splash is a water paradise I had\npersonally designed once; the pinnacle of\nwaterfront architecture."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2013048"
msgid "The king's red eyes glow as he speaks."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2013088"
msgid "Over the span of quite a few minutes,\nhe continued to tell me of how wonderful\na place Waku Waku Splash is…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2013200"
msgid "It's sort of… very… emperor of the night."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2013244"
msgid "Emperor? Don't group me together\nwith those scum. I am a king.\nI am mankind's oldest and first anecdote."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2013352"
msgid "Though, that said… Emperor of the night…\nIt has an obscene ring to it, and it's not\ntrying to hide it. Good. It pleases me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2013480"
msgid "This title calls for some Ropogi fugu-munchies.\nThen we can hit up Ginzer for some sush after.\nWhat say you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2013592"
msgid "But what the hell time period does this\nmerry ol' king think he belongs to―――!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2013676"
msgid "Naturally, we'll come back in a \"xiTa.\"\nMy Experience Card will let out a small beep,\nand the door to my luxury apartment opens."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2013808"
msgid "Gah… he's THIS dead set on the outfit!\nNow all he's doing is gushing praise for it…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2013896"
msgid "What else would one expect from a Servant\nwho has full experience in all the world's joys."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2013988"
msgid "All I could feel was overwhelmed―by the\ngenerosity it took him to unabashedly rock\nthat outfit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2014088"
msgid "…I never expected to don this regalia. Only\nonce did I ever wear this―when I confronted\ndivine providence alongside my friend."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2014220"
msgid "My rehabilitation is at last complete,\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. You served, without fear of death,\nfor a truly great cause."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2014344"
msgid "We will know only victory in the battles ahead.\nTo all enemies who impede us, we will show\nthem primordial hell."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2014460"
msgid "Hmph. I noticed that curious mongrel today."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2014504"
msgid "He asks a question immediately as we return to our room,\nand it gets me thinking."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2014588"
msgid "A \"curious mongrel\"?\nLet's see――I wonder what he could be talking about."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2014664"
msgid "We fought one not too long ago in the Labyrinth.\nYour head must be made of sticks and mud if you\ncan't even remember an event so recent."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2014804"
msgid "The golden Servant observes me with his red eyes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2014856"
msgid "It's mortifying, so I shift my\nbrain into full throttle to remember."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2014928"
msgid "\"We fought one a while back\"; a \"curious mongrel.\" \n…maybe he's talking about a rare enemy?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2015024"
msgid "That's it. So you CAN do it if you try. As you\nare now, I figured we would lose. But with your\nquick wit and perseverance, we overcame."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2015160"
msgid "…so I guess basically, he's telling me that\nwe should focus on hunting rare enemies."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2015248"
msgid "…despite the fact that he's in this wimpy state…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2015300"
msgid "Did you say something?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2015324"
msgid "No, nothing of the sort, sir.\nI shall continue to devote myself fully to your rehabilitation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2015420"
msgid "A humble and flattering response if I've\never heard one. Work diligently to get your king\nback into his rightful shape."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2015540"
msgid "…I'm already tired."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2015564"
msgid "Still, focusing on taking down rare enemies sounds kind of fun.\nIf that's what this golden king―who only ever thinks\nof his own convenience―wants…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2015716"
msgid "You're so ever full of surprises.\nAmong all those mongrels, I didn't expect you\nto exterminate ALL of those rares!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2015832"
msgid "But I didn't take them down on my own.\nIt's thanks to this Servant next to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2015912"
msgid "Hm. You're mostly correct, but not completely.\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, your modesty and humility are\nunique. You were the director of the battle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2016060"
msgid "If those rares were routed as a result of your\ndirection, then the feat belongs to you.\nStand tall and proud for it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2016180"
msgid "I never thought I would get a reward like\nthis for taking out all those rare enemies."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2016268"
msgid "I'm in very good spirits right now.\nI'll bestow upon you a prize for your\nachievements. Be humbled and accept it."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "2016384"
msgid "Total Money Earned:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2016404"
msgid "I return back to the room then start\nreviewing my war funds and such to better\nplan out our next moves."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2016508"
msgid "Although…\nI know they say that money comes and goes,\nbut aren't my funds a bit… lacking…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2016604"
msgid "It's no exaggeration to say this is\nessentially nothing rather than lacking."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2016684"
msgid "…how about I tear off that armor\nand see how much it'll fetch?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2016748"
msgid "Nothing like an empty treasury to know how\nfleeting this life is and how weak humans are.\nFill your stores quickly. Go transfer funds."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2016884"
msgid "Oh, sure, \"fill your stores quickly\"…\nBut I only make money through battles…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2016964"
msgid "What? You don't have another treasury?\nThat scanty, meager, barren, desolate treasury\nis all the wealth you have to your name?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2017092"
msgid "So you're one of those \"penniless students\"…\nOh, how impoverished a creature you are…\nI'm sorry I've treated you so harshly…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2017220"
msgid "Oh, how destitute a woman you are…\nDestitute not only in figure, but finances…?\nAs for your looks… well, you're average."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2017344"
msgid "And it feels like I'm receiving\nunwarranted insults and pity I've never seen from him…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2017436"
msgid "Sorry. The concept of being \"poor\" is one I\ndon't understand well. After all, I have an\ninexhaustible fortune."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2017548"
msgid "Which is why I don't know how to alleviate\nyour sorrow… Forgive me, #C236196003Hasan#CDEF. Also, don't\ncome near me. I think poor is contagious."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2017696"
msgid "\"Being poor is contagious\"!?\nAlright, now I'm taking him to court!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2017764"
msgid "You don't know? The most unlucky Servant\nthere is; he's called #C236196003Hasan#CDEF. Anyway, that's how\nI'll describe your financial situation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2017912"
msgid "―――You're not only a #C236196003Hasan#CDEF, but #RUBSbankrupt #RUBE#C000246204hasan#CDEF#REND.\nYou may laugh. Isn't it said in your country\nthat \"good fortune comes to those who laugh?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2018104"
msgid "This is now a matter of #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF's pride.\nI may be living penniless now, but just wait…\nOne day, I'll amass a fortune that\ntowers over this nouveau riche!\nThen we'll see who the #C236196003Hasan#CDEF is…!"
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "2018336"
msgid "Total Money Earned:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2018356"
msgid "With this much saved up,\nI KNOW I'll be able to get #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF to reappraise me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2018452"
msgid "You're making some odd noises over there.\nFeeling alright? Was it something you ate?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2018540"
msgid "Always so pompous, this Servant.\nSure, go ahead and pretend like everything's fine.\nToday, I stand before you a new #[man][woman]#…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2018676"
msgid "The bell of victory tolls loud above me on this day…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2018732"
msgid "…curses.\nI let out a sob.\nThis tragic sight has overwhelmed me…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2018800"
msgid "Still a destitute treasury as ever…\nIt's miserable; it looks like a sparrow's nest.\nWhy show me this, #C236196003Hasan#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2018928"
msgid "Wha―――\nHe called me that humiliating name… again?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2018984"
msgid "No, that can't be.\nBetween what I had then and the amount I\nsaved up now―there's no contest! Yet still!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2019092"
msgid "Very well, beggared one.\nBeseech me whenever you have want for coin."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2019164"
msgid "I always have charity to give, so long as\nyou labor diligently in turn. I'm a generous\nman after all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2019268"
msgid "Why was I humiliated so?\nI wanted to put this haughty Servant in his place…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2019348"
msgid "If I want to amaze #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF,\nthen I need to aim for the cap of what I can hold―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2019452"
msgid "Yes. I tire of this, #C236196003Hasan#CDEF. Fetch me some food\nand drink. Not that spicy mapo tofu from the\nCommissary, though. I'll have none of that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2019604"
msgid "I'm going to show this brassy Servant\njust how much I can save up.\nI won't let him call me #C236196003Hasan#CDEF ever again!"
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "2019732"
msgid "Total Money Earned:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2019752"
msgid "…I've waited for this day to come."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2019788"
msgid "An eon has passed since I received\nthat nethermost title: \"#C236196003Hasan#CDEF.\"\nThe time to humbly hang up said title is nigh…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2019920"
msgid "What's the matter?\nYou're of awfully good cheer today, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nWhat happened?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2020016"
msgid "Behold the mass of my wallet,\nthe wealth I've saved and saved up!\nMay this sight forevermore haunt your dreams!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2020128"
msgid "Indeed. I can no longer be honest with myself\nin calling you such things as\n\"beggared one\" or \"Master #C236196003Hasan#CDEF.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2020256"
msgid "Oh, how long it took.\nIt truly was―――a long journey."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2020312"
msgid "You did well turning that dismal treasury into\nsomething I can actually bear to look at.\nYour efforts have been admirable."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2020436"
msgid "He's talking about it as if it belongs to him―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2020488"
msgid "Nonsense.\nIn battle, you're the commander and I'm the\none who fights on your behalf."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2020576"
msgid "Thus, our war supplies will be shared.\nYour treasury was always mine too. Is there an\nissue with me using it freely?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2020696"
msgid "C'mon, what's his is his and what's mine is his?\n…wait."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2020756"
msgid "I would end this with rebellion if all he was\ndoing was flexing his monarch muscles―but #C236196003Gil#CDEF has a point."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2020880"
msgid "We ARE in the same boat here,\nso as far as battle goes,\nwe share the right to use what's in our coffers!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2020988"
msgid "Mhm. To see you pouring your heart and soul into\namassing wealth touches me. Truly, hard work\nDOES pay. Not that I'll be doing any work."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2021128"
msgid "Thinking about it now,\nI've even been following your progress."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2021192"
msgid "Perhaps my purpose in being in the Far Side\nof the doldrums was to chance upon a slav…\nerm, a contractor like yourself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2021316"
msgid "That doesn't come off as a compliment."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2021356"
msgid "Not when you're being totally condescending."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2021404"
msgid "Not when I had no chance of ever winning this battle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2021460"
msgid "Oh, it's fine. If you knew how much\nSakurament my treasured combat swords would\nfetch, your head would spin."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2021572"
msgid "I'm not asking you to pay that much. The sight\nof you working to supply me is a treasure in and\nof itself. Keep endeavoring for my sake."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2021712"
msgid "Gah… This is so frustrating."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2021744"
msgid "What's so frustrating?\nThe fact that hearing him say that actually makes me happy…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2021828"
msgid "…*sigh*… Unless I explain this to you,\nyou won't get it. #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, take a seat.\nRepent for your folly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2021948"
msgid "You've been using my Noble Phantasm.\nAgain and again and again,\nletting it rain down like hail."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2022044"
msgid "My Noble Phantasm is a celestial marvel.\nNot something to so readily reveal. \nYou're depreciating its value!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2022156"
msgid "I speak neither of its performance nor its\npotency. The amount of intellectual curiosity\ntowards it in the universe is already in flux."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2022292"
msgid "It's stylish. It gleams.\nIt's rare. It's not often shown.\nIt's quintessential #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2022400"
msgid "Such attributes raise its value. If you only\never use it because it's \"strong,\" then its\nvalue will plummet to the likes of a Gae Bolg."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2022536"
msgid "Listen. Prize my Noble Phantasm to your utmost.\nIf you burn to witness my majesty,\nthen bring to me a worthy foe."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2022652"
msgid "Rare foes will excite our spectators. I won't\nask for #C236196003Ishtar#CDEF-class enemies, but choose\ngenerally lofty battlegrounds for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2022796"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF is apparently fighting\non a level unfathomable to us commoners…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2022888"
msgid "I don't really get what he's talking about,\nbut I think I should refrain from using his Noble\nPhantasm arbitrarily…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2023008"
msgid "I've fought a considerable amount of battles\nalongside #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF at this point."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2023104"
msgid "You're sharper than I give you credit for.\nWhy not quit this magus rubbish\nand become a chiropractor instead?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2023216"
msgid "―――And there he goes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2023244"
msgid "You say the most incomprehensible things.\nWhy should I shake my people off when\nthey take my hand to aid me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2023356"
msgid "Not to mention, I'm in the middle of\nrehabilitation. You, adept in setting things\nstraight, have a duty to aid me in that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2023480"
msgid "Looks like I'll be helping him out with\nmore Code Casts for the time being…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2023560"
msgid "So, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nYou've become quite proficient at assisting me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2023640"
msgid "That's right.\nAfter all, I've assisted him with Code Casts #VAL086 times."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2023716"
msgid "I have to say, I really do feel like I got the hang of it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2023776"
msgid "Opportunities to assist a king come seldom.\nReflect deeply on how fortunate you are."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2023864"
msgid "…ah, how about this?\nIt wouldn't hurt to recompensed for your\nloyalty now and then."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2023952"
msgid "I'll allow you to be rewarded.\nBe humbled and accept it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2024012"
msgid "You directed that previous battle with splendor.\nYour perfect tactics rendered the enemy\ndisabled. It even left me exhilarated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2024140"
msgid "My goal here is to stave off boredom, so I'm\nnot quite sold on becoming TOO powerful.\nBut a king must act as a king does."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2024264"
msgid "Therefore, strive for more flawless victories.\nYes, once in a while is fine. I don't see you\nsucceeding often with your competence."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2024396"
msgid "…hrm. Tell me, are you a prodigy?\nAre you one of those protagonists\nwhom \"awaken\" in a pinch?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2024492"
msgid "Though it's only been against mongrels,\nyou've already accomplished #VAL087\nflawless victories… even I'm surprised."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2024612"
msgid "Your tactical prowess deserves an A-Rank.\nHmph… You're something else. I can't tell\nif you're ordinary or extraordinary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2024736"
msgid "…still, with how you know and discern people…\nPerhaps that's where your \"root\" lies."
msgstr ""

